                "hints": "Know anyone named {tooltip:Reading:Ricky} ({span:lang=ja:\u308a\u304d}), even a famous person like Ricky Ricardo or Ricky Gervais? Put his face on the monster the {tooltip:Kanji:Power} Rangers are fighting. Also, imagine him throwing {tooltip:Reading:rocks} ({span:lang=ja:\u308a\u3087\u304f}) and hitting people with them. You should imagine it as more gruesome than Power Rangers was on the show. This is real, yo (and gruesome will help you to remember).",
                "mnemonic": "Who has the most Power of anyone? It's the {tooltip:Kanji:Power} Rangers. Who are they battling? {tooltip:Reading:Ricky} ({span:lang=ja:\u308a\u304d}) the {tooltip:Reading:Rock} ({span:lang=ja:\u308a\u3087\u304f}) Monster."
