                "hints": "Whenever the reading {span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3087} comes up, we will use the character Jo-Anne. She's quite a short woman, which is to help us differentiate {span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3087} from {span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3087\u3046} (who is the giant, oafish farmhand Jourm). {span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3087} is a smaller lady, {span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3087\u3046} is a giant man.",
