{
            "mnemonic": "This is the adjective form of {tooltip:Kanji:big}. It has the same meaning, though it is a word for describing. Words that end with {span:lang=ja:\u3044} are often adjectives, remember that for future words as well. So, as long as you know the meaning of this kanji, you can transfer that to the meaning of this word. It's the adjective {tooltip:Vocabulary:big}, or {tooltip:Vocabulary:large}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Big",
