                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}What do you do when you see something really, really {tooltip:Vocabulary:big}? You say {tooltip:Reading:\u304a\u304a} because you can't believe your eyes. Imagine something really large and say {span:lang=ja:\u304a\u304a} out loud to help seal the memory in that brain of yours.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
