{
            "mnemonic": "When a vocab is a single kanji with no okurigana (that's hiragana attached to the kanji) it tends to steal the meaning of the kanji it comes from. So, this one is {tooltip:Vocabulary:below} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:down}.",
