                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "27914-subject-2475.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}When a vocab is a single kanji with no okurigana (hiragana attached to the kanji), it usually uses the kun'yomi reading. Since you don't know the kun'yomi reading for this kanji yet, let's use a mnemonic to learn it.\n{splitParent}What does a {tooltip:Vocabulary:person} hate more than anything? They hate extreme {tooltip:Reading:heat} ({span:lang=ja:\u3072\u3068}). You can always put on more clothes to stay warm, but when the heat gets too high, you can only take off so much.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3084\u3058\u308b\u3057\u306e\u4eba\u306f\u306a\u3093\u3068\u3044\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "What will the person the arrow is pointing at say?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306e\u4eba\u306f\u4f55\u4eba\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "What is that person's nationality?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eba\u3073\u3068\u306f\u3001\u304b\u308c\u3092\u3070\u304b\u306a\u4eba\u3060\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3002",
                    "en": "People say he's a stupid person."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You know that the kanji {span:lang=ja:\u4e0b} means {tooltip:Kanji:down} and that {span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3044} sounds like the word \"sigh.\" You need to ask someone for something, so you look down, sigh, and say {tooltip:Vocabulary:please give me} that thing. You're ashamed that you have to ask. But you still need it. {tooltip:Vocabulary:Please}, please give it to me!",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Please Give Me",
                "Alternative": "Please",
                "Word Type": "expression"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "3138-subject-2496.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "27992-subject-2496.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for this word is an exceptional reading. You just have to be able to recall the {span:lang=ja:\u304f\u3060} part, though (since {span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3044} is already there in the form of the hiragana). So, think about why you have to be polite to this misbehaving kid. Turns out, if you don't, he has the power to initiate a {tooltip:Reading:Coup d'\u00e9}tat against you and your family, who runs the government. Just imagine yourself thinking over and over \"Okay... I have to be nice to this kid. If I don't... he'll initiate a Coup d'\u00e9tat... and that would ruin my family...\" You're walking on thin ice, here.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u308c\u3092\u4e0b\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please give me that one."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u308a\u3093\u3054\u3092\u4e8c\u3053\u4e0b\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please give me two apples."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u307c\u304f\u306b\u767e\u4e07\u5186\u3092\u4e0b\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please give me a million yen."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
