{
            "mnemonic": "When a vocab word is made up of a single kanji and that's it, it almost always takes the meaning from its parent kanji. So, this vocab word also means {tooltip:Vocabulary:power}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Power",
                "Alternatives": "Strength, Ability",
                "Word Type": "noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
