{
            "mnemonic": "When a vocab is alone with no okurigana (that's hiragana attached to a kanji) it usually has the same meaning as the kanji too. That goes for this word as well. So, if you know the kanji's meaning ({tooltip:Kanji:seven}) you'll know the vocab's meaning ({tooltip:Vocabulary:seven}).",
