                    }
                ],
                "hints": "If you're right-handed, imagine trying to use these left-handed saws. It flips and flops all over until you drop it. But if you're left-handed it feels just right!",
                "mnemonic": "In their {tooltip:Kanji:left} hands, the narwhals all hold {tooltip:Reading:saw}s ({span:lang=ja:\u3055}). That's because the ice for their homes is already there, so they just need to saw away at them to make the shapes they want. Narwhal construction is actually very simple."
