                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture these {tooltip:Kanji:round} {span:lang=ja:\u3048\u3093} in your mind. Maybe look some up online too, just to be safe.",
                "mnemonic": "What does the word {tooltip:Kanji:yen} sound like? It sounds like {span:lang=ja:\u3048\u3093}. Why? because back in the day, Japanese used to have a \"ye\" sound, but now it doesn't. Instead, it's an \"e\" sound, which is why yen = {span:lang=ja:\u3048\u3093}!"
