                    "en": "Please put the fire out soon."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u77f3\u3092\u3064\u304b\u3063\u3066\u706b\u3092\u304a\u3053\u3057\u305f\u3053\u3068\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Have you ever started a fire with stones?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u706b\u306f\u3001\u304b\u308c\u306e\u304b\u307f\u306e\u3051\u3092\u305c\u3093\u3076\u3084\u3044\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "The fire burned off all of his hair."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
