                    "en": "The puppy that was standing at the entrance was given the nine balls around its neck by the prince."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5b50\u72ac\u3054\u3063\u3053\u3092\u3057\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3088\u3002",
