                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it uses the kun'yomi reading. I'm hoping you already know this word - that will make everything much easier. It's {tooltip:Reading:\u304b\u305f\u306a} (you know what a katana is, right?).\n"
