                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. When learning the kanji, you didn't learn that reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you with this word:\n{splitParent}You walk up to the tree. You have to get inside, because it takes you someplace secret. So, you take out your {tooltip:Reading:key} ({span:lang=ja:\u304d}) and put it in the slot, opening the door in the tree so you can slip inside.\n"
