{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:city} {tooltip:Kanji:stand} is {tooltip:Vocabulary:municipal} in nature. Municipal means \"of or relating to a city or its governing body\", and this vocabulary means just that. Or just {tooltip:Vocabulary:city}. City is fine too.",
