{
            "mnemonic": "Since this is a kanji with hiragana attached that ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know that this word is a verb. What's the ultimate verb version of the kanji {span:lang=ja:\u751f}? That would be {tooltip:Vocabulary:to be born}, the very beginning of life as we know it! ",
