                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "32833-subject-2576.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}You have to remember the {span:lang=ja:\u3046} part of this word to read it. To remember that, let's use a mnemonic: \n{splitParent}Just imagine someone being born. All they do is scream: {tooltip:Reading:UUUUUuuUuuUUUuuuUUUuu} ({span:lang=ja:\u3046}) the whole time. Go ahead and imagine yourself being born and doing the same thing. Say UUUuuUUuuu out loud to help you to remember.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u65e5\u3088\u3046\u65e5\u3001\u30e4\u30f3\u3055\u3093\u306e\u5b50\u3069\u3082\u304c\u751f\u307e\u308c\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "On Sunday, Yang\u2019s child was born."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30de\u30a4\u30b1\u30eb\u305b\u3093\u624b\u306e\u3001\u529b\u3065\u3088\u3044\u30d5\u30eb\u30b9\u30a4\u30f3\u30b0\u304b\u3089\u751f\u307e\u308c\u308b\u30db\u30fc\u30e0\u30e9\u30f3\u306e\u304b\u305a\u304b\u305a\u3092\u3054\u3089\u3093\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please watch these home runs produced by the strong swings of a pro player named Michael."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u751f\u307e\u308c\u305f\u3070\u304b\u308a\u306e\u5b50\u3069\u3082\u306b\u3001\u3055\u3051\u3092\u306e\u307e\u305b\u308b\u306a\u3002",
                    "en": "Do not make a newborn baby drink alcohol."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

