                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "32869-subject-2606.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You have to learn the {span:lang=ja:\u3075\u3068} portion of this word to be able to read it. Here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}You're getting fat so quickly that you can see your body expanding. You look down - at first you can see your {tooltip:Reading:foot} ({span:lang=ja:\u3075\u3068}) but then a second later you can't. You can't see your foot because you're getting fat, even when you stick your foot way out. What's going on?\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3055\u3044\u304d\u3093\u3001\u305f\u3079\u3059\u304e\u3067\u5c11\u3057\u592a\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019ve gotten a little fat from overeating lately."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u305f\u3079\u3066\u3082\u592a\u3089\u306a\u3044\u4eba\u304c\u3046\u3089\u3084\u307e\u3057\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "I envy people who don't get fat even though they eat a lot."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u592a\u308c\u3070\u592a\u308b\u307b\u3069\u3001\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306f\u304a\u306a\u304b\u304c\u3059\u304f\u3002",
                    "en": "The fatter I get, the hungrier I become."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

