                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}You scream \"{tooltip:Reading:WAHHHHHH}\" ({span:lang=ja:\u308f}) in terror and \"{tooltip:Reading:CAAA}R!!!\" ({span:lang=ja:\u304b}) as you careen down the freeway. Your dad is driving like a maniac and almost hit another car! \"{tooltip:Reading:WAAH CAAA}R!!!\" ({span:lang=ja:\u308f\u304b}) you scream again. If only he understood your terror!\n"
