                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "But you get your soul up early and head to the church fast anyway, because you're doing all of this for your soul in the first place!",
                "mnemonic": "To remember the {span:lang=ja:\u305d\u3046} reading we use the word \"soul.\""
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You're looking for a {tooltip:Radical:treasure}, but no normal treasure... a treasure that's a stash of {tooltip:Radical:energy}. Not gold, money, or anything like that. Imagine yourself finding it, and opening up a treasure chest. Out bursts a {tooltip:Kanji:spirit} ball of {tooltip:Kanji:energy} like you've never seen.",
