{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Rice paddy} {tooltip:Radical:power} comes from a {tooltip:Kanji:man}. One man, in fact. He's running on a big wheel next to the rice paddy and providing all of the power for the rice to grow and be harvested.",
