{
            "mnemonic": "{span:lang=ja:\u3061\u3083\u3093} is the honorific you put on a child's name. So, who is this mysterious child you're calling {tooltip:Kanji:red}? When a baby is born, what color are they? You got it, they're all red. And, because you want to be nice and cute you add {span:lang=ja:\u3061\u3083\u3093} to that. That's why {span:lang=ja:\u3042\u304b\u3061\u3083\u3093} is a {tooltip:Vocabulary:baby}.",
