                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings for the kanji that make this word are the kun'yomi readings, where fire's {span:lang=ja:\u3072} changes to {span:lang=ja:\u3073}. You already learned the kun'yomi reading for {span:lang=ja:\u82b1} when you learned the kanji, so it's only a matter of remembering to use the kun'yomi for {span:lang=ja:\u706b}. If you do, you should be able to read this word.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u82b1\u706b\u304c\u4e0a\u304c\u308b\u306e\u306f\u304d\u3093\u3088\u3046\u65e5\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u3002",
