{
            "mnemonic": "The kanji means {tooltip:Kanji:previous}. This is an adverb version of that word. It's a little thing you can begin sentences with. You can't start your sentences with \"previous\" but you can start it with \"{tooltip:Vocabulary:First of all}\" or \"{tooltip:Vocabulary:to start with}.\"",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
