                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "15201-subject-2727.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a kanji plus some hiragana attached, it should use the kun'yomi reading. When learning the kanji, you didn't learn that reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you with this word: \n{splitParent}Something is very, very {tooltip:Vocabulary:flat}. Perhaps someone who doesn't eat much, like a model? Which model? Let's imagine it's {tooltip:Reading:Tyra} ({span:lang=ja:\u305f\u3044\u3089}) Banks.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d1\u30bd\u30b3\u30f3\u3092\u3001\u3069\u3053\u304b\u5e73\u3089\u306a\u3068\u3053\u308d\u306b\u304a\u3044\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Put your PC somewhere flat, please."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u306e\u5973\u306e\u5b50\u306f\u8d64\u306e\u30d3\u30fc\u7389\u3092\u516b\u3064\u5e73\u3089\u306a\u3068\u3053\u308d\u306b\u304a\u3044\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "That girl put eight red marbles in a flat place."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5e73\u3089\u3067\u7d30\u9577\u3044\u30d1\u30b9\u30bf\u306e\u540d\u524d\u899a\u3048\u3066\u306a\u3044\uff1f",
                    "en": "Do you remember the name of the pasta that is thin, long and flat?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

