                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can assume it uses the kun'yomi reading. The {span:lang=ja:\u3093} part of {span:lang=ja:\u3088\u3093} gets converted to a small {span:lang=ja:\u3063} though, so watch out for that.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
