                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. That's true for the {span:lang=ja:\u5343} part, but the {span:lang=ja:\u56db} reading is kun'yomi. You should know how to read this word as long as you've been studying your kanji!\n"
