                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well. Note that the {span:lang=ja:\u65e5} reading is the alternate reading, {span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3064}.\n"
