{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Kanji:writing} {tooltip:Kanji:letter} is simpler than it sounds. It's really just a {tooltip:Vocabulary:letter}, right? You're reading {span:lang=ja:\u6587\u5b57} right now, in fact!",
