                        "file": "15176-subject-2718.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. When learning the kanji, you didn't learn that reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you with this word: \n{splitParent}You need to go for a drive to the public gardens, but you aren't going to get your normal car, you're going to get your {tooltip:Kanji:other} car. Your {tooltip:Reading:hoe car} ({span:lang=ja:\u307b\u304b})! It's a car made entirely out of garden hoes. You can drive it and hoe with it at the same time! Your other car can't do that!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u4ed6\u306b\u3057\u3064\u3082\u3093\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "Any other questions?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30af\u30e9\u30b9\u306e\u4ed6\u306e\u304c\u304f\u751f\u306f\u305c\u3093\u305c\u3093\u5927\u3057\u305f\u3053\u3068\u306e\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306b\u898b\u3048\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "It looked like the other students in the class weren't great."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u5375\u3092\u3042\u3044\u3064\u306e\u5bb6\u306b\u6295\u3052\u308b\u306e\u306f\u3001\u4ed6\u306e\u65e5\u306b\u3057\u3088\u3046\u305c\u3002",
                    "en": "Let\u2019s throw these eggs at his house some other day."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

