{
            "mnemonic": "Everything that happened to you {tooltip:Kanji:previous}ly is just the {tooltip:Vocabulary:tip} of the iceberg, and the important stuff is {tooltip:Vocabulary:ahead} of you, in your {tooltip:Vocabulary:future}. So make sure you put that stuff {tooltip:Vocabulary:first}!",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Tip",
