                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This word uses the kun'yomi reading, which you haven't learned yet, but never fear! A mnemonic is here:\n{splitParent}Something is coming toward your face. It's black and spiky and it's definitely going {tooltip:Vocabulary:to hit} you right in the eye. It's an {tooltip:Reading:u}ni ({span:lang=ja:\u3046}). Have you ever seen one of those things before? You definitely aren't going to be happy with whoever is trying to hit you with an uni.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30ab\u30d6\u30ec\u30e9\u304c\u30db\u30fc\u30e0\u30e9\u30f3\u3092\u6253\u3061\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Cabrera hit a home run."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u307c\u304f\u306e\u5148\u751f\u306f\u3001\u30ad\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u3092\u6253\u3064\u306e\u304c\u4e16\u304b\u3044\u3067\u4e00\u3070\u3093\u306f\u3084\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "My teacher is the world's fastest keyboard typer."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30de\u30de\u306f\u72c2\u3063\u3066\u3001\u4eba\u53c2\u3067\u50d5\u306e\u304a\u3057\u308a\u3092\u4f55\u5ea6\u3082\u3072\u3069\u304f\u6253\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "My mom went crazy and pounded my butt with a carrot."
                }
            ],
