{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means \"life,\" making this word mean \"{tooltip:Vocabulary:to live}.\"",
