                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you to remember the {span:lang=ja:\u304b} portion. \n{splitParent}You have {tooltip:Vocabulary:to replace} your {tooltip:Reading:car} ({span:lang=ja:\u304b}). It is getting old, and seems like it will explode at any moment, literally.\n"
