                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}You need {tooltip:Vocabulary:to rest}, right? Don't just answer with a \"yes,\" this deserves a \"{tooltip:Reading:YAASS}\" ({span:lang=ja:\u3084\u3059})! YAAASSS let's RESSST!!!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306f\u3044\u3048\u3067\u4f11\u3093\u3067\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019m resting at home."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3084\u308b\u3068\u304d\u306b\u304d\u3061\u3093\u3068\u3084\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3092\u3084\u3063\u3066\u3001\u4f11\u3080\u3068\u304d\u306f\u3057\u3063\u304b\u308a\u4f11\u3093\u3060\u65b9\u304c\u3044\u3044\u3088\u3002",
