                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. When learning the kanji, you didn't learn that reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you with this word: \n{splitParent}You walk into this town. You hate it (because it's vocab, and who doesn't hate vocab?). So what do you do? You pull out a {tooltip:Reading:match} ({span:lang=ja:\u307e\u3061}) and burn this town to the ground. Whoa, you some kind of psycho?\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u753a\u306b\u306f\u3001\u30b3\u30f3\u30d3\u30cb\u304c\u304a\u304a\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "There are a lot of convenience stores in this town."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3088\u308b\u3001\u4e00\u4eba\u3067\u3053\u306e\u753a\u3092\u3042\u308b\u304f\u306e\u306f\u304d\u3051\u3093\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "It's dangerous to walk alone in this town at night."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u79c1\u306e\u753a\u306f\u3001\u6700\u9ad8\u306e\u30a8\u30a2\u30ae\u30bf\u30fc\u3092\u4f5c\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3067\u6709\u540d\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "My town is famous for making the best invisible guitars."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

