                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Anyone with some {tooltip:Vocabulary:treasure} is going to be a real talker about it. In fact, they act like they're the Egyptian Sun God, Ra, and they have way more treasure than they really do. Making them a {tooltip:Reading:talker} like {tooltip:Reading:Ra} ({span:lang=ja:\u305f\u304b\u3089}), a Takara, if you will.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
