                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it uses the kun'yomi reading. Here's a mnemonic to help you to remember it: \n{splitParent}Since you have generations of people making up this {tooltip:Vocabulary:world}, think of the rapper generation. What do they say all the time (obviously I don't know anything about rap)? They say \"{tooltip:Reading:Yo} yo yo!\" ({span:lang=ja:\u3088}).\n"
