                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You learned this reading when you learned {span:lang=ja:\u751f\u307e\u308c\u308b}. Just drop the {span:lang=ja:\u308b} off the end and you have your reading!\n"
