                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for this word is all kun'yomi despite being jukugo. Just think of sketchy things going on in the downtown, just like how there's sketchy kun'yomi readings for this word. You should know both the kun'yomi readings from the previous level, though, so if you do you know the reading for this word as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306f\u3001\u4e0b\u753a\u3067\u305d\u3060\u3061\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I grew up downtown."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3068\u3046\u304d\u3087\u3046\u306e\u4e0b\u753a\u306b\u3042\u308b\u3080\u304b\u3057\u306a\u304c\u3089\u306e\u3055\u304b\u3070\u306b\u884c\u3063\u3066\u307f\u305f\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I'd like to go to a good old fashioned saloon in the backstreet areas of the old cities of Tokyo."
