                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "37439-subject-2760.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for {span:lang=ja:\u6bce} is what you'd expect. The reading for {span:lang=ja:\u5e74} is the kun'yomi reading, though. So, use your knowledge of the vocab {span:lang=ja:\u5e74} to help yourself to remember the reading for this word. You'll need to remember that the reading for this word is strange to get it into that brain of yours. \n{splitParent}That being said, the reading {span:lang=ja:\u307e\u3044\u306d\u3093} works as well. I don't like this one as much as {span:lang=ja:\u307e\u3044\u3068\u3057} but it's equally acceptable.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5c71\u7530\u3055\u3093\u306f\u3001\u6bce\u5e74\u3069\u3053\u306b\u308a\u3087\u884c\u306b\u884c\u304d\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Where does Yamada go for her trip every year?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306e\u304b\u624b\u306f\u6bce\u5e74\u5f15\u305f\u3044\u3092\u53e3\u306b\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u306e\u3067\u3001\u304d\u3063\u3068\u4eca\u56de\u3082\u305f\u3060\u306e\u3064\u308a\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002",
                    "en": "That singer hints at retiring every year, so he must be saying it again this time just to get people to react."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u79c1\u306f\u3001\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3\u30bd\u30f3\u3055\u3093\u4e00\u5bb6\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306b\u300110\u5e74\u9593\u6bce\u5e74\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u6249\u3092\u5efa\u3066\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3\u30bd\u30f3\u3055\u3093\u305f\u3061\u306f\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30eb\u306b\u6249\u3092\u4f7f\u308f\u305b\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3057\u306a\u3044\u306e\u3060\u308d\u3046\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019ve built a new door for the Johnson family every year for the past decade. Why don\u2019t they just stop letting the troll use it?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

