                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji, but in this case, we use the kun'yomi for {span:lang=ja:\u4f55}. {span:lang=ja:\u65e5} uses the on'yomi. \n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
