                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for {span:lang=ja:\u58f0} is {span:lang=ja:\u3054\u3048} (rendaku'd version of the reading you know: {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3048}). The reading for {span:lang=ja:\u5927} is the kun'yomi reading, like with the word {span:lang=ja:\u5927\u304d\u3044} ({span:lang=ja:\u304a\u304a\u304d\u3044}). Just imagine a loud voice saying \"{span:lang=ja:\u304a\u304a\uff01}.\"\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u3093\u306a\u5927\u58f0\u3092\u51fa\u3055\u306a\u3044\u3067\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please don\u2019t use such a loud voice."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u304a\u3082\u308f\u305a\u5927\u58f0\u3092\u51fa\u3057\u3066\u308f\u3089\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I couldn't help laughing out loud."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30af\u30ea\u30b9\u30c6\u30a3\u30fc\u30ca\u306f\u5927\u58f0\u306e\u6301\u3061\u4e3b\u3067\u3001\u6b8b\u5ff5\u306a\u3053\u3068\u306b\u305d\u308c\u3092\u4f7f\u3046\u306e\u3092\u5168\u304f\u306f\u3070\u304b\u3089\u306a\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Christina has a loud voice, and unfortunately, she\u2019s not afraid to use it."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
