                        "file": "37588-subject-2754.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u304a\u304a\u3044",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "17677-subject-2754.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}Think of something that is {tooltip:Vocabulary:many}. Doesn't matter what it is as long as you imagine a ridiculous number of them. Many of them. So many that they start avalanching into you and crushing you. The last thing you yell is \"{span:lang=ja:\u304a\u304a}!!!\" as you get smushed.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u308a\u3087\u3046\u308a\u306f\u591a\u3059\u304e\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "There is too much food."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u81ea\u5206\u306f\u6b63\u3057\u3044\u300d\u3068\u304a\u3082\u3044\u3053\u3093\u3067\u3044\u308b\u4eba\u306f\u591a\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "There are many people who firmly believe that they are right."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u96fb\u8eca\u306b\u306f\u3068\u3066\u3082\u591a\u304f\u306e\u4e57\u5ba2\u304c\u4e57\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305f\u306e\u3067\u3001\u7720\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306f\u3067\u304d\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u304c\u3001\u5927\u58f0\u3067\u6b4c\u3046\u3053\u3068\u306f\u3067\u304d\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I wasn\u2019t able to sleep because there were far too many people on the train, so I just sang loudly instead."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

