                        "file": "37416-subject-2799.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for {span:lang=ja:\u91d1} is different from the one you learned with the kanji. Makes sense since this is a single kanji with hiragana attached. Here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}You've saved up a ton of money. With it you're going to buy something awesome. Then, suddenly someone hits you in the knees with a bat. Now you have to spend all your {tooltip:Vocabulary:money} buying a {tooltip:Reading:cane} ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u306d}). Sucks for you :(\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u5199\u3057\u3093\u306f\u3001\u304a\u91d1\u3088\u308a\u3082\u5927\u5207\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "This photo is more important than money."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u304a\u91d1\u3092\u306a\u3081\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3068\u30d0\u30c1\u304c\u5f53\u305f\u308b\u3088\uff01",
                    "en": "If you're careless with money, it's going to bite you in the butt."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u6a5f\u68b0\u306f\u3001\u304a\u91d1\u3092\u53d6\u308a\u3042\u3052\u308b\u3051\u3069\u306a\u3093\u306e\u898b\u8fd4\u308a\u3082\u304f\u308c\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3089\u3001\u6c17\u3092\u3064\u3051\u305f\u65b9\u304c\u3044\u3044\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "You should be aware that this machine takes your money and gives you nothing in return."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
