                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is the on'yomi readings put together, though {span:lang=ja:\u6708} is modified and shortened a bit. {span:lang=ja:\u3052\u3064} goes to {span:lang=ja:\u3052\u3063}. Make note of the different sized {span:lang=ja:\u3064} otherwise you'll be confused why you keep getting this one wrong over and over again!\n"
