                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "12958-subject-2620.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. You haven't learned this reading yet, so here's a mnemonic to help you:\n{splitParent}Your {tooltip:Vocabulary:older brother} is different from everyone else's. He has odd powers... some would say powers of the force. Do you know what his name is? It's {tooltip:Reading:Ani} ({span:lang=ja:\u3042\u306b}), short for Anikin... wait a sec, does that sound familiar?\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5c71\u4e0b\u3055\u3093\u306f\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306e\u5144\u306b\u306b\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "You look like my older brother, Mr. Yamashita."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e00\u30f6\u6708\u307e\u3048\u306b\u5144\u304c\u304f\u308d\u30e9\u30d6\u3092\u3064\u308c\u3066\u3044\u3048\u306b\u304b\u3048\u3063\u3066\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "A month ago, my older brother came home with a black labrador."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5144\u306f\u3001\u3068\u3046\u3075\u306b\u30b3\u30fc\u30d2\u30fc\u3092\u304b\u3051\u3066\u305f\u3079\u308b\u306e\u304c\u3059\u304d\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "My older brother likes eating tofu covered in coffee."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

