                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. When learning the kanji, you didn't learn that reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you with this word: \n{splitParent}In the sky, you are the ruler. You are known as \"The {tooltip:Reading:soarer}!\" ({span:lang=ja:\u305d\u3089}). Imagine your theme song and make sure it includes \"soarer of the sky\" or something awesome like that.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u7a7a\u306b\u304d\u308c\u3044\u306a\u306b\u3058\u304c\u304b\u304b\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "There is a beautiful rainbow in the sky."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5973\u5fc3\u3068\u3042\u304d\u306e\u7a7a\u3068\u3044\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u7537\u5fc3\u3060\u3063\u3066\u304b\u308f\u308a\u3084\u3059\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "They say that women's minds and the autumn skies change quickly, but men's minds change quickly too."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u591c\u6620\u753bE.T.\u306e\u6709\u540d\u306a\u30b7\u30fc\u30f3\u304c\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u898b\u308c\u308b\u304f\u3089\u3044\u3001\u7a7a\u304c\u6674\u308c\u6e21\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3068\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3060\u304c\u3002",
                    "en": "I hope the sky tonight is clear enough for us to see the famous scene from the movie E.T."
                }
