                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "32793-subject-2577.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}You have to remember the {span:lang=ja:\u3046} part of this word to be able to read it. It's the same as {span:lang=ja:\u751f\u307e\u308c\u308b}, so that could help if you've learned that word already. If not, just imagine yourself giving birth, and all you can do is scream: \"{tooltip:Reading:UUuUUuuUUuUuu!}\" ({span:lang=ja:\u3046}).\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u304b\u308c\u306e\u306f\u3064\u3052\u3093\u306f\u3001\u304e\u3082\u3093\u3092\u751f\u3093\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "His remark produced problems."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3054\u304b\u3044\u3092\u751f\u3080\u3088\u3046\u306a\u3068\u3046\u3053\u3046\u306f\u3057\u306a\u3044\u3067\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please do not post things that could give rise to misunderstandings."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u304a\u3063\u3068\u306e\u5b50\u3067\u306f\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u304c\u3001\u751f\u3080\u3057\u304b\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Even though it wasn\u2019t my husband\u2019s, I had no choice but to give birth to the baby."
                }
            ],
