                        "file": "37397-subject-2787.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}You have to remember the {span:lang=ja:\u307e\u306a} part to learn this word's reading. Think about a class you're taking. It's a manners class, and you're there {tooltip:Vocabulary:to learn} {tooltip:Reading:manner}s ({span:lang=ja:\u307e\u306a}). Imagine this study of manners and imagine yourself practicing it.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306f\u3001\u3069\u304f\u5b66\u3067\u65e5\u672c\u3054\u3092\u5b66\u3093\u3067\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019m learning Japanese through self-study."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u65e5\u672c\u3054\u3092\u3079\u3093\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3059\u308b\u306e\u306f\u3084\u3081\u3066\u3001\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u3068\u3044\u3063\u3057\u3087\u306b\u3078\u3093\u304c\u304a\u3068\u3078\u3093\u306a\u30dd\u30fc\u30ba\u3092\u5b66\u3073\u307e\u305b\u3093\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Why don't you learn how to make weird faces and poses with Tofugu, instead of studying Japanese?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5b66\u3076\u3053\u3068\u306f\u5927\u5207\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u304a\u305d\u3089\u304f\u3082\u3063\u3068\u5927\u5207\u306a\u306e\u306f\u3069\u306e\u3088\u3046\u306b\u5b66\u3076\u304b\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3058\u3083\u306a\u3044\u3060\u308d\u3046\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "Learning is important, but perhaps what\u2019s more important is how you learn."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

