                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}You have a bag of walnuts that you're bringing to a friend's house but you trip and drop them all on the ground. You shout, \"{tooltip:Reading:Mah Wa}lnuts! ({span:lang=ja:\u307e\u308f})\" as they start {tooltip:Vocabulary:to revolve} around you on the ground. Picture your walnuts going around you, getting all dirty.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u65e5\u306f\u3001\u304a\u304d\u3083\u304f\u3055\u3093\u3068\uff11\uff18\u30db\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u56de\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I went around 18 holes with a customer today."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u767e\u5186\u7389\u306f\u307e\u3060\u3064\u304f\u3048\u306e\u4e0a\u3067\u56de\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "That 100 yen coin is still spinning on the desk."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u60d1\u661f\u304c\u592a\u967d\u306e\u5468\u308a\u3092\u56de\u308b\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3001\u305d\u306e\u5b50\u732b\u305f\u3061\u304c\u89aa\u732b\u306e\u5468\u308a\u3092\u56de\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "Those kittens revolve around their mother like the planets revolve around the sun."
                }
