                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u306f\u3057\u308b",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "37591-subject-2840.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u306f\u3057\u308b",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "17674-subject-2840.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}You have to remember the {span:lang=ja:\u306f\u3057} portion. Think of yourself running. It's nice. As you run, though, you notice the ground changing into something weird and mushy. Everything is turning into {tooltip:Reading:hash} ({span:lang=ja:\u306f\u3057}) browns. You start to get sucked in, and soon you can't run anymore. Smell the hash browns and taste them too. What a terrible run this was.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3048\u3044\u304c\u306b\u304a\u304f\u308c\u305d\u3046\u3060\u3063\u305f\u306e\u3067\u3001\u8d70\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I ran because I was almost late for the movie."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u30ab\u30e1\u3088\u308a\u3082\u306f\u3084\u304f\u8d70\u308c\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi can run faster than a turtle."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eba\u751f\u8d70\u308a\u7d9a\u3051\u308b\u3088\u308a\u3001\u4f8d\u306b\u9996\u3092\u306f\u306d\u3089\u308c\u308b\u65b9\u304c\u305a\u3063\u3068\u307e\u3057\u3060\u3068\u3044\u3046\u7d50\u8ad6\u306b\u9054\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019ve come to the conclusion that having my head cut off by a samurai would be much worse than running for my life."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:say}, so the verb version of that is {tooltip:Vocabulary:to say}.",
