                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}If you want {tooltip:Vocabulary:to think}, the best way to do so is to do the {tooltip:Reading:conga} ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u3093\u304c}). Imagine yourself doing the conga and thinking away. You're so inspired! The thoughts are flowing as freely as your sweet, slow dance moves.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5c11\u3057\u8003\u3048\u3055\u305b\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
