                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is also an exception. It can be {span:lang=ja:\u3044\u304d}, but instead we're focusing on the {span:lang=ja:\u3086\u304d} reading. You have to remember the {span:lang=ja:\u3086} portion, so think of it this way: \n{splitParent}Just think about the {tooltip:Vocabulary:train direction} that {tooltip:Reading:you} ({span:lang=ja:\u3086}) need to go in. It's all about you. Not your friends or anyone else. You. You are the most important person at this train station.\n"
