                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for this word is the kun'yomi reading which you learned previously when you learned the vocab word {span:lang=ja:\u4eca}. You can tell this is a kun'yomi reading because it has hiragana attached. So if you know that, you should be able to read this word as well.\n"
