                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. When learning the kanji, you didn't learn that reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you with this word: \n{splitParent}You go off to the {tooltip:Vocabulary:west}. It's the Wild West, even. There aren't many people out here, making it easy to find a {tooltip:Reading:niche} ({span:lang=ja:\u306b\u3057}) for your snake oil business.\n"
