{
            "mnemonic": "What is the {tooltip:Kanji:color} of {tooltip:Kanji:tea}? You'd think it would be green, assuming it's Japanese... but this word came from China. What color is Chinese tea? It tends to be more {tooltip:Vocabulary:brown}. Think Oolong tea, for example.",
