                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3084\u3059\u3044",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "19679-subject-2859.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}\"Would you like this item for {tooltip:Vocabulary:cheap}?\" \n{splitParent}\"Uh, {tooltip:Reading:yes} ({span:lang=ja:\u3084\u3059}) please!\" \n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u3057\u3066\u3001\u3067\u3093\u8eca\u306f\u5b89\u3044\u65b9\u304c\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Also, the cheap train is better."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30bf\u30a4\u306e\u3076\u3063\u304b\u306f\u30a2\u30e1\u30ea\u30ab\u3088\u308a\u3082\u5b89\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Prices in Thailand are cheaper than America."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30a2\u30d1\u30fc\u30c8\u306e\u5c4b\u6839\u304b\u3089\u6295\u3052\u3066\u7c89\u3005\u306b\u306a\u308b\u306e\u3092\u898b\u3066\u307f\u305f\u304b\u3063\u305f\u306e\u3067\u3001\u6628\u65e5\u3059\u3054\u304f\u5b89\u3044\u30e9\u30b8\u30aa\u3092\u8cb7\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I bought a very cheap radio yesterday just so I could throw it off the roof of my apartment and watch it shatter."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:middle} {tooltip:Kanji:country}... who could that be? Let's think about it. Who invented kanji and therefore probably thinks they're the middle of the world? Who also is just a huge country that ruled much of Asia? That would be none other than {tooltip:Vocabulary:China}.",
