                    "en": "Next month I\u2019m traveling to China on business."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u51ac\u4f11\u307f\u306b\u3001\u4e2d\u56fd\u3067\u308a\u3085\u3046\u661f\u3050\u3093\u3092\u898b\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "During winter break, I watched the meteor shower in China."
                },
