                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "19619-subject-2908.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. When learning the kanji, you didn't learn that reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you with this word: \n{splitParent}What's in {tooltip:Vocabulary:front} of you? Think about it. Make it something ridiculous. Now look at a tag that's on it. Who does this thing belong to? Oh, wait, it's {tooltip:Reading:my} ({span:lang=ja:\u307e\u3048}) thing there in front of me. Say that out loud for better memory.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u524d\u306f\u82b1\u3084\u3067\u3001\u82b1\u3084\u306e\u3068\u306a\u308a\u306f\u3055\u304b\u306a\u3084\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "In front is a flower shop and next door to it is a fish shop."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6bce\u3042\u3055\u3001\u4f1a\u793e\u306b\u884c\u304f\u524d\u306b\u3001\u30b9\u30af\u30ef\u30c3\u30c8\u3092\u4e94\u767e\u56de\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Every morning I do 500 squats before leaving for work."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u8d64\u4fe1\u53f7\u306e\u524d\u306b\u3044\u308b\u6642\u3001\u300c\u3082\u3046\u3059\u3050\u9752\u306b\u5909\u308f\u308b\u305e\uff01\u300d\u3068\u601d\u3046\u3068\u304b\u306a\u308a\u8208\u596e\u3059\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "When I\u2019m in front of a red light, I get very excited at the thought of it turning green soon."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

