                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is the on'yomi reading, but {span:lang=ja:\u571f} gets modified to {span:lang=ja:\u3068} for some reason. Just remember that the land you're standing on is made of {tooltip:Reading:toe}s... millions of them. Yuck.\n"
