                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word and uses the on'yomi readings of the kanji. The {span:lang=ja:\u3061\u3087\u304f} of {span:lang=ja:\u76f4} is shortened with a small {span:lang=ja:\u3063}, though, so make sure to take note of that.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u3072\u884c\u304d\u306f\u3001\u6771\u4eac\u306b\u76f4\u884c\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "This airplane is nonstop to Tokyo."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u65e5\u306f\u3001\u65e5\u672c\u3068\u306e\u4f1a\u304e\u306e\u5f8c\u3001\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u3068\u306e\u30a2\u30dd\u306b\u76f4\u884c\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Today after the meeting with Japan, I'll go directly to the appointment with Tofugu."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3054\u3081\u3093\u306a\u3055\u3044\u3001\u4eca\u306f\u8a71\u305b\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u30c8\u30a4\u30ec\u3078\u76f4\u884c\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3068\u3053\u308d\u306a\u306e\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019m sorry, I can't talk right now. I\u2019m on a nonstop trip to the bathroom."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
