                    "en": "After having worked in the insurance industry for eight years, I went to America to study abroad."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u79c1\u306f\u3069\u3053\u304b\u6d77\u5916\u3067\u4f4f\u307f\u305f\u3044\u3068\u601d\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u304c\u3001\u65c5\u884c\u306f\u5acc\u3044\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "I want to live somewhere overseas, but I hate traveling."
