{
            "mnemonic": "Something is {tooltip:Kanji:flat} and {tooltip:Kanji:relax}ed. That is you. What words does that describe? To me, that would be {tooltip:Vocabulary:peace} and {tooltip:Vocabulary:tranquility}. Just imagine something that is flat and relaxed, like a field of grass with happy people in it. It's so {tooltip:Vocabulary:peaceful}! It's so {tooltip:Vocabulary:tranquil}! This is also the way you write the {tooltip:Vocabulary:Heian} period of Japanese history.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Peace",
