{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. Remember how {span:lang=ja:\u751f\u304d\u308b} means \"to live?\" Well this is what happens right after it starts to live. It begins {tooltip:Vocabulary:to grow}!",
