{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:East} {tooltip:Kanji:North} area of Japan is called {tooltip:Vocabulary:Tohoku} or the {tooltip:Vocabulary:Tohoku region}. It was the region hit by the 2011 Tohoku Earthquake. This can also mean {tooltip:Vocabulary:northeast region} when talking about China or Japan, but for other countries (and for the direction) we'd use {span:lang=ja:\u5317\u6771}.",
