                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}To learn to read this kanji you have to remember the {span:lang=ja:\u306a} part of {span:lang=ja:\u4ea1\u304f}, though our mnemonic will use the whole thing.\n{splitParent}If you're about to become deceased, you are probably {tooltip:Reading:knock}ing ({span:lang=ja:\u306a\u304f}) on death's door.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u307e\u3064\u672c\u3055\u3093\u304c\u3001\u4ea1\u304f\u306a\u3063\u305f\u305d\u3046\u3067\u3059\u3002",
