{
            "mnemonic": "America is the {tooltip:Kanji:country} of {tooltip:Kanji:rice}. I guess this is from all those rolling plains and such we have. Another way to say America in Japanese is {span:lang=ja:\u30a2\u30e1\u30ea\u30ab}, but this is another more formal (and older) way. \"Rice Country\" aka {tooltip:Vocabulary:United States Of America}, {tooltip:Vocabulary:United States}, {tooltip:Vocabulary:America}, or {tooltip:Vocabulary:USA}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
