                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u7c73\u56fd\u306e\u5927\u3068\u3046\u308a\u3087\u3046\u306e\u540d\u307e\u3048\u3092\u77e5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "Do you know the name of the president of the United States?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u7c73\u56fd\u306b\u306f\u5143\u3005\u4f55\u3082\u304d\u305f\u3044\u306a\u3093\u3066\u3057\u3066\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "I never expected anything from the US anyways."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u591a\u304f\u306e\u4eba\u306f\u3001\u5358\u306b\u30de\u30af\u30c9\u30ca\u30eb\u30c9\u306e\u30b9\u30fc\u30d1\u30fc\u30b5\u30a4\u30ba\u30b3\u30f3\u30dc\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306b\u7c73\u56fd\u306b\u79fb\u4f4f\u3059\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "Many people immigrate to the United States solely for the super-size combos at McDonald\u2019s."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
