                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "After bursting out of this bird, she turns her head sharply in your direction. \"I don't just own the streets, I own the birds too. I'm inside every bird, and I, Mrs Chou, can burst out at any time.",
                "mnemonic": "Think of a run of the mill {tooltip:Kanji:bird}, whatever comes to mind for you first is fine. Then, your lovely bird swells. The shape of a face, then a hand, start stretching the bird apart until it explodes outward. Covered in blood and feathers is Mrs. {tooltip:Reading:Chou} ({span:lang=ja:\u3061\u3087\u3046})."
            }
