{
            "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Radical:boat} has {tooltip:Radical:fins} and a {tooltip:Radical:mouth}! It's still a {tooltip:Kanji:boat} though.",
            "hints": "Picture this boat. It's still a boat, but there is a big mouth on the front and it has fins that it paddles forward with.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Boat",
                "Alternatives": "Ship, Vessel"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
