                "mnemonic": "You catch a {tooltip:Kanji:fish}. As you pull it out of the water, it starts yelling and pointing: \"{tooltip:Reading:GO}!\" ({span:lang=ja:\u304e\u3087}). \"GO GYO GYO GYO!\" There's a huge cruise ship coming right towards your little fishing boat. No wonder the fish was yelling GO at you."
