                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This consists of a couple kun'yomi readings put together. You can tell it's kun'yomi because of the hiragana sticking out at the end. In previous levels, you learned both the words {span:lang=ja:\u5148} and {span:lang=ja:\u56de\u308b} (verb version of {span:lang=ja:\u56de\u308a}). If you know those, you should be able to put them together to learn the reading of this word as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5148\u56de\u308a\u3057\u3066\u3001\u307e\u3061\u3076\u305b\u3057\u3088\u3046\uff01",
                    "en": "Let\u2019s go ahead and ambush them!"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30ea\u30af\u306f\u3068\u3066\u3082\u305b\u3063\u304b\u3061\u3067\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3082\u4eba\u306e\u8a71\u3092\u304b\u3063\u624b\u306b\u3088\u305d\u3046\u3057\u3066\u5148\u56de\u308a\u3057\u3066\u8a71\u3059\u304b\u3089\u3001\u3059\u3054\u304f\u30a4\u30e9\u30a4\u30e9\u3059\u308b\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "Riku is very impatient, and always tries to anticipate what I'm going to say before I've said it, and it's been really annoying me."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5f7c\u306f\u5148\u56de\u308a\u3092\u3057\u3066\u5bcc\u58eb\u5c71\u306e\u9802\u4e0a\u306b\u7740\u3044\u3066\u304a\u308a\u3001\u79c1\u306e\u3053\u3068\u3092\u306e\u308d\u307e\u3068\u7b11\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "He beat me to the top of Mt. Fuji and then laughed at me for being slow."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This is a strange one, but only at first glance. You {tooltip:Kanji:make} a {tooltip:Kanji:house}. You'd think this would mean something like \"building a house\" or \"construction\" or something. Instead, it means author. Think of it this way: An {tooltip:Vocabulary:author} {tooltip:Kanji:makes} (writes and creates works) in their {tooltip:Kanji:home}. Authors don't make their word magic in a corporate office!",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Author",
                "Alternatives": "Writer, Novelist",
                "Word Type": "noun"
