                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "19854-subject-2955.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings are on'yomi readings, though {span:lang=ja:\u3055\u304f} from {span:lang=ja:\u4f5c} gets shortened to {span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3063}. Just be sure to remember that and you should be able to read this word just fine.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u3053\u304c\u308c\u306e\u4f5c\u5bb6\u3055\u3093\u304b\u3089\u3001\u30b5\u30a4\u30f3\u3092\u3082\u3089\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I got an autograph from an aspiring author."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u4f5c\u5bb6\u3001\u305a\u3044\u3076\u3093\u601d\u3044\u5207\u3063\u305f\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "This novelist pushed things pretty far, eh?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306e\u30d9\u30b9\u30c8\u30bb\u30e9\u30fc\u4f5c\u5bb6\u306e\u8da3\u5473\u306f\u30b5\u30c3\u30ab\u30fc\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "That best-selling author\u2019s hobby is playing soccer."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Kanji:wind} {tooltip:Kanji:boat}. This is a strange one for sure. You may assume this is like one of those giant balloons you can go ride around in, and you'd be partly right. Really, this word covers the general word {tooltip:Vocabulary:balloon}, though it especially has to do with the toy-style balloons (or smaller balloons). It's a little round wind ship!",
