                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for {span:lang=ja:\u4eba} is pretty normal, though the reading for {span:lang=ja:\u5f62} is different from the one you learned. To remember this, think of a doll... made totally of {tooltip:Reading:gyo}za ({span:lang=ja:\u304e\u3087\u3046}) dumplings. This doll is crazy (like most dolls) and it's eating itself and trying to get you to eat some of it too. Hey... why you no eat me? Mmmm. Gyoza doll.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u305f\u3093\u751f\u65e5\u30d7\u30ec\u30bc\u30f3\u30c8\u306b\u3001\u4eba\u5f62\u3092\u3082\u3063\u3066\u884c\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019m going to bring a doll for her birthday present."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u306e\u4eba\u5f62\u3001\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u5143\u306e\u3068\u3053\u308d\u306b\u3082\u3069\u3057\u3066\u304a\u3044\u3066\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "Put the doll back the way you found it."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "17\u6b73\u307e\u3067\u3001\u79c1\u306e\u89aa\u53cb\u306f\u9774\u4e0b\u3067\u4f5c\u3063\u305f\u8155\u4eba\u5f62\u3060\u3063\u305f\u3002",
