                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "19860-subject-2982.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. When learning the kanji, you didn't learn that reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you with this word: \n{splitParent}Imagine a {tooltip:Vocabulary:fish}. Now imagine the fish playing soccer, while wearing a nun's outfit. This is a {tooltip:Reading:soccer nu}n ({span:lang=ja:\u3055\u304b\u306a}).\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u9b5a\u306f\u3059\u304d\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u751f\u9b5a\u306f\u306b\u304c\u624b\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I like fish, but I don\u2019t like it raw."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d0\u30e9\u30f3\u30b9\u306e\u3044\u3044\u3061\u3087\u3046\u98df\u3092\u3068\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306b\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3082\u30b0\u30e9\u30ce\u30fc\u30e9\u3068\u9b5a\u3092\u98df\u3079\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I always eat granola and fish for a well-balanced breakfast."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3082\u3046\u7d76\u5bfe\u306b\u30e1\u30ad\u30b7\u30b3\u306e\u8efd\u30c8\u30e9\u306e\u7a4d\u307f\u8377\u304b\u3089\u9b5a\u3092\u8cb7\u3046\u3082\u3093\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019ll never buy fish from the back of a pickup truck in Mexico again."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Your future consists of {tooltip:Kanji:certain} {tooltip:Kanji:death}. How would you feel in this situation? Probably very {tooltip:Vocabulary:frantic} and {tooltip:Vocabulary:desperate}. ",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Frantic",
                "Alternatives": "Desperate, Certain Death, Sure Death",
                "Word Type": "\u306a adjective, \u306e adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3072\u3063\u3057"
