                        "pronunciation": "\u3072\u3063\u3057",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "19867-subject-2944.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings are the on'yomi readings, though {span:lang=ja:\u5fc5} ({span:lang=ja:\u3072\u3064}) gets shortened to {span:lang=ja:\u3072\u3063}. In your {tooltip:Vocabulary:desperate} situation just imagine that you're trying to get out of it, and to do so you move the {span:lang=ja:\u3064} only to find a smaller {span:lang=ja:\u3063} blocking your way. It is certain death.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5fc5\u6b7b\u306b\u304c\u3093\u3070\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3001\u3069\u3046\u306b\u3082\u306a\u3089\u306a\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3042\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "Even if I try desperately, it might still be futile."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306e\u305d\u7236\u306f\u3001\u5fc5\u6b7b\u306e\u304b\u304f\u3054\u3067\u305b\u3093\u3058\u3087\u3046\u306b\u5411\u304b\u3063\u305f\u305d\u3046\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I heard that my grandfather went to the war front prepared to die."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u968a\u9577\u3001\u79c1\u306f\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u3082\u706b\u661f\u306b\u623b\u308b\u5fc5\u8981\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002\u30a2\u30a4\u30d5\u30a9\u30f3\u3092\u5fd8\u308c\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u306e\u3067\u3059\u3002\u300d\u5f7c\u306f\u5fc5\u6b7b\u306b\u983c\u3093\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "\"Captain, I really need to return to Mars. I left my iPhone there,\" he said desperately."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
