{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:reason} the {tooltip:Kanji:earth} is the way it is because of the {tooltip:Vocabulary:geography} of it. Though it may seem kind of strange that geography is bringing reason to the earth, if you think of geography as a study, then you can think about how you try to get reason through that, as well.",
