                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "40888-subject-3422.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings for these kanji are the kun'yomi readings. Just think of this word as two separate words put together ({span:lang=ja:\u624b} and {span:lang=ja:\u4f5c\u308b}). The {span:lang=ja:\u308b} in {span:lang=ja:\u4f5c\u308b} gets changed to {span:lang=ja:\u308a} because it's an adjective, and the {span:lang=ja:\u3064} in {span:lang=ja:\u3064\u304f\u308a} gets changed to {span:lang=ja:\u3065} because of the way the words are combined with each other. You should know most of the reading that is in this word, though it will probably take a little bit of thinking to sort out the little changes in those readings.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u306f\u3001\u6797\u3055\u3093\u306e\u624b\u4f5c\u308a\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "This table was handmade by Hayashi."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6bce\u65e5\u624b\u4f5c\u308a\u306e\u30d0\u30e9\u30f3\u30b9\u306e\u3044\u3044\u98df\u3058\u3092\u3068\u308b\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I try to have a homemade, well-balanced diet every day."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u624b\u4f5c\u308a\u306e\u30d7\u30ec\u30bc\u30f3\u30c8\u306f\u3001\u3069\u308c\u3060\u3051\u6687\u306a\u6642\u9593\u304c\u3042\u308b\u304b\u3063\u3066\u3053\u3068\u304c\u30d0\u30ec\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u306e\u3067\u3001\u7d50\u69cb\u6016\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Handmade presents are pretty scary because they reveal that you have too much free time."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

