                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings for this word are both kun'yomi readings. You've learned both of these readings by now so you should be able to read this on your own. Just remember that {span:lang=ja:\u305d\u3089} becomes {span:lang=ja:\u305e\u3089} because of rendaku here.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5927\u7a7a\u3092\u898b\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3089\u3001\u3044\u3084\u306a\u6c17\u3082\u3061\u304c\u3075\u304d\u3068\u3093\u3060\u3002",
