{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:reason}ing of your {tooltip:Kanji:heart} decides what you do. Probably when kanji was being made people thought that the heart directed our actions, not our brains. So, if you think about it that way, the reasoning of your heart is your {tooltip:Vocabulary:mental state}. Nowadays that's known as {tooltip:Vocabulary:psychology}.",
            "hints": "",
