                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}So you wanna be {tooltip:Vocabulary:strong} huh? Well, all you have to do is eat these {tooltip:Reading:two yo}gurts ({span:lang=ja:\u3064\u3088}). One is filled with horse steroids, the other is full of bull steroids. They will make you so strong.\n"
