                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. When learning the kanji, you didn't learn that reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you with this word:\n{splitParent}You can't find your {tooltip:Vocabulary:tag} anywhere. It was just there, you swear, but now it's nowhere to be found. You search for it everywhere, then you realize... it was right there all along. Seriously? You're such a {tooltip:Reading:foo}l, {tooltip:Reading:duh} ({span:lang=ja:\u3075\u3060})!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u304a\u672d\u306f\u3001\u3052\u3093\u304b\u3093\u306e\u30c9\u30a2\u306e\u5185\u304c\u308f\u306b\u306f\u3063\u3066\u304a\u3044\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please put this amulet on the inside of your front door."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u672d\u3092\u898b\u305b\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3057\u305f\u65b9\u304c\u3044\u3044\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "You should be careful not to show your hand."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b8\u30a7\u30ed\u3063\u3066\u307b\u3093\u3068\u306b\u30ad\u30e2\u3044\u3002\u30c9\u30af\u30ed\u30de\u30fc\u30af\u306e\u7d75\u304c\u63cf\u304b\u308c\u305f\u672d\u3067\u3082\u4ed8\u3051\u3066\u304a\u304f\u3079\u304d\u3060\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "Jello is really disgusting. There should be a picture of a skull and crossbones on the label."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This is a single kanji with an {span:lang=ja:\u3044} on the end, meaning you know it's probably an adjective. What's the adjective form of {tooltip:Kanji:tall} or {tooltip:Kanji:expensive}? It's the same: {tooltip:Vocabulary:tall} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:expensive}. ",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Tall",
                "Alternatives": "High, Expensive",
                "Word Type": "\u3044 adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u305f\u304b\u3044"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u305f\u304b\u3044",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
