                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "19909-subject-2941.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}So how did you lose the wedding ring anyway? Well... it was eaten by a cow. The {tooltip:Reading:\u725b now} ({span:lang=ja:\u3046\u3057} + {span:lang=ja:\u306a\u3046}) has to have it surgically removed. What a mess!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3082\u3046\u304a\u308c\u306b\u306f\u5931\u3046\u3082\u306e\u304c\u4f55\u3082\u306a\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "I already have nothing to lose."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u304c\u30ae\u30e3\u30f3\u30d6\u30eb\u3067\u5168\u3056\u3044\u3055\u3093\u3092\u5931\u3063\u305f\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3058\u3087\u3046\u307b\u3046\u306f\u3001\u3057\u3093\u3074\u3087\u3046\u305b\u3044\u306b\u6b20\u3051\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "The information that Tofugu gambled away its entire assets is not reliable."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eba\u751f\u6700\u60aa\u306e\u65e5\u306f\u3001\u79c1\u304cAKB48\u306e\u30d5\u30a3\u30ae\u30e5\u30a2\u3092\u5931\u3063\u305f\u65e5\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "The worst day of my life was when I lost my AKB48 Barbie doll."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
