                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Remember how you learned the reading for {span:lang=ja:\u5149}? Well this is almost the same thing. Just change the {span:lang=ja:\u308a} to {span:lang=ja:\u308b} and you'll know this reading!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
