                    "en": "The stars are shining."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u53f3\u306e\u304f\u3064\u306b\u3001\u5149\u308b\u3068\u308a\u3087\u3046\u304c\u4ed8\u3044\u3066\u308b\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "You've got some glittery paint on your right shoe."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u305d\u3053\u3067\u78ba\u304b\u306b\u4f55\u304b\u304c\u5149\u308b\u306e\u3092\u898b\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019m sure I saw something shining over there."
                }
            ],
