{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:teach} so the verb vocab version means {tooltip:Vocabulary:to teach}. It's also used to mean {tooltip:Vocabulary:to tell} in a more general sense.",
