                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}You just got beaten up because you're {tooltip:Vocabulary:weak}. Then the bully asks you: \"{tooltip:Reading:Yo! Why} ({span:lang=ja:\u3088\u308f}) you so weak?\"\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
