                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Do you know the word \"kamikaze\" from WWII history? Well, it means \"divine wind.\" The \"kaze\" part is the wind part, and this word uses the same reading, making it {span:lang=ja:\u304b\u305c} as well.\n"
