{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:stool} is in the {tooltip:Radical:cliff}. If someone has a stool deep inside a cliff, they are most likely pretty {tooltip:Kanji:anti} society, hiding away like that.",
            "hints": "Imagine someone who looks super antisocial (and a little feral). Ask them why they're sitting on this stool inside a cliff... they reply because they hate people. They are anti people!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Anti"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u306f\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Make sure you get to the point where you pull this anti-social guy's beard off, to reveal Han Solo beneath. Be surprised... not just because he's Han Solo, but because he's real, too! Maybe you can yell out \"Han! Your people need you!\"",
                "mnemonic": "Turns out, when you go to this guy and pull off his beard, he's {tooltip:Reading:Han} ({span:lang=ja:\u306f\u3093}) Solo, the {tooltip:Kanji:anti}-hero from Star Wars! What is Han doing here, so hidden away? He's obviously hiding from Jabba because he doesn't want to get frozen in carbonite again."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:wolverine} is going down a {tooltip:Radical:slide} into your {tooltip:Radical:mouth}. Why is he going into your mouth, though? You're opening it really wide, because you're screaming \"{tooltip:Kanji:BUDDY}!!! You're so excited to see your wolverine buddy-pal again. You thought he was dead.",
            "hints": "Make sure you feel super happy. Even yell \"Buddy\" out loud while imagining this wolverine coming at you, if you're not in a quiet-zone.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Buddy"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304f\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304d\u307f",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "\"RaCCOON!\" you yell. \"THIS IS NONE OF YOUR BUSINESS. Get out of here.\" Feel some hate for the raccoon. He ruined everything.",
                "mnemonic": "As you're about to embrace your {tooltip:Kanji:buddy} wolverine, a rac{tooltip:Reading:coon} tackles the wolverine off the slide, preventing your mouth embrace."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Your nation's {tooltip:Radical:flag} sits on top of a {tooltip:Radical:cape}d {tooltip:Radical:mouth}. This is the symbol for the \"{tooltip:Kanji:Bureau} of Secret Things.\" It's a special {tooltip:Kanji:department} of your government made to keep things hidden.",
            "hints": "The cape covering the mouth represents how this bureau never talks about their secrets. The flag represents your country. Think about all the cool secret things the Bureau of Secret Things must have.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Bureau",
                "Alternative": "Department"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304d\u3087\u304f",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Now, this mnemonic isn\u2019t perfectly close, but the goal is to get you close enough in your brain so that you can remember {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u304f} later. If you can get to CLOAK YOU, then you can get to {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u304f} much easier than just trying to get there from scratch. So imagine working in this bureau and getting to cloak yourself all the time.",
                "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:bureau}'s best-kept secret is cloaking devices that {tooltip:Reading:cloak you} ({span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u304f}) with the press of a button."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "There are some {tooltip:Radical:shellfish} in a {tooltip:Radical:net} that you can {tooltip:Kanji:buy}. You can't just buy loose shellfish. You can only buy the ones that are in the net, bagged up and ready for your money.",
            "hints": "Imagine looking over a bunch of different kinds of shellfish wrapped in nets. Think about which ones you want to buy.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Buy"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
