{
            "mnemonic": "Using just {tooltip:Radical:thread} {tooltip:Radical:meeting} the paper (with a little ink on the end) you create a masterpiece of a {tooltip:Kanji:drawing} (or a {tooltip:Kanji:painting}).",
            "hints": "It's unbelievable the kind of drawing you're able to draw with just the tip of a thread. So much detail. So artistic. If it helps, imagine that you drew the Mona Lisa, better than the original, only using this floppy thread tool.",
