                        "reading": "\u305f\u3059, \u3059\u3051",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You can imagine saving her however you like. Perhaps she was under a car, and you used your top hat powers to help her out of that situation by lifting it above your head.{splitParent}Note: Jo-Anne is the character we're using with {span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3087} reading mnemonics. She is short compared to Jourm ({span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3087\u3046}), the giant farmhand, which is how you'll differentiate the two similar readings.",
                "mnemonic": "The person you {tooltip:Kanji:help} with your top hat power? It's {tooltip:Reading:Jo}-Anne ({span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3087})."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:horse} radical and the {tooltip:Kanji:horse} kanji are exactly the same! Huzzah!",
