                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Or, so you think. He just keeps circling and circling. Feel some hate for the eagle. Why isn't he dropping the medicine? You don't have long to live!",
                "mnemonic": "When we need to remember the sound {span:lang=ja:\u3044} we use the word \"Eagle.\""
            }
