                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You watch the sun scaffolded by crosses, and the moon next to it, as you sip on your early-morning Asahi.",
                "mnemonic": "Every {tooltip:Kanji:morning} you have {tooltip:Reading:Asa}hi ({span:lang=ja:\u3042\u3055}) beer for breakfast."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You have to {tooltip:Radical:sickle} the {tooltip:Radical:rice paddy} today because it's your {tooltip:Kanji:turn}. This kanji also means {tooltip:Kanji:number in a series}, which is a lot like a turn. For example, you're number 3, so your turn will be number 3.",
            "hints": "Go through in your mind the system your farm / village uses for deciding who has to sickle on any given day. It rotates, and it's a turn-based system. So, do you all stand in a line? Is there a calendar? Come up with something interesting, focusing on your turn in the process you come up with. {splitParent} It will be helpful to remember both the \"number in a series\" and \"turn\" meanings for the vocab coming up in the future.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Number In A Series",
                "Alternatives": "Turn, Ordinal Number"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3070\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Try to feel disappointed by this. Strange thing to feel disappointed by, but you were a great sickler. You were going to win the great prize, too (come up with something huge!), but now you're banned for the season.",
                "mnemonic": "This {tooltip:Kanji:turn}-based rice sickle system is a contest as well! But, you are disappointed to find out that you have been {tooltip:Reading:ban}ned from the game because of the performance enhancing steroids you've been taking."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You're taking an {tooltip:Radical:axe} to a {tooltip:Radical:door}. You're absolutely crazy. \"I HATE THIS {tooltip:Kanji:PLACE}!!\" you keep yelling as you smash in the door.",
            "hints": "Why do you hate this place, in particular? Come up with a great reason why to help you to remember this very broad kanji meaning.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Place"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
