                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Come up with a weird reason as to why the circus is at this place you hate so much. Why did you come here with your axe? Does it have something to do with the circus show?",
                "mnemonic": "You finally break through the door and jump in. Inside is a great circus {tooltip:Reading:show} ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3087}). There are elephants, tightrope walkers, bears on unicycles, and more! The greatest show on earth, but why is it here at this {tooltip:Kanji:place}?"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The poor {tooltip:Radical:alligator} was taken far inland by a {tooltip:Radical:tsunami}. Now his only source of water is a tiny {tooltip:Kanji:pond} that barely fits his body, and doesn't even provide much food.",
            "hints": "Imagine the alligator riding the tsunami in. When he hits the ground, and the water recedes, he's all alone in a pond, but it doesn't provide much for him. Imagine him looking for food in the little, shallow pond. Imagine him trying to stay wet... it's just not a great situation to be in, unfortunately.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Pond"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3061",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3044\u3051",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture an alligator crying in a pond full of cheese. It's eating a piece really slowly and weeping.",
                "mnemonic": "The worst part about this {tooltip:Kanji:pond} is that the only thing for the alligator to eat is {tooltip:Reading:chee}se ({span:lang=ja:\u3061}). Cheese may be yummy for humans, but alligators hate it. They'd rather eat the cow the cheese came from. Sadly, this pond is full of cheese."
            }
        }

{
