                "hints": "Put nine full grown cucumbers into their holes so you can research what happens next.",
                "mnemonic": "You are {tooltip:Kanji:research}ing {tooltip:Reading:cu}cumbers ({span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3085\u3046})!"
