{
            "mnemonic": "Aim the {tooltip:Radical:scooter}'s {tooltip:Radical:neck} at the {tooltip:Kanji:road}! Scooters are only meant for driving on {tooltip:Kanji:street}s and {tooltip:Kanji:path}s, and if you go the wrong {tooltip:Kanji:way}, you'll probably break your own neck!",
            "hints": "Imagine riding your scooter down the road. You're carefully aiming the scooter's neck the right way so you don't end up going out of control and dying.",
            "meanings": {
