{
            "mnemonic": "Do you remember how {span:lang=ja:\u7c73\u56fd} can mean \"America?\" That {span:lang=ja:\u7c73} means America sometimes. So, when you see {tooltip:Kanji:all} {tooltip:Kanji:rice} (I mean, {tooltip:Kanji:America}), you can think of this word as meaning {tooltip:Vocabulary:All America} (sort of like how {span:lang=ja:\u5168\u65e5\u672c} means \"All Japan.\").",
