{
            "mnemonic": "Add this to the end of someone's name, it's like saying ______{tooltip:Kanji:buddy}. It's generally used as a name ender (like {span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3093}) for boys and young men. Don't use this on people who are higher ranked than you (socially or literally). As in, you wouldn't use it on your boss. Use it on your younger male subordinates as well as boys who aren't adults yet.",
