                        "pronunciation": "\u307b\u3063\u304b\u3044\u3069\u3046",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "20301-subject-7474.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word that uses the on'yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own. The {span:lang=ja:\u307b\u304f} does get shortened though, so be careful!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u307c\u304f\u306f\u3001\u5317\u6d77\u9053\u3067\u96ea\u5408\u305b\u3093\u3092\u3057\u305f\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019ve gone yukigassen snowball fighting in Hokkaido."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5317\u6d77\u9053\u306b\u3064\u3044\u305f\u3069\u30fc\uff01\u672c\u3082\u306e\u306e\u3059\u3057\u3092\u98df\u3079\u308b\u3069\u30fc\uff01",
                    "en": "I've arrived in Hokkaido! Time to eat some real sushi!"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5317\u6d77\u9053\u306e\u304a\u571f\u7523\u3068\u3044\u3048\u3070\u3001\u4f55\u304c\u6709\u540d\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "Speaking of Hokkaido souvenirs, what\u2019s famous?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
