{
            "mnemonic": "You know the word {span:lang=ja:\u9577\u3044} from a couple levels ago. This is like the word {span:lang=ja:\u5927\u304d\u3044} versus {span:lang=ja:\u5927\u304d\u3055}, where {span:lang=ja:\u5927\u304d\u3055} is \"size\" and {span:lang=ja:\u5927\u304d\u3044} is \"big.\" So, {span:lang=ja:\u9577\u3044} is \"long\" and {span:lang=ja:\u9577\u3055} is {tooltip:Vocabulary:length}.",
