                        "file": "20218-subject-3455.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}If you know the reading of the word {span:lang=ja:\u9577\u3044} from level 6 you'll know the reading for this word too. Only difference is the {span:lang=ja:\u3055} at the end, which is hiragana so it should be easy to read.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u304a\u304b\u3057\u3044\u306a\u30fc\u3001\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u9577\u3055\u3092\u306f\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3064\u3082\u308a\u306a\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u306a\u30fc\u3002",
                    "en": "Weird, I was sure I measured the length properly."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u3061\u3089\u306e\u30d8\u30d3\u306f3\u30bb\u30f3\u30c1\u305f\u3093\u3044\u306e\u9577\u3055\u3067\u5207\u308a\u58f2\u308a\u306f\u3093\u58f2\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "This snake is sold in three centimeter long pieces."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u50d5\u304c\u3088\u308d\u3081\u3044\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u4e3b\u306a\u539f\u56e0\u306f\u6a4b\u306e\u9577\u3055\u3067\u3059\u3002\u50d5\u306b\u306f\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u9577\u3059\u304e\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "The length of the bridge was one of the main reasons why I faltered. It was just too long for me."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Kanji:Life} that comes out of the {tooltip:Kanji:earth} is made up of different kinds of {tooltip:Vocabulary:material}s. Sometimes it's {tooltip:Vocabulary:cloth}, sometimes it's {tooltip:Vocabulary:dough}, but everything has to be made out of something.",
