                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "40102-subject-7738.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This word uses a new kun'yomi reading for {span:lang=ja:\u751f} and a new on'yomi reading for {span:lang=ja:\u5730}. You haven't learned either of these readings yet, sorry! Here's some mnemonics to help you:\n{splitParent}If you want the best {tooltip:Vocabulary:material} to make clothes or pies out of, the {tooltip:Reading:key} ({span:lang=ja:\u304d})is asking {tooltip:Reading:Je}sus ({span:lang=ja:\u3058})! He knows everything, including where to find the materials for whatever weird thing you're making. Just remember: Who's the key? Jesus!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30de\u30ea\u30e1\u30c3\u30b3\u306e\u751f\u5730\u3067\u30af\u30c3\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3092\u4f5c\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I made a cushion out of Marimekko fabric."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u30ab\u30fc\u30c6\u30f3\u306f\u3001\u30d1\u30e9\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\u30c8\u751f\u5730\u3067\u3067\u304d\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "This curtain is made of parachute material."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u51b7\u51cd\u306e\u30d1\u30a4\u751f\u5730\u3092\u8cb7\u3063\u3066\u304d\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please go buy a frozen piecrust."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

