{
            "mnemonic": "This is a word that's attached to the end of various other words. Think of a \"road\" as a {tooltip:Vocabulary:way} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:method of} something. For example, the {span:lang=ja:\u3069\u3046} in Judo is the soft \"way.\" There are many words that end with {span:lang=ja:\u9053}, and you'll see them later on. For now, know that this means {tooltip:Vocabulary:method of} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:way}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Method Of",
                "Alternatives": "Way, Style, Way Of",
                "Word Type": "noun, suffix"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
