                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is the same as the one you learned with the kanji. Hopefully this means you won't have to wake up too early in the morning to study kanji, now.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u671d\u306e\u3042\u3044\u3055\u3064\u3092\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please say the morning greeting."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u671d\u306f\u6bce\u65e5\u3001\u30c8\u30ed\u30c8\u30ed\u306e\u534a\u3058\u3085\u304f\u76ee\u7389\u3084\u304d\u3092\u98df\u3079\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Every morning I eat over easy and sunny-side-up eggs."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u660e\u65e5\u306e\u671d\u306f\u65e9\u8d77\u304d\u3092\u3057\u306a\u304f\u3066\u306f\u3044\u3051\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u3060\u3063\u3066\u3001Xbox\u3092\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3057\u307e\u304f\u308b\u3068\u3044\u3046\u9577\u3044\u4e00\u65e5\u304c\u5f85\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u304b\u3089\u3002",
                    "en": "I have to wake up early tomorrow morning because I have a long day of Xbox playing to do."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:morning} {tooltip:Kanji:sun} is not only the {tooltip:Vocabulary:morning sun}, but it's the {tooltip:Vocabulary:rising sun} as well (because that's when the sun rises, right?).",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Morning Sun",
                "Alternative": "Rising Sun",
                "Word Type": "noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3042\u3055\u3072"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3042\u3055\u3072",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "40121-subject-3046.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3042\u3055\u3072",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "20214-subject-3046.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This word uses the kun'yomi readings for both kanji, which is convenient since you've learned both of them by now with the words {span:lang=ja:\u671d} ({span:lang=ja:\u3042\u3055}) and {span:lang=ja:\u65e5} ({span:lang=ja:\u3072}). Put them together and what do you get? {span:lang=ja:\u3042\u3055\u3072}!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u660e\u65e5\u306e\u671d\u3001\u4e00\u3057\u3087\u306b\u5c71\u306b\u306e\u307c\u3063\u3066\u671d\u65e5\u3092\u898b\u307e\u305b\u3093\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Would you like to climb a mountain with me tomorrow morning to see the morning sun?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u3042\u306e\u671d\u65e5\u306e\u7d75\u3092\u304b\u3079\u304b\u3089\u5916\u3057\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Why did you take the picture of the rising sun off of the wall?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u65e5\u672c\u306f\u300c\u65e5\u51fa\u305a\u308b\u56fd\u300d\u3068\u3057\u3066\u77e5\u3089\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u304c\u3001\u305d\u308c\u306f\u300c\u671d\u65e5\u56fd\u65d7\u300d\u306b\u898b\u4e8b\u306b\u63cf\u5199\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "Japan is known as \"the Land of the Rising Sun,\" which is excellently depicted on its \"Rising Sun\" flag."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "What is the {tooltip:Kanji:sound} of {tooltip:Kanji:pleasure}? What {tooltip:Kanji:sound} puts you at {tooltip:Kanji:ease}? For most people that is some nice {tooltip:Vocabulary:music}. Just be sure you don't put on any Bieber... that would be like {span:lang=ja:\u4e0d\u97f3\u697d} or something... I kid, I kid.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Music",
                "Word Type": "noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u304a\u3093\u304c\u304f"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u304a\u3093\u304c\u304f",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
