                        "file": "40140-subject-3072.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u304a\u3093\u304c\u304f",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "20228-subject-3072.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. You haven't learned this reading for {span:lang=ja:\u697d} yet, so here's a mnemonic to help you:\n{splitParent}If you play your {tooltip:Vocabulary:music} too loud, people will come and {tooltip:Reading:gawk} ({span:lang=ja:\u304c\u304f}) at you. But if you try to turn it off and say, \"OH WHAT I DON'T LIKE MUSIC ANYWAY!\" they'll gawk at you even more. Learn proper music etiquette and people won't gawk at you so much, okay?\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3079\u3093\u5f37\u3057\u3066\u304b\u3089\u97f3\u697d\u3092\u304d\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019ll listen to music after I study."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u97f3\u697d\u3092\u304d\u304d\u306a\u304c\u3089\u4ed5\u3054\u3068\u3092\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306f\u3088\u304f\u306a\u3044\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Do you think it isn't good to work while listening to music?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u9055\u3063\u305f\u30bf\u30a4\u30d7\u306e\u97f3\u697d\u304c\u5275\u308a\u3060\u3055\u308c\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306f\u3082\u3046\u7121\u3044\u306e\u304b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u601d\u3063\u305f\u308a\u3059\u308b\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306d\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u3001\u4eba\u985e\u306f\u65e2\u306b\u5168\u30b8\u30e3\u30f3\u30eb\u306e\u97f3\u697d\u3092\u5168\u3066\u5275\u308a\u3060\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305f\u3068\u601d\u3046\uff1f",
                    "en": "I wonder if another type of music will be created. Do you think mankind already made every possible genre?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
