{
            "mnemonic": "This is a strange word, so you'll have to bear with me. You know that {span:lang=ja:\u77e5} means {tooltip:Kanji:know}. But in the case of this word, what do you know? Look at the second half. {span:lang=ja:\u3089\u305b} sounds a bit like \"race.\" So, you know about a \"race.\" How do you know about this race? You got a {tooltip:Vocabulary:notice} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:notification} about it.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Notice",
                "Alternatives": "Notification, Flier, Pamphlet, Handbill, Flyer, Leaflet",
