                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "20136-subject-3459.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Remember {span:lang=ja:\u77e5\u308b}? This is the same reading ({span:lang=ja:\u3057}). So, if you know that, you'll be able to read this one as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306e\u3046\u3001\u304a\u77e5\u3089\u305b\u3057\u305f\u3044\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u4eca\u3001\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Excuse me, I have something that I\u2019d like to tell you - do you have some time now?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5b66\u6821\u304b\u3089\u306e\u304a\u77e5\u3089\u305b\u306f\u3082\u3046\u3088\u307f\u307e\u3057\u305f\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Did you read the notice from the school already?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6b8b\u5ff5\u306a\u304a\u77e5\u3089\u305b\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6628\u591c\u8ab0\u304b\u304c\u3053\u306e\u5bb6\u306b\u4fb5\u5165\u3057\u3001\u51b7\u51cd\u5eab\u306b\u5165\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305f\u30a2\u30a4\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u5168\u90e8\u76d7\u3093\u3067\u3057\u307e\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I have some bad news. Someone broke into our home last night and stole all the ice cream we had stored in our freezer."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
