                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}Standing with {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3061} is a cow. It is saying {tooltip:Reading:moo} ({span:lang=ja:\u3080}). Weird, now {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3061} is saying it too. Also, if you know the reading of {span:lang=ja:\u5411\u304f} you should be able to read this one as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5411\u3053\u3046\u306e\u30d1\u30f3\u3084\u3067\u3001\u30d1\u30f3\u3092\u8cb7\u3044\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002",
                    "en": "Let\u2019s buy bread at the bakery over there."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e00\u82b1\u306f\u3001\u5411\u3053\u3046\u306e\u4e16\u754c\u304b\u3089\u3084\u3063\u3066\u6765\u305f\u306e\u304b\u3082\u3057\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Ichika might have come from the other side of the world."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3082\u3057\u541b\u304c\u9053\u8def\u306e\u5411\u3053\u3046\u5074\u306b\u7acb\u3064\u306e\u3067\u3042\u308c\u3070\u3001\u79c1\u306e\u79d8\u5bc6\u3092\u541b\u306b\u6253\u3061\u660e\u3051\u308b\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019ll tell you my secret if you go stand on the opposite side of the road."
                }
            ],
