{
            "mnemonic": "\"When it comes to {tooltip:Kanji:somebody} like my{tooltip:Kanji:self}... aka {tooltip:Kanji:I}...\" When you say this you're really saying \"{tooltip:Vocabulary:personally}\" or \"{tooltip:Vocabulary:as for me}.\"",
