                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "39947-subject-8814.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word that uses the on'yomi readings of the kanji. You haven't learned this reading for {span:lang=ja:\u624b} yet, so here's a mnemonic to help you:\n{splitParent}To be a good {tooltip:Vocabulary:pitcher}, all you have to do is put the ball into the {tooltip:Reading:chute} ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3085}). Pitchers don't actually throw the ball. There is an invisible pitching chute right on the mound. You slide the ball into the chute and off it goes!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u306e\u30c0\u30eb\u30d3\u30c3\u30b7\u30e5\u6295\u624b\u306e\u4eba\u5f62\u306f\u3044\u304f\u3089\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "How much is the doll of the pitcher, Darvish?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e8c\u4e01\u76ee\u306b\u306f\u3001\u7530\u4e2d\u6295\u624b\u304c\u4f4f\u3093\u3067\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "The pitcher, Tanaka, lives in 2-Chome."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u65e5\u306e\u5148\u767a\u6295\u624b\u306f\u8ab0\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Who do you think today's starting pitcher will be?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

