                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This word uses the kun'yomi reading for the first kanji and the on'yomi reading for the second. You haven't learned this reading for {span:lang=ja:\u5834} yet, so here's a mnemonic to help you:\n{splitParent}What is this {tooltip:Vocabulary:place} you're in? You look around and listen. You hear, \"{tooltip:Reading:Baa} ({span:lang=ja:\u3070}) baa baa!\" You must be in a {tooltip:Reading:ba}rn!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3044\u3064\u3082\u306f\u6559\u5ba4\u306b\u3042\u3064\u307e\u308a\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u660e\u65e5\u306f\u5834\u6240\u304c\u3061\u304c\u3046\u306e\u3067\u3001\u307e\u3061\u304c\u3048\u306a\u3044\u3067\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "Usually we gather in the classroom, but the location is different tomorrow, so make sure you don\u2019t go to the wrong place."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u81ea\u5206\u304c\u305f\u305f\u304b\u3046\u3079\u304d\u5834\u6240\u3092\u304d\u3061\u3093\u3068\u77e5\u3063\u3066\u304a\u304f\u3079\u304d\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "You should know your own battlefield."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u5834\u6240\u306f\u79c1\u304c\u521d\u3081\u3066\u30ed\u30fc\u30ba\u306b\u4f1a\u3063\u305f\u5834\u6240\u3067\u3059\u3002\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3042\u306e\u65e5\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u9774\u3092\u8131\u3044\u3060\u306e\u304b\u306f\u601d\u3044\u51fa\u305b\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002",
                    "en": "This is the place where I first met Rose. But, I forget why I took my shoes off that day."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

