                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}If you know the readings of the words {span:lang=ja:\u79c1\u7acb} and {span:lang=ja:\u5927\u5b66} you'll be able to read this. It's also all jukugo on'yomi readings too, so you can read it that way.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u79c1\u7acb\u5927\u5b66\u306f\u516c\u7acb\u5927\u5b66\u3088\u308a\u3058\u3085\u696d\u6599\u304c\u9ad8\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Tuition for private universities is more expensive than that of public universities."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u308f\u305b\u7530\u5927\u5b66\u306f\u65e5\u672c\u306e\u6709\u540d\u306a\u79c1\u7acb\u5927\u5b66\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Waseda University is a famous, private university in Japan."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306e\u51fa\u706b\u3057\u305f\u79c1\u7acb\u5927\u5b66\u306f\u3001\u79c1\u304c\u901a\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u5b66\u6821\u3060\u3088\u3002",
