{
            "mnemonic": "The {span:lang=ja:\u3082\u306a\u304f} part is like saying \"also don't have.\" So, when you \"also don't have {tooltip:Kanji:an interval of time},\" things will happen {tooltip:Vocabulary:soon} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:before long}.",
