                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u307e\u3082\u306a\u304f",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "40166-subject-3062.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u307e\u3082\u306a\u304f",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "20259-subject-3062.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for this one is weird, though. It's a second kun'yomi reading (there is also {span:lang=ja:\u3042\u3044\u3060}), read as {span:lang=ja:\u307e}. So what is happening {tooltip:Vocabulary:soon}? Your {tooltip:Reading:Ma} is going to be here {tooltip:Vocabulary:before long}. You better hurry and prepare, because your room looks terrible... \n{splitParent}\"{span:lang=ja:\u9593\u3082\u306a\u304f}, your mom is about to show up!\"\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u9593\u3082\u306a\u304f\u304b\u3044\u3048\u3093\u3067\u3059\uff01",
                    "en": "The curtain rises soon."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5927\u5b66\u3044\u3093\u7814\u7a76\u751f\u306e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u5b66\u91d1\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u306e\u3078\u3093\u3058\u304c\u3001\u9593\u3082\u306a\u304f\u6765\u308b\u306f\u305a\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I'll probably get a reply regarding the postgraduate research scholarship before long."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3082\u3046\u9593\u3082\u306a\u304f\u5915\u98ef\u304c\u51fa\u6765\u4e0a\u304c\u308b\u9803\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u30af\u30c3\u30ad\u30fc\u3092\u98df\u3079\u308b\u624b\u304c\u6b62\u307e\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002",
                    "en": "Supper will be ready really soon but I still can\u2019t stop eating these cookies."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Kanji:exit} a {tooltip:Kanji:place}. It's a {tooltip:Vocabulary:release from prison} for you!",
