{
            "mnemonic": "Remember how {span:lang=ja:\u7c73\u56fd} can also mean America? That goes for North and South America, actually, not just the United States. So, {tooltip:Kanji:south} {tooltip:Kanji:America} is {tooltip:Vocabulary:South America}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "South America",
                "Word Type": "noun"
