                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well. Just be sure to take note of the rendaku for the second half, where {span:lang=ja:\u3059\u3046} goes to {span:lang=ja:\u305a\u3046}.\n"
