            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30ab\u30e9\u30aa\u30b1\u306b\u884c\u304f\u4eba\u6570\u306f\u5168\u3076\u3067\u4f55\u4eba\u3067\u3059\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "What\u2019s the total number of people going to karaoke?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u306e\u3042\u305f\u3089\u3057\u3044\u30e9\u30a4\u30bf\u30fc\u306e\u307c\u3057\u3085\u3046\u4eba\u6570\u306f\u4f55\u4eba\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "What are the recruitment numbers for the new Tofugu writers?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6ca2\u5c71\u306e\u4eba\u6570\u306e\u4eba\u304c\u3001\u3053\u306e\u56fd\u306e\u4eba\u306f\u540c\u3058\u30ba\u30dc\u30f3\u3092\u5c65\u304f\u3079\u304d\u3060\u3068\u3044\u3046\u79c1\u306e\u63d0\u6848\u306b\u53cd\u5bfe\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "There are a great number of people who disagree with my proposal that everyone in this country must wear the same pants."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "{span:lang=ja:\u3053\u306e} means \"this\", and you know what the word {span:lang=ja:\u524d}  means (front/before). The combination of these words, \"this before\" if you will, can mean a few different things. If we're talking about when something happened, the \"before\" meaning kicks in, and it means {tooltip:Vocabulary:the other day} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:recently}. If we're talking about location, then the \"front\" meaning kicks in, and it means {tooltip:Vocabulary:in front of this}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "The Other Day",
                "Alternatives": "Recently, In Front of This",
                "Word Type": "noun, \u306e adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
