                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}You already learned this reading when you learned {span:lang=ja:\u70b9\u3051\u308b} but here's a mnemonic just in case:\n{splitParent}Every time you count to {tooltip:Reading:two} ({span:lang=ja:\u3064}) a light comes on. How {tooltip:Reading:cool} ({span:lang=ja:\u304f}) that it does it all by itself!!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
