                        "pronunciation": "\u307e\u3052\u308b",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "40006-subject-3462.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u307e\u3052\u308b",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "20096-subject-3462.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}How did you bend this gentleman? You bent him using {tooltip:Reading:ma}gic ({span:lang=ja:\u307e}). Just imagine yourself bending a gentleman with magic. Go ahead, do it in your mind.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6b21\u306f\u3001\u53f3\u8db3\u306e\u3072\u3056\u309290\u3069\u66f2\u3052\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Next, please bend your right knee at a 90 degree angle."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306eYoutube\u30d3\u30c7\u30aa\u3067\u306f\u3001\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u304c\u30b9\u30d7\u30fc\u30f3\u3092\u767e\u672c\u3072\u305f\u3059\u3089\u66f2\u3052\u3064\u3065\u3051\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "In this Youtube video, Koichi just keeps bending 100 spoons."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b9\u30fc\u30d1\u30fc\u30de\u30f3\u306f\u306a\u3093\u3067\u3082\u66f2\u3052\u3089\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3059\u3067\u306b\u66f2\u304c\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3082\u306e\u3067\u3055\u3048\u3082\u3002",
                    "en": "Superman can bend anything, even something that is already bent."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

