                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for {span:lang=ja:\u5f79} is the one you learned with the kanji. The {span:lang=ja:\u7acb\u3064} reading is that of the {span:lang=ja:\u7acb\u3064} vocabulary, which you should be familiar with by now.\n"
