                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "40204-subject-3065.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}You begin {tooltip:Vocabulary:to count} vocabulary words. You're out of control and you can't stop. One after another. Scientists have to come in, but they can't figure out the {tooltip:Reading:cause} ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u305e}) of your counting. They drag you away to a padded cell where they keep testing you trying to figure out the cause of your craziness.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u306d\u3089\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3068\u304d\u3001\u7f8a\u3092\u6570\u3048\u308b\u306e\u306f\u306a\u305c\u3067\u3059\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "When you can\u2019t sleep, why do you count sheep?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3044\u306e\u3061\u304c\u304a\u3057\u3051\u308a\u3083\u3001\u5341\u6570\u3048\u308b\u3046\u3061\u306b\u304d\u3048\u308d\u3002",
                    "en": "If you value your own life, get lost in ten seconds."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b9\u30df\u30b9\u5148\u751f\u3001\u751f\u5f92\u304c\u4e8c\u4eba\u8db3\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u6570\u3048\u307e\u3057\u305f\u304c38\u4eba\u3057\u304b\u3044\u306a\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "There are two students missing, Mr. Smith. I only counted thirty-eight children."
                }
            ],
