                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "20295-subject-3434.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}There's hiragana attached to this kanji, which means it's probably the kun'yomi reading (and it is). You've seen the kun'yomi reading via the word {span:lang=ja:\u8fd1\u3044}. So, as long as you know that word, you should be able to read this one as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30ab\u30e1\u30e9\u30de\u30f3\u304c\u8fd1\u3065\u304f\u3068\u30ab\u30e1\u306f\u306b\u3052\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "When the cameraman approached it, the turtle ran away."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u304a\u308c\u306e\u5973\u306b\u8fd1\u3065\u304f\u306a\uff01",
                    "en": "Don't go anywhere near my girlfriend!"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u79c1\u9054\u306b\u4eca\u8fd1\u3065\u3044\u3066\u304d\u3066\u3044\u308b\u30be\u30f3\u30d3\u3001\u3081\u3061\u3083\u304f\u3061\u3083\u79c1\u306e\u30bf\u30a4\u30d7\u306a\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3002",
                    "en": "Strange as it is, the zombie approaching us right now is actually my type."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You know that the kanji {span:lang=ja:\u5f53} means {tooltip:Kanji:right} or {tooltip:Kanji:success}. So since this is a verb, you're doing right and success (which doesn't make much sense). Instead, you're guessing something and getting it right. So, this word means {tooltip:Vocabulary:to guess} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:to guess something}. Hopefully you don't have to guess too hard when it comes to the meaning of this word as well.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "To Guess",
                "Alternatives": "To Hit, To Put",
                "Word Type": "transitive verb, ichidan verb"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
