                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "40093-subject-2994.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}You have a place to live... but not for long. You are being {tooltip:Reading:sue}d ({span:lang=ja:\u3059}) out of your house and home so you will have nowhere {tooltip:Vocabulary:to dwell}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306f\u3001\u7236\u3068\u6bcd\u3068\u4e00\u3057\u3087\u306b\u4f4f\u3093\u3067\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I live with my father and mother."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u9752\u6728\u30f6\u539f\u306e\u3058\u3085\u6d77\u306f\u3001\u4f4f\u3080\u306b\u306f\u304a\u305d\u308d\u3057\u3059\u304e\u308b\u5834\u6240\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Aokigahara's Jukai is a terrifying place to live."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30db\u30d3\u30c3\u30c8\u306e\u7a74\u306b\u4f4f\u3093\u3067\u307f\u305f\u3044\u306e\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u3069\u3046\u3084\u3063\u3066\u6398\u308c\u3070\u3044\u3044\u306e\u304b\u5206\u304b\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002",
                    "en": "I want to live in a hobbit hole, but I don\u2019t know how to dig."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Kanji:bright} {tooltip:Kanji:day} isn't today (because today was terrible), it's {tooltip:Vocabulary:tomorrow}, because you can always look to tomorrow to be a better, brighter day.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Tomorrow",
                "Word Type": "noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3042\u3057\u305f"
                    },
                    {
                        "primary": false,
                        "reading": "\u3042\u3059"
                    },
                    {
                        "primary": false,
                        "reading": "\u307f\u3087\u3046\u306b\u3061"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3042\u3059",
