{
            "mnemonic": "You know that {span:lang=ja:\u601d\u3046} means to think (so {span:lang=ja:\u601d\u3044} is {tooltip:Kanji:a thought}). You also know that {span:lang=ja:\u51fa\u3059} means {tooltip:Kanji:to remove}. So, when you remove a thought, you are remembering something. This is a verb, so the verb form of remembering something is {tooltip:Vocabulary:to remember}.",
