{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:change} so you'd think the verb version is \"to change\" but it's a little different. This word means {tooltip:Vocabulary:to transform}, which is a lot like \"to change\" but this is more like when a person transforms into something else, like a dinosaur.",
