{
            "mnemonic": "This radical looks like a {tooltip:Radical:helicopter} coming straight at you, doesn't it? You can't see the tail part because it's behind the bigger front cab of the helicopter. But you can see the windows and the big spinning blade on top from here.",
            "hints": "",
