{
            "mnemonic": "You're standing up on top of a cross. Why? Because you ate something so {tooltip:Radical:spicy} that it caused you to beg Jesus for mercy. You need to save your mouth from the spicy flames. To make sure he hears you, you stand up on the closest cross. Make sure to feel how spicy this is in your mouth to remember it better!",
