{
            "mnemonic": "Kind of a strange {tooltip:Radical:tent}, I'll admit, but one that will protect you from things trying to get in (that's why it has all the spikes). It's the best you can do, considering you're in a cloth/plastic building.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Tent"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "There's a canopy with a little table and seats inside. This is a {tooltip:Radical:yurt}! It may look like a canopy at first, but when you go inside it has a bunch of nice furniture for you to relax on.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Yurt"
