{
            "mnemonic": "Once you remove the {tooltip:Radical:lantern} from the {tooltip:Radical:tent}, we will be ready for {tooltip:Kanji:departure}. We can\u2019t leave the lantern inside of the tent; that\u2019s a fire hazard. We\u2019d best take it with us before the departure. Don\u2019t you agree?",
            "hints": "Feel the heat from the lantern. It\u2019s not quite as comforting as being inside a tent, but it\u2019s better than nothing. The lantern will light your way on your departure.",
