{
            "mnemonic": "When you're in {tooltip:Radical:prison}, whoever ends up with the {tooltip:Radical:shellfish} will {tooltip:Kanji:lose}. It's the game all prisoners play. It's like keep away from the shellfish. And if you end up with the shellfish BZZZZTT that's it, you're the loser.",
            "hints": "Imagine that it's your first day in prison. You're walking around the yard, minding your own business, when suddenly a shellfish smacks you right in the head and falls into your open hands. \"HAHA YOU LOSE!\" someone shouts.",
            "meanings": {
