                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305d\u3046, \u3057\u3087\u3046",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3042\u3044",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "This is basically a FernGully moment, you know? You can feel the tree's pain like it's your pain. It's that kind of mutual sharing of souls you need.",
                "mnemonic": "If your respect for the tree is {tooltip:Kanji:mutual} with the respect the tree feels for you, you'll be able to see the tree's {tooltip:Reading:sou}l ({span:lang=ja:\u305d\u3046}). Right now its soul looks pretty sad, like it's trying to say, \"Why are your people cutting down all my friends? I thought we had a mutual understanding.\""
            }
        }

{
