{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:clown} {tooltip:Radical:building} is over in that {tooltip:Kanji:part} of town. We keep the clown part as separate as we can from the rest of the normal people. In fact, the entire clown education {tooltip:Kanji:department} and their clown {tooltip:Kanji:club}s have to stay in their part, they can't come in ours.",
