                ],
                "hints": "Picture Ken protecting the prefecture, punching hyenas in the face, and yelling, \"This may just be a prefecture, not a country, but I'll give it my all for my lion king!\"",
                "mnemonic": "This small lion's {tooltip:Kanji:prefecture} is being protected by {tooltip:Reading:Ken} ({span:lang=ja:\u3051\u3093}) the samurai because the lion is too small to protect all of this land himself. Ken the samurai is used to wandering far and wide, so one, eye-sized prefecture is nothing to him."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:mouth} of a {tooltip:Radical:tree} {tooltip:Radical:leader} is all about trying to {tooltip:Kanji:preserve} the trees. In fact, she {tooltip:Kanji:guarantee}s that she will preserve the trees if it's the last thing she does.",
            "hints": "Basically, a tree leader is someone who stands up for trees. Mostly she talks, but that can be a powerful skill to have.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Preserve",
                "Alternative": "Guarantee"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u307b",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305f\u3082",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "What a terrible scene. Focus on the fact that they're using a horrible, modified back hoe. It's more like a weapon than a back hoe, and they show no mercy at all.",
                "mnemonic": "She chains herself to a tree to {tooltip:Kanji:preserve} them. But, unfortunately, the lumberjacks just take a giant back {tooltip:Reading:ho}e ({span:lang=ja:\u307b}) and tear this tree leader and the tree she's attached to in half."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Radical:scooter} is {tooltip:Radical:anti} scoot. It doesn't want to run. So you have to {tooltip:Kanji:return} it.",
            "hints": "Unfortunately, now you have to return to the store to return this scooter, but you have no scooter to get there with. Ugh.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Return"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3078\u3093",
