                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "The employee leans down toward you in hen form and says, \"Ooh, I'm sorry. We don't take returns from hens. You'll have to just return home.\"",
                "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Kanji:return} to the store and wait in line to return the scooter but the person working returns doesn't want you to return it. He stares you dead in the eyes, waves his hand, and turns you into a {tooltip:Reading:hen} ({span:lang=ja:\u3078\u3093})!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You put a {tooltip:Radical:grain} in your {tooltip:Radical:mouth} and let it take a {tooltip:Kanji:ride}. This kanji has the same radicals as {span:lang=ja:\u548c}, but this time the grain is in your mouth, which is why there's little pieces of grain sticking out of the {span:lang=ja:\u53e3} part ;)",
            "hints": "Just imagine you're a car or a train and the grain is a person. It's going for a nice ride in your mouth!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Ride"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3058\u3087\u3046",
