                "hints": "No one can resist a good cookie. It will ease your suffering, or at least distract you for a little bit.",
                "mnemonic": "If an old flower (or person) is {tooltip:Kanji:suffering}, give them a {tooltip:Reading:coo}kie ({span:lang=ja:\u304f})."
