{
            "mnemonic": "If a {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} is going to last an {tooltip:Radical:eternity} you better learn how to {tooltip:Kanji:swim} now. We'll be under water for the rest of time and if you can't swim you're not gonna make it.",
            "hints": "Picture most of the earth's population already swimming on the tsunami that will last the rest of eternity. Your floaties and life preservers would help you through this mess. You need to swim!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Swim"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
