{
            "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Radical:leader} is very {tooltip:Radical:anti}-everything, making it all {tooltip:Kanji:temporary}. You get a new shirt, \"I'm anti shirts!\" she yells, and out it goes.",
            "hints": "She tires of things so quickly, you hardly have time to get used to them before they're gone.",
