                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture all of the temporary cars she's tried filling up an entire junkyard. They're all a little different, but in the end they were all just temporary fads.",
                "mnemonic": "The leader's most {tooltip:Kanji:temporary} possession is her {tooltip:Reading:ca}r ({span:lang=ja:\u304b}). Or... cars, because they're all very temporary. She buys one, drives it around, and then suddenly she's anti red car. She needs a blue one!"
            }
        }

{
