{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:wing}ed {tooltip:Radical:cow} is flying in the air. What a strange {tooltip:Kanji:thing}! You\u2019ve heard of flying pigs before, but cows? This is a new and strange thing indeed! Cows with wings! What a silly thing to imagine.",
            "hints": "Imagine if cows could fly. Wouldn\u2019t you be jealous of them? I mean, if a cow can fly, any old thing should be able to, right?",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Thing"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
