                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine a thing like flying boots. Do you believe such a thing could be real?",
                "mnemonic": "You want a {tooltip:Kanji:thing} to help you fly with the cow so you put on your flying {tooltip:Reading:boots} ({span:lang=ja:\u3076\u3064}). Your flying boots are a pretty strange thing in themselves, but they're the only way you can keep up."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "An {tooltip:Radical:eye} and {tooltip:Radical:fins} litter the {tooltip:Radical:ground}. What happened? You killed a fish. You must hide the murder {tooltip:Kanji:tool} before someone finds out it was you.",
            "hints": "You feel the panic upon realizing what you've just done. This is murder in the first degree. You used a terrible tool to do it, and now you must hide it.",
