                "mnemonic": "There\u2019s {tooltip:Reading:goo} ({span:lang=ja:\u3050}) all over your hands. Goopy goo. It\u2019s the guts of the fish you just killed and it\u2019s dripping off of the {tooltip:Kanji:tool} as well. Yuck."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Climb onto the {tooltip:Radical:roof} in {tooltip:Radical:spring} to see the {tooltip:Kanji:truth}. The world is waking back up from winter and revealing the {tooltip:Kanji:reality} of what it is all around you. ",
            "hints": "Imagine sitting comfortably on your roof as the world around you changes to spring. Snow melts and reveals all of the truths that have been obscured and hidden in winter.",
            "meanings": {
