                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Gee! Two babies! Reality sure is lovely.",
                "mnemonic": "At the moment, you're trying to learn the {tooltip:Kanji:truth} about the deer that is coming out of the snowy woods when you see not one, but two baby deer appear with it! {tooltip:Reading:Gee! Two} ({span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3064}) babies! You keep looking around and realize that all of the animals seem to have two babies that they had hidden in the snow."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If you want to {tooltip:Radical:say} something at a {tooltip:Radical:ceremony} for {tooltip:Radical:construction} workers you're going to have to {tooltip:Kanji:try} really hard. Construction is loud, so if you want to be heard you have to {tooltip:Kanji:attempt} to be louder than the drilling and smashing and digging and handing out of awards.",
            "hints": "Try to imagine trying this hard to be heard. The construction workers are all screaming at each other with ease. It's so hard for you to try and keep up with their volume!",
