                "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Kanji:try} to get their attention the only way you know how, by lifting a {tooltip:Reading:shee}p ({span:lang=ja:\u3057}) above your head. The sheep baas and suddenly everything is silent, all eyes are on you. Well, they're on the sheep."
            }
