{
            "mnemonic": "A good {tooltip:Radical:leader} can put the {tooltip:Radical:ground}'s {tooltip:Radical:history} to great {tooltip:Kanji:use}. You are a good leader. You have studied the ground and dirt of the earth your entire life. You know the history of the ground and you know how to use it to lead your people.",
            "hints": "Smell the ground. Waft the earthy smell of history into your leader-like nostrils. What does it smell like? It smells useful. And also like ground.",
            "meanings": {
