{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Kanji:temporary} {tooltip:Kanji:determin}ation is something you're not totally sure about. You've decided to think of something in a certain way, but only for now. If more information comes to light, you may change. That's why this word means {tooltip:Vocabulary:assumption} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:hypothesis}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Assumption",
                "Alternative": "Hypothesis",
                "Word Type": "noun, \u3059\u308b verb"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
