                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is the same as the word {span:lang=ja:\u901a\u308b}, so as long as you know that, you should be able to read this one as well. Mind the strange long {span:lang=ja:\u304a} sound!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u901a\u308a\u3092\u307e\u3063\u3059\u3050\u306b\u884c\u3063\u3066\u3001\u4e09\u3064\u76ee\u306e\u3057\u3093\u53f7\u3092\u5de6\u306b\u66f2\u304c\u3063\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please go straight on this street and turn left at the third light."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u901a\u308a\u3067\u306f\u3001\u4e00\u65e5\u4e2d\u8eca\u304c\u884c\u304d\u4ea4\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "This road is busy all day long."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30c1\u30fc\u30ba\u30d9\u30fc\u30b3\u30f3\u30d0\u30fc\u30ac\u30fc\u901a\u308a\u306b\u306f\u3001\u30ac\u30bd\u30ea\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30c9\u3063\u3066\u3042\u3063\u305f\u3063\u3051\uff1f",
                    "en": "Were there any gas stations on Bacon Cheeseburger Avenue?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This is a single kanji with an {span:lang=ja:\u3044} on the end, meaning you know it's probably an adjective. What's the adjective form of {tooltip:Kanji:beauty}? It's {tooltip:Vocabulary:beautiful}.",
