                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings come from the two words {span:lang=ja:\u6c17} and {span:lang=ja:\u4ed8\u3051\u308b}. So long as you know those from the previous levels, you should be able to read this one as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
