                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well. Just be sure to take note of the shortened {span:lang=ja:\u3051\u3064} in {span:lang=ja:\u6c7a}. It goes to {span:lang=ja:\u3051\u3063}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30af\u30de\u30de\u30f3\u307e\u3093\u304c\u306e\u3001\u30a2\u30cb\u30e1\u5316\u304c\u6c7a\u5b9a\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\uff01",
                    "en": "They\u2019ve decided to turn the Kumaman manga into an anime!"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u308c\u306f\u3055\u3044\u3057\u3085\u3046\u6c7a\u5b9a\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u306e\u3067\u3001\u305d\u306e\u5f8c\u306e\u5909\u66f4\u306f\u3067\u304d\u307e\u305b\u3093\u304c\u3001\u3088\u308d\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "This will be your final decision and it can't be changed later. Is that okay?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u541b\u306e\u59b9\u306e\u7d50\u5a5a\u5f0f\u3068\u4ffa\u306e\u6bcd\u3055\u3093\u306e\u846c\u5f0f\u3001\u3069\u3061\u3089\u306b\u51fa\u5e2d\u3059\u308b\u304b\u306e\u6c7a\u5b9a\u306f\u541b\u306b\u4efb\u305b\u308b\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019ll leave the decision of whether we\u2019re going to attend your little sister\u2019s wedding or my mother\u2019s funeral to you."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The kanji {tooltip:Kanji:degree} can mean both degree in terms of angles and degree in terms of temperature. This word is how you talk about these things. Just attach it to a number and you have yourself the number of {tooltip:Vocabulary:degrees} that something is. After the numbers 1, 2 and 3 (and in some other situations) this can also mean {tooltip:Vocabulary:times}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Degrees",
                "Alternative": "Times",
                "Word Type": "noun, suffix"
            },
