{
            "mnemonic": "You make {tooltip:Kanji:departure} from your home off into the great beyond. You will go to {tooltip:Kanji:see} the unseen, and hopefully make a great {tooltip:Vocabulary:discovery}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Discovery",
                "Word Type": "noun, \u3059\u308b verb"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u306f\u3063\u3051\u3093"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u306f\u3063\u3051\u3093",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "40298-subject-3136.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u306f\u3063\u3051\u3093",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "20384-subject-3136.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. You know the {span:lang=ja:\u306f\u3064} part, which gets shortened to {span:lang=ja:\u306f\u3063}. The {span:lang=ja:\u898b} is unlike what you learned with {span:lang=ja:\u898b}, though. \n{splitParent}In order to remember that this is {span:lang=ja:\u3051\u3093}, imagine you're going out to make a discovery of some strange new lands. With strange new lands, there comes strange new people. This one has a samurai named {tooltip:Reading:Ken} {span:lang=ja:\u3051\u3093} on it. He's trying to discover new things too!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u81ea\u305f\u304f\u306e\u30d9\u30e9\u30f3\u30c0\u3067\u3001\u30a4\u30e2\u30e0\u30b7\u3092\u767a\u898b\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I found hornworms on my balcony."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u304c\u3093\u306f\u3001\u65e9\u304d\u767a\u898b\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3072\u3058\u3087\u3046\u306b\u91cd\u3088\u3046\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "It\u2019s very important to have early detection for cancer."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "Facebook\u3067\u304a\u91d1\u3092\u7a3c\u3050\u65b9\u6cd5\u3092\u767a\u898b\u3057\u305f\u305c\u3002\u3057\u304b\u3082\u8d85\u7c21\u5358\u306a\u306e\u3002\u307e\u305a\u3001\u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u8a2d\u5b9a\u306b\u884c\u304f\u3060\u308d\u3001\u305d\u308c\u304b\u3089\u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u3092\u505c\u6b62\u3057\u3066\u3001\u4ed5\u4e8b\u306b\u884c\u304f\u3093\u3060\uff01",
                    "en": "I discovered how to make money from Facebook. It\u2019s easy. Just go to your account settings, deactivate your account, and go to work."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
