{
            "mnemonic": "{span:lang=ja:\u30cf\u30fc\u30c8} is of course \"heart\" and you know that {span:lang=ja:\u5f62} means {tooltip:Kanji:shape}. You've probably already figured this one out. It's {tooltip:Vocabulary:heart shaped}. ",
