                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word that uses the on'yomi readings of the kanji. You didn't learn this reading for {span:lang=ja:\u4ed8} though, so here's a mnemonic to help you:\n{splitParent}Your {tooltip:Vocabulary:neighborhood} is full of {tooltip:Reading:foo}ls ({span:lang=ja:\u3075}). Fools everywhere. You're probably one too, since you live {tooltip:Vocabulary:nearby}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u4ed8\u8fd1\u306b\u3001\u30b3\u30f3\u30d3\u30cb\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
