                    "en": "I went swimming in the sea."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6d77\u306e\u516c\u3048\u3093\u3067\u3001\u5148\u751f\u304c\u5b66\u751f\u306b\u8a71\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "The teacher is talking to her students in Marine Park."
