                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}Everything is really {tooltip:Vocabulary:painful} right now. Why? You have something heavy on top of you, {tooltip:Reading:cru}shing ({span:lang=ja:\u304f\u308b}) you.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
