                    "en": "I ate too much and it\u2019s painful."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u306b\u3042\u3044\u3092\u3053\u304f\u767d\u3067\u304d\u306a\u304f\u3066\u82e6\u3057\u3044\u3088\uff01",
                    "en": "I'm agonizing over the fact that I'm not able to confess my love to Tofugu."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6b63\u76f4\u306b\u8a00\u3048\u3070\u3001\u305d\u308c\u306f\u304b\u306a\u308a\u82e6\u3057\u3044\u72b6\u6cc1\u3060",
                    "en": "To speak frankly, those are pretty agonizing circumstances."
                }
