{
            "mnemonic": "Picture the {tooltip:Kanji:part} of your body that makes up your {tooltip:Kanji:neck}. Are you picturing it? That's a building block that makes up your body. A really important one. If you didn't have that neck, you wouldn't look like a person at all. Sound familiar? It should! Because that part of your neck is a {tooltip:Vocabulary:radical}! Just like part of your neck is a building block of your body, the radical is a building block of kanji. Get it? I sure hope so!",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Radical",
                "Word Type": "noun"
