                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is kind of an exception. The {span:lang=ja:\u5c4b} is normal ({span:lang=ja:\u3084}) but the {span:lang=ja:\u90e8} is weird. It is {span:lang=ja:\u3078}. Just imagine that you rent out a {tooltip:Vocabulary:room} and the only one they have is just the {tooltip:Reading:hay} ({span:lang=ja:\u3078}) room in the barn, so you sleep there for the night. Imagine the smell of hay and how scratchy it is to sleep in this room.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u59b9\u306f\u90e8\u5c4b\u306e\u305d\u3046\u3058\u3092\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "My younger sister cleaned the room."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306e\u5b66\u6821\u306b\u306f\u3001\u97f3\u697d\u5ba4\u306e\u4e2d\u306b\u591c\u3060\u3051\u306b\u3042\u3089\u308f\u308c\u308b\u90e8\u5c4b\u304c\u3042\u308b\u305d\u3046\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I heard that there is a room that only appears at night in the music room of my school."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u90e8\u5c4b\u3092\u7247\u4ed8\u3051\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3059\u308b\u3068\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3082\u9014\u4e2d\u3067\u898b\u3064\u3051\u305f\u5225\u306e\u3082\u306e\u306b\u6c17\u3092\u53d6\u3089\u308c\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u3066\u3001\u7247\u4ed8\u3051\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002",
                    "en": "I can\u2019t clean my room because whenever I try I just get distracted by all the stuff I find."
                }
            ],
