{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:generations} (and society!) that make up the {tooltip:Kanji:world} create our world. So this is {tooltip:Vocabulary:the World}, {tooltip:Vocabulary:society}, or {tooltip:Vocabulary:the Universe}.\u3000",
