                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3058\u3083\u3042\u3001\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308a\u4eca\u5ea6\u306b\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3002",
                    "en": "Okay, then let\u2019s do it next time."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u5ea6\u306f\u672c\u5f53\u306b\u672c\u6c17\u306e\u672c\u6c17\u3067\u65e5\u672c\u3054\u3092\u3079\u3093\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3057\u307e\u3059\uff01",
                    "en": "I'm really, really serious about studying Japanese this time."
