                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: You're trying not to say it directly, and trying to figure out how {tooltip:Vocabulary:to express} that you {tooltip:Reading:are a wuss} ({span:lang=ja:\u3042\u3089\u308f\u3059}). Sorry, had to be expressed.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u308d\u3053\u3064\u306b\u4e0d\u304b\u3044\u304b\u3093\u3092\u8868\u3059\u306e\u306f\u3088\u304f\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3002",
