{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:hold} so the verb version is {tooltip:Vocabulary:to hold}. This word is for when you're carrying or holding something, simply.",
