                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}If you want to learn how {tooltip:Vocabulary:to preserve} fruits and veggies, you should start with {tooltip:Reading:tamots} ({span:lang=ja:\u305f\u3082}), that's slang for delish tomatoes. Once they're preserved, you get to make everyone you love eat those yummy tamots. Mmm!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u308f\u304b\u3055\u3092\u4fdd\u3064\u3072\u3051\u3064\u306f\u4f55\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "What's the secret to preserving your youth?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u306e\u304a\u304b\u3052\u3067\u3001\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u30e1\u30f3\u30c4\u3092\u4fdd\u3064\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Thanks to Viet, Koichi was able to maintain his face."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306e\u304a\u533b\u8005\u3055\u3093\u306b\u3001\u300c\u4f53\u8abf\u3092\u4fdd\u3064\u305f\u3081\u306b\u306f\u3001\u65e5\u3005\u306e\u904b\u52d5\u304c\u5927\u5207\u3060\u3088\u300d\u306a\u3093\u3066\u8a00\u308f\u308c\u305f\u3051\u3069\u3001\u305d\u306e\u304a\u533b\u8005\u3055\u3093\u81ea\u4f53\u304c\u3059\u3063\u3054\u304f\u592a\u3063\u3066\u308b\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "The doctor told me that it\u2019s important to exercise regularly to maintain your physical health, but he is so fat."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
