                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}You want {tooltip:Vocabulary:to sell} something, but what? What can you sell that will take the least amount of work? {tooltip:Reading:U}ni ({span:lang=ja:\u3046})! They're just hanging out in the ocean, ready for the taking. Go scoop some up, watch out for the pointy bits, and sell them for some quick cash!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u3053\u306b\u3001\u65e5\u672c\u3054\u306e\u3058\u3057\u3087\u306f\u58f2\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "Are Japanese dictionaries sold here?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u6751\u3067\u306f\u3001\u4eba\u3005\u306f\u5927\u9ea6\u3092\u58f2\u3063\u3066\u751f\u3051\u3044\u3092\u7acb\u3066\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "In this village, people make a living by selling barley."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u8acb\u6c42\u66f8\u306e\u652f\u6255\u3044\u3092\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306b\u8eca\u3092\u58f2\u308b\u5fc5\u8981\u304c\u3042\u308b\u304c\u3001\u305d\u3046\u3059\u308c\u3070\u4eca\u5ea6\u306f\u4ed5\u4e8b\u306b\u3044\u3051\u306a\u304f\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u3002",
                    "en": "I need to sell my car to pay the bills, but if I do that I won\u2019t be able to get to work."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

