                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}You know how when you try to do something you put your whole heart into it? Well, think of that in Japanese. You put your whole {span:lang=ja:\u5fc3} ({span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3053\u308d}) into it.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u306b\u8a00\u308f\u308c\u305f\u65b9\u6cd5\u3092\u4e94\u5ea6\u8a66\u307f\u305f\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u30c0\u30e1\u3067\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I've attempted the method that Viet told me about five times, but it never worked."
                },
                {
