{
            "mnemonic": "You give your {tooltip:Radical:scooter} to a {tooltip:Radical:turkey} so that it can {tooltip:Kanji:advance}. The turkey was trying and failing to walk through a crowded street, so out of the goodness of your heart you gave it a scooter so it could advance.",
            "hints": "Imagine picking up the turkey and putting it on your scooter. Of course, you give it your helmet as well, safety first.",
