{
            "mnemonic": "You don't want to keep all the {tooltip:Radical:alcohol} to yourself ({tooltip:Radical:oneself}), so you {tooltip:Kanji:distribute} it to all of your friends. Heck, not just your friends, to everyone you can find!",
            "hints": "Don't be that person who keeps the alcohol all to themselves. Distribute it to all of the legally-aged people you know!",
