                "hints": "This becomes the haiku you say before every party, every potluck, and every night out at the bar. You even get it tattoo'd to your arm.",
                "mnemonic": "As you {tooltip:Kanji:distribute} the alcohol you say a {tooltip:Reading:hai}ku ({span:lang=ja:\u306f\u3044}):"
