{
            "mnemonic": "You can {tooltip:Radical:eat} all you want, but you'll still {tooltip:Radical:lack} something to {tooltip:Kanji:drink}. You can't live just from eating, you have to drink things too!",
            "hints": "Imagine eating and eating and lacking a delicious, cold, thirst-quenching drink. Your mouth is dry. You have to drink something, anything!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Drink"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
