{
            "mnemonic": "If you think about it, an {tooltip:Kanji:earth} {tooltip:Kanji:road} isn't going to be the main road. It will be the road less traveled. You could call it a {tooltip:Vocabulary:path} (you know, like a dirt path!) or a {tooltip:Vocabulary:dirt road}. Alternatively, another less traveled street that would probably be made out of dirt back in the day (before everything was paved) would be an {tooltip:Vocabulary:alley}. Imagine yourself walking down a dirt alley at night with no shoes. Scary!",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Alley",
                "Alternatives": "Path, Dirt Road",
