                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28110-subject-3226.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u307e\u3001\u89aa\u53cb\u306b\u306f\u53cd\u5bfe\u3055\u308c\u305f\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3051\u3069\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "Well, I was objected to by a close friend."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u3068\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u306f\u89aa\u53cb\u3067\u3001\u53cb\u3060\u3061\u4ee5\u4e0a\u3001\u3053\u3044\u4eba\u672a\u307e\u3093\u306e\u304b\u3093\u3051\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi and Viet are good friends. They are more than friends, but not lovers."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u306d\u3047\u3001\u77e5\u3063\u3066\u308b\uff1f\u30b5\u30e9\u304c\u30d9\u30b9\u3068\u4ed8\u304d\u5408\u3063\u3066\u308b\u306e\u3088\u3002\u300d\u300c\u3048\u3001\u77e5\u3089\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3002\u30b5\u30e9\u306e\u3053\u3068\u89aa\u53cb\u3060\u3068\u601d\u3063\u3066\u305f\u3051\u3069\u3001\u79c1\u305d\u306e\u3053\u3068\u4f55\u3082\u805e\u3044\u3066\u306a\u3044\u308f\u3002\u300d",
                    "en": "\"Hey, you know what? Sara is going out with Beth.\" \"What? I didn\u2019t know that. I thought she was my best friend but she never told me about that.\""
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "When you {tooltip:Kanji:collect} {tooltip:Kanji:gold} you are {tooltip:Vocabulary:collecting money} (or doing {tooltip:Vocabulary:money collection}). Of course, back in the day gold was like money, which is why this word works the way it does. Hopefully you don't have to deal with too much {span:lang=ja:\u96c6\u91d1} in your daily life. We'll try to keep WaniKani nice and reasonably priced for you.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Collecting Money",
                "Alternative": "Money Collection",
                "Word Type": "noun, \u3059\u308b verb"
            },
