{
            "mnemonic": "Do you remember {span:lang=ja:\u533b\u8005} (doctor)? What happens when you add {tooltip:Kanji:eye} on there? You have yourself an {tooltip:Vocabulary:eye doctor}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
