                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28062-subject-3210.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is just the vocab word {span:lang=ja:\u65e5\u672c} ({span:lang=ja:\u306b\u307b\u3093}) plus the reading that you learned for {span:lang=ja:\u8a9e}. Combine them together to get the reading for this word.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304b\u3002\u82f1\u8a9e\u3058\u3083\u306a\u304f\u3066\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u3067\u3059\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "Okay? Not English, Japanese."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u30ef\u30cb\u30ab\u30cb\u3092\u8cb7\u3046\u3068\u3001\u3082\u308c\u306a\u304f\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u3067\u304b\u304b\u308c\u305f\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u306e\u30b5\u30a4\u30f3\u304c\u4ed8\u3044\u3066\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "If you subscribe to WaniKani right now, it will come with Tofugu's autograph in Japanese."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u9593\u9055\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3092\u6050\u308c\u308b\u306a\u3088\u3002\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u3067\u558b\u3063\u3066\u307f\u308d\u3063\u3066\u3002\u3084\u3063\u3066\u307f\u308d\u3088\u3002\u541b\u306a\u3089\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3068\u601d\u3046\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "Don\u2019t be afraid of making mistakes. Speak in Japanese. Give it a shot. I think you can do it."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

