                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "3711-subject-3484.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u305f\u306e\u3057\u307f",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28196-subject-3484.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is just like {span:lang=ja:\u697d\u3057\u3044}, so make sure you know that and you'll be able to read this one as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306b\u4f1a\u3046\u306e\u304c\u697d\u3057\u307f\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019m looking forward to seeing you."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u590f\u4f11\u307f\u306e\u697d\u3057\u307f\u3068\u8a00\u3048\u3070\u3001\u6d77\u306b\u30ad\u30e3\u30f3\u30d7\u306b\u8272\u3005\u3042\u308b\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "I think there are lots of different fun activities during summer break, like going to beach and camping and stuff."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u79c1\u9054\u3001\u307f\u3093\u306a\u4e80\u3092\u71c3\u3084\u3059\u306e\u3092\u697d\u3057\u307f\u306b\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306d\uff1f",
                    "en": "We are all looking forward to burning turtles, aren\u2019t we?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {span:lang=ja:\u3044\u3044} portion means \"good.\" So, when what you {tooltip:Kanji:carry} is good you are {tooltip:Vocabulary:lucky}. Just think of it in terms of luck being a physical item you carry in your hands. Now imagine yourself carrying it. Now think to yourself \"what I'm carrying is good, it's lucky!\"",
