                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You've hopefully seen {span:lang=ja:\u5411\u304f} and {span:lang=ja:\u5411\u3051\u308b} by now. They mean \"to face\" and \"to turn toward.\" This has a similar idea. When you add {span:lang=ja:\u5411\u3051} to something imagine you're turning it, aiming it at someone. It's aimed at them, meaning it's {tooltip:Vocabulary:made for} them. Turn a book toward someone, now it's {tooltip:Vocabulary:aimed at} them, it's made for them. See the connection?",
