{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:new} {tooltip:Kanji:hear} is what it sounds like. It's new things that you're hearing about in your ear... at least that's what it was back a long time ago. Now those new things that get to your ear get to you via other mediums. In this case, a {tooltip:Vocabulary:newspaper}.",
