{
            "mnemonic": "You know that this has something to do with {tooltip:Kanji:read}ing and you know that {span:lang=ja:\u65b9} means {tooltip:Kanji:way} or {tooltip:Kanji:method}. So, when you think of a \"way of reading\" you can think of a couple other better words, such as {tooltip:Vocabulary:reading} (aka the reading of a word) or {tooltip:Vocabulary:pronunciation}. Anytime you need to know how something sounds, this is what you'll ask for.",
