{
            "mnemonic": "The kanji version of {span:lang=ja:\u8a71} means {tooltip:Kanji:talk}. This word also means {tooltip:Vocabulary:talk}, but it means a few other things as well. This can refer to a {tooltip:Vocabulary:speech} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:story} as well. Basically anything that involves a talking session. So, before you go, I hope you stay awhile and listen to my {span:lang=ja:\u8a71}.",
