                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28194-subject-3495.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Who tells a great {tooltip:Vocabulary:story}? {tooltip:Reading:Hana, she} ({span:lang=ja:\u306f\u306a\u3057}) tells a great story! If you know someone named Hana or Hanna you can use that person to help you to remember this one better too. \n{splitParent}You can also use {span:lang=ja:\u8a71\u3059}'s reading to help you to remember this one, as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u308c\u304b\u3089\u8a71\u3092\u805e\u3044\u3066\u3001\u3082\u3093\u3060\u3044\u7528\u7d19\u306e\uff11\u304b\u3089\uff14\u306e\u4e2d\u304b\u3089\u3001\u4e00\u756a\u3044\u3044\u3082\u306e\u3092\u4e00\u3064\u3048\u3089\u3093\u3067\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "And then you will listen to the story and choose the best answer between 1-4 on the answer sheet."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u8a71\u304c\u3061\u304c\u3046\u3088\uff01",
                    "en": "I didn't sign up for this!"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u305d\u308c\u304b\u3089\u3001\u79c1\u3001\u4ed6\u306b\u3082\u8a00\u3044\u305f\u3044\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308b\u306e\u3088\u3001\u30d6\u30ea\u30bf\u30cb\u30fc\uff01\u300d\u300c\u30b8\u30a7\u30ec\u30df\u30fc\u3001\u3044\u3044\u52a0\u6e1b\u9ed9\u3063\u3066\u304f\u308c\u306a\u3044\u304b\uff01\u541b\u306e\u8a71\u306f\u3082\u3046\u805e\u304d\u98fd\u304d\u305f\u3088\u3002\u300d",
                    "en": "\"Now, I\u2019d also like to say something else, Brittany!\" \"Jeremy! Give it a rest! I\u2019m tired of listening to you.\""
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

