            "mnemonic": "Remember how {span:lang=ja:\u5f15\u304f} means \"to subtract?\" Add {tooltip:Kanji:calculate} to that and you'll have {tooltip:Vocabulary:subtraction}! It's the type of calculation you're doing when you subtract.",
