{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:ground} {tooltip:Kanji:below} {tooltip:Kanji:iron} is iron under the ground. It isn't a deposit of iron, though. It's man-made. And what's made of iron? Trains. In this case, because it's underground, it's a {tooltip:Vocabulary:subway}. Depending on where you live, you might call it {tooltip:Vocabulary:the Underground}, {tooltip:Vocabulary:the Tube}, or {tooltip:Vocabulary:the Metro}",
