{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:most} {tooltip:Kanji:tall} isn't literally the most tall. When you think of something high above the rest, you think of something that is {tooltip:Vocabulary:the best}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "The Best",
                "Alternatives": "Best, Supreme, The Most, Most",
