{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:sick}, so the verb version is {tooltip:Vocabulary:to be sick}. It can also be used as {tooltip:Vocabulary:to come down with} when you have the flu or some other illness.",
