                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28233-subject-3189.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}When you only have one thing, there's only one thing. Nothing is collected. But when you have two... \"{tooltip:Reading:ah two}!\" ({span:lang=ja:\u3042\u3064}). Now you're starting {tooltip:Vocabulary:to collect something}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u9752\u3044\u30b7\u30e3\u30c4\u3092\u304d\u3066\u3044\u308b\u4eba\u3092\u96c6\u3081\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please gather the people wearing blue shirts."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u30fc\u304b\u3089\u306e\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30c9\u30d0\u30c3\u30af\u3092\u96c6\u3081\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "We've been gathering feedback from users."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u79c1\u306f\u5916\u56fd\u306e\u98df\u3079\u7269\u306e\u5199\u771f\u3092\u96c6\u3081\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "I am collecting pictures of foreign food."
