{
            "mnemonic": "A thing that {tooltip:Kanji:carries} {tooltip:Kanji:rotation}s (think wheels!) is most kinds of vehicles. So, it's kind of like saying you're \"doing vehicles\" here... but that doesn't make sense. What do you do to vehicles though? You drive them. That's why this word means {tooltip:Vocabulary:to drive}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
