            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u3051\u3057\u30b4\u30e0\u3001\u3064\u304f\u3048\u306e\u4e0b\u306b\u843d\u3061\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "Your eraser fell under the desk."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3057\u3051\u3093\u306b\u843d\u3061\u305f\u65e5\u306b\u3001\u3072\u308d\u3046\u304b\u3089\u3001\u306f\u304c\u306c\u3051\u843d\u3061\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "On the day I failed the exam, I dropped my teeth from exhaustion."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u4f55\u3057\u3066\u308b\u306e\uff1f\u79c1\u3082\u5165\u308c\u3066\uff1f\u300d\u300c\u672c\u5f53\uff1f\u4ffa\u305f\u3061\u3001\u30b9\u30c6\u30a2\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30eb\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3046\u3001\u68d2\u4eba\u9593\u304c\u3072\u305f\u3059\u3089\u968e\u6bb5\u304b\u3089\u843d\u3061\u308b\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u3057\u3066\u308b\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3002\u300d\u300c\u304a\u3082\u3057\u308d\u305d\u3046\u3058\u3083\u3093\u3002\u300d",
                    "en": "\"What are you guys playing? Let me in!\" \"Really? We\u2019re playing a game called Stair Fall where a stickman just keeps falling down the stairs.\" \"Sounds fun!\""
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:ride} so this word has to do with riding. There's another word that's similar ({span:lang=ja:\u4e57\u308b} which means to ride). This particular one is transitive, meaning there is a direct object. The action is done to someone or something. So this means {tooltip:Vocabulary:to give someone a ride} when it's used for people, and {tooltip:Vocabulary:to place something on}, or {tooltip:Vocabulary:to load something} when it's used for things. ",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "To Give Someone A Ride",
                "Alternatives": "To Place Something On, To Load Something",
                "Word Type": "transitive verb, ichidan verb"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u306e\u305b\u308b"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u306e\u305b\u308b",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "20355-subject-3113.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u306e\u305b\u308b",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "40264-subject-3113.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is kun'yomi (see that hiragana?) but that's the reading you learned with the kanji so you should be okay with this. Allow me to give you a ride to the next item to study.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5b50\u3069\u3082\u3092\u52a9\u624b\u305b\u304d\u306b\u4e57\u305b\u308b\u306e\u306f\u304d\u3051\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "It\u2019s dangerous to let children ride in the passenger's seat."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u673a\u306b\u8db3\u3092\u4e57\u305b\u308b\u306e\u306f\u884c\u304e\u304c\u308f\u308b\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "Putting your feet on a table is bad manners."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u7537\u306f\u3001\u5973\u6027\u306e\u81ea\u8ee2\u8eca\u304c\u5b8c\u74a7\u306b\u58ca\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u306e\u3092\u898b\u3066\u3001\u300c\u753a\u307e\u3067\u8eca\u306b\u4e57\u305b\u3066\u3042\u3052\u308b\u3088\u300d\u3068\u8a00\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "The man saw that the woman\u2019s bicycle was completely destroyed so he offered to give her a ride back to town."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

