                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}You are hired {tooltip:Vocabulary:to investigate} someone's wife. It is said that {tooltip:Reading:she love}s ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3089}) another man... but you need to investigate her to find out if that's true, for her husband of course.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u65e5\u306e\u5348\u5f8c\u306f\u3001\u3068\u3057\u3087\u304b\u3093\u3067\u305b\u3093\u305d\u3046\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u8abf\u3079\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "This afternoon, I looked up things about the war at the library."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3051\u3044\u3055\u3064\u304c\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306e\u8eca\u306e\u4e2d\u3092\u8abf\u3079\u308b\u3068\u3001\u4e2d\u304b\u3089\u9152\u306b\u3088\u3063\u305f\u30d5\u30b0\u304c\u51fa\u3066\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "When the police investigated inside Koichi's car, a drunken blowfish came out."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30ab\u30d4\u30d0\u30e9\u304c\u98df\u3079\u3089\u308c\u308b\u306e\u304b\u3069\u3046\u304b\u3001\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u8abf\u3079\u3066\u304f\u308c\u306a\u3044\uff1f",
                    "en": "Can you research capybaras and see if they are edible?"
                }
            ],
