                        "file": "28030-subject-7686.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}Sometimes when you're trying {tooltip:Vocabulary:to talk}, there will be that one person who always cuts you off {tooltip:Vocabulary:to tell} everyone what they want to say. We call them language {tooltip:Reading:cutter}s ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u305f}). They cut you off and make everyone pay attention to what they're saying. Don't be a language cutter.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6b21\u306e\u30bb\u30df\u30ca\u30fc\u3067\u306f\u3001\u4f55\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u8a9e\u308b\u4e88\u5b9a\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "What do you plan to talk about at the next seminar?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u7530\u4e2d\u3055\u3093\u3001\u6642\u9593\u304c\u306a\u3044\u306e\u3067\u3001\u307c\u3046\u3051\u3093\u3060\u3093\u3092\u8a9e\u308b\u306e\u306f\u3053\u306e\u8fba\u3067\u6b62\u3081\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Mr. Tanaka, time is up, so please wrap up your adventure tale."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u4e8b\u4ef6\u3092\u4eba\u306b\u8a9e\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306f\u3067\u304d\u306a\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "I can\u2019t talk about this case with people."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You know that you're {tooltip:Kanji:throw}ing something that is {tooltip:Kanji:attach}ing to something else. How else can you say that? The best way would be to say {tooltip:Vocabulary:to throw against} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:to throw at}.",
