{
            "mnemonic": "So, you're {tooltip:Kanji:send}ing something that {tooltip:Kanji:revolve}s. It's a little {tooltip:Vocabulary:transfer} / {tooltip:Vocabulary:transmission}, going through the wires. Little messages that revolve around as they zip through the lines to get to their destination. Try to imagine this happening in slow motion, getting to the other end.",
