                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}What did you do {tooltip:Vocabulary:beforehand}? You had {tooltip:Reading:a raw cas}ual ({span:lang=ja:\u3042\u3089\u304b\u3058}) encounter with {tooltip:Reading:a raw Cage}, Nic Cage. You probably should have planned something better {tooltip:Vocabulary:ahead of time}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u3046\u306a\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306f\u5206\u304b\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305f\u306e\u3067\u3001\u4e88\u3081\u7528\u610f\u3057\u3066\u304a\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I knew it would happen, so I prepared ahead of time."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3072\u884c\u304d\u306b\u4e57\u308a\u304a\u304f\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3001\u4e88\u3081\u524d\u65e5\u306b\u30aa\u30f3\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3\u3067\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u30a4\u30f3\u3057\u3066\u304a\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I checked in online a day before the flight so that I wouldn't miss it."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e88\u3081\u4e88\u7fd2\u3057\u3066\u304a\u3044\u305f\u7532\u6590\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Preparing the lesson in advance was worthwhile."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

