                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u3068\u306f\u5171\u901a\u70b9\u304c\u5168\u304f\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3089\u3001\u4f55\u3092\u8a71\u305b\u3070\u3044\u3044\u304b\u5206\u304b\u3089\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "I don't know what to talk about because Koichi and I have nothing in common."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30c8\u30a6\u30d5\u3068\u30d5\u30b0\u306e\u3001\u304a\u3069\u308d\u304f\u3079\u304d\u5171\u901a\u70b9\u3092\u767a\u898b\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "We discovered an amazing similarity between Tofu and Fugu."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u304c\u719f\u5973\u597d\u304d\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3046\u5642\u3092\u805e\u3044\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3002\u300d\u300c\u30de\u30b8\u304b\u3088\uff01\u3082\u3057\u305d\u308c\u304c\u672c\u5f53\u306a\u3089\u3001\u4ffa\u3068\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306b\u5171\u901a\u70b9\u304c\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3063\u3066\u3053\u3068\u306b\u306a\u308b\u305c\u3002\u300d",
                    "en": "\"I heard a rumor that Koichi likes older women.\" \"Seriously? If that was true it would mean that he and I have something in common.\""
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Kanji:relationship} {tooltip:Kanji:intervals}... this doesn't make much sense at first, but if you think about it, at certain intervals from within your friends, you'll run into someone who's your {tooltip:Vocabulary:companion}... not just any old friend. Something better. Something part of your group.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Companion",
                "Alternatives": "Comrade, Associate",
                "Word Type": "noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u306a\u304b\u307e"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u306a\u304b\u307e",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
