                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u306a\u304b\u307e",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28458-subject-3241.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for {span:lang=ja:\u4ef2} is the one you learned. When you learned the kanji {span:lang=ja:\u9593}, we didn't give you a mnemonic for the ({span:lang=ja:\u307e}) reading, so here's one now:\n{splitParent}Think through all your companions in your life. Imagine one of them is your {tooltip:Reading:Ma} ({span:lang=ja:\u307e}). She's on your pirate crew, and a pretty awesome pirate.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u306f\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u9031\u9593\u4e2d\u3060\u304b\u3089\u3001\u7d42\u308f\u308b\u307e\u3067\u4ef2\u9593\u3068\u3042\u305d\u3076\u306e\u306f\u304a\u3042\u305a\u3051\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I'm in the middle of the exam week, so I have to wait to hang out with my companions until it's done."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4ef2\u9593\u305f\u3061\u3068\u306f\u3001\u5144\u5f1f\u307f\u305f\u3044\u306b\u3044\u3064\u3082\u4e00\u3057\u3087\u306b\u3044\u3066\u3001\u3075\u3056\u3051\u5408\u3063\u3066\u3001\u304a\u305f\u304c\u3044\u306b\u304b\u3089\u304b\u3044\u5408\u3063\u3066\u308b\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "Me and my comrades are like brothers who are always together, fooling around, and picking on each other."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5b66\u6821\u3067\u306e\u53b3\u3057\u3044\u4e00\u65e5\u3092\u7d42\u3048\u3066\u3001\u4ef2\u9593\u305f\u3061\u3068\u30ea\u30e9\u30c3\u30af\u30b9\u3092\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Me and my group of friends relaxed after a hard day at school."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
