                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "40259-subject-3132.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings are the same as the ones you learned with the kanji, though {span:lang=ja:\u6c17} is on'yomi and {span:lang=ja:\u6301\u3061} is kun'yomi. One of those weird exception readings, but it'll work out for you anyway, as long as you're studying the kanji well enough.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u6c17\u6301\u3061\u306f\u3088\u304f\u5206\u304b\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I know exactly how you feel."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6c17\u6301\u3061\u304c\u308f\u308b\u304f\u3066\u306f\u304d\u305d\u3046\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I feel sick, like I'm going to throw up."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u308c\u3001\u3064\u307e\u3089\u306a\u3044\u3082\u306e\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3002\u3055\u3055\u3084\u304b\u306a\u611f\u8b1d\u306e\u6c17\u6301\u3061\u3067\u3059\u3002\u3069\u3046\u305e\u3001\u958b\u3051\u3066\u307f\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Here\u2019s a little something for you. This is just a small token of my appreciation. Go ahead, open it."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

