                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. You learned this reading for {span:lang=ja:\u9996} when you learned {span:lang=ja:\u90e8\u9996}, and the reading for {span:lang=ja:\u4f4d} is the one you learned with the kanji, so you should be able to read this on your own.\n"
