                        "file": "28360-subject-3311.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it probably uses the kun'yomi reading. You did not learn this reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you to remember: \n{splitParent}A {tooltip:Vocabulary:good} way to pass the time is with a {tooltip:Reading:yo}-yo ({span:lang=ja:\u3088}). But it better be a good yo-yo. A bad one will just fall apart.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u304a\u7f8a\u3056\u3068\u5929\u3073\u3093\u3056\u306f\u76f8\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304c\u826f\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Aries and Libra are compatible."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3051\u3093\u304b\u3059\u308b\u307b\u3069\u4ef2\u304c\u826f\u3044\u3063\u3066\u8a00\u3046\u3060\u308d\uff1f",
                    "en": "Don't they say, \"The closer you are, the more you fight?\""
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u826f\u3044\u8003\u3048\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u5b9f\u969b\u306f\u305d\u308c\u3092\u3059\u308b\u306b\u306f\u8cc7\u91d1\u304c\u8db3\u308a\u306a\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "That\u2019s a good idea, but the fact is that we don\u2019t have enough money for it."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
