                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading comes from the vocab word {span:lang=ja:\u6c17\u6301\u3061}, so if you know that (or the vocab words {span:lang=ja:\u6c17} and {span:lang=ja:\u6301\u3061}) you should be A-okay on this one. Maybe even {tooltip:Vocabulary:feeling good} about it?\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u7fbd\u6bdb\u3076\u3068\u3093\u3001\u6c17\u6301\u3061\u3044\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "This down duvet feels really good."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5bb6\u304c\u304d\u308c\u3044\u3060\u3068\u6c17\u6301\u3061\u3044\u3044\u3088\u306d\uff01",
                    "en": "Doesn't it feel good to have a clean house?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u30de\u30c3\u30b5\u30fc\u30b8\u3001\u6c17\u6301\u3061\u3044\u3044\u3002\u3053\u306e\u3044\u305f\u6c17\u6301\u3061\u3088\u3055\u304c\u305f\u307e\u3089\u306a\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "This massage feels good. I'm enjoying this good pain!"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

