                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u52aa\u529b\u306f\u3046\u3089\u5207\u3089\u306a\u3044\u300d\u3068\u3044\u3046\u8a00\u8449\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3051\u3069\u3001\u3042\u308c\u306f\u3046\u305d\u3060\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "There is a saying, \"Your efforts will not betray you,\" but it's a lie."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u52aa\u529b\u306e\u304b\u3044\u3082\u3080\u306a\u3057\u304f\u3001\u305f\u304b\u3089\u304f\u3058\u306b\u306f\u5f53\u305f\u3089\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "In spite of his grueling efforts, he didn't win the lottery."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u52aa\u529b\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3001\u7d50\u679c\u304c\u51fa\u306a\u304f\u3066\u306f\u610f\u5473\u304c\u7121\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Even if you work hard, if you don't have results, there isn't a point to it."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
