{
            "mnemonic": "You've seen the word {span:lang=ja:\u4f7f\u3046} hopefully by now. If you have, you know it means \"to use.\" So, the {tooltip:Kanji:way} to {tooltip:Kanji:use} something is the {tooltip:Vocabulary:way of using} (aka {tooltip:Vocabulary:how to use}). This will be a word you see when you're looking at directions for how to use something.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "How To Use",
                "Alternative": "Way Of Using",
