                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u52b4\u50cd\u6642\u9593\u306f\u9031\u4f55\u6642\u9593\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "How many hours do you work per week?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3046\u3061\u306e\u4e3b\u4eba\u306f\u5e74\u306a\u306e\u3067\u3001\u8089\u4f53\u52b4\u50cd\u306f\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u3055\u3059\u304c\u306b\u304d\u3073\u3057\u3044\u304b\u3082\u3002",
                    "en": "My husband is old, so manual labor would be a bit too hard for him."
