                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28420-subject-7689.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}Your parents put a {tooltip:Vocabulary:newly} wrapped present under the Christmas tree. You don't want to wait to see what new thing they got you so you rip it open to find they got you {tooltip:Reading:a ra}w ({span:lang=ja:\u3042\u3089}) steak. Getting a new steak is cool and all, but a raw steak is pretty gross. It's dripping blood all over the place.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u304c\u65b0\u305f\u306a\u30aa\u30e0\u30c4\u305b\u3044\u305e\u3046\u304e\u3058\u3085\u3064\u3092\u767a\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi invented a novel diaper-making technique."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e5d\u6708\u306f\u81ea\u5206\u306b\u3068\u3063\u3066\u65b0\u305f\u306a\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u30c8\u306b\u306a\u308a\u305d\u3046\u306a\u4e88\u304b\u3093\u304c\u3059\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "I feel like September is going to be a fresh start for me."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u5c0f\u8aac\u306f\u3001\u8aad\u307f\u8fd4\u3059\u5ea6\u306b\u65b0\u305f\u306a\u767a\u898b\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "Every time I reread this novel I make a new discovery."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If someone asks if you want a {tooltip:Kanji:separate} knee ({span:lang=ja:\u306b}), you'll say {tooltip:Vocabulary:not particularly}. I mean, you've never thought about it, but do you really need more knees? {tooltip:Vocabulary:Not really}...",
