{
            "mnemonic": "An {tooltip:Kanji:elderly} {tooltip:Kanji:person} is an {tooltip:Vocabulary:old person} (or an {tooltip:Vocabulary:elderly person}). Don't call a person a {span:lang=ja:\u53e4\u3044\u4eba}, though. {span:lang=ja:\u53e4\u3044} is used for things, not people. Be nice, they're your elders.",
