                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is the on'yomi reading, which you learned. This is probably because you'll see this word attached to other words, showing the rank of that thing.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u5e74\u306f\u4f55\u4f4d\u3060\u308d\u3046\uff1f",
                    "en": "I wonder where I'll rank this year."
                },
                {
