                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28456-subject-3243.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings are the kun'yomi readings. For {span:lang=ja:\u4ef2} you're fine. That's what you learned with the kanji. For {span:lang=ja:\u76f4\u308a} think back to the vocab word {span:lang=ja:\u76f4\u308b}. That's what's going on here.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u904e\u53bb\u306e\u3053\u3068\u306f\u6c34\u306b\u6d41\u3057\u3066\u3001\u4ef2\u76f4\u308a\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "Let\u2019s let bygones be bygones and just make peace."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u3093\u306a\u306b\u304b\u3093\u305f\u3093\u306b\u4ef2\u76f4\u308a\u306f\u51fa\u6765\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "I can't make up with her that quickly."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e00\u4f53\u5168\u4f53\u3001\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u3069\u3046\u3084\u3063\u3066\u30de\u30ea\u30aa\u30d6\u30e9\u30b6\u30fc\u30ba\u3092\u4ef2\u76f4\u308a\u3055\u305b\u305f\u306e\uff1f",
                    "en": "How did Koichi bring about a reconciliation between the Mario brothers?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
