                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "20528-subject-3131.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Do you remember the word {span:lang=ja:\u304a\u91d1}? This is the {span:lang=ja:\u91d1} in this word. The reading for {span:lang=ja:\u6301\u3061} is the {span:lang=ja:\u3082} you learned with {span:lang=ja:\u6301\u3064}. So, combine the {span:lang=ja:\u304b\u306d} of {span:lang=ja:\u304a\u91d1} and the {span:lang=ja:\u6301\u3061} and you have the reading of this word. Alternatively, you can say this word as {span:lang=ja:\u304a\u91d1\u6301\u3061} as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u304b\u308c\u3001\u304a\u91d1\u6301\u3061\u306a\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u2026",
                    "en": "He\u2019s rich though\u2026"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3061\u3087\u3046\u304a\u91d1\u6301\u3061\u3068\u3051\u3063\u3053\u3093\u3057\u305f\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "I want to marry someone who is filthy rich."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u82e5\u3044\u9803\u3001\u304a\u91d1\u3092\u7a3c\u3050\u305f\u3081\u306b\u3001\u8fd1\u6240\u306e\u304a\u91d1\u6301\u3061\u306e\u4eba\u305f\u3061\u306e\u4f7f\u3044\u8d70\u308a\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I used to run small errands for a wealthy neighbor of mine to make money when I was young."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
