                        "file": "28301-subject-7577.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word that uses the on'yomi readings of the kanji. You didn't learn this reading for {span:lang=ja:\u5c4b} though, so here's a mnemonic to help you:\n{splitParent}One place in the world has more {tooltip:Vocabulary:rooftop}s than any where else, and that's {tooltip:Reading:Ok}lahoma ({span:lang=ja:\u304a\u304f}). They get so many tornadoes that they need extra rooftops for when the first few blow off.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u65e5\u3001\u5c4b\u4e0a\u3067\u30d0\u30fc\u30d9\u30ad\u30e5\u30fc\u3092\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "We're doing a rooftop barbecue today."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u591c\u304d\u3093\u660e\u3051\u306b\u3082\u304b\u304b\u308f\u3089\u305a\u3001\u5c4b\u4e0a\u3067\u304d\u3093\u30c8\u30ec\u3092\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I worked out on the rooftop in the morning even though I work the night shift."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5c4b\u4e0a\u306b\u4e0a\u304c\u3063\u3066\u3001\u5929\u304b\u3089\u3075\u308a\u6ce8\u3050\u661f\u306e\u5149\u3092\u4e00\u7dd2\u306b\u3042\u3073\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3044\uff1f",
                    "en": "Why don't we go up to the housetop and catch the star light shining down from the heavens?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:ocean}/{tooltip:Kanji:sea} {tooltip:Kanji:coast} is the {tooltip:Vocabulary:seashore}. Then again, it could also be the {tooltip:Vocabulary:coast} as well.",
