                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28379-subject-3300.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is the same as you learned with the kanji. It's presumably because it's usually attached to other things, like numbers, making it act more like a jukugo word would. Anyway, you should only need a {tooltip:Vocabulary:second} to learn this reading, since you should already know it.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306b\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3\u3057\u305f\u3089\u79d2\u3067\u8fd4\u4e8b\u304d\u3066\u308f\u3089\u3048\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I sent a LINE message to Koichi and he replied to me in a second. That made me chuckle."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5927\u4f53\u3044\u3064\u3082\u3001\u3075\u3068\u3093\u306b\u5165\u3063\u305f\u3089\u4e09\u79d2\u3067\u306d\u3066\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "When I go to bed, I usually fall asleep in three seconds."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u767a\u97f3\u3092\u305f\u3063\u305f\u306e\u5341\u4e8c\u79d2\u3067\u30cd\u30a4\u30c6\u30a3\u30d6\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u306b\u3057\u3066\u307f\u305b\u307e\u3059\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "Your pronunciation can reach native-level in just twelve seconds."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "When you {tooltip:Kanji:sell} something {tooltip:Kanji:cheap}, you're selling it at a {tooltip:Vocabulary:discount}. Alternatively you can remember this word as {tooltip:Vocabulary:sell cheaply} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:bargain sale}. These are good deals!",
