                        "file": "20151-subject-3456.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The hiragana on the end hints that the readings are the kun'yomi readings. Use your memory of {span:lang=ja:\u5b89\u3044} and {span:lang=ja:\u58f2\u308b} to help you to remember how to read this.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u3093\u307e\u308a\u81ea\u5206\u3092\u5b89\u58f2\u308a\u3059\u308b\u3068\u3001\u5f8c\u3067\u8f9b\u304f\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "If you sell yourself too short, it\u2019ll be tough later."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u30b8\u30e3\u30b1\u30c3\u30c8\u3001\u3081\u3063\u3061\u3083\u597d\u304d\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u3088\u3086\u3046\u304c\u306a\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3088\u306d\u3002\u8fd1\u3005\u5b89\u58f2\u308a\u3059\u308b\u3088\u3066\u3044\u3068\u304b\u3063\u3066\u306a\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304b\u306d\uff1f",
                    "en": "I really love this jacket, but can't afford it. Are there any upcoming sales?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u3046\u3060\u3088\u3002\u541b\u306b\u58f2\u3063\u305f\u6642\u306b\u306f\u305d\u306e\u30c6\u30ec\u30d3\u306f\u58ca\u308c\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3055\u3002\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3060\u304b\u3089\u3053\u305d\u5b89\u58f2\u308a\u3057\u305f\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "Yes, the TV was broken when I sold it to you, but that\u2019s why it was on sale."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:hand} that {tooltip:Kanji:sell}s the items is connected to a person who is known as the {tooltip:Vocabulary:seller} or the {tooltip:Vocabulary:vendor}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Seller",
                "Alternative": "Vendor",
                "Word Type": "noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
