                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28243-subject-3262.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is the same as the one you learned. Move on to a {span:lang=ja:\u5225\u306e\u6f22\u5b57}, mmk?\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5225\u306e\u30a2\u30d7\u30ed\u30fc\u30c1\u3092\u30c8\u30e9\u30a4\u3057\u3066\u307f\u306a\u3044\uff1f",
                    "en": "Why don't we try a different approach?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u308c\u3068\u305d\u308c\u306f\u3001\u5225\u306e\u3082\u3093\u3060\u3044\u3060\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I think this and that are separate issues."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u79c1\u306f\u5bb6\u3092\u4e8c\u8ed2\u6240\u6709\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002\u4e09\u30f6\u6708\u307b\u3069\u524d\u306b\u8cfc\u5165\u3057\u305f\u5834\u6240\u3068\u3001\u8c37\u5e95\u306b\u3082\u3046\u4e00\u4ef6\u5225\u306e\u5bb6\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "I own two houses. I bought this place about three months ago and I own another place down in the valley."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "When you {tooltip:Kanji:separate} {tooltip:Kanji:separate} you're putting things off into their own areas. You're marking them off {tooltip:Vocabulary:separately} and {tooltip:Vocabulary:individually}.",
