                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is all on'yomi, and you know how to read {span:lang=ja:\u7269}. {span:lang=ja:\u898b}'s on'yomi ({span:lang=ja:\u3051\u3093}) is a reading you didn't learn with the kanji because it's so much less useful, but you do have to know it here. You've seen it with {span:lang=ja:\u767a\u898b} a couple levels ago, so that should help. Just imagine taking the samurai {tooltip:Reading:Ken} on an epic {tooltip:Vocabulary:sightseeing} trip. Think of all the things you and Ken will visit!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u304a\u3082\u767d\u305d\u3046\u3060\u304b\u3089\u3001\u898b\u7269\u3057\u3066\u307f\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002",
                    "en": "It seems fun, so let\u2019s have a look."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30aa\u30d5\u30a3\u30b9\u306e\u307e\u3069\u304b\u3089\u3001\u30af\u30ea\u30b9\u30de\u30b9\u30d1\u30ec\u30fc\u30c9\u3092\u898b\u7269\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "We watched the Christmas parade from the office windows."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6bcd\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306a\u3089\u3001\u6771\u4eac\u898b\u7269\u306b\u51fa\u304b\u3051\u305f\u305c\u3002",
                    "en": "Mom would have gone sightseeing in Tokyo."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
