{
            "mnemonic": "Every single {tooltip:Kanji:thing} you {tooltip:Kanji:see} is {tooltip:Vocabulary:splendid}. You saw it after all, so of course it's {tooltip:Vocabulary:magnificent}. Your eyes are so great that they make everything reflect you. And you're {tooltip:Vocabulary:beautiful}.",
