                        "file": "28376-subject-3149.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u30c9\u30e9\u30de\u304c\u653e\u9001\u3055\u308c\u308b\u306e\u306f\u3001\u4e45\u3057\u3076\u308a\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "It\u2019s been a while since this drama was broadcast."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u306e\u3057\u5408\u306e\u3055\u3044\u653e\u9001\u306a\u3089\u3001\u4eca\u65e5\u4e94\u6642\u304b\u3089NHK\u3067\u653e\u9001\u3055\u308c\u308b\u4e88\u5b9a\u3067\u3059\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "A rebroadcast of the game is scheduled to run on NHK at 5pm today."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u793e\u9577\u306f\u4eca\u6669\u30c6\u30ec\u30d3\u3067\u91cd\u5927\u306a\u6c7a\u5b9a\u3092\u653e\u9001\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "President Koichi\u2019s important announcement will be broadcast on television tonight."
