                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28473-subject-3238.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}You're starting {tooltip:Vocabulary:to compete} and {tooltip:Vocabulary:to argue} with someone, who is yelling at you: \"You {tooltip:Reading:are so} ({span:lang=ja:\u3042\u3089\u305d}) stupid!\". You might want to imagine this in an accent that gets you closer to the Japanese pronuncation.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306e\u4e8b\u3067\u4e89\u3046\u306e\u306f\u3088\u3057\u3066\uff01",
                    "en": "Please don't argue about me!"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u306e\u793e\u3044\u3093\u305f\u3061\u306f\u3001\u793e\u9577\u306e\u3056\u3092\u306d\u3089\u3063\u3066\u4e89\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Tofugu workers are competing with each other for the position of president."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u3063\u3066\u672c\u5f53\u306b\u843d\u3061\u7740\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3057\u697d\u3057\u3044\u3057\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u3068\u904a\u3076\u306e\u306f\u6700\u9ad8\u3060\u308f\u3002\u3057\u304b\u3082\u3001\u79c1\u305f\u3061\u8a00\u3044\u4e89\u3063\u305f\u3053\u3068\u3082\u307e\u3060\u4e00\u5ea6\u3082\u7121\u3044\u308f\u3088\u306d\u3002\u305d\u308c\u3063\u3066\u3059\u3054\u304f\u306a\u3044\uff1f",
                    "en": "You are so chill. It\u2019s great hanging out with you. You know what? We\u2019ve never had an argument yet, either. That\u2019s crazy, isn\u2019t it?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

