{
            "mnemonic": "*Ahem.* This is the {tooltip:Kanji:place} of {tooltip:Kanji:convenience}. What place above all others do you want to be convenient? Just in case, you know... that would be the {tooltip:Vocabulary:toilet}. You might also call it the {tooltip:Vocabulary:lavatory}, the {tooltip:Vocabulary:restroom}, or the {tooltip:Vocabulary:bathroom}.",
