                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}You learned this reading when you learned {span:lang=ja:\u6b20\u3051\u308b}, but here's a mnemonic just in case:\n{splitParent}You never know when you're going {tooltip:Vocabulary:to lack something}. Like a {tooltip:Reading:ca}r ({span:lang=ja:\u304b}). Did you plan for it to break? NO! But it happened and now you lack a car in a big way. Not {tooltip:Reading:cool} ({span:lang=ja:\u304f})!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5de5\u4e8b\u306e\u97f3\u304c\u3001\u96c6\u4e2d\u529b\u3092\u6b20\u304f\u539f\u56e0\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "The reason you lack concentration are those construction noises."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d0\u30ca\u30ca\u3060\u3051\u306e\u98df\u4e8b\u306f\u30d0\u30e9\u30f3\u30b9\u3092\u6b20\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "I think your banana-only diet lacks balance."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u306f\u79c1\u305f\u3061\u306e\u751f\u6d3b\u306b\u6b20\u304f\u3053\u3068\u306e\u3067\u304d\u306a\u3044\u30b5\u30fc\u30d3\u30b9\u3060\u3002",
