                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28466-subject-3507.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading comes from {span:lang=ja:\u82e6\u3057\u3044}, so as long as you're on top of that word, this word should be readable for you as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u306e\u8003\u3048\u65b9\u306f\u3001\u7406\u304b\u3044\u306b\u82e6\u3057\u307f\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I struggle to understand Tofugu's way of thinking."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u306f\u3093\u3056\u3044\u306b\u624b\u3092\u305d\u3081\u308b\u3088\u3046\u305d\u305d\u306e\u304b\u3057\u3066\u304f\u308b\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u304b\u3089\u306e\u5f37\u308c\u3064\u306a\u30d7\u30ec\u30c3\u30b7\u30e3\u30fc\u306b\u82e6\u3057\u3093\u3067\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I'm struggling under intense pressure from Koichi, who aided and abetted me in a crime."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u306a\u305c\u7f6a\u306e\u306a\u3044\u4eba\u304c\u82e6\u3057\u3093\u3067\u3044\u308b\u306e\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "Why do innocent people suffer?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:transmit}, so the verb version is {tooltip:Vocabulary:to transmit} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:to tell} something.",
