{
            "mnemonic": "You've hopefully seen {span:lang=ja:\u52dd\u3064} by now, which means \"to win.\" This is a nouny version of that. So, what's the noun version of \"to win?\" It's {tooltip:Vocabulary:a win} or a {tooltip:Vocabulary:victory}.",
