                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28426-subject-3504.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading comes from {span:lang=ja:\u52dd\u3064}. So as long as you have some understanding of that reading, you should be able to read this one as well. \n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u30d9\u30ea\u30fc\u30c0\u30f3\u30b9\u5bfe\u6c7a\u3067\u30dc\u30ed\u52dd\u3061\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi won the belly dancing competition hands down."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u96ea\u5408\u305b\u3093\u65e5\u672c\u4ee3\u8868\u306f\u304e\u3083\u304f\u8ee2\u52dd\u3061\u3092\u304a\u3055\u3081\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Japan's national snow ball fighting team made a comeback to clinch the victory."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u65e9\u3044\u8005\u52dd\u3061\u306a\u3093\u3060\u3060\u304b\u3089\u3001\u6025\u3054\u3046\u3088\uff01\u3042\u306e\u30d5\u30b0\u306e\u30ad\u30fc\u30db\u30eb\u30c0\u30fc\u3059\u3054\u304f\u6b32\u3057\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306d\uff01\u3053\u306e\u6a5f\u4f1a\u3092\u9003\u3057\u305f\u304f\u306a\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "It\u2019s first come, first served. Let\u2019s get a move on! I really want the Fugu keychain. I don\u2019t want to miss out on this chance."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

