                "mnemonic": "On this {tooltip:Kanji:field}, the {tooltip:Reading:Ya}nkees ({span:lang=ja:\u3084}) used to play."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Look at a {tooltip:Radical:building} and {tooltip:Radical:compare} the {tooltip:Radical:white} parts. Each of those white parts is a {tooltip:Kanji:floor}. Multi-{tooltip:Kanji:story} buildings have tons of different floors that you can see from the outside.",
            "hints": "All buildings have white marks that you can compare with the rest to see where the floors are. ",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Floor",
                "Alternatives": "Story, Storey"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
