                "mnemonic": "Standing in {tooltip:Kanji:sunshine} for this long has worked up your appetite, so you take a {tooltip:Reading:yo}gurt ({span:lang=ja:\u3088\u3046}) cup out of your bag and eat it."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Stop}! That {tooltip:Radical:box} of {tooltip:Radical:rice} is actually full of {tooltip:Kanji:teeth}! I know it says \"rice\" on the cover, but I promise you those are all teeth and if you bite into them you'll break a {tooltip:Kanji:tooth} of your own.",
            "hints": "Stop what you're doing and look into the rice box. Nope, it's definitely full of teeth. There's a grain or two of rice, but it's like 98% teeth.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Tooth",
                "Alternative": "Teeth"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
