                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine adjusting your tie as you wait. Oh no, now even more people are staring at you. The tie thing is making you look even more suspicious!",
                "mnemonic": "As you {tooltip:Kanji:wait} outside the temple, you can't help but adjust your {tooltip:Reading:tie} ({span:lang=ja:\u305f\u3044}). When you wait you get nervous, and when you get nervous you fidget. So now you're messing with your tie a whole bunch."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "After a {tooltip:Radical:tsunami}, any {tooltip:Radical:plate} left out in the {tooltip:Radical:sun} will be sure to get {tooltip:Kanji:warm}. The tsunami knocked this plate out of the kitchen, and now it\u2019s just sitting outside in the sun. The sun heats things, so the plate is getting really warm.",
            "hints": "Right after the tsunami, this plate was wet, but the sun is warming and drying the plate. Imagine looking at the plate and seeing the beads of water evaporate off it as it warms up. Feel the warm steam on your face as this happens.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Warm"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
