{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Kanji:moving} {tooltip:Kanji:thing}... think about the \"things\" that move. Technically it could be a lot of things (aka basically anything), but in this case we are talking about moving living things. We won't include humans, because humans are too good to be called things. This refers to {tooltip:Vocabulary:animals} instead.",
