{
            "mnemonic": "Who is {tooltip:Kanji:part} {tooltip:Kanji:parent} to you? Your {tooltip:Vocabulary:boss}! They make it so you can take care of yourself by paying you, don't they? They'll break the legs of someone who crosses you. But they won't help you get back to sleep after you have nightmares. So they're only part like a parent.",
