                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This word consists of the kun'yomi reading for {span:lang=ja:\u89aa} and the on'yomi reading for {span:lang=ja:\u5206}. You've learned both of these so you should be able to read this already!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5730\u4e0b\u9053\u3067\u30e4\u30af\u30b6\u306e\u89aa\u5206\u3068\u3059\u308c\u3061\u304c\u3063\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "I walked by a yakuza kingpin in the underpass."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u3068\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u3067\u306f\u3069\u3061\u3089\u304c\u89aa\u5206\u3067\u3069\u3061\u3089\u304c\u5b50\u5206\u3067\u3059\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "Between Koichi and Viet, which is the boss and which is the henchman?"
                },
