                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28631-subject-3520.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is the reading of {span:lang=ja:\u5fc3\u914d} (which you've hopefully gotten down okay by now) and {span:lang=ja:\u4e8b} using the ({span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3068}) reading. It is rendaku'd, as well, so beware of the {span:lang=ja:\u3054\u3068} (just another {span:lang=ja:\u5fc3\u914d\u4e8b}, ammiright?).\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5fc3\u914d\u4e8b\u3092\u308f\u3089\u3044\u3068\u3070\u3057\u3066\u304f\u308c\u3066\u3042\u308a\u304c\u3068\u3046\u3002",
                    "en": "Thank you for laughing my cares away."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u306a\u3093\u3060\u304b\u5fc3\u914d\u4e8b\u304c\u3042\u308b\u307f\u305f\u3044\u3060\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "Apparently he's got some worries."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u79c1\u306e\u4e00\u756a\u306e\u5fc3\u914d\u4e8b\u306f\u3001\u753a\u306b\u964d\u308a\u843d\u3061\u308b\u706b\u5c71\u7070\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "My biggest worry is volcanic ash falling over the city."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Kanji:tooth} {tooltip:Kanji:bug}... Luckily, it's not some bug living in your tooth, though you can see why someone might think this is what happens. A tooth with a \"bug\" in it is a tooth with a {tooltip:Vocabulary:cavity}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Cavity",
                "Alternatives": "Decayed Tooth, Tooth Decay",
                "Word Type": "noun, \u306e adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3080\u3057\u3070"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3080\u3057\u3070",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "4364-subject-3383.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3080\u3057\u3070",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28501-subject-3383.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings are both kun'yomi, but those are the readings you learned with these kanji. Notice that {span:lang=ja:\u306f} turns to {span:lang=ja:\u3070}, though. Presumably this is because you might yell out \"BAH!\" when you find out you have a cavity.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u65e5\u3001\u6b6f\u533b\u8005\u3067\u866b\u6b6f\u3092\u306c\u3044\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Today, I had my decayed tooth extracted at the dentist."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u866b\u6b6f\u306e\u3052\u3093\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3042\u308b\u30df\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30f3\u30b9\u304d\u3093\u306f\u5b50\u3069\u3082\u306e\u6210\u9577\u3068\u3068\u3082\u306b\u307e\u308f\u308a\u306e\u5927\u4eba\u304b\u3089\u3046\u3064\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Streptococcus mutans bacteria, the cause of tooth decay, can be transferred from adults to the kids around them as they grow up."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u866b\u6b6f\u304c\u3044\u3063\u3071\u3044\u3042\u308b\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u6b6f\u79d1\u4fdd\u967a\u304c\u7121\u3044\u306e\u3067\u3001\u6cbb\u7642\u4ee3\u3092\u637b\u51fa\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u306a\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "I have so many cavities but I don\u2019t have dental insurance and I can\u2019t afford to get them treated."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

