{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:sound} {tooltip:Kanji:read}ing. What could this be...? Wait a sec, think to Japanese and kanji. What's the reading that uses sounds from another place, specifically China? That's the {tooltip:Vocabulary:Chinese reading}, aka the {tooltip:Vocabulary:on'yomi}. Sounds familiar?",
