            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:capital} {tooltip:Kanji:metropolis} back in the day was {tooltip:Vocabulary:Kyoto}. Now of course the capital is Tokyo, but kanji doesn't know this. That's why Kyoto is the capital metropolis!",
