                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28572-subject-3552.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for this is strange. It's the kun'yomi vocab reading, probably because the literal translation is \"mother parent\" and therefore consists of a couple words combined together into one concept. So, make sure you know the separate word readings of {span:lang=ja:\u6bcd} and {span:lang=ja:\u89aa}. If you do, you should be able to read this too.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6bcd\u89aa\u3068\u4ef2\u76f4\u308a\u304c\u3057\u305f\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "I want to make up with my mother."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6bcd\u89aa\u3068\u305d\u306e\u304b\u308c\u6c0f\u3001\u6c17\u6301\u3061\u304c\u3060\u3093\u3060\u3093\u306f\u306a\u308c\u3066\u3044\u3063\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305f\u307f\u305f\u3044\u3067\u3001\u3051\u3063\u304d\u3087\u304f\u5225\u308c\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "My mother and her boyfriend ended up breaking up because apparently they had been gradually growing apart."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u3054\u3081\u3093\u306a\u3055\u3044\u3002\u660e\u65e5\u306e\u30e9\u30f3\u30c1\u3001\u30ad\u30e3\u30f3\u30bb\u30eb\u3057\u306a\u304f\u3061\u3083\u3044\u3051\u306a\u304f\u306a\u3063\u305f\u306e\u3002\u6bcd\u89aa\u304c\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u4f53\u8abf\u5d29\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066\u3002\u300d \u300c\u6c17\u306b\u3057\u306a\u3044\u3067\u3002\u307e\u305f\u4eca\u5ea6\u3001\u4f1a\u3044\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002\u305d\u308c\u3088\u308a\u3001\u304a\u6bcd\u69d8\u3001\u65e9\u304f\u826f\u304f\u306a\u308b\u3068\u3044\u3044\u308f\u306d\u3002\u300d",
                    "en": "\"I\u2019m sorry but I have to cancel lunch tomorrow. My mother got sick.\" \"It\u2019s no big deal. Let\u2019s meet another time. I hope your mom gets well soon.\""
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Kanji:Climb} a {tooltip:Kanji:mountain}. That is {tooltip:Vocabulary:mountain climbing}.",
