                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This word uses the kun'yomi readings. The kun'yomi for {span:lang=ja:\u6839} is {span:lang=ja:\u306d}. For a mnemonic, we'll use the sound a horse makes, {tooltip:Reading:neigh} ({span:lang=ja:\u306d}). Why is the horse neigh-ing? It's stuck on the {tooltip:Vocabulary:roof}.\n"
