                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28715-subject-3398.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}What's a very {tooltip:Vocabulary:short} race? A {tooltip:Reading:midge}t {tooltip:Reading:ca}r ({span:lang=ja:\u307f\u3058\u304b}) race. Don't tell me you've never heard of {link#https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Midget_car_racing#midget car racing}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u306e\u30b9\u30ab\u30fc\u30c8\u3001\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u77ed\u3059\u304e\u308b\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306a\u3044\uff1f",
                    "en": "Isn't that skirt a bit too short?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u8d64\u3061\u3083\u3093\u304c\u77ed\u3044\u624b\u8db3\u3092\u30d0\u30bf\u30d0\u30bf\u3055\u305b\u3066\u308b\u306e\u306f\u672c\u5f53\u306b\u304b\u308f\u3044\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "The baby's short, flailing arms and legs are so cute!"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u308f\u3041\uff01\u3042\u3093\u305f\u306e\u5c3b\u5c3e\u304c\u79c1\u3088\u308a\u77ed\u3044\u306a\u3093\u3066\u3001\u77e5\u3089\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u308f\u3002",
                    "en": "Wah! I didn\u2019t know your tail was shorter than mine."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
