            "mnemonic": "Something you {tooltip:Kanji:wear}, and {tooltip:Kanji:wear} again, is something you {tooltip:Vocabulary:steadily} wear. You do it so often, it's reliable. Also, if you wear something this much it's steadily wearing away too.",
