                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u308a\u304c\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307e\u3059\uff01\u52c9\u5f37\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Thank you so much. I've been learning a lot from you."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6700\u8fd1\u3001\u3060\u3089\u3051\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066\u3066\u3001\u3042\u3093\u307e\u308a\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u52c9\u5f37\u3057\u3066\u306a\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "I've been slacking off and haven't been studying as much recently."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u82f1\u8a9e\u306e\u52c9\u5f37\u3001\u9811\u5f35\u3063\u3066\u4e0b\u3055\u3044\u306d\u3002\u79c1\u3082\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u3092\u305a\u3063\u3068\u52c9\u5f37\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u306e\u3067\u82e6\u52b4\u306f\u3088\u304f\u308f\u304b\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Keep up your English language studies. I\u2019m always working on my Japanese too, so I know how hard it is."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:fat} {tooltip:Kanji:sunshine} thing up in the sky... what is it called? Oh, that's right. It's the {tooltip:Vocabulary:sun}.",
