            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u592a\u967d\u306e\u3088\u3046\u306a\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306e\u3048\u9854\u306b\u3001\u3053\u3044\u306b\u843d\u3061\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I fell in love with Koichi's sunshine-like smile."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u592a\u967d\u306e\u6e29\u5ea6\u3063\u3066\u4f55\u5ea6\u3050\u3089\u3044\u3042\u308b\u304b\u77e5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Do you happen to know what the sun's temperature is?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u65e5\u672c\u4e07\u56fd\u535a\u89a7\u4f1a\u306e\u30b7\u30f3\u30dc\u30eb\u306f\u3001\u5ca1\u672c\u592a\u90ce\u304c\u4f5c\u3063\u305f\u300c\u592a\u967d\u306e\u5854\u300d\u3067\u3001\u305d\u308c\u306f\u4eca\u3082\u65e5\u672c\u306e\u5927\u962a\u306e\u5439\u7530\u306b\u3042\u308b\u4e07\u535a\u516c\u5712\u306b\u305d\u3073\u3048\u7acb\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "The symbol of Expo \u201970 was the Tower of the Sun, created by Taro Okamoto, and it\u2019s still standing in the Expo Commemoration Park in Suita, Osaka, Japan."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Kanji:rice paddy} is used as a {tooltip:Kanji:substitute} for an {tooltip:Kanji:island}. Which island is it? That's right, {tooltip:Vocabulary:Tashirojima}. Imagine a rice paddy in the middle of the sea, standing in for {tooltip:Vocabulary:Tashiro Island}",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Tashirojima",
                "Word Type": "proper noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
