                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28614-subject-7537.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a place name and it uses the kun'yomi. You haven't learned this particular kun'yomi for {span:lang=ja:\u4ee3} yet, so here's a mnemonic to help you remember it:\n{splitParent}When you go to {tooltip:Vocabulary:Tashirojima}, make sure you visit the old woman. You know what woman I'm talking about, the one who starred on Murder {tooltip:Reading:she wro}te ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u308d}). She writes a lot about cats now, I guess.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u7530\u4ee3\u5cf6\u306e\u4eba\u53e3\u306f\u767e\u4eba\u4ee5\u4e0b\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "The population of Tashirojima is less than one hundred."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u7530\u4ee3\u5cf6\u306b\u306f\u30ac\u30bd\u30ea\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30c9\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002",
                    "en": "There are no gas stations on Tashirojima."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6700\u3082\u6709\u540d\u306a\u300c\u732b\u5cf6\u300d\u3068\u3044\u3048\u3070\u3001\u65e5\u672c\u306e\u5bae\u57ce\u770c\u306b\u3042\u308b\u7530\u4ee3\u5cf6\u3068\u3044\u3046\u5cf6\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "The most famous \"cat island\" is Tashiro Island in Japan's Miyagi prefecture."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:hot water} of {tooltip:Kanji:tea}. That is part of the ceremony that goes into the {tooltip:Vocabulary:tea ceremony}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Tea Ceremony",
                "Word Type": "noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3061\u3083\u306e\u3086"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3061\u3083\u306e\u3086",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "4451-subject-3389.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
