                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. This has the same reading as {span:lang=ja:\u4e0a\u308b} which you learned all that time ago in Level 1. If you can remember that, you can remember this one!\n"
