{
            "mnemonic": "I bet you remember {span:lang=ja:\u96c6\u3081\u308b} which means \"to collect.\" This is similar to that, except you're not doing the action of collecting, it's just happening. Instead of \"to collect\" it's {tooltip:Vocabulary:to come together}. You can remember this because a herd of {tooltip:Reading:Maru}s (the cat) will come together into one place if they sense a box there.",
