{
            "mnemonic": "You've seen how {span:lang=ja:\u843d\u3061\u308b} means \"to fall down.\" Now you're doing the action of \"falling something down,\" aka you're dropping it. You can remember this because you kind of {tooltip:Reading:toss} ({span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3059}) something and it drops to the ground, making this word mean {tooltip:Vocabulary:to drop something}.",
