                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: The {tooltip:Reading:ke}ttle is getting too hot so it catches on fire. You have to extinguish the flames before your house burns down too, just because of this stupid little kettle.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6d88\u3057\u305f\u3044\u904e\u53bb\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I have a past that I want to erase."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u9593\u9055\u3048\u3066\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u3092\u5168\u90e8\u6d88\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "I erased all the data by mistake."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6559\u5ba4\u3092\u51fa\u305f\u5f8c\u306f\u96fb\u6c17\u3092\u6d88\u3059\u306e\u3092\u5fd8\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3067\u4e0b\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "After you leave the classroom, please don\u2019t forget to turn off the light."
