{
            "mnemonic": "Do you remember the word {span:lang=ja:\u8ee2\u304c\u308b}? This is kind of similar, instead of rolling, this is more for when something falls and hits the ground. It means {tooltip:Vocabulary:to fall over} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:to fall down}. Just imagine someone falling off a chair face first into the dirt and making a {span:lang=ja:\u3076} sound.",
