        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This is a lot like {span:lang=ja:\u9cf4\u304f}, which means \"to chirp\" (or some other animal noise). This has to do with noises too, but not so much animal and more like bells (including telephones). This word means {tooltip:Vocabulary:to ring}. If it helps, think of the {span:lang=ja:\u308b} as a hint, kind of like the first sound of the word \"ring\" ({span:lang=ja:\u308b}). So, {span:lang=ja:\u308b} = \"ring\" and it's a verb, so {tooltip:Vocabulary:to ring}.",
