                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "40337-subject-3128.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}You need {tooltip:Vocabulary:to wait} for your {tooltip:Reading:ma}ma ({span:lang=ja:\u307e}) all the time. You want to go out? You have to wait for mama to drive you. Want to eat dinner? You have to wait for mama to make you food. Hmm. Maybe all this waiting is really a you problem.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u304d\u3063\u8336\u5e97\u3067\u3001\u4e94\u6642\u9593\u5f85\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u304c\u3001\u304b\u308c\u306f\u6765\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I was waiting for five hours at the cafe, but he didn\u2019t come."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b9\u30bf\u30d0\u3067\u5f85\u3063\u3066\u307e\u3059\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "I'll be waiting for you at Starbucks."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u5f85\u3063\u3066\uff01\u8ca1\u5e03\u3092\u5bb6\u306b\u5fd8\u308c\u305f\u304b\u3082\u3002",
                    "en": "Wait! I might have forgotten my wallet at home."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
