                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28495-subject-3393.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}What do you want {tooltip:Vocabulary:to wear} today? How about a dress made entirely of {tooltip:Reading:key}s ({span:lang=ja:\u304d})? Feel the metal on your skin and the weight on your shoulders. It's not a comfortable thing to put on. Maybe just stick with wearing a single key around your neck next time.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d1\u30cb\u30af\u3063\u3066\u3066\u3001T\u30b7\u30e3\u30c4\u3092\u304a\u3082\u3066\u3046\u3089\u306f\u3093\u305f\u3044\u306b\u7740\u3066\u305f\u308f\uff01",
                    "en": "I was so freaked out that I even wore my t-shirt inside out."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u6bce\u65e5\u30a8\u30d7\u30ed\u30f3\u3092\u7740\u3066\u51fa\u304d\u3093\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi is wearing an apron when he comes to office every day."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e00\u6628\u65e5\u306e\u5f7c\u6c0f\u306e\u8a95\u751f\u65e5\u4f1a\u306b\u306f\u3001\u9ed2\u306e\u819d\u4e08\u306e\u30c9\u30ec\u30b9\u3092\u7740\u3066\u3044\u3063\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "I wore a knee-length black dress at my boyfriend\u2019s birthday party the day before yesterday."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

