                        "file": "28693-subject-3326.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. When learning the kanji, you didn't learn that reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you with this word: You are going on your {tooltip:Vocabulary:trip} but you need to bring your little {tooltip:Reading:tabby} ({span:lang=ja:\u305f\u3073}) cat with you to keep you company. This cat keeps you calm and lets you leave your house, but the airlines won't let you take it on this trip. What to do?\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e16\u754c\u4e2d\u3092\u65c5\u3059\u308b\u306e\u304c\u3086\u3081\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "My dream is to travel around the world."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3055\u3044\u3075\u3068\u30d1\u30b9\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u3092\u306c\u3059\u307e\u308c\u308b\u306f\u3001\u3072\u884c\u304d\u306b\u4e57\u308a\u304a\u304f\u308c\u308b\u306f\u3001\u30de\u30b8\u3067\u6700\u60aa\u306e\u65c5\u3060\u3063\u305f\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "My wallet and passport were stolen and I missed the plane. It was the worst trip ever."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u79c1\u306f\u3082\u3046\u3059\u3063\u304b\u308a\u65c5\u652f\u5ea6\u304c\u3067\u304d\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019m already prepared for our trip."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

