                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u306a\u3055\u3051",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Perhaps Jourm can't read. Or perhaps he doesn't want to see you again because of something you did. Whatever the story, make sure it makes you feel a little blue too.",
                "mnemonic": "Why is your soul {tooltip:Kanji:feeling} blue? Because {tooltip:Reading:Jou}rm ({span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3087\u3046}) the big man farmhand did something mean to you. Imagine a story playing out, and then imagine your soul turning blue with emotion."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Down a {tooltip:Radical:slide}, a {tooltip:Radical:drunkard} comes and places a {tooltip:Radical:creeper} into your {tooltip:Radical:heart}. Your entire body is filled with a {tooltip:Kanji:feeling}. A feeling you don't like.",
            "hints": "This awful sliding drunkard filled your heart with his creeper vibes (and an actual creeper) and now you're feeling a lot of things. Probably bad things.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Feeling"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
