                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3042\u3064",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "These nets aren't making the fever heat go away, but they have made the spinning stop at least.",
                "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:heat} from your {tooltip:Kanji:fever} is making your insides and your head and your entire body spin and boil, until your doctor throws some {tooltip:Reading:nets} ({span:lang=ja:\u306d\u3064}) around you. You were flailing around and they couldn't get you to stop, so they had to catch you in a series of nets."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A cult {tooltip:Radical:leader} has a great {tooltip:Radical:idea} to recruit a {tooltip:Kanji:hundred million} new members. Since he\u2019s the guy with all the ideas, he is the leader of the cult. His idea is to give every new member a free puppy. He\u2019ll have a hundred million new recruits in no time.",
            "hints": "Imagine a hundred million free puppies. That\u2019s a lot. Imagine playing with all of them. You\u2019d be pretty happy. Unless you hate puppies. Then you\u2019d be pretty unhappy, I imagine.",
            "meanings": {
