{
            "mnemonic": "When a {tooltip:Radical:spirit} decides to live in your {tooltip:Radical:scarecrow}, you'll be granted good {tooltip:Kanji:luck} and good {tooltip:Kanji:fortune}. Crows won't hang out in your farm. Everything you grow will become large and delicious. But not everyone is so lucky that a spirit will decide to live in their scarecrow. So maybe the luck was in you all along!",
            "hints": "Nope, the luck is definitely coming from the spirit in your scarecrow. You aren't lucky on your own.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Luck",
                "Alternative": "Fortune"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
