{
            "mnemonic": "You can {tooltip:Radical:see} {tooltip:Radical:gold} if you {tooltip:Radical:stand} in front of a {tooltip:Kanji:mirror}. Yes, you are made of gold. You\u2019re so great and valuable, standing in front of that mirror. It\u2019s not hard to see, especially in a mirror \u2013 you\u2019re golden.",
