                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture the sheep samurai. Maybe draw him on a piece of paper. He's a sheep wearing wool armor, and he has ram horns on the hilt of his katana.",
                "mnemonic": "The most famous {tooltip:Kanji:samurai} in Japanese history was the illustrious {tooltip:Reading:shee}p ({span:lang=ja:\u3057}) samurai. He wasn't JUST a sheep who learned the ways of the sword, he would use the wool from the sheep enemies he killed to create his armor!"
            }
