{
            "mnemonic": "I always {tooltip:Radical:say} the {tooltip:Radical:fruit} {tooltip:Kanji:section} at the grocery should be at the front of the store. It\u2019s the perfect place for the fruit section, I say.",
            "hints": "Think about it. Every grocery store has the fruit section right at the front, wouldn\u2019t you say?",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Section"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
