            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u9280\u884c\u306b\u304a\u91d1\u3092\u4e0b\u308d\u3057\u306b\u884c\u304b\u306a\u3044\u3068\u3044\u3051\u306a\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I have to go to the bank to withdraw some cash."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e00\u5186\u3092\u7b11\u3046\u8005\u306f\u4e00\u5186\u306b\u6ce3\u304f\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u308f\u3056\u304c\u3042\u308b\u306e\u3067\u3001\u9280\u884c\u306b\u4e00\u5186\u3092\u3042\u305a\u3051\u306b\u884c\u304f\u3053\u3068\u306b\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "There is a proverb that says someone who laughs over one yen will eventually cry over one yen, so I decided to go to the bank to put one yen in my account."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u9280\u884c\u3092\u5f37\u76d7\u3057\u305f\u4eba\u306f\u7262\u5c4b\u884c\u304d\u306a\u306e\u306b\u3001\u9280\u884c\u304c\u4eba\u3005\u304b\u3089\u304a\u91d1\u3092\u596a\u3063\u305f\u3089\u3001\u30dc\u30fc\u30ca\u30b9\u304c\u3082\u3089\u3048\u308b\u3093\u3060\u3088\u3002\u305d\u308c\u3063\u3066\u3059\u3054\u304f\u4e0d\u516c\u5e73\u3058\u3083\u306a\u3044\uff1f",
                    "en": "When people rob banks they go to prison. When banks rob people they get bonuses. It\u2019s so unfair, isn\u2019t it?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This is a time based word (because of the {span:lang=ja:\u306b}). What is the {tooltip:Kanji:first} point of time when you are beginning something? That is the {tooltip:Vocabulary:beginning}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Beginning",
                "Alternatives": "In The Beginning, First Of All, To Begin With",
                "Word Type": "expression"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
