                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28784-subject-3597.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: You're thrown into something {tooltip:Vocabulary:dark} and small. A lid is closed on top of you, and you are confused. What have you been thrown in? You find out you've been thrown in a {tooltip:Reading:cooler} ({span:lang=ja:\u304f\u3089}). Feel afraid like you would be if you were thrown in such a dark cooler like this. Is it cold?\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3082\u3046\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068iPhone\u306e\u753b\u9762\u3092\u6697\u304f\u3057\u3066\u304f\u308c\u307e\u305b\u3093\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "Can you make your iPhone screen a bit darker, please?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u7530\u4e2d\u3055\u3093\u306f\u6697\u3084\u307f\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3075\u3057\u3087\u3046\u306a\u306e\u3067\u3001\u90e8\u5c4b\u304c\u6697\u3044\u3068\u306d\u3080\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3063\u3066\u3002",
                    "en": "I heard that Mr. Tanaka has nyctophobia, so he can't sleep in a dark room."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6700\u8fd1\u3001\u6697\u3044\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u30b9\u3070\u3063\u304b\u308a\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u3053\u3093\u306a\u6697\u3044\u4e16\u306e\u4e2d\u3067\u3082\u6ec5\u8336\u82e6\u8336\u826f\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3060\u3063\u3066\u3042\u308b\u3093\u3060\u3088\u3002\u3048\u3063\u3068\u3001\u305d\u308c\u3067\u2026\u3046\u30fc\u3093\u3002\u4f55\u3092\u8a00\u3044\u304b\u3051\u305f\u306e\u304b\u5fd8\u308c\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u3068\u306b\u304b\u304f\u3001\u50d5\u3068\u7d50\u5a5a\u3057\u3066\u304f\u308c\u307e\u305b\u3093\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Everything in the news has been depressing lately, but there is a great big silver lining to this dark cloud, you know. And... well... I kind of lost my train of thought, but, anyway, will you marry me?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
