{
            "mnemonic": "You know that {tooltip:Kanji:previous} part of your {tooltip:Kanji:finger}? The part I just chopped off? Well that was your {tooltip:Vocabulary:fingertip}! I only had time to get the tip. It used to be on your finger and now it's right here, in my hand. Sorry, I guess. Oh, but don't worry, I'll even things out and get the tip of your toe real quick too.",
