                    "en": "Mr. Koichi from Tofugu, party of nine. Your table is ready."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You know that {span:lang=ja:\u521d} means \"first\" This word means {tooltip:Vocabulary:for the first time}. Think of {span:lang=ja:\u3081\u3066} as \"meet.\" Then think \"when we met {tooltip:Vocabulary:for the first time} ____ happened.\"",
