                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This word uses the kun'yomi, which you didn't learn with the kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you out. What are you beginning? You are beginning {tooltip:Reading:Haj} ({span:lang=ja:\u306f\u3058}). (Haj is the fifth pillar of Islam, and is a pilgrimage to Mecca during the month of Dhu al-Hijja).\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u521d\u3081\u3066\u30aa\u30d0\u30de\u5927\u3068\u3046\u308a\u3087\u3046\u3068\u4f1a\u3063\u305f\u3057\u3085\u3093\u304b\u3093\u304b\u3089\u610f\u6c17\u6295\u5408\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Since the first time we met, President Obama and I have gotten along very well."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u521d\u3081\u3066\u306e\u9280\u884c\u696d\u3080\u306b\u56db\u82e6\u516b\u82e6\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "This is my first time dealing with banking and I'm really struggling."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u3082\u3057\u304b\u3057\u3066\u3001\u65e5\u672c\u306f\u3053\u308c\u304c\u521d\u3081\u3066\uff1f\u300d\u300c\u306f\u3044\u3002\u305d\u3046\u306a\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002\u300d\u300c\u305d\u3046\u306a\u3093\u3060\u3002\u65e5\u672c\u306f\u3069\u3046\uff1f\u300d\u300c\u304b\u306a\u308a\u6c17\u306b\u5165\u3063\u3066\u308b\u308f\u3002\u300d",
                    "en": "\"Is it possible this is your first time in Japan?\" \"Yes, it is.\" \"Oh really? How do you like it?\u201d \"I really like it!\""
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
