                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28954-subject-3644.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is like two separate words put together into one, so you can imagine it's the kun'yomi readings. You learned the right reading for {span:lang=ja:\u99c5} in the kanji, and you should know the vocab word {span:lang=ja:\u524d} by now. Combine the two together and you have yourself {tooltip:Vocabulary:front of station}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u99c5\u524d\u306e\u30de\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3092\u3055\u304c\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I'm looking for an apartment in front of the station."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u305b\u3093\u304d\u3087\u306e\u671f\u9593\u306f\u591a\u304f\u306e\u305b\u3044\u3058\u5bb6\u304c\u99c5\u524d\u3067\u30b9\u30d4\u30fc\u30c1\u3092\u3059\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "During the election period, lots of politicians make speeches in front of stations."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u306a\u3093\u3067\u79c1\u306b\u3001\u99c5\u524d\u3067\u64ae\u3063\u305f\u3053\u3093\u306a\u5909\u306a\u81ea\u64ae\u308a\u5199\u30e1\u3092\u9001\u3063\u3066\u304d\u305f\u306e\uff1f",
                    "en": "Why did you just send that weird looking selfie taken in front of the station to me?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:luck} {tooltip:Kanji:island} wasn't actually too lucky. This is {tooltip:Vocabulary:Fukushima} where the nuclear meltdown happened after the 2011 earthquake. So, when you think of \"luck island\" this is where you should think.",
