{
            "mnemonic": "This is for when a thing is {tooltip:Kanji:hot}, making this word {tooltip:Vocabulary:hot thing}. When the weather is hot that's {span:lang=ja:\u6691\u3044}. This is when you touch something and you burn yourself.",
