{
            "mnemonic": "When you take your {tooltip:Kanji:feeling}s and {tooltip:Kanji:concept}ualize them, you come up with your impressions and thoughts on the subject. That's why this word is {tooltip:Vocabulary:thoughts} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:impressions}.",
