                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings are kun'yomi readings for both, probably because this is two words put together into one. You know the reading of {span:lang=ja:\u98a8} from previous levels, hopefully. Now all you need to do is apply your knowledge of the word {span:lang=ja:\u795e} to be able to read the rest.\n"
