{
            "mnemonic": "In the {tooltip:Kanji:dark} if you try to {tooltip:Kanji:write down} something it won't work very well. You can't see. So, how can you \"write something down\" in the dark? You write it down in your mind. This is {tooltip:Vocabulary:memorization}! Recognize this word? The SRS application \"Anki\" comes from this word, I'm guessing!",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Memorization",
