{
            "mnemonic": "This is a fun one. {tooltip:Kanji:Water} {tooltip:Kanji:silver} is {tooltip:Vocabulary:mercury}, which makes a lot of sense. Mercury is liquidy like water, but it is all silver like silver. So silver water isn't some new mineral water you can get for $4 at the store, it's {tooltip:Vocabulary:mercury}! Or {tooltip:Vocabulary:quicksilver}, if you prefer.",
