{
            "mnemonic": "Remember how {span:lang=ja:\u697d} was used in {span:lang=ja:\u97f3\u697d} and meant \"music\"? Well this is that {span:lang=ja:\u697d} again. A {tooltip:Kanji:music} {tooltip:Kanji:container} is something that can produce music. It is a {tooltip:Vocabulary:musical instrument}.",
