                        "pronunciation": "\u304c\u3063\u304d",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28773-subject-3534.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. \n{splitParent}You have already learned the reading for {span:lang=ja:\u5668} but {span:lang=ja:\u697d} uses the secondary reading so you may not have learned it.  However, you learned this reading in the word {span:lang=ja:\u97f3\u697d}. Just bear in mind that the {span:lang=ja:\u304c\u304f} shortens to {span:lang=ja:\u304c\u3063}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u697d\u5668\u306b\u3082\u8272\u3005\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u3069\u3093\u306a\u697d\u5668\u304c\u597d\u304d\u3067\u3059\u304b\u3002\u79c1\u306f\u6253\u697d\u5668\u304c\u597d\u304d\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "There are various different types of musical instruments. Which type do you like? I like percussion."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u307e\u305a\u306f\u697d\u5668\u3092\u697d\u3075\u901a\u308a\u306b\u3048\u3093\u305d\u3046\u3057\u3066\u307f\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please start by trying to play your instrument note for note."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306eCD\u3092\u6301\u3063\u3066\u304f\u308b\u306e\u3092\u5fd8\u308c\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u308f\u3002\u300d\u300c\u5225\u306b\u3044\u3044\u3088\u3001\u307e\u305f\u306e\u6a5f\u4f1a\u3067\u3002\u3067\u3082\u3001\u305d\u306e\u4ee3\u308f\u308a\u306bBGM\u3068\u3057\u3066\u4f55\u304b\u697d\u5668\u3092\u5f3e\u3044\u3066\u304f\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3002\u300d",
                    "en": "\"I forgot to bring your CD.\" \"That\u2019s okay. I can get it another time, but can you play an instrument for background music instead?\""
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

