            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u3059\u3054\u3044\uff01\u3042\u306e\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u3067\u767e\u70b9\u3068\u3063\u305f\u306e\uff1f\u300d\u300c\u5f53\u7136\u3055\u3002\u300d",
                    "en": "\"Wow! You scored a one hundred on that test?\" \"Naturally.\""
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u304b\u3093\u5b57\u304c\u4e0a\u624b\u304f\u306a\u308a\u305f\u3051\u308c\u3070\u6bce\u65e5\u5c11\u3057\u305a\u3064\u7df4\u7fd2\u3059\u308b\u306e\u306f\u5f53\u7136\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\uff01",
                    "en": "It's only natural that you must practice kanji little by little every day in order to become good at it."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u3093\u306a\u7d20\u6575\u306a\u5965\u3055\u3093\u304c\u3044\u308b\u306a\u3093\u3066\u3001\u304a\u524d\u306f\u672c\u5f53\u306b\u904b\u304c\u3044\u3044\u3088\u306a\u3002\u5f53\u7136\u306e\u3053\u3068\u3060\u306a\u3093\u3066\u601d\u3046\u306a\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "You are very lucky to have such a lovely wife. Don\u2019t take her for granted."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Kanji:Self} {tooltip:Kanji:nature} is nature itself. That is {tooltip:Vocabulary:nature}, like all those green things and {span:lang=ja:\u9752\u8449} outside. Many apologies if someone hundreds of years from now is reading this. It used to be pretty green outside before the robots.",
