{
            "mnemonic": "When you {tooltip:Kanji:arrange} things in the way that {tooltip:Kanji:nature} intended, you're doing things in a quite {tooltip:Vocabulary:orderly} fashion. This is the natural state of things, nice and arranged and natural. Orderly!",
