{
            "mnemonic": "Remember how {span:lang=ja:\u6559\u80b2} means \"education?\" Well, the {span:lang=ja:\u80b2} here is referring to the education word, but this time it's a {tooltip:Kanji:body} education. What do you call the body education at school? {tooltip:Vocabulary:Physical education} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:PE}.",
