                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. You know these readings, but there's usually an extra {span:lang=ja:\u3044} in the middle. Don't worry, {span:lang=ja:\u3057\u304b} is totally fine too, but {span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3044\u304b} is more common. You got this!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6bce\u65e5\u8a69\u6b4c\u3092\u697d\u3057\u3093\u3067\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I enjoy poetry every day."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d5\u30b0\u306b\u306f\u3059\u3070\u3089\u3057\u3044\u8a69\u6b4c\u3092\u4f5c\u308b\u304b\u304f\u308c\u305f\u624d\u306e\u3046\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Fugu's secret skill is composing marvelous poetry."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u8a69\u6b4c\u3068\u306f\u65e5\u672c\u306e\u8a69\u306e\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u4e00\u822c\u7684\u306b\u306f\u6f22\u8a69\u3084\u548c\u6b4c\u3001\u4ff3\u53e5\u306e\u3053\u3068\u3092\u6307\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Shiika means Japanese poetry and that generally includes kanshi, waka, or haiku."
