{
            "mnemonic": "This word uses {span:lang=ja:\u9577} in the same way as {span:lang=ja:\u793e\u9577}, where it means something like \"boss\" or \"manager.\" So, this {span:lang=ja:\u9577} is the boss of the {tooltip:Kanji:station}, right? What do you call someone like that? You call them the {tooltip:Vocabulary:stationmaster} (that is, unless you want to be thrown to the trains).",
