{
            "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Kanji:eat}ing {tooltip:Kanji:container}s refer to {tooltip:Vocabulary:tableware}, including {tooltip:Vocabulary:eating utensils}, such as knives, forks, spoons, and chopsticks, as well as {tooltip:Vocabulary:serving utensils}, like plates, bowls, and saucers. Basically, it's stuff you use to eat your food.",
