                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e94\u611f\u306e\u3046\u3061\u3069\u308c\u304b\u4e00\u3064\u3092\u5931\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u3068\u3057\u305f\u3089\u3001\u3069\u308c\u3092\u9078\u3073\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f\u307e\u305f\u3001\u305d\u306e\u7406\u7531\u3082\u6559\u3048\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "If you had to lose one of your five senses, which one would you give up and why?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3055\u304f\u591c\u306e\u3086\u3081\u3067\u3001\u4eca\u307e\u3067\u306b\u304b\u3044\u3060\u3053\u3068\u306e\u306a\u3044\u306b\u304a\u3044\u3092\u611f\u3058\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u4e94\u611f\u3063\u3066\u306d\u3066\u3044\u308b\u9593\u3082\u50cd\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3093\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "In my dream last night, there was a smell I didn't notice before... do all five senses work in dreams?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e94\u611f\u306b\u95a2\u3059\u308b\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u306e\u5358\u8a9e\u3068\u52d5\u8a5e\u306e\u4ed6\u306b\u3001\u7b2c\u516d\u611f\u306b\u95a2\u3059\u308b\u8a9e\u5f59\u3082\u5b66\u7fd2\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please study Japanese words and verbs related to the five senses, as well as some Japanese vocabulary related to the sixth sense."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:concept} you {tooltip:Kanji:think} about is your {tooltip:Vocabulary:thought}s. It is your {tooltip:Vocabulary:idea}s.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Thought",
                "Alternative": "Idea",
                "Word Type": "noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
