                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28769-subject-3545.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. You haven't learned the on'yomi for {span:lang=ja:\u601d} yet, so here's a mnemonic to help you:\n{splitParent}All your {tooltip:Vocabulary:thought}s and {tooltip:Vocabulary:idea}s are about {tooltip:Reading:shee}p ({span:lang=ja:\u3057}) right now. You just can't stop thinking about sheep. Are you thinking about sheep right now? What kind of sheep are they?\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306e\u601d\u60f3\u306b\u306f\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3044\u3051\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002",
                    "en": "I can't follow Koichi's thoughts."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u304d\u306e\u3046\u3001\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u30b9\u3092\u898b\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3089\u3001\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u304c\u601d\u60f3\u72af\u3068\u3057\u3066\u305f\u3044\u307b\u3055\u308c\u305f\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u30b9\u304c\u51fa\u3066\u672c\u5f53\u306b\u3073\u3063\u304f\u308a\u3057\u305f\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "When I was watching the news yesterday, I was so shocked that it said Viet was arrested for thoughtcrimes."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u306e\u5275\u59cb\u8005\u3067\u3042\u308a\u3001\u8fd1\u4ee3\u65e5\u672c\u3092\u4ee3\u8868\u3059\u308b\u5553\u8499\u601d\u60f3\u5bb6\u3067\u3042\u308b\u3002",
