                        "file": "28953-subject-3577.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings are the ones you learned with the kanji, but you can also just notice that this word includes {span:lang=ja:\u8ffd\u3046} and {span:lang=ja:\u4ed8\u304f} combined.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u524d\u65e5\u306b\u30b7\u30a2\u30c8\u30eb\u307e\u3067\u3068\u6b69\u3067\u51fa\u767a\u3057\u305f\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306b\u8eca\u3067\u4e94\u5206\u3082\u304b\u304b\u3089\u305a\u8ffd\u3044\u4ed8\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "We took a car and less than five minutes later we overtook Koichi who had departed for Seattle on foot on the previous day."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "100\u30e1\u30fc\u30c8\u30eb\u8d70\u3067\u30af\u30ea\u30b9\u30c6\u30f3\u306b\u8ffd\u3044\u4ed8\u304f\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u305f\u3089\u30aa\u30ea\u30f3\u30d4\u30c3\u30af\u306b\u51fa\u3089\u308c\u308b\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "If you can catch up with Kristen in the hundred meter dash, you can compete in the Olympics."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "Tofugu\u306e\u5857\u308a\u7d75\u306f\u4eba\u6c17\u3059\u304e\u3066\u3001\u751f\u7523\u304c\u9700\u8981\u306b\u8ffd\u3044\u4ed8\u304b\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Tofugu\u2019s coloring book was so popular that production couldn\u2019t keep up with demand."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
