                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28818-subject-3586.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Guess what? Even though this would use the vocab kun'yomi reading, usually, the readings for both on'yomi and kun'yomi on this kanji are the same, meaning you can read this word no matter what. Feeling better now?\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u898b\u308b\u306e\u3067\u306f\u306a\u304f\u3001\u5fc3\u3067\u611f\u3058\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Don't look at it, feel it with your heart."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30ef\u30cb\u30ab\u30cb\u306e\u53f0\u982d\u306b\u3088\u308a\u3001\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u306f\u4f1a\u793e\u306b\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u3044\u5834\u6240\u304c\u306a\u304f\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3068\u611f\u3058\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "Due to the rising power of WaniKani, Tofugu feels that it's been losing its place within the company."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6700\u8fd1\u5144\u306b\u51b7\u305f\u304f\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3068\u611f\u3058\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I feel like my older brother has been giving me the cold shoulder recently."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This is the verb version of the vocab word {tooltip:Vocabulary:\u6226\u3044}, which I'm hoping you learned earlier. The verb version of course means {tooltip:Vocabulary:to fight} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:to battle}.",
