                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading comes from {span:lang=ja:\u6226\u3044} a word you've hopefully seen by now. Associate these words together in your mind and you'll be able to read them so long as you know the other one.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u7b2c\u4e8c\u6b21\u4e16\u754c\u5927\u6226\u3067\u65e5\u672c\u3068\u30a2\u30e1\u30ea\u30ab\u306f\u6226\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Japan and America fought in WWII."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u308f\u305f\u3057\u305f\u3061\u306f\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u304c\u3046\u307e\u304f\u306a\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306b\u3001\u6bce\u65e5\u3053\u306e\u304b\u3093\u5b57\u3068\u3044\u3046\u304d\u3087\u5927\u306a\u5316\u3051\u7269\u3068\u6226\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "We battle against this gigantic monster called kanji every day so we can get good at Japanese."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5263\u9053\u306f\u901a\u5e38\u3001\u4e00\u5bfe\u4e00\u3067\u6226\u3046\u6b66\u9053\u3060\u304c\u3001\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u4e94\u5e74\u524d\u3001\u4e8c\u4eba\u306e\u7537\u3092\u540c\u6642\u306b\u76f8\u624b\u306b\u3057\u306a\u304f\u3066\u306f\u3044\u3051\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Kendo is normally a one-on-one martial art, but 5 years ago Koichi had to fight against two guys at the same time."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:foster} so the verb vocab version is {tooltip:Vocabulary:to foster}.",
