                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "43688-subject-8943.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word has okurigana (hiragana attached to the kanji) you know that it's probably going to be the kun'yomi reading. Here's a little mnemonic to help ya remember:\n{splitParent}You open up your acceptance letter and shout \"OOOO!!!\" ({span:lang=ja:\u3046}). You passed!\n\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3084\u3063\u305f\uff01\u30b7\u30a2\u30c8\u30eb\u5e02\u306e\u5927\u5b66\u306b\u53d7\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3088\uff01",
                    "en": "Yay! I got accepted into a university in Seattle!"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6b21\u56de\u53d7\u304b\u3089\u306a\u3051\u308c\u3070\u3001\u533b\u8005\u306b\u306a\u308c\u308b\u30c1\u30e3\u30f3\u30b9\u306f\u5c11\u306a\u304f\u306a\u308b\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "If you don't pass next time, you'll have fewer chances of becoming a doctor."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u8a66\u9a13\u306b\u53d7\u304b\u308b\u307e\u3067\u9031\u672b\u306f\u51fa\u304b\u3051\u306a\u3044\u3063\u3066\u6c7a\u5fc3\u3057\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "I made a resolution that I won't go out on weekends until I pass my exams."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You know that the kanji {span:lang=ja:\u6e29} means {tooltip:Kanji:warm}, and this verb is related. It means {tooltip:Vocabulary:to heat up} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:to warm something up}. It's all about you doing something to another object to make it hot, like putting it in the microwave. ",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "To Heat Up",
                "Alternative": "To Warm Something Up",
                "Word Type": "transitive verb, ichidan verb"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3042\u305f\u305f\u3081\u308b"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
