{
            "mnemonic": "This is a weird word, sorry ahead of time. You have the {tooltip:Kanji:formal name title} plus another {tooltip:Kanji:formal name title} (thanks to the {span:lang=ja:\u3005}). When you have several different kinds of formal name titles you have all kinds of fancy people that you're talking to. Each one of them is different. There are {tooltip:Vocabulary:many} {tooltip:Vocabulary:various} people!",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Various",
                "Alternative": "Many",
                "Word Type": "noun, \u306a adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3055\u307e\u3056\u307e"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3055\u307e\u3056\u307e",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "5217-subject-3601.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3055\u307e\u3056\u307e",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28936-subject-3601.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is just the reading you learned with the kanji. The second one is {span:lang=ja:\u3056\u307e} however, which plays right into the \"various\" meaning of the word. There's even various ways to read {span:lang=ja:\u3055\u307e} in this word!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306e\u5927\u5b66\u306f\u5927\u304d\u304f\u3066\u6709\u540d\u306a\u306e\u3067\u3001\u69d8\u3005\u306a\u56fd\u304b\u3089\u308a\u3085\u3046\u5b66\u751f\u304c\u96c6\u307e\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "My university is big and famous, so foreign exchange students come here from many different countries."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u306e\u767a\u8a00\u306b\u5bfe\u3057\u3066\u306f\u69d8\u3005\u306a\u53d7\u3051\u3068\u308a\u65b9\u304c\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I think there are various ways to interpret that remark."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u306e\u793e\u54e1\u306f\u3001\u3069\u3053\u306e\u51fa\u8eab\u304b\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u3001\u808c\u306e\u8272\u3082\u4f53\u578b\u3082\u5927\u304d\u3055\u3082\u69d8\u3005\u3067\u3001\u307f\u3093\u306a\u305d\u308c\u305e\u308c\u30e6\u30cb\u30fc\u30af\u306a\u500b\u6027\u3092\u3082\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Tofugu workers vary in size, shape, and color, depending on where they come from. They all have unique characteristics."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

