{
            "mnemonic": "Next to the {tooltip:Radical:cross} we combine our {tooltip:Radical:power} {tooltip:Radical:power} {tooltip:Radical:power} so that we have {tooltip:Kanji:cooperation}. And with our powers combined, we become stronger than we ever could have been apart, lifting the cross above our heads!",
            "hints": "The power of cooperation is a *ahem* powerful thing.",
