{
            "mnemonic": "If your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} are strong enough you can take an {tooltip:Radical:axe} and {tooltip:Kanji:fold} it in half. Bad men were cutting down all the forests, so you're going around {tooltip:Kanji:bend}ing their axes so they can't cut trees down anymore.",
