                "hints": "The next time you get one of those surveys where you have to choose your gender just think back to that time your life when the Shougun came and officiated your gender with his saber. Ahh, what lovely memories.",
                "mnemonic": "Once you've decided what your {tooltip:Kanji:gender} is, the {tooltip:Reading:Shou}gun ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3087\u3046}) comes to your house, lays his {tooltip:Reading:sa}ber ({span:lang=ja:\u305b\u3044}) on your shoulders, and then it's official! It's in all the newspapers, there's a parade, and everyone is patting you on the back because you did it!"
