{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:woman} with {tooltip:Radical:cleat}s is walking on someone's back, but she doesn't want to hurt him. She has to be very {tooltip:Kanji:gentle}. Cleats are sharp and pointy, and not designed for back walking, so she's being extra, special gentle right now.",
            "hints": "Picture a woman walking gently over someone's back. She's hardly moving.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Gentle"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
