{
            "mnemonic": "Causing {tooltip:Radical:death} at every turn, the {tooltip:Radical:moon} {tooltip:Radical:king} sits inside his moon, getting ready to cause death on anything in his sights. Sounds a lot like the Death Star from a certain movie. One of which is \"Star Wars: A New {tooltip:Kanji:Hope}.\"",
            "hints": "Now picture the death moon king as the Emperor, sitting in his Death Star. There is no hope, except for that little opening you can shoot through to destroy the whole thing. That's hope, I guess!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Hope"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
