                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u306e\u305e",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "In the end, the real hope was bowling all along. I hope you've learned a valuable lesson from this space movie.",
                "mnemonic": "The name A New {tooltip:Kanji:Hope}, as we all know, comes from the ending where the moon king's son sends a {tooltip:Reading:bow}ling ({span:lang=ja:\u307c\u3046}) ball into that little opening and knocks it out of the sky."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tree} to a {tooltip:Radical:genius} immediately becomes {tooltip:Kanji:lumber}. They can look at the tree and see more: the ability to turn it into lumber into {tooltip:Kanji:material} and use it for a million different things.",
            "hints": "Picture the genius staring at a large tree. Math symbols and equations fly around in their head, until finally a little lightbulb and a pile of lumber appear above their head.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Lumber",
                "Alternatives": "Material, Timber"
