                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Watch as the tree becomes lumber and that lumber is used to craft a ginormous xylophone. Each key is its own plank of lumber!",
                "mnemonic": "This genius doesn't want to use the {tooltip:Kanji:lumber} to build a house or a chair, no no, they're going to use these {tooltip:Kanji:material}s to build a {tooltip:Reading:xy}lophone ({span:lang=ja:\u3056\u3044})! The most difficult instrument to create!!"
            }
