                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Would you want to participate in Christmas if it meant looking like Santa and visiting every single house on earth?",
                "mnemonic": "You know who has big hair and loves to {tooltip:Kanji:participate} in everything? {tooltip:Reading:San}ta-san ({span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3093})! Well, his hair is more big on the bottom (it's a beard) than whatever you have on your head, but hair is hair. And he participates in present giving in every house in the world! See? Big hair = participation!"
