                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Genghis Khan was a perfectionist, and by conquering and bringing all of these different people together, he was able to create something perfect by all standards.",
                "mnemonic": "This {tooltip:Kanji:perfect} roof was commissioned by Genghis {tooltip:Reading:Khan} ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u3093}). We got all of the carpenters and home makers and construction workers he'd conquered together and tasked them with making the first roof, but only if they made it absolutely perfect."
