{
            "mnemonic": "You've probably seen the words {span:lang=ja:\u77e5\u308b} and {span:lang=ja:\u5408\u3046} by now. This is someone you \"know\" because you have \"come together\" before, but that's pretty much it. You don't really know them well, you just met them a couple times so you know who they are. This person is an {tooltip:Vocabulary:acquaintance}.",
