                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings are that of {span:lang=ja:\u77e5\u308b} and {span:lang=ja:\u5408\u3046}. So long as you know those words, you should be able to read this one too.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u77e5\u308a\u5408\u3044\u306b\u305f\u306e\u3093\u3067\u3001\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u306e\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u304b\u3089\u30b5\u30a4\u30f3\u3092\u3082\u3089\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I asked an acquaintance if they could get me Koichi\u2019s autograph from Tofugu."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u77e5\u308a\u5408\u3044\u306b\u308c\u3093\u3042\u3044\u76f8\u3060\u3093\u3057\u3066\u308b\u304b\u3089\u3001\u30ab\u30e9\u30aa\u30b1\u306b\u306f\u884c\u3051\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3082\u3002\u3054\u3081\u3093\u306d\uff01",
                    "en": "I\u2019m consulting my acquaintance about my relationship with my boyfriend right now, so I probably won\u2019t be able to join the karaoke party. Sorry!"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u3053\u3060\u3051\u306e\u8a71\u306a\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u4e0a\u53f8\u304c\u77e5\u308a\u5408\u3044\u306e\u4eba\u59bb\u3068\u6d6e\u6c17\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u306e\u3088\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "Don\u2019t tell a soul but my boss is having an affair with a married woman who is an acquaintance of mine."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This is a strange word, I'm afraid. You'll have to bear with it. This, when added onto a word, is like adding an \"-al\" to a word (or a -like to a word). For example, add it onto {span:lang=ja:\u65e5\u672c} (Japan) and you have \"Japanese-like,\" which comes out to \"Very Japanese.\" It's a weird sort of modifying word that really depends on each situation it's in, though {tooltip:Reading:-al} and {tooltip:Reading:-like} often do a decent job. For now, just know this word means these things. We'll start applying it to various words in the future, slowly but surely.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Al",
                "Alternatives": "Like, Typical",
                "Word Type": "suffix, \u306a adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3066\u304d"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3066\u304d",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "5310-subject-3711.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3066\u304d",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28973-subject-3711.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is the same as the one you learned with the kanji, probably because this is usually added onto other words, making it behave like a jukugo.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u81ea\u5206\u7684\u306b\u306f\u4e0a\u624b\u306b\u30a2\u30e1\u30ea\u30ab\u7684\u306a\u30b9\u30d4\u30fc\u30c1\u304c\u3067\u304d\u305f\u3068\u601d\u3063\u3066\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u306a\u3002",
                    "en": "I personally thought I was able to give an American-style speech pretty well."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306e\u795e\u3074\u7684\u306a\u3048\u307f\u304c\u3001\u3053\u4eba\u7684\u306b\u3081\u3063\u3061\u3083\u30c4\u30dc\u306a\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "I just personally love Koichi's mysterious smile."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "Tofugu\u7684\u79d8\u5bc6\u8a08\u753b\u3063\u3066\u4e00\u4f53\u4f55\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f\u3082\u3046\u5c11\u3057\u5177\u4f53\u7684\u306b\u304a\u3063\u3057\u3083\u3063\u3066\u9802\u3051\u307e\u305b\u3093\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "What do you mean by a Tofugu-like secret plan? Do you think you could be more specific?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

