{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:acting} {tooltip:Kanji:art}s are the greatest arts of all. Back in the day they were the only arts, which is why the art of acting is just {tooltip:Vocabulary:art} itself. In fact, it's {tooltip:Vocabulary:THE arts}.",
