                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. When learning the kanji, you didn't learn that reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you with this word: You are counting your {tooltip:Vocabulary:bundle}s. There are a lot of them, so you have to create {tooltip:Reading:tab}s ({span:lang=ja:\u305f\u3070}) in your notebook to properly categorize everything. Imagine yourself doing this (physically creating the tabs in your notebook, even though your notebook didn't come with tabs).\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u672d\u675f\u306b\u3046\u3082\u308c\u308b\u307b\u3069\u91d1\u3092\u6301\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi has so much money that he can swim in it."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u8a18\u304a\u304f\u304c\u6b63\u3057\u3051\u308c\u3070\u3001\u305f\u3057\u304b\u30d6\u30ed\u30c3\u30b3\u30ea\u30fc\u306f\u675f\u3067\u58f2\u3063\u3066\u305f\u3068\u601d\u3046\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "If I remember correctly, I think they sell broccoli in bunches."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u3082\u30b3\u30d4\u30fc\u7528\u7d19\u304c\u3044\u308b\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u3053\u306e\u82b1\u675f\u3068\u305d\u306e\u30b3\u30d4\u30fc\u7528\u7d19\u4e00\u675f\u3092\u4ea4\u63db\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3048\u306a\u3044\u304b\u306a\uff1f",
                    "en": "I have to get some copy paper. Could you exchange a bundle of copy paper for this bouquet of flowers?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
