                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You already learned this reading when you learned {span:lang=ja:\u6df1\u3044} so you should be able to read this one too!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u30d7\u30fc\u30eb\u306e\u6df1\u3055\u3092\u6559\u3048\u3066\u4e0b\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Could you tell me the depth of this pool?"
                },
