{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:hope} you {tooltip:Kanji:request} is your {tooltip:Vocabulary:desire}. Just imagine yourself hoping and requesting some higher power for something you really want. What is this? It's your {tooltip:Vocabulary:desire} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:wish}.",
