                        "file": "5449-subject-3650.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3051\u3057\u3054\u3080",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29059-subject-3650.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading comes from {span:lang=ja:\u6d88\u3059}, so make sure you know that word so you can read this one!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u65e5\u672c\u306e\u6d88\u3057\u30b4\u30e0\u304c\u3053\u3044\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I miss Japanese erasers."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u30c1\u30fc\u30e0\u306f\u3001\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306e\u305f\u3093\u751f\u65e5\u306b\u3001\u6d88\u3057\u30b4\u30e0\u4ed8\u304d\u306e\u3048\u3093\u3074\u3064\u3092\u767e\u672c\u5206\u30d7\u30ec\u30bc\u30f3\u30c8\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "The Tofugu team got one hundred pencils with rubbers on the end for Koichi's birthday present."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u3001\u304a\u524d\u306b\u8b1d\u308b\u30c1\u30e3\u30f3\u30b9\u3092\u3042\u3052\u3066\u3082\u3044\u3044\u3088\u3002\u300d\u300c\u4f55\u306b\u8b1d\u308c\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3046\u3093\u3060\u3088\u3001\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\uff1f \u304a\u524d\u304c\u4ffa\u3092\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u306e\u30aa\u30d5\u30a3\u30b9\u304b\u3089\u8ffd\u653e\u3057\u305f\u3053\u3068\u306b\u5bfe\u3057\u3066\u8b1d\u308c\u3063\u3066\u304b\uff1f\u300d\u300c\u305d\u3082\u305d\u3082\u304a\u524d\u304c\u4ffa\u306e\u6d88\u3057\u30b4\u30e0\u3092\u76d7\u3093\u3060\u304b\u3089\u305d\u3046\u306a\u3063\u305f\u3093\u3060\u308d\uff1f\u3044\u3044\u304b\u3089\u8b1d\u308c\u3088\uff01\u300d",
                    "en": "\"I could give you a chance to apologize to me, Koichi.\" \"For what, Viet? For letting you throw me out of Tofugu office?\" \"It only happened because you stole my eraser! I need an apology!\""
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Someone with {tooltip:Kanji:bad} {tooltip:Kanji:energy} is someone who has {tooltip:Vocabulary:evil intent}, {tooltip:Vocabulary:malice}, or {tooltip:Vocabulary:ill will}. Hopefully you don't have too much {span:lang=ja:\u60aa\u6c17}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Evil Intent",
                "Alternatives": "Malice, Ill Will",
                "Word Type": "noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u308f\u308b\u304e"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u308f\u308b\u304e",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "5317-subject-3651.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u308f\u308b\u304e",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "28975-subject-3651.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading itself has a lot of {span:lang=ja:\u60aa\u6c17} with all the exceptions it has. The {span:lang=ja:\u60aa} part is read like {span:lang=ja:\u60aa\u3044}. Then, {span:lang=ja:\u6c17} is rendaku'd. What an evil reading. Just think \"what's the most evil reading I can come up with?\" when you see this word. Then you should hopefully be able to read it.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u60aa\u6c17\u304c\u306a\u3044\u306e\u306f\u77e5\u3063\u3066\u308b\u3051\u3069\u3001\u305d\u3046\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8a00\u308f\u308c\u308b\u3068\u3053\u3063\u3061\u3082\u304d\u305a\u3064\u304f\u3093\u3060\u3088\uff1f",
                    "en": "I know you don't have any evil intent, but please understand that we could get hurt if you say something like that."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u60aa\u6c17\u304c\u3042\u3063\u3066\u3057\u305f\u308f\u3051\u3058\u3083\u306a\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u3051\u3063\u304b\u3066\u304d\u306b\u305d\u3046\u3044\u3046\u98a8\u306b\u611f\u3058\u3055\u305b\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u4e8b\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u672c\u5f53\u306b\u3054\u3081\u3093\u306a\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "I didn't do it out of malice, but I'm really sorry that I made you feel that way."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3068\u3053\u308d\u3067\u3001\u305d\u3082\u305d\u3082\u3001\u4f55\u306e\u7d4c\u9a13\u3082\u306a\u304f\u3066\u3001\u3069\u3046\u3084\u3063\u3066\u305d\u306e\u8077\u3092\u5f97\u305f\u306e\uff1f\u3042\u3001\u60aa\u6c17\u306f\u7121\u3044\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "By the way, how did you get the job without any experience in the first place? No offense, of course."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

