                        "pronunciation": "\u3057\u3042\u3044",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29927-subject-4149.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This word uses the on'yomi {span:lang=ja:\u3057} for {span:lang=ja:\u8a66} and the kun'yomi {span:lang=ja:\u3042\u3044} for {span:lang=ja:\u5408}. You learned both of these readings already, so you should be able to put them together!\n\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u826f\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3089\u3082\u3046\u4e00\u8a66\u5408\u3057\u307e\u305b\u3093\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "If you don't mind, why don't we play another game together?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3051\u3093\u9053\u306e\u8a66\u5408\u306e\u7d50\u679c\u306f\u3069\u3046\u3067\u3057\u305f\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "What was the outcome of the kendo match?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u3042\u306e\u91ce\u7403\u306e\u8a66\u5408\u306f\u672c\u5f53\u306b\u3072\u3069\u304b\u3063\u305f\u306d\u3002\u300d\u300c\u672c\u5f53\u306b\u305d\u3046\u3060\u306d\u3002\u300d",
                    "en": "\"That baseball game was really terrible.\" \"Yeah, tell me about it.\""
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

