{
            "mnemonic": "You've hopefully seen {span:lang=ja:\u6d88\u5316} by now and know that it means \"digestion.\" If you know that, then you can see that the \"digestion\" is {tooltip:Kanji:not} {tooltip:Kanji:good}. When your digestion is not good, what do you have? {tooltip:Vocabulary:Indigestion}. Excuse me, I have to run to the restroom...",
