{
            "mnemonic": "You have to pay a {tooltip:Kanji:fee} for the {tooltip:Kanji:material} you use to make food. Those are the {tooltip:Vocabulary:ingredients} you're paying for! Imagine making a list of all of the materials you need to make a stew, then making sure you have enough to pay the fees, so you'll have all the ingredients you need to make it.",
