{
            "mnemonic": "You wouldn't put your {tooltip:Kanji:idea} in a {tooltip:Kanji:diagram} {tooltip:Kanji:~like} format if it wasn't {tooltip:Vocabulary:intentional}. Doing that takes a lot of work. So you can only make diagram like things {tooltip:Vocabulary:on purpose}!",
