                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29040-subject-3713.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is a reading for {span:lang=ja:\u76ee} that's abnormal. You've seen this reading with {span:lang=ja:\u76ee\u6a19} and {span:lang=ja:\u76ee\u6b21}, though, so hopefully it won't be too hard at this point. Just imagine telling someone your {span:lang=ja:\u76ee\u7684}, only to have them laugh in your face and begin {tooltip:Reading:mock}ing {span:lang=ja:\u3082\u304f} you for it. Now you're not so sure if your goal is going to work.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e00\u4f53\u3001\u76ee\u7684\u306f\u4f55\u306a\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "What the heck is your goal?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u7740\u4ed8\u3051\u304c\u51fa\u6765\u308b\u3088\u3046\u306b\u306a\u308b\u306e\u304c\u76ee\u7684\u3067\u3001\u3053\u306e\u6599\u3066\u3044\u3067\u50cd\u304d\u59cb\u3081\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I started working at this fancy Japanese-style restaurant with my motive being the ability to wear kimono."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u79c1\u305f\u3061\u306e\u76ee\u7684\u306f\u3001\u4e00\u7dd2\u306b\u697d\u3057\u307f\u306a\u304c\u3089\u7686\u3055\u3093\u306b\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u3092\u52c9\u5f37\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Our goal is to make you all have fun while studying Japanese together."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

