{
            "mnemonic": "What is a {tooltip:Kanji:skill}? It's something you can do, and do quite well. It is a {tooltip:Vocabulary:technique} that you can make happen with ease.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Technique",
                "Alternative": "Art",
                "Word Type": "independent noun, in compounds"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u308f\u3056"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u308f\u3056",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "5631-subject-3681.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u308f\u3056",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29146-subject-3681.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. When learning the kanji, you didn't learn that reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you with this word: You do your {tooltip:Vocabulary:technique} on a bad guy, coming at you. You flip him over and knock him out. He {tooltip:Reading:was} ({span:lang=ja:\u308f\u3056}) a threat, but now he's not. You look closer at the bad guy. Turns out it's {tooltip:Reading:Woz}, the Apple Co-founder. He was just trying to hand you an iPhone12, not grab your wrist. Whoops!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u308c\u306f\u307e\u305f\u304d\u308f\u3069\u3044\u6280\u3092\u30de\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u3057\u305f\u306d\uff01",
                    "en": "You've mastered tricky art like that one, have you?"
                },
                {
