                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29093-subject-3944.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading comes from the word {span:lang=ja:\u671f\u5f85}, so make sure you know that to know this one as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u75c5\u6c17\u304c\u3061\u306a\u4f53\u3057\u3064\u306a\u306e\u3067\u3001\u3042\u307e\u308a\u671f\u5f85\u3057\u306a\u3044\u3067\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "I'm quite susceptible to illness, so don't expect too much from me."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3064\u307e\u306f\u3001\u3051\u3063\u3053\u3093\u8a18\u5ff5\u65e5\u306b\u306f\u304a\u3063\u3068\u304c\u307f\u304b\u3093\u3092\u8cb7\u3063\u3066\u304b\u3048\u3063\u3066\u304f\u308b\u3082\u306e\u3060\u3068\u671f\u5f85\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "The wife was anticipating that her husband would come back with clementines on their anniversary."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u5e74\u306f\u6bcd\u89aa\u4ee5\u5916\u306e\u5973\u5b50\u304b\u3089\u306e\u30d0\u30ec\u30f3\u30bf\u30a4\u30f3\u306e\u30c1\u30e7\u30b3\u30ec\u30fc\u30c8\u3092\u671f\u5f85\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I'm anticipating Valentine\u2019s chocolate from girls other than my mother this year."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:fold} so the vocab verb version is {tooltip:Vocabulary:to fold}.",
