                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: You {tooltip:Vocabulary:fold} your {tooltip:Reading:o}bi ({span:lang=ja:\u304a}) really carefully and put it away with the rest of your kimono.\n"
