{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:remainder} of your {tooltip:Kanji:thought}s are very small. You've thought of everything you possibly can to solve this problem. In the end, the remainder of your thoughts is left with one phrase: \"{tooltip:Vocabulary:too bad}.\" There's nothing else to think but the remainder.",
