{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:surround} so the verb vocab version is {tooltip:Vocabulary:to surround} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:to enclose}.",
