                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The kanji reading is the same as {span:lang=ja:\u6e29\u304b\u3044} and {span:lang=ja:\u6e29\u3081\u308b}. \n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b7\u30e3\u30ef\u30fc\u306e\u6c34\u304c\u6e29\u307e\u308b\u307e\u3067\u3001\u3053\u3053\u3067\u5f85\u3061\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Until the shower water warms up, I'll wait here."
