                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is the kun'yomi vocab readings for these two kanji, probably because this word is just two words put together into one (bad + mouth). Use your knowledge of the vocab words {span:lang=ja:\u60aa\u3044} and {span:lang=ja:\u53e3} to learn the reading of this word.\n{splitParent}Okay, I lied. You can also do {span:lang=ja:\u308f\u308b\u3050\u3061} if you want. Sorry to say such bad things before.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
