{
            "mnemonic": "If you visit a {tooltip:Radical:bar} after a {tooltip:Radical:tsunami}, you\u2019ll be hanging out in {tooltip:Kanji:shallow} water. After a tsunami, you want to relax with a drink at the bar. Unfortunately, tsunamis cause floods, and the bar floor is immersed in shallow water.",
