                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture a slope. Now picture yourself playing soccer on the slope. Now picture your anti self playing soccer on the anti slope.",
                "mnemonic": "You need to know these kinds of things about {tooltip:Kanji:slope}s if you want to play {tooltip:Reading:soccer} ({span:lang=ja:\u3055\u304b}). Soccer is pretty slope-intensive. You really have to know how to read their dirt and anti dirt to really get good."
