                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29230-subject-3729.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. When learning the kanji, you didn't learn that reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you with this word: You go up to {tooltip:Vocabulary:Buddha}. You want to rub his head for good luck, because that's what you hear is good to do. Right before you touch him, he backs off and says, \"Whoa! I'm {tooltip:Reading:hot, okay}?\" ({span:lang=ja:\u307b\u3068\u3051}). You touch him and it burns your hand clean off. \n{splitParent}Imagine saying \"hot, okay?\" in a strange accent to help you to remember.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u306f\u30e4\u30af\u30b6\u3092\u3084\u3081\u3066\u3001\u4ecf\u306e\u9053\u306b\u5165\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3092\u6c7a\u610f\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Viet has decided to leave the Yakuza group and follow the teachings of Buddha."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3082\u4ecf\u306e\u3088\u3046\u306b\u308c\u3044\u305b\u3044\u3067\u3001\u3048\u3093\u307e\u5927\u738b\u306e\u3088\u3046\u306b\u304d\u3073\u3057\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi is always as cool as Buddha and as strict as Enma, the King of Hell."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u77e5\u3089\u306c\u304c\u4ecf\u300d\u3084\u300c\u4ecf\u306e\u9854\u3082\u4e09\u5ea6\u307e\u3067\u300d\u306a\u3069\u3001\u4ecf\u306b\u95a2\u3059\u308b\u8afa\u306f\u3044\u304f\u3064\u304b\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "There are some proverbs related to Buddha like, \"what you don\u2019t know can\u2019t hurt you,\" and, \"the crushed worm will turn.\""
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

