                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well. Note that {span:lang=ja:\u4ecf} gets changed to {span:lang=ja:\u3076\u3063} for this one.\n"
