                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}How much {span:lang=ja:\u81ea\u4fe1} do you have that you know how to read this word already? I bet you have some, at least! This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u5927\u5909\u306a\u81ea\u4fe1\u5bb6\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi is quite the self-confident person."
                },
                {
