                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is different from what you learned with the kanji. Remember the word {span:lang=ja:\u7af9}? It has the same reading as this. Just think of everyone measuring the heights of things with {tooltip:Reading:bamboo} ({span:lang=ja:\u305f\u3051}) poles with markers on them. Okay, this one is 5 bamboo poles high!\n"
