                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e0a\u6d77\u4e8b\u5909\u306f\u4f55\u5e74\u306b\u8d77\u3053\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "What year did Shanghai Incident occur?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e8b\u5909\u3068\u3044\u3046\u8a00\u8449\u3092\u4f7f\u3063\u305f\u4f8b\u6587\u3092\u3055\u304c\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3089\u3001\u6771\u4eac\u4e8b\u5909\u3068\u3044\u3046\u30d0\u30f3\u30c9\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3092\u77e5\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "When I was looking for an example sentence with the word incident, I came across a band called Tokyo Incident."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6e80\u5dde\u4e8b\u5909\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u8aac\u660e\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3048\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Can you explain what the Manchurian Incident is?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "When you get someone to {tooltip:Kanji:transmit} information, they're a type of {tooltip:Vocabulary:intermediary}, a {tooltip:Vocabulary:go-between}, if you will.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Intermediary",
                "Alternatives": "Connections, Go Between",
                "Word Type": "independent noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3064\u3066"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3064\u3066",
