                        "file": "29369-subject-3796.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is the same as the one you learned with the kanji. Now how about you \"{tooltip:Reading:han}d\" me another bowl of rice?\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6700\u8fd1\u308f\u305f\u3057\u305f\u3061\u3001\u3054\u98ef\u3092\u98df\u3079\u308b\u30bf\u30a4\u30df\u30f3\u30b0\u304c\u5408\u308f\u306a\u304f\u3066\u3059\u308c\u3061\u304c\u3063\u3066\u3070\u304b\u308a\u3060\u3088\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "Recently we haven't been able to get our meal timing right, have we?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\uff01\u3054\u98ef\u3053\u307c\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Damn it! I just spilled my rice."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306e\u30c7\u30b9\u30af\u306e\u5f15\u304d\u51fa\u3057\u306b\u306f\u4e7e\u3044\u305f\u3054\u98ef\u306e\u584a\u304c\u5165\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u306e\uff1f",
                    "en": "Why is there a big ball of dried-up, cooked rice in Koichi's desk drawer?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
