                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings are the kun'yomi vocab readings. So, if you know {span:lang=ja:\u4eba}'s reading as a vocab word and {span:lang=ja:\u6bba\u3059}'s reading, you should be able to read this word. Just note that {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u308d\u3057} goes to {span:lang=ja:\u3054\u308d\u3057} due to rendaku.\n"
