                    "ja": "\u3084\u3070\u3044\u3001\u8fd4\u4fe1\u3059\u308b\u306e\u308f\u3059\u308c\u3066\u305f\u3002\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u5927\u5909\u306a\u3053\u3068\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u304b\u3082\u3002",
                    "en": "Oh no, I forgot to reply. What have I gotten myself into?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u304d\u8aad\u306b\u306a\u3063\u305f\u306e\u306b\u3001\u3044\u3064\u307e\u3067\u305f\u3063\u3066\u3082\u8fd4\u4fe1\u304c\u6765\u306a\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "It said \"read,\" but I never got a reply."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u304a\u75b2\u308c\u301c\u3002\u8fd4\u4fe1\u3057\u305f\u3064\u3082\u308a\u3060\u3063\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u3069\u3046\u3084\u3089\u529b\u5c3d\u304d\u3066\u3001\u9001\u4fe1\u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\u3092\u62bc\u3059\u524d\u306b\u5bdd\u3066\u305f\u307f\u305f\u3044\u3002\u3054\u3081\u3093\u306d\u3001\u8a31\u3057\u3066\u301c\u3002",
                    "en": "How\u2019s it going? I thought I sent a reply to you, but it seems that I was too tired and fell asleep before pressing the \u2019send\u2019 button. Sorry. Forgive me."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Kanji:finger} {tooltip:Kanji:ring} is the kind of {tooltip:Vocabulary:ring} you'd put on your finger. That's just simply a \"ring\" though, so you'll have to know what \"ring\" this is via context.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Ring",
                "Word Type": "noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3086\u3073\u308f"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3086\u3073\u308f",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "5811-subject-3900.ogg"
