                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is the same as the one you learned with the kanji. You can return home happily, knowing how to read this word! \n{splitParent}This word has a pair verb though, so you'll want to remember the {span:lang=ja:\u308b} ending. Just imagine how {tooltip:Reading:ru}de ({span:lang=ja:\u308b}) it is when someone goes home without saying goodbye. The nerve!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30ab\u30ca\u30a8\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306f\u3001\u65e5\u672c\u304b\u3089\u5e30\u3063\u3066\u304d\u3066\u3001\u30aa\u30d5\u30a3\u30b9\u306e\u4eba\u306b\u304a\u307f\u3084\u3052\u3092\u914d\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Kanae distributed souvenirs to her colleagues after she had come back from Japan."
                },
                {
