{
            "mnemonic": "A thing that gives you {tooltip:Kanji:time} {tooltip:Kanji:measurement}s is a {tooltip:Vocabulary:watch} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:clock}. Most people have these in their phones instead of on their wrists now.",
