                "hints": "Now picture these bamboo again up in bamboo heaven, and remember this strange accent to remember that the bamboo plants up in bamboo heaven are laughing with nervous laughter at this bamboo war that\u2019s a goin\u2019 on up there.",
                "mnemonic": "There\u2019s actually a war a goin\u2019 on up in that there bamboo heaven, y\u2019know? Ye might not have heard of it with all that there {tooltip:Kanji:laugh}in\u2019 a goin\u2019 on, but there definitely be a {tooltip:Reading:war a} ({span:lang=ja:\u308f\u3089}) goin\u2019 on up in bamboo heaven, y\u2019hear? The bamboo are scared so that\u2019s why they be laughin\u2019 so much. They nervous."
            }
