                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Now that you think about it, it's really odd. You went to his house and saw this forehead table. Then Jourm said, \"Ah this? It's a superfluous purchase. Don't mind it.\" You've never heard him say any word above a third grade level, let alone a fancy word such as superfluous. Also, the table made of foreheads is a bit... strange. You'll have to keep your eye on Jourm.",
                "mnemonic": "The only person you know with a {tooltip:Kanji:superfluous} forehead table is {tooltip:Reading:Jou}rm ({span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3087\u3046}), the ten foot tall, simple farmhand. "
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "There's an {tooltip:Radical:ear} just sitting on a {tooltip:Radical:stool}. Nobody's watching, so, you {tooltip:Kanji:take} it.",
            "hints": "Feel the rush of stealing something (even though it's a weird something, admittedly). Start walking away quickly. You don't want to get caught!",
