{
            "mnemonic": "You've seen {span:lang=ja:\u6280} as a vocab word meaning \"technique.\" This is sort of using that meaning. So, a {tooltip:Kanji:technique} of {tooltip:Kanji:art} is still {tooltip:Vocabulary:art}, but it's also your {tooltip:Vocabulary:craft}, your {tooltip:Vocabulary:technique}.",
