{
            "mnemonic": "This is the same as the kanji, at least in regards to the {tooltip:Kanji:article} or {tooltip:Kanji:goods} meaning, which means you can use this word to mean {tooltip:Vocabulary:article} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:goods}.",
