                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well. It will help to know the reading of {span:lang=ja:\u81ea\u52d5} as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u308c\u306f\u3001\u30dc\u30c3\u30c8\u306b\u3088\u308b\u81ea\u52d5\u7684\u306a\u30c4\u30a4\u30fc\u30c8\u3067\u3059\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "That's an automated tweet by a bot."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u96fb\u8eca\u306e\u30c9\u30a2\u306f\u3001\u81ea\u52d5\u7684\u306b\u306f\u958b\u304d\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002",
                    "en": "This train's doors don't open automatically."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3082\u3057\u8ab0\u304b\u304c\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u5bb6\u306b\u4fb5\u5165\u3057\u305f\u3089\u3001\u3053\u306e\u6a5f\u68b0\u304c\u81ea\u52d5\u7684\u306b\u8b66\u5099\u4f1a\u793e\u306b\u901a\u5831\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "If someone breaks into your house this machine will automatically send a message to the security company."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You know that {span:lang=ja:\u81ea\u52d5} is {tooltip:Kanji:automatic}. So what is an automatic {tooltip:Kanji:car}? That is an {tooltip:Vocabulary:automobile}, or simply a {tooltip:Vocabulary:car}.",
