{
            "mnemonic": "If you {tooltip:Kanji:make} a {tooltip:Kanji:product}, it's not really a product anymore, but {tooltip:Vocabulary:a work}. It's your {tooltip:Vocabulary:work} of art or literature, or maybe a theater {tooltip:Vocabulary:production}.",
