{
            "mnemonic": "You know how {span:lang=ja:\u5f01} means {tooltip:Kanji:dialect} and {span:lang=ja:\u5f53} means {tooltip:Kanji:success}? Well, this isn't going to help you much, because this means {tooltip:Vocabulary:bento} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:box lunch}. Chances are, though, you know the word \"bento\" from English. So, if you read this word (which you should be able to) you can figure out it's {span:lang=ja:\u3079\u3093\u3068\u3046}. If you do that, you can realize this word means {tooltip:Vocabulary:bento} too!",
