{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Kanji:new} {tooltip:Kanji:product} is something that's {tooltip:Vocabulary:brand new} or a {tooltip:Vocabulary:new item}. I like looking around the store for the brand new stuff because it's interesting!",
