        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:Buddha} {tooltip:Kanji:rule}s are the rules Buddha made for Buddhists. These can be found in the {tooltip:Vocabulary:Buddhist Scriptures} and {tooltip:Vocabulary:Buddhist Writing}s.",
