{
            "mnemonic": "Who are all {tooltip:Kanji:like} \"I want to {tooltip:Kanji:preserve} and {tooltip:Kanji:protect} what I have, get out of my business, government!\"? {tooltip:Vocabulary:Conservative} people, of course.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Conservative",
                "Word Type": "\u306a adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u307b\u3057\u3085\u3066\u304d"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u307b\u3057\u3085\u3066\u304d",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "6329-subject-3801.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u307b\u3057\u3085\u3066\u304d",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29501-subject-3801.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading doesn't match up for this word's {span:lang=ja:\u5b88}. The reading is {span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3085}, but you can remember that because the conservatives want to protect and preserve their {tooltip:Reading:hoe}s ({span:lang=ja:\u307b}) and their {tooltip:Reading:chute}s ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3085}) from the government. For some reason those get taxed a lot.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u4fdd\u5b88\u7684\u306a\u5b66\u6821\u3060\u3063\u305f\u306e\u3067\u3001\u5b66\u751f\u306f\u307f\u3093\u306a\u6821\u305d\u304f\u901a\u308a\u306b\u305b\u3044\u670d\u3092\u7740\u7528\u3059\u308b\u3088\u3046\u8981\u6c42\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "My school was very conservative, so students were required to wear uniforms in accordance with the school regulations."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u65e5\u672c\u56fd\u6c11\u306f\u3001\u4fdd\u5b88\u7684\u306a\u56fd\u6c11\u3060\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Do you think the Japanese are conservative people?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u306b\u3001\u5e74\u3092\u3068\u308b\u306b\u3064\u308c\u3066\u4fdd\u5b88\u7684\u306b\u306a\u308b\u4eba\u304c\u591a\u3044\u3051\u3069\u3001\u4ffa\u306f\u305d\u3046\u306f\u306a\u308a\u305f\u304f\u306a\u3044\u3001\u3068\u8a00\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi told Viet that people tend to become more conservative as they get older, but he doesn\u2019t want to be like that."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Your job is to {tooltip:Kanji:take} {tooltip:Kanji:material}s from a bunch of different people because you're {tooltip:Vocabulary:covering an event}. This {tooltip:Vocabulary:data collection} needs to be thorough, so you try to take all the materials you can from as many people as you can find.",
