            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u53d6\u6750\u306b\u3054\u5354\u529b\u3044\u305f\u3060\u3051\u307e\u305b\u3093\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "I'm wondering if you would allow us to get an interview?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30c6\u30ec\u30d3\u306e\u53d6\u6750\u3092\u53d7\u3051\u305f\u6642\u306b\u3001\u91d1\u304c\u5168\u3066\u3067\u306f\u306a\u3044\u3068\u7b54\u3048\u305f\u3068\u3053\u308d\u304c\u3001\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u30b9\u756a\u7d44\u306b\u4f7f\u308f\u308c\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "The clip where I was interviewed by a TV crew and I said that money isn't everything was used for a news program."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u7121\u7406\u306f\u627f\u77e5\u306a\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u3069\u3046\u306b\u304b\u3054\u4e3b\u4eba\u3092\u53d6\u6750\u3055\u305b\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3046\u3053\u3068\u306f\u3067\u304d\u306a\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304b\uff1f\u3082\u3057\u4f55\u3068\u304b\u3057\u3066\u9802\u3051\u308c\u3070\u3001\u672c\u5f53\u306b\u672c\u5f53\u306b\u611f\u8b1d\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I know it\u2019s difficult, but isn\u2019t there any way that I could collect some data on your husband? If you could help me set up the interview, I would really really appreciate it."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Things that are {tooltip:Kanji:below} normal {tooltip:Kanji:products} are the cheap knockoffs and bad quality items. These items are incredibly {tooltip:Vocabulary:crude} in their manufacturing and design. So much {tooltip:Vocabulary:vulgarity}!",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Crude",
                "Alternative": "Vulgarity",
                "Word Type": "noun, \u306a adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3052\u3072\u3093"
