{
            "mnemonic": "Something filled with the {tooltip:Kanji:rule}s of various {tooltip:Kanji:action}s is something that contains a ton of knowledge. It contains all things and actions, right? What kind of \"thing\" is filled with all this information (that existed during the creation of words and kanji?)? One thing would be an {tooltip:Vocabulary:encyclopedia}.",
