                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29611-subject-3928.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}If you know the reading for {span:lang=ja:\u5408\u683c}, all you have to do is add {span:lang=ja:\u4e0d} to it! You've learned all these readings, yay!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30ab\u30f3\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0\u3057\u305f\u306e\u304c\u30d0\u30ec\u3066\u4e0d\u5408\u683c\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "They found out that I'd cheated and I was rejected."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u672c\u547d\u306e\u516c\u7acb\u5927\u5b66\u306e\u5165\u5b66\u3057\u3051\u3093\u306f\u4e0d\u5408\u683c\u3060\u3063\u305f\u304c\u3001\u3059\u3079\u308a\u6b62\u3081\u3067\u53d7\u3051\u305f\u79c1\u7acb\u5927\u5b66\u306b\u5408\u683c\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I failed the entrance exam for a public university, which was my first choice, but I passed for a private college, which was my second choice."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u3093\u306a\u306b\u7c21\u5358\u306a\u8a66\u9a13\u304c\u4e0d\u5408\u683c\u3060\u3063\u305f\u306a\u3093\u3066\u672c\u5f53\u306b\u6065\u305a\u304b\u3057\u3044\u3088\u3002\u7a74\u304c\u3042\u3063\u305f\u3089\u5165\u308a\u305f\u3044\u3050\u3089\u3044\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019m so embarrassed I failed such an easy test. I wish I could sink through the floor."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This is a single kanji with an {span:lang=ja:\u3044} on the end, meaning you know it's probably an adjective. What's the adjective form of {tooltip:Kanji:far}? It's also {tooltip:Vocabulary:far} (or it's {tooltip:Vocabulary:far away}).",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Far",
                "Alternative": "Far Away",
                "Word Type": "\u3044 adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3068\u304a\u3044"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3068\u304a\u3044",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
