                        "pronunciation": "\u3068\u304a\u3044",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29425-subject-3868.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}You want to go {tooltip:Vocabulary:far}, {tooltip:Vocabulary:far away} when you see a {tooltip:Reading:toe... oh} ({span:lang=ja:\u3068\u304a})! You realize there is a zombie toe on the ground and it reminds you of where you can go that's far from here\u2014where the zombie that once had this toe went! (Remember the kanji mnemonic? It's that scooter zombie's toe that makes you say oh and want to go.)\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306e\u30a2\u30d1\u30fc\u30c8\u306f\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u30aa\u30d5\u30a3\u30b9\u304b\u3089\u4e09\u6642\u9593\u307b\u3069\u884c\u3063\u305f\u3001\u9060\u3044\u6797\u306e\u4e2d\u306b\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi's apartment is located about three hours from the Tofugu office, in some faraway woods."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306e\u65b0\u7bc9\u30de\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3001\u3068\u3066\u3082\u3088\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3051\u3069\u3001\u99c5\u304b\u3089\u9060\u3059\u304e\u3066\u8cb7\u3046\u306e\u3092\u3042\u304d\u3089\u3081\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "That newly-built condo was really nice but we gave up on buying it, because it was too far from the station."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6771\u4eac\u306f\u3001\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u30e9\u30f3\u30c9\u304b\u3089\u3069\u308c\u304f\u3089\u3044\u9060\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f\u6b69\u304f\u306b\u306f\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u9060\u3059\u304e\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "How far is Tokyo from Portland? Is it too far for me to walk?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "When you {tooltip:Kanji:quit} your current {tooltip:Kanji:generation} to join an older one you need all the {tooltip:Vocabulary:flattery} you can get because you're starting to feel old. People probably still won't like you though, ya old fart.",
