                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u5fc3\u306b\u3082\u306a\u3044\u304a\u4e16\u8f9e\u3092\u8a00\u3046\u306e\u304c\u4e0b\u624b\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi is not good at giving insincere compliments."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u304a\u4e16\u8f9e\u3067\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u304c\u4e0a\u624b\u3060\u3068\u8a00\u308f\u308c\u308b\u306e\u306f\u597d\u304d\u3067\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002",
                    "en": "I don't like being complimented on my Japanese speaking."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u308f\u3049\uff01\u4eca\u591c\u306e\u541b\u306f\u3068\u3066\u3082\u304d\u308c\u3044\u3060\u306d\u3002\u307e\u308b\u3067\u3001\u304a\u59eb\u69d8\u307f\u305f\u3044\u3060\u3088\u3002\u300d\u300c\u30d1\u30d1\u3001\u304a\u4e16\u8f9e\u3092\u8a00\u3063\u3066\u3082\u4f55\u3082\u51fa\u306a\u3044\u308f\u3088\u3002\u300d",
                    "en": "\"Oh wow! You look so beautiful tonight. Like a princess!\" \"Flattery will get you nowhere, daddy.\u201d"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Kanji:fold} you can see with your {tooltip:Kanji:eye} is a {tooltip:Vocabulary:fold} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:crease} in something.",
