                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29422-subject-3912.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings are both kun'yomi vocab readings. You should have seen {span:lang=ja:\u6298\u308b} by now which should help you to read {span:lang=ja:\u6298\u308a}. Then there's {span:lang=ja:\u76ee}, which I'm guessing you won't have a problem with.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u30ba\u30dc\u30f3\u306b\u306f\u3001\u6298\u308a\u76ee\u304c\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3092\u3001\u3053\u3053\u306b\u8a3c\u660e\u3044\u305f\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I hereby certify that these pants are without a single fold."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6298\u308a\u7d19\u3092\u534a\u5206\u306b\u6298\u3063\u3066\u3001\u6298\u308a\u76ee\u3092\u3064\u3051\u3066\u304b\u3089\u307e\u305f\u958b\u3044\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please open the origami again after you fold it in half to add the crease."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30ba\u30dc\u30f3\u306b\u306f\u6298\u308a\u76ee\u3092\u4ed8\u3051\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3048\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Could you put a crease in my trousers?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
