                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6765\u5e74\u3082\u3069\u3063\u3066\u304d\u3066\u3082\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u30dd\u30b8\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u304c\u3042\u308b\u304b\u306f\u4fdd\u8a3c\u3057\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "I can't guarantee that your position will still exist when you come back next year."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3046\u307e\u304f\u7d44\u7e54\u3092\u56fa\u3081\u3089\u308c\u308b\u4fdd\u8a3c\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "There is no guarantee that I can strengthen the organization well."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u79c1\u306f\u30ef\u30cb\u30ab\u30cb\u306e\u30e9\u30a4\u30d5\u30bf\u30a4\u30e0\u30e1\u30f3\u30d0\u30fc\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u304c\u4e94\u5e74\u5f8c\u3082\u3042\u308b\u306a\u3093\u3066\u4fdd\u8a3c\u306f\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3089\u672c\u5f53\u306b\u30e9\u30a4\u30d5\u30bf\u30a4\u30e0\u3067\u30ef\u30cb\u30ab\u30cb\u304c\u4f7f\u3048\u308b\u306a\u3093\u3066\u601d\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "I am a lifetime member of WaniKani, but I don't really think I can use it for life, as there is no guarantee that Tofugu will still be around in five years."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:slope}s of the {tooltip:Kanji:god}s! What could this be? Well, it's mainly just a company, known as {tooltip:Vocabulary:Hanshin}. They're based in the area between Osaka and Kobe. Think of it this way: {span:lang=ja:\u5927\u962a} + {span:lang=ja:\u795e\u6238} = {span:lang=ja:\u962a\u795e}! They're everywhere, though, and even have a baseball team (the Hanshin Tigers), so it's good to know.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
