                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5e78\u798f\u306e\u79d1\u5b66\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3057\u3085\u3046\u6559\u56e3\u4f53\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u8abf\u3079\u3066\u307f\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I looked up some information about a religious group called Happy Science."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u306b\u5e78\u798f\u3092\u3082\u305f\u3089\u3059\u305f\u3081\u306b\u3001\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u3058\u3085\u3046\u696d\u54e1\u5168\u54e1\u306b\u5e78\u798f\u306e\u30d5\u30b0\u306e\u304a\u307e\u3082\u308a\u3092\u4e00\u4e07\u30c9\u30eb\u3067\u8cb7\u308f\u305b\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "In order to bring happiness to Tofugu, Koichi tried to make all of his employees buy a happiness fugu charm for $10,000 each."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5f7c\u5973\u306f\u5e78\u904b\u306e\u661f\u306e\u3082\u3068\u306b\u751f\u307e\u308c\u305f\u305f\u3081\u3001\u5e78\u798f\u3059\u304e\u3066\u6bce\u65e5\u6d99\u304c\u6b62\u307e\u3089\u306a\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "She was born under a lucky star and she has so much happiness in her life that she can\u2019t help but cry every day."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Some {tooltip:Kanji:day}s are so special that you have to {tooltip:Kanji:write down} all your {tooltip:Kanji:thoughts} when they're done. These are special days like {tooltip:Vocabulary:holidays} and your {tooltip:Vocabulary:anniversary}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Holiday",
                "Alternatives": "Anniversary, Memorial Day",
                "Word Type": "noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u304d\u306d\u3093\u3073"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u304d\u306d\u3093\u3073",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "6539-subject-7587.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u304d\u306d\u3093\u3073",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29608-subject-7587.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is a combination of on'yomi for the first two and kun'yomi for the last one. That being said, all of the readings for all of the kanji are the readings you've learned already, so you should be able to read this word too. Just watch out because {span:lang=ja:\u3072} is rendaku'd into {span:lang=ja:\u3073}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u8a18\u5ff5\u65e5\u3092\u308f\u3059\u308c\u308b\u306a\u3093\u3066\u3001\u6700\u4f4e\u3088\uff01",
                    "en": "Forgetting something like a Memorial Day is the worst!"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u5e74\u306e\u3051\u3063\u3053\u3093\u8a18\u5ff5\u65e5\u306b\u306f\u3001\u592b\u304b\u3089\u5168\u81ea\u52d5\u305b\u3093\u305f\u304f\u304d\u3092\u3082\u3089\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "My husband gave me a fully automatic washing machine for our wedding anniversary this year."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3069\u304f\u7acb\u8a18\u5ff5\u65e5\u306f\u3001\u30d5\u30ea\u30de\u3067\u670d\u3092\u58f2\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "On Independence Day, I'm selling clothes at a flea market."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
