                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. You'll need to remember the {span:lang=ja:\u7269} reading as {span:lang=ja:\u3082\u3064}, though. Why? Because all your luggage just got thrown into various {tooltip:Reading:moats} along the countryside. It's going to take you forever to collect your luggage from these moats and by then it'll be all soggy. Dangit...\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u305c\u3044\u95a2\u3067\u8377\u7269\u3092\u8abf\u3079\u3089\u308c\u306a\u3044\u304b\u5fc3\u914d\u3067\u3059\u3002",
