                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29551-subject-3857.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for this word won't make you {tooltip:Vocabulary:smile}, though. You were smiling, but then you heard about the reading of this kanji. It made you yell out \"{tooltip:Reading:EH}??\" ({span:lang=ja:\u3048}). Just watch out for the rendaku of {span:lang=ja:\u304b\u304a} to {span:lang=ja:\u304c\u304a}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306e\u7b11\u9854\u304c\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306e\u305b\u3044\u5b9f\u3055\u3092\u8a3c\u660e\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3088\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "That smiling face proves Koichi's integrity, eh?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u56fd\u306e\u738b\u5b50\u306f\u7b11\u9854\u3067\u56fd\u6c11\u3092\u6bba\u3059\u3068\u3066\u3082\u3072\u3069\u3044\u7537\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "The prince of this country is a very terrible man who kills his citizens with a smile."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u7b11\u9854\u306e\u7d20\u6575\u306a\u7537\u306f\u4ffa\u306e\u9023\u308c\u3067\u3001\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3046\u306e\u3002",
