                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29463-subject-3931.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since the reading for {span:lang=ja:\u56fa} ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u305f}) is different than the one you learned with the kanji, here's a mnemonic to help you out. A {tooltip:Reading:cate}rpillar ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u305f}) forms a cocoon. The caterpillar's cocoon is hard and the caterpillar made it that way. Keep this in mind and you too will blossom into a beautiful butterfly.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u306d\u3093\u571f\u306f\u71b1\u3067\u56fa\u3081\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "You can harden clay with heat."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u306f\u6bce\u671d\u4e00\u6642\u9593\u304b\u3051\u3066\u30ea\u30fc\u30bc\u30f3\u30c8\u3092\u30ef\u30c3\u30af\u30b9\u3067\u56fa\u3081\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Viet takes an hour to make his pompadour hard every morning."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u3001\u65e5\u672c\u306b\u8ecd\u968a\u3092\u6d3e\u9063\u3059\u308b\u6c7a\u610f\u3092\u56fa\u3081\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi decided to fortify his position and send his troops to Japan."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "{span:lang=ja:\u7d04\u675f} is a \u201cpromise.\u201d So when you add {span:lang=ja:\u3059\u308b} to it you\u2019re making it a verb, meaning {tooltip:Vocabulary:to promise}. Now promise you\u2019ll remember!",
