                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29518-subject-3920.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading comes from {span:lang=ja:\u5e0c\u671b}. It's also the on'yomi jukugo reading as well, if that helps any.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u65e5\u672c\u3078\u306e\u7559\u5b66\u3092\u5e0c\u671b\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I'm hoping to study abroad in Japan."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5e0c\u671b\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305f\u5927\u5b66\u306b\u5165\u5b66\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I was able to get into the university I'd been wishing for."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u96e8\u304c\u964d\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u306e\u3067\u3001\u5f85\u3061\u5408\u308f\u305b\u3092\u5730\u4e0b\u306b\u5909\u66f4\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3092\u5e0c\u671b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u3069\u3046\u601d\u308f\u308c\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "It\u2019s raining, so I request that we change our appointment and instead hold it underground, what do you think?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
