{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:viking} with a {tooltip:Radical:mouth} {tooltip:Radical:towel} is a totally {tooltip:Kanji:ordinary} thing. It's {tooltip:Kanji:normal}.",
            "hints": "Vikings get a lot of nasty stuff on their mouths from their messy eating and pillaging, so it makes sense that they'd all have mouth towels. It's as ordinary and normal as it gets, at least amongst the vikings.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Normal",
