{
            "mnemonic": "If there is a {tooltip:Radical:drum} in your {tooltip:Radical:mouth} it's time to {tooltip:Kanji:rejoice}! And because of your mouth drum your rejoicing will be loud and booming!",
            "hints": "Imagine having a drum in your mouth and rejoicing about it! Imagine how loud it would be!",
            "meanings": {
