{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:criminal}'s {tooltip:Radical:heart} will always be {tooltip:Kanji:sad}. No one chooses a life of crime if they're happy. And even if they seem like they're doing fine on the outside, deep down they're really sad.",
            "hints": "Imagine watching a criminal after he's done stealing from a bank. He's all alone. He stops throwing the money around. And cries. So so sad.",
