{
            "mnemonic": "There is a {tooltip:Radical:plate} on the {tooltip:Radical:dirt} with a {tooltip:Radical:gun} on it. You decide to put it in your {tooltip:Radical:mouth}, but it's very bland, so you add some {tooltip:Kanji:salt}. Salt will make anything tastier.",
            "hints": "Imagine putting a gun you found on a plate on the ground in your mouth to eat it. Are you crazy? Don't eat unseasoned food. Put some salt on that first.",
            "meanings": {
