                "mnemonic": "As you {tooltip:Kanji:salt} this strange choice in food you mutter, \"{tooltip:Reading:She owe}s ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u304a}) me for this,\" out loud to yourself. Who is she, you ask? The lady that put this salt-less food gun down in front of you before running away."
            }
