                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Which theory do you believe? That there is nothing or that there are sets of things?",
                "mnemonic": "The guard listens to your {tooltip:Kanji:theory} but then he says his OWN! He thinks there are two {tooltip:Reading:sets} ({span:lang=ja:\u305b\u3064}) of guarded items, and he's only guarding one. According to his theory, either one could be real! His theory is more plausible, don't you think?"
            }
        }

{
