{
            "mnemonic": "Aiming your {tooltip:Radical:gun} out the {tooltip:Radical:window}, you shoot at a {tooltip:Radical:tree} filled with {tooltip:Kanji:ume}, {tooltip:Kanji:Japanese plum}s. This is, in your opinion, the best way to harvest the plums \u2013 shooting at them out your window with a gun.",
