{
            "mnemonic": "You know how {span:lang=ja:\u6669\u3054\u98ef} is \"dinner\"? Well, that word is so 12 hours ago. This is morning and in the {tooltip:Kanji:morning} your {tooltip:Kanji:meal} is {tooltip:Vocabulary:breakfast}.",
