{
            "mnemonic": "This is a single kanji with an {span:lang=ja:\u3044} on the end, meaning you know it's probably an adjective. What's the adjective form of {tooltip:Kanji:void}? It's {tooltip:Vocabulary:empty} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:vacant}. Just think of what has to happen to make a void in the first place.",
