                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29875-subject-7758.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}If everything in life seems {tooltip:Vocabulary:empty} and {tooltip:Vocabulary:futile}, even cows will be affected. Listen to them say, \"{tooltip:Reading:Moo, nah} ({span:lang=ja:\u3080\u306a}), never mind. What's the point?\" Nothing makes life seem empty like a cow saying \"Moo, nah.\"\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6bce\u65e5\u6ce3\u3044\u3066\u3070\u304b\u308a\u3044\u308b\u306e\u306f\u865a\u3057\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "It's futile to just cry every day."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u65e5\u306f\u4f55\u3060\u304b\u865a\u3057\u3044\u6c17\u5206\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I feel empty today, for some reason."
                },
                {
