{
            "mnemonic": "Things that {tooltip:Kanji:cause} {tooltip:Kanji:evil} are the {tooltip:Kanji:fruit}s of {tooltip:Kanji:evil}. This is a nice little saying. In English, you might say it as {tooltip:Vocabulary:evil breeds evil}. Remember that.",
