                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29858-subject-4010.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for this is an exception, at least for the {span:lang=ja:\u679c} portion. To remember this part, imagine yourself asking for some {tooltip:Vocabulary:fruit}. {tooltip:Reading:Could I} ({span:lang=ja:\u304f\u3060}) have some fruit, please?\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u679c\u7269\u306e\u4e2d\u3067\u306f\u3001\u7121\u82b1\u679c\u304c\u4e00\u756a\u597d\u304d\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Out of all fruit, I like figs the best."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3046\u3061\u306e\u5b50\u306f\u91ce\u3055\u3044\u306f\u304d\u3089\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u30c8\u30de\u30c8\u3060\u3051\u306f\u679c\u7269\u3060\u3068\u601d\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3088\u3046\u3067\u98df\u3079\u3066\u304f\u308c\u308b\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "My kid doesn't like veggies, but apparently he thinks the tomato is a fruit so he eats them."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u679c\u7269\u5c4b\u3055\u3093\u304c\u9589\u307e\u308b\u307e\u3067\u306b\u3001\u4ed5\u4e8b\u7d42\u308f\u308a\u305d\u3046\uff1f\u300d\u300c\u5927\u4e08\u592b\u3002\u3082\u3057\u7d42\u308f\u3089\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3089\u660e\u65e5\u306b\u56de\u3059\u3088\u3002\u300d",
                    "en": "\"Do you think you\u2019ll finish your work before the fruit shop closes?\" \"Don\u2019t worry. If I can\u2019t finish, I\u2019ll just leave it for tomorrow.\""
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

