                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u56f3\u8aac\u4ed8\u304d\u306e\u53c2\u8003\u66f8\u3092\u3055\u304c\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I'm looking for a textbook with illustrations."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30a2\u30e4\u304c\u3001\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u793e\u5185\u306e\u4eba\u9593\u95a2\u4fc2\u306e\u56f3\u8aac\u3092\u4f5c\u3063\u3066\u304f\u308c\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Aya made an explanatory diagram of the in-house Tofugu relationships."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3082\u3057\u89e3\u8aac\u3068\u5171\u306b\u56f3\u8aac\u304c\u3042\u308c\u3070\u3001\u3088\u308a\u5206\u304b\u308a\u3084\u3059\u304f\u306a\u308b\u304b\u3068\u601d\u3046\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u5982\u4f55\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "I think it would be easier to understand if there was an illustration with an explanation, what do you think?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If you can do {tooltip:Kanji:nothing} within {tooltip:Kanji:reason}, then what you're trying to do is {tooltip:Vocabulary:unreasonable} and probably downright {tooltip:Vocabulary:impossible}. If you still try, you're probably just {tooltip:Vocabulary:overdoing} it.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Impossible",
                "Alternatives": "Unreasonable, Overdoing",
