                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29791-subject-7547.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. As long as you know the readings for these kanji, you should be able to read this word just fine.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u30cb\u30f3\u30cb\u30af\u306f\u4fbf\u3074\u3092\u6cbb\u3059\u85ac\u3060\u3063\u3066\u8a00\u3063\u3066\u305f\u3051\u3069\u3001\u30cb\u30f3\u30cb\u30af\u3067\u4fbf\u3074\u3092\u6cbb\u3059\u306e\u306f\u7121\u7406\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi said that garlic is a cure for constipation, but I'd say curing constipation with garlic is impossible."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u304c\u7121\u7406\u306a\u3093\u984c\u3092\u3075\u3063\u304b\u3051\u3066\u3082\u3001\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u30c1\u30fc\u30e0\u306f\u7121\u7406\u3057\u3066\u306a\u3093\u3068\u304b\u3084\u3063\u3066\u306e\u3051\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "Even though Koichi makes unreasonable demands, the Tofugu team manages to meet them by overworking themselves."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u8098\u3092\u8210\u3081\u308b\u306e\u306f\u7121\u7406\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "It\u2019s impossible to lick your own elbow."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Okay, so you {tooltip:Kanji:guess} but you also kind of {tooltip:Kanji:know}. You can make an {tooltip:Vocabulary:inference} as to what the answer is... You're not 100% sure, but you think you know, even though you're guessing.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Inference",
