                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29665-subject-3977.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well. Note that {span:lang=ja:\u5bdf} gets shortened to {span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3063}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6628\u591c\u3001\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u304c\u30b3\u30f3\u30d4\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u306e\u4e0d\u6b63\u5229\u7528\u3092\u5bdf\u77e5\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Last night, Viet detected unauthorized use of the computers."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u3068\u624b\u4e0b\u305f\u3061\u306f\u3001\u8b66\u5bdf\u306e\u624b\u5165\u308c\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3092\u4e8b\u524d\u306b\u5bdf\u77e5\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3088\u3046\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "Viet and his foot soldiers seemed to have sensed that the police would raid them."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u50d5\u9054\u306e\u8d64\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306f\u3001\u6bcd\u89aa\u3067\u3042\u308b\u30b5\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u306e\u611f\u60c5\u3084\u4e0d\u5b89\u3092\u3059\u3054\u304f\u654f\u611f\u306b\u5bdf\u77e5\u3059\u308b\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Our baby is very sensitive to the emotions and anxieties of his mom, Salmon."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:inside} {tooltip:Kanji:side} is the {tooltip:Vocabulary:inside}. A little redundant but makes a lot of sense.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Inside",
                "Word Type": "noun, \u306e adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3046\u3061\u304c\u308f"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3046\u3061\u304c\u308f",
