{
            "mnemonic": "When you have {tooltip:Kanji:romance} and {tooltip:Kanji:love} all in the same package. Well, that is {tooltip:Vocabulary:love}! Ah, love! This is the word used when talking about love, though. You don't use this to say \"I love you.\"",
