                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29691-subject-4050.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings are the kun'yomi vocab readings. You already know {span:lang=ja:\u9f3b}'s reading from the kanji and vocab, and you should know the vocab reading of {span:lang=ja:\u8840} as well. Put them together and you have {span:lang=ja:\u306f\u306a\u3061}, though you want to change the {span:lang=ja:\u3061} to {span:lang=ja:\u3062}. Alternatively, it's possible (though less common, but it doesn't matter if you're turning it to kanji via an IME anyways) to write it as {span:lang=ja:\u306f\u306a\u3058}. I guess that blood added a little tenten (it represents the blood coming out of that nose!). Spurt spurt spurt.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u9f3b\u306e\u4e0b\u306b\u3072\u3052\u3092\u306f\u3084\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3068\u3001\u9f3b\u8840\u304c\u51fa\u305f\u6642\u306b\u5927\u5909\u3067\u3059\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "If you have a mustache it'll be a pain if your nose bleeds, right?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3059\u307f\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u4e00\u8a00\u3001\u8a00\u308f\u305b\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3044\u305f\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u3001\u9f3b\u8840\u304c\u51fa\u3066\u307e\u3059\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "Excuse me. I just need a quick word with you. Your nose is bleeding."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u96fb\u8eca\u306b\u99c6\u3051\u8fbc\u307f\u4e57\u8eca\u3092\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3057\u3066\u9f3b\u304c\u631f\u307e\u308c\u3066\u3001\u9f3b\u8840\u304c\u51fa\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I tried to rush onto the train, but the doors closed, squished my nose and made it bleed."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Kanji:small} {tooltip:Kanji:theory} is some idea you have that you put on paper. Perhaps it's an idea about life, that you write in the form of a {tooltip:Vocabulary:novel}?",
