                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29652-subject-4011.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well. Just note that the {span:lang=ja:\u7d50} gets shortened to {span:lang=ja:\u3051\u3063}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u5e74\u306eAKB\u306e\u9078\u304d\u3087\u306e\u7d50\u679c\u304c\u6c17\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I can't wait to find out the results of the AKB election this year."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u3001\u7d50\u679c\u304c\u4e00\u756a\u5927\u4e8b\u3060\u3068\u3088\u304f\u53e3\u306b\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi often says that results are all that matter."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u306e\u7d50\u679c\u306b\u306f\u5168\u7136\u6e80\u8db3\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3088\u3002\u5f7c\u5973\u306e\u5f79\u306b\u7acb\u3068\u3046\u3068\u3044\u3046\u8a08\u753b\u306f\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3082\u88cf\u76ee\u88cf\u76ee\u306b\u51fa\u308b\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002\u4eca\u56de\u3082\u307e\u305f\u7136\u308a\u3067\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019m not pleased with the results at all. My plans to help her always backfire for some reason and this time was no exception."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

