                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29743-subject-4047.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is just like what you learned with the kanji. {span:lang=ja:\u306f\u306a\u304f\u305d}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u304b\u304e\u9f3b\u306e\u7537\u304c\u3001\u307b\u3058\u304f\u308a\u51fa\u3057\u305f\u9f3b\u304f\u305d\u3092\u3001\u306d\u3080\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u4f4e\u3044\u9f3b\u306e\u7537\u306e\u9f3b\u306e\u7a74\u306b\u5165\u308c\u308b\u306e\u3092\u898b\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I saw a man with an aquiline nose pick his boogers and put them in the nostrils of a sleeping man with a short nose."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6307\u3067\u307b\u3058\u304f\u308a\u51fa\u3057\u305f\u9f3b\u304f\u305d\u3092\u30c6\u30a3\u30c3\u30b7\u30e5\u306e\u4e0a\u306b\u96c6\u3081\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I'm collecting the snot I pick out with my finger on a tissue."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d5\u30b0\u304c\u50d5\u306e\u3053\u3068\u3092\u81ea\u5206\u52dd\u624b\u3060\u3063\u3066\u8cac\u3081\u308b\u3093\u3060\u3002\u76ee\u304f\u305d\u9f3b\u304f\u305d\u3092\u7b11\u3046\u3060\u3088\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "Fugu accused me of being selfish. Talk about an eye crust laughing at a booger."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
