                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}If your garden is too {tooltip:Vocabulary:thin}, just get out the {tooltip:Reading:hose} ({span:lang=ja:\u307b\u305d})! How about if your hair is thin? Point the hose at your head! Hoses can cure any thin issues you may have.\n"
