{
            "mnemonic": "You know the {tooltip:Kanji:previous} part of your {tooltip:Kanji:nose}? The part of your nose I just chopped off? Well, you were lucky, as that was only the {tooltip:Vocabulary:tip of the nose}. Time to cut off the rest, next!",
