                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You learned this reading already so you should be able to read it!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3060\u308c\u304c\u30d9\u30fc\u30b3\u30f3\u3092\u3084\u3044\u3066\u3082\u304a\u3044\u3057\u3055\u306f\u305d\u3093\u306a\u306b\u5909\u308f\u3089\u306a\u3044\u3068\u8a00\u3046\u306e\u306f\u3046\u305d\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Whoever said that fried bacon tastes the same no matter how you make it was wrong."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u7fd2\u304b\u3093\u306f\u56fd\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u5909\u308f\u308a\u307e\u3059\u304b\u3089\u3001\u306a\u308c\u308b\u3057\u304b\u306a\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "The custom varies from country to country, so we should just get used to it."
