                        "pronunciation": "\u3044\u3055\u3080",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29874-subject-7589.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}Who is the one person who always seems {tooltip:Vocabulary:to be encouraged} and excited? {tooltip:Reading:Isa}bel ({span:lang=ja:\u3044\u3055})! She's so positive and always cheers everyone, including herself, up.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u3093\u306a\u306b\u52c7\u3093\u3067\u305f\u3089\u3001\u3042\u306e\u99ac\u306f\u8cb7\u3048\u306a\u3044\u306a\u3041\u3002",
                    "en": "That horse is acting too lively for me to bet on it."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u3068\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u306f\u3001\u52c7\u3093\u3067\u30aa\u30d5\u30a3\u30b9\u306b\u5165\u3063\u3066\u6765\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi and Viet came into the office in high spirits."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5c11\u5e74\u306f\u3001\u559c\u3073\u52c7\u3093\u3067\u65c5\u306b\u51fa\u767a\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "The boy left for his trip in high spirits."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You know that {span:lang=ja:\u5efa\u3066\u308b} is \"to build.\" This is similar to that, but it's the version where you're not doing the building. Something is just getting built. That's why this word is {tooltip:Vocabulary:to be erected} and {tooltip:Vocabulary:to be built}. You can recognize that because of the {span:lang=ja:\u3064}, which tells you that {tooltip:Reading:two} ({span:lang=ja:\u3064}) guys are building the building while you watch. So you're not doing it, they are, and it's just happening.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "To Be Erected",
