                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29815-subject-3985.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: Why do you need to dry something off? Because someone used a {tooltip:Reading:hose} ({span:lang=ja:\u307b\u3059}) and got everything all wet. Ugh, you shouldn't leave that hose out anymore...\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30bb\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u306f\u304b\u3093\u305d\u3046\u304d\u306b\u5165\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3067\u3001\u5e72\u3057\u3066\u306d\u3063\u3066\u8a00\u3063\u305f\u3058\u3083\u306a\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "I told you not to put the sweater in the dryer but to hang dry it."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306e\u82b8\u4eba\u3001\u305c\u3063\u5bfe\u6700\u8fd1\u5e72\u3055\u308c\u3066\u308b\u3088\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "I think that comedian has definitely been deprived of any chance to appear on television recently. Don't you agree?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6d17\u6fef\u7269\u3092\u5916\u306b\u5e72\u3057\u305f\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u7269\u5e72\u3057\u7aff\u304c\u58ca\u308c\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066\u3002",
                    "en": "I wanted to put our laundry outside to dry, but our clothesline just broke."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If you tear ({span:lang=ja:\u3066\u308b}) up a {tooltip:Kanji:fruit}, its life is going {tooltip:Vocabulary:to end}. Fruit can't go on when they've been beaten up so much. ",
