                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u306f\u3066\u308b",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29844-subject-7759.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}The fruit's life is about {tooltip:Vocabulary:to end} and you laugh, \"Hahahaha ({span:lang=ja:\u306f})!\" And then you start tearing at it more! What's wrong with you? Weirdo...\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e09\u65e5\u3082\u306d\u3066\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3089\u3001\u3064\u304b\u308c\u679c\u3066\u305f\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "I haven't slept for three days and I'm exhausted."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u3093\u306a\u3068\u3053\u308d\u3067\u679c\u3066\u308b\u308f\u3051\u306b\u306f\u3044\u304b\u306a\u3044\u3068\u601d\u3063\u305f\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I thought, I must not die here."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3044\u3064\u679c\u3066\u308b\u3068\u3082\u306a\u304f\u7d9a\u304f\u4f1a\u8b70\u306b\u3001\u793e\u54e1\u306f\u5168\u54e1\u30a6\u30f3\u30b6\u30ea\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "The meeting continued without any sign of ending and the employees were getting fed up."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

