                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for this is actually the same as what you learned with the kanji, but the {span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3064} is shortened to {span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3063}. If you had {tooltip:Vocabulary:to guess} be sure to guess with the shorter {span:lang=ja:\u3064}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3075\u3060\u3093\u306e\u8a00\u52d5\u304b\u3089\u5bdf\u3059\u308b\u306b\u3001\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u9f3b\u306e\u4e0b\u304c\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u9577\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "From Koichi's language and behavior, I presume he is very soft on women."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3046\u3061\u306e\u592b\u306f\u3001\u79c1\u306e\u6c17\u6301\u3061\u3092\u5bdf\u3059\u308b\u306e\u304c\u4e0b\u624b\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "My husband is not good at guessing my feelings."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3044\u304f\u3064\u304b\u306e\u8a18\u4e8b\u3092\u8aad\u3093\u3067\u3001\u79c1\u306fTofugu\u30c1\u30fc\u30e0\u306b\u306f\u4f55\u304b\u6697\u9ed9\u306e\u69cb\u60f3\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3092\u5bdf\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "From reading a few articles, I sense that the Tofugu team has some kind of implicit plan."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

