{
            "mnemonic": "When how much you {tooltip:Kanji:prosper} goes into your {tooltip:Kanji:heart} and just enters a {tooltip:Kanji:void}, it will rarely mean anything to you. A person who has this trait is going to have extreme {tooltip:Vocabulary:vanity} because he/she just needs to suck more and more prosperity into their bottomless pit of a heart. It's like a black hole. They need more and more and more so then they have to become vain.",
