                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings are the kun'yomi vocab readings. You should know both of them, with {span:lang=ja:\u897f} being {span:lang=ja:\u306b\u3057} and {span:lang=ja:\u5074} being {span:lang=ja:\u304c\u308f} (what you learned with the kanji).\n"
