{
            "mnemonic": "Saying you're going to {tooltip:Radical:slide} the {tooltip:Radical:dirt} out of your {tooltip:Radical:mouth} is just another way of saying you're going to {tooltip:Kanji:announce} something. All that information is the dirt, and to announce that dirt you just slide it on out of your mouth. How's that for a visual?",
            "hints": "The next time you have something important to announce, calm your nerves by imagining dirt sliding out of your mouth. It's that easy!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Announce"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
