                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine drinking some coke and then making an announcement. Try not to burp while you talk.",
                "mnemonic": "Now that you're about to {tooltip:Kanji:announce} something important, you should maybe get it nice and smooth in your mouth so the dirt can slide out easier. So take a big gulp of {tooltip:Reading:Coke} ({span:lang=ja:\u3053\u304f}). Coke is just like, the dirt of soda anyway, you know?"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "For {tooltip:Radical:happiness}, a {tooltip:Radical:scooter} is the best way to {tooltip:Kanji:attain} it\u2014{tooltip:Kanji:plural} scooters would be even better. Everyone loves a good scooter. And as they say, the path to attaining happiness is littered with plural scooters.",
            "hints": "You're zipping along in a scooter, fast as can be. Feel yourself attaining happiness as you gleefully speed down the street.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Attain",
                "Alternative": "Plural"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
