                        "reading": "\u3084",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine this guy running around cooking in the fire of his home, only this time with a Yankees hat and jersey on. He doesn\u2019t play for them anymore, but he still loves the team.",
                "mnemonic": "This gambler used to play for the New York {tooltip:Reading:Ya}nkees ({span:lang=ja:\u3084}). He had a pitching injury, developed a gambling problem, and also took up some hobbies to {tooltip:Kanji:bake} and {tooltip:Kanji:cook}. Certainly a departure from his time with the Yankees."
            }
        }

{
