{
            "mnemonic": "Nestled in the light of the {tooltip:Radical:moon} in the {tooltip:Radical:grass} is a {tooltip:Radical:treasure chest} that you can see with your {tooltip:Kanji:brain}. You close your eyes, and you can see the spot, but it's kept deep in your brain, and you have to use its power to find it.",
