{
            "mnemonic": "In a {tooltip:Radical:prison} on the {tooltip:Radical:moon} lies a {tooltip:Radical:treasure chest} containing a golden {tooltip:Kanji:chest} piece. This mighty chest armor will grant you protection from nearly any attack, for it is imbued with moon magic.",
