                "mnemonic": "Where is this {tooltip:Kanji:chest} armor from? It\u2019s from the moon. Now how would you say that if you were Canadian? It\u2019s from the {tooltip:Reading:moon, eh} ({span:lang=ja:\u3080\u306d}). Right, this here chest armor is from the moon, eh."
            }
