{
            "mnemonic": "In your {tooltip:Radical:mouth} you put your {tooltip:Radical:life} on the line by putting in a {tooltip:Radical:sword} that is {tooltip:Radical:big}. You put it all the way down there, so you {tooltip:Kanji:consume} it.",
