{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:bamboo} {tooltip:Radical:temple} is {tooltip:Kanji:equal} to all of the other non-bamboo temples. Just because it's made of bamboo doesn't make it any less special and spiritual.",
            "hints": "Picture this bamboo temple compared to some temples made of stone or wood. It's the same size, shape, and it has the same number of worshipers. It's equal in every way.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Equal"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
