                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "21536-subject-4136.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This vocab word uses the same reading as the one you learned with the kanji. At least I won't have to bring up the image of you {tooltip:Reading:moon}ing ({span:lang=ja:\u3080\u306d}) people with your breasts or whatnot. Oh dang, I just went and did it.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5e0c\u671b\u306b\u80f8\u3092\u3075\u304f\u3089\u307e\u305b\u306a\u304c\u3089\u3001\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u3067\u50cd\u304d\u59cb\u3081\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "With hope swelling in my chest, I started working for Tofugu."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u304b\u306b\u3055\u3055\u308c\u3066\u80f8\u304c\u3059\u3054\u304f\u304b\u3086\u3044\u3053\u3068\u306f\u3001\u80f8\u306b\u3057\u307e\u3063\u3066\u304a\u3044\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I kept it to myself that I got mosquito bites on my breasts, making them very itchy."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u304c\u6bce\u671d\u80f8\u3092\u5f35\u3063\u3066\u6b4c\u3046Tofugu\u306e\u30c6\u30fc\u30de\u30bd\u30f3\u30b0\u306e\u6b4c\u8a5e\u306f\u80f8\u306b\u3050\u3063\u3068\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "The lyrics to the Tofugu theme song, which Koichi sings every morning, with his chest puffed out, cause a swell of emotions in my own chest."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

