                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u306e\u793e\u54e1\u3092\u304a\u7b11\u3044\u306e\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u3067\u677e\u3001\u7af9\u3001\u6885\u306b\u5206\u985e\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please classify Tofugu employees into three grades using pine, bamboo, and plum, based on their level of comedy."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u52d5\u7269\u3046\u3089\u306a\u3044\u3067\u3001\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u81ea\u5206\u304c\u7f8a\u306b\u5206\u985e\u3055\u308c\u305f\u3053\u3068\u306b\u5927\u559c\u3073\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi was delighted by the fact that he was classified as a sheep during animal fortunetelling."
                },
