                    "ja": "\u300c\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u544a\u767d\u306b\u305d\u3093\u306a\u306b\u6642\u9593\u304c\u304b\u304b\u3063\u305f\u306e\uff1f\u300d\u300c\u544a\u767d\u306e\u4ed5\u65b9\u304c\u5206\u304b\u3089\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3002\u300d",
                    "en": "\"Why did you take so long for the confession?\" \"Because I didn't know how to do it.\""
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b8\u30e3\u30de\u30eb\u306f\u305a\u3063\u3068\u30c9\u30e9\u30af\u30a8\u30d5\u30a1\u30f3\u3060\u3068\u516c\u8a00\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305f\u306e\u306b\u3001\u6700\u8fd1\u3064\u3044\u306b\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30ca\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30f3\u30bf\u30b8\u30fc\u306e\u304b\u304f\u308c\u30d5\u30a1\u30f3\u3060\u3063\u305f\u3053\u3068\u3092\u544a\u767d\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Jamal has been publicly declaring that he is a fan of Dragon Quest, but recently, he finally confessed that he is a secret admirer of Final Fantasy."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4f1a\u8a08\u4e8b\u52d9\u6240\u3067\u306e\u30a2\u30b7\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30c8\u306e\u4ed5\u4e8b\u3092\u5f97\u305f\u5f8c\u306b\u3001\u5f7c\u5973\u306f\u5b9f\u306f\u6570\u5b66\u304c\u3042\u307e\u308a\u5f97\u610f\u3067\u306f\u306a\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3092\u544a\u767d\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "After getting an assistant position in a finance office, she confessed that she is actually bad at math."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "It's {tooltip:Kanji:possible} to {tooltip:Kanji:love} this thing. It's so gosh darn {tooltip:Vocabulary:cute}! Any really cute thing is possible to love.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Cute",
                "Word Type": "\u3044 adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u304b\u308f\u3044\u3044"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u304b\u308f\u3044\u3044",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "30135-subject-4077.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u304b\u308f\u3044\u3044",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "20772-subject-4077.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for this word is screwed up, though if we're lucky, you already know the word for cute. It seems to have injected itself into American and English culture a decent amount, anyways. If you are one of the lucky ones, you'll know that this word is read as {span:lang=ja:\u304b\u308f\u3044\u3044}. If you're not, think of the cute thing being a cow. Then you say, \"that {tooltip:Reading:cow\u306f\u3044\u3044}\" ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u308f\u3044}), or \"that cow is good\" because it's so cute.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u3063\u3066\u53ef\u611b\u3044\u58f0\u3067\u8a71\u3059\u3088\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi speaks in a cute voice, don't you think?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306e\u53ef\u611b\u3044\u8d64\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306f\u3060\u308c\u306e\u5b50\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Who does this cute baby belong to?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d5\u30b0: \u30b5\u2026\u30b5\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u3063\uff1f\u3078\u30fc\u3063...\u3059\u3001\u3059\u3063\u3054\u304f\u53ef\u611b\u3044\u540d\u524d\u3060\u306d\u3002 \u30b5\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3: \u305d\u3046\u601d\u3046\uff1f \u79c1\u306f\u305a\u3063\u3068\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u540d\u524d\u304c\u3042\u307e\u308a\u597d\u304d\u3058\u3083\u306a\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "Fugu: S-Salmon...? Wow what a, what a cute name. Salmon: You think so? I\u2019ve always kinda hated it."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:money} (and {tooltip:Kanji:gold}) you {tooltip:Kanji:borrow} is your {tooltip:Vocabulary:debt}. Be sure to pay it back before the yakuza come for you.",
