{
            "mnemonic": "This is a day of the week. You know this because it has {span:lang=ja:\u66dc\u65e5} in it. But what day of the week is it? The {tooltip:Kanji:gold} day of the week is the greatest day. It's the day that makes you feel like gold because it's the end of the weekdays and the beginning of the weekend! This day is {tooltip:Vocabulary:Friday}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
