                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u9280\u5ea7\u4ed8\u8fd1\u3067\u3001\u3058\u3085\u3046\u305f\u3044\u3092\u306c\u3051\u308b\u306e\u306b\u3059\u3054\u304f\u6642\u9593\u304c\u304b\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "It took forever to get through the traffic around Ginza."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3044\u3068\u3053\u306f\u9280\u5ea7\u3092\u6b69\u3044\u3066\u3044\u305f\u6642\u306b\u3001\u30c6\u30ec\u30d3\u5c40\u304b\u3089\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30d3\u30e5\u30fc\u3092\u53d7\u3051\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "When my cousin was walking in Ginza, she was interviewed by a TV crew."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3082\u3057\u8ce2\u3044\u611b\u4eba\u3092\u898b\u3064\u3051\u305f\u3044\u306e\u306a\u3089\u3001\u6771\u4eac\u306e\u9280\u5ea7\u306b\u884c\u304f\u306e\u304c\u3044\u3044\u304b\u3082\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "If you want to find a clever lover, maybe you should go to Ginza, Tokyo."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Kanji:product} {tooltip:Kanji:thing} is any type of general {tooltip:Vocabulary:goods}. It's about as specific as you can get when you're talking about {tooltip:Vocabulary:thing}s like this.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Goods",
                "Alternatives": "Article, Item, Thing",
                "Word Type": "noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
