                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "30076-subject-8807.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word that uses the kun'yomi readings of the kanji. You should be able to read this on your own, but don't be fooled into using the on'yomis! This isn't {span:lang=ja:\u3072\u3093\u3076\u3064} \u2014 no, it's {span:lang=ja:\u3057\u306a\u3082\u306e}!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u3061\u3089\u306e\u30c4\u30a4\u30fc\u30c8\u3078\u3001\u307b\u3057\u3044\u54c1\u7269\u306e\u540d\u524d\u3092\u66f8\u3044\u3066\u8fd4\u4fe1\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please write the name of the goods you'd like and reply to this tweet."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u6642\u9593\u306e\u30b9\u30fc\u30d1\u30fc\u306b\u306f\u3001\u54c1\u7269\u304c\u307b\u3068\u3093\u3069\u7121\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "There are almost no goods in the grocery store around this time."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u54c1\u7269\u304c\u5230\u7740\u6b21\u7b2c\u3001\u3054\u9023\u7d61\u5dee\u3057\u4e0a\u3052\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "As soon as the item arrives, I'll contact you."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "When {tooltip:Kanji:writing} just happens to \"{tooltip:Kanji:fall}\" on the wall (whoops, wasn't me who did that, how strannnnge) it's writing that's not supposed to be where it is. This kind of writing is {tooltip:Vocabulary:graffiti}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Graffiti",
                "Alternatives": "Scribble, Sketch",
                "Word Type": "noun, \u3059\u308b verb"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3089\u304f\u304c\u304d"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3089\u304f\u304c\u304d",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "29974-subject-4142.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3089\u304f\u304c\u304d",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "20767-subject-4142.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. {span:lang=ja:\u66f8}, however, is kun'yomi in this case and also has rendaku. So just remember that it's read as {span:lang=ja:\u304c} for this vocab and you'll be fine.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306e\u843d\u66f8\u304d\u306f\u4eca\u3084\u30aa\u30fc\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3067\u767e\u4e07\u30c9\u30eb\u3067\u843d\u672d\u3055\u308c\u308b\u307e\u3067\u306b\u306a\u3063\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi's sketches have increased in value by as much as a million dollars at auctions."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u65b0\u5bbf\u99c5\u306e\u5730\u4e0b\u9053\u306b\u306f\u3001\u6614\u3001\u305f\u304f\u3055\u3093\u306e\u843d\u66f8\u304d\u304c\u3057\u3066\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u304c\u3001\u4eca\u306f\u307b\u3068\u3093\u3069\u898b\u5f53\u305f\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002",
                    "en": "There used to be lot of graffiti along the underground passages at Shinjuku Station a long time ago, but we rarely see them now."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b9\u30d7\u30ec\u30fc\u3067\u306e\u843d\u66f8\u304d\u30a2\u30fc\u30c8\u306f\u65e2\u306b\u5c11\u3057\u6642\u4ee3\u9045\u308c\u3067\u3059\u3002\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u82b8\u8853\u5bb6\u9054\u306f\u3001\u58c1\u306e\u6c5a\u308c\u3092\u30b4\u30b7\u30b4\u30b7\u64e6\u3063\u3066\u6d17\u3044\u843d\u3068\u3057\u306a\u304c\u3089\u30a2\u30fc\u30c8\u3092\u5275\u308a\u3060\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Spray-painting graffiti is already a bit old-fashioned. The newer artists create works of art by scrubbing the dirt off the wall."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Remember {span:lang=ja:\u8377\u7269} and how it means \"baggage\" or \"luggage.\" Add a {tooltip:Kanji:hand} to it and you have {tooltip:Vocabulary:hand baggage} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:hand luggage}.",
