                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}If you know {span:lang=ja:\u8377\u7269} and you know {span:lang=ja:\u624b}, then you should be able to Voltron the two together into one mega reading.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u624b\u8377\u7269\u3092\u5fd8\u308c\u3066\u307e\u305b\u3093\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Did you forget your carry on?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d5\u30ed\u30f3\u30c8\u3067\u624b\u8377\u7269\u3092\u3042\u305a\u304b\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3048\u308b\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "You can leave your baggage at the front desk."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u7a0e\u95a2\u3068\u624b\u8377\u7269\u53d7\u53d6\u6240\u3092\u901a\u308b\u306e\u306b\u3001\u7d76\u5bfe\u306b\u4e09\u5341\u5206\u4ee5\u4e0a\u304b\u304b\u308b\u3068\u601d\u3046\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "I think it would definitely take more than thirty minutes to go through customs and baggage claim."
