{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Kanji:Happiness} is {tooltip:Vocabulary:happiness}!",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Happiness",
                "Alternatives": "Luck, Fortune",
                "Word Type": "adverb, noun, \u306a adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3055\u3044\u308f\u3044"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3055\u3044\u308f\u3044",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "21293-subject-8673.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3055\u3044\u308f\u3044",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "30066-subject-8673.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You haven't learned this reading yet so here's a mnemonic to help you:\n{splitParent}If your life is filled with nothing but {tooltip:Vocabulary:happiness}, every time someone says something to you, all you can do is say, \"{tooltip:Reading:Sigh, wha}t ({span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3044\u308f})?\" You sigh and say what. Because you're too happy to really listen. You're just sighing all day and not paying attention.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5e78\u3044\u306a\u3053\u3068\u306b\u3001\u3061\u3087\u3046\u3069\u7a7a\u8eca\u306e\u30bf\u30af\u30b7\u30fc\u304c\u3084\u3063\u3066\u6765\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Luckily, an empty taxi just came."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u304a\u5f79\u306b\u7acb\u3066\u305f\u3088\u3046\u3067\u3001\u5e78\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I'm happy that I was able to help you."
