                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "30149-subject-4056.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well. It will help to know the word {span:lang=ja:\u66dc\u65e5} as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6708\u66dc\u65e5\u306b\u3001\u304a\u98a8\u308d\u306e\u6c34\u3092\u6b62\u3081\u308b\u306e\u3092\u5fd8\u308c\u3066\u3066\u3001\u6e6f\u8239\u304b\u3089\u3042\u3075\u308c\u3066\u3001\u5bb6\u4e2d\u6c34\u3073\u305f\u3057\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "On Monday, I forgot to turn off the bath, it overflowed, and our place was flooded."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u53d7\u9a13\u6599\u306f\u3001\u6708\u66dc\u65e5\u307e\u3067\u306b\u3075\u308a\u3053\u3093\u3067\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Please pay the examination fee through your bank by Monday."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6708\u66dc\u65e5\u3001\u71b1\u3005\u306e\u30ed\u30de\u30f3\u30b9\u3068\u304b\u3001\u30be\u30c3\u3068\u3059\u308b\u30db\u30e9\u30fc\u307f\u305f\u3044\u306a\u611f\u3058\u306e\u697d\u3057\u3044\u6620\u753b\u3092\u3042\u306a\u305f\u3068\u4e00\u7dd2\u306b\u89b3\u305f\u3044\u306a\u3063\u3066\u601d\u3046\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u3069\u3046\u304b\u306a\uff1f",
                    "en": "On Monday, I would like to watch some fun movies with you, like a steamy romance or blood-curdling horror film. How does that sound?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

