                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "30092-subject-4052.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}If you know how to read {span:lang=ja:\u5927\u962a} you can just add {span:lang=ja:\u5f01} to it and be able to read the whole thing, though maybe not in {tooltip:Vocabulary:Osaka dialect}. Okay, fine, it's probably the same thing in Osaka dialect.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306e\u5927\u962a\u5f01\u306e\u4e0a\u53f8\u306f\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3082\u524d\u304a\u304d\u304c\u9577\u3044\u306e\u3067\u3001\u3046\u3093\u3056\u308a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "That supervisor with the Osaka dialect always takes forever to get to the point, it's very annoying."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5927\u962a\u5f01\u306e\u304b\u308c\u6c0f\u3068\u306e\u304b\u3053\u306f\u3001\u3082\u3046\u5fd8\u308c\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I've put the past with my ex with the Osaka dialect behind me already."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u5fc3\u914d\u3057\u306a\u3044\u3067\u3002\u541b\u304c\u5927\u962a\u5f01\u3092\u558b\u308b\u3063\u3066\u3053\u3068\u306f\u8ab0\u306b\u3082\u8a00\u308f\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3002\u79d8\u5bc6\u306f\u5b88\u308b\u3088\u3002\u300d\u300c\u304a\u304a\u304d\u306b\uff01\u300d",
                    "en": "\"Don\u2019t worry. I won\u2019t tell anyone that you speak with the Osaka dialect. Your secret is safe with me.\" \"Thanks.\""
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This is the {tooltip:Kanji:way} of {tooltip:Kanji:writing} (kind of like how {span:lang=ja:\u898b\u65b9} is the way of seeing). A better way to say this though would be to call it {tooltip:Vocabulary:penmanship}, though. How's your {span:lang=ja:\u66f8\u304d\u65b9}? Mine is terrible.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
