{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:correct} way to {tooltip:Kanji:sit} is this way: {tooltip:Vocabulary:traditional Japanese sitting} (this is when you sit on your legs and your feet, kneeling). You can also call it {tooltip:Vocabulary:seiza}. Learning the reading will help with the meaning.",
