{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Kanji:steam} {tooltip:Kanji:car} is a car that runs on steam. No regular car runs on steam, but what thing that has things called \"cars\" does run on steam? How about a {tooltip:Vocabulary:steam train}? You can also think about {span:lang=ja:\u96fb\u8eca}s, which are electric cars (but means \"train\"). This is similar to that, but now it's run with steam, making it a steam train.",
