{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Kanji:Candy} made into a {tooltip:Kanji:thin} {tooltip:Kanji:construction} is a {tooltip:Vocabulary:sugar sculpture} or a {tooltip:Vocabulary:candy sculpture}. It's usually a {tooltip:Vocabulary:sugar animal}, but it can be anything, really.",
