                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings here are the vocab kun'yomi readings. You have {span:lang=ja:\u3072} for {span:lang=ja:\u65e5} and {span:lang=ja:\u3084} for {span:lang=ja:\u713c\u3051} (which you learned with the vocab). Combine it with some sunscreen and hopefully you'll prevent the {tooltip:Vocabulary:sunburn}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3069\u3046\u3084\u3089\u3046\u3061\u306e\u5a18\u306f\u3001\u3042\u306e\u65e5\u713c\u3051\u3057\u305f\u9752\u5e74\u3078\u306e\u604b\u306b\u80f8\u3092\u3053\u304c\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3088\u3046\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "It seems like my daughter is deeply in love with that tan young man."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u65e5\u713c\u3051\u3067\u305b\u4e2d\u304c\u771f\u3063\u8d64\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u308b\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "Your back is super red from that sunburn."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30cf\u30ef\u30a4\u3067\u306f\u5f37\u3044\u65e5\u713c\u3051\u6b62\u3081\u304c\u5fc5\u9700\u54c1\u3067\u3001\u4eba\u9054\u3092\u65e5\u713c\u3051\u304b\u3089\u5b88\u308b\u306e\u306b\u30b7\u30fc\u30c8\u3067\u8986\u3063\u305f\u308a\u3082\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "In Hawaii, strong sunscreen is essential and covers are also used to protect people from getting sunburned."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This is a day of the week. You know this because it has {span:lang=ja:\u66dc\u65e5} in it. But what day of the week is it? The {tooltip:Kanji:Sun} day of the week is {tooltip:Vocabulary:Sunday}. Doesn't get much easier than that for you. Lucky!",
