                        "pronunciation": "\u3082\u304f\u3088\u3046\u3073",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "30143-subject-4057.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well. It will help to know the word {span:lang=ja:\u66dc\u65e5} as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6728\u66dc\u65e5\u306b\u3001\u30ac\u30b9\u30d1\u30a4\u30d7\u306b\u30d2\u30d3\u304c\u5165\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "The gas pipe cracked on Thursday."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6d17\u305f\u304f\u306f\u3001\u6728\u66dc\u65e5\u306b\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u601d\u3063\u3066\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I think I'm gonna do the laundry on Thursday."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6728\u66dc\u65e5\u306b\u3001\u96ea\u3060\u308b\u307e\u3092\u4f5c\u308b\u3068\u304b\u304b\u307e\u304f\u3089\u3092\u4f5c\u308b\u307f\u305f\u3044\u306a\u3001\u4f55\u304b\u697d\u3057\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3092\u3057\u305f\u304f\u306a\u3044\uff1f",
                    "en": "On Thursday, do you want to do something fun like making a snowman or building an igloo?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:announce} so the verb vocab version is {tooltip:Vocabulary:to announce}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "To Announce",
                "Alternative": "To Tell",
                "Word Type": "transitive verb, ichidan verb"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3064\u3052\u308b"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3064\u3052\u308b",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "7195-subject-4082.ogg"
                    },
                    {
