                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: Wait, what {tooltip:Reading:was} ({span:lang=ja:\u308f\u3059}) the reading? I {tooltip:Vocabulary:forget}... What was it?\n"
