                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: You have {tooltip:Vocabulary:to wash} {tooltip:Reading:a ro}ck ({span:lang=ja:\u3042\u3089}) you found. It looks shiny, but you can't tell until you wash it.\n"
