{
            "mnemonic": "This is a day of the week. You know this because it has {span:lang=ja:\u66dc\u65e5} in it. But what day of the week is it? The {tooltip:Kanji:fire} day of the week is the day after the worst day of the week (monday). You set fire to everything because you're so pissed off about yesterday, which makes today {tooltip:Vocabulary:Tuesday}.",
