{
            "mnemonic": "This is a day of the week. You know this because it has {span:lang=ja:\u66dc\u65e5} in it. But what day of the week is it? The {tooltip:Kanji:water} day of the week is where the water flows from. Think of your entire week as a big hill, with Wednesday (hump day) being in the middle. This hump is a hill. What originates from hills? Water! That's why Water day is {tooltip:Vocabulary:Wednesday}.",
