                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Your eyes fill with tears under Tokugawa's gaze and you drop everything you acquired to the ground. You bow before him apologizing. You'll never do this again!",
                "mnemonic": "You managed to {tooltip:Kanji:acquire} some tobacco, but just as you're about to leave {tooltip:Reading:Toku}gawa ({span:lang=ja:\u3068\u304f}) Ieyasu comes marching up to you!! Or at least, his ghost does. He stares you dead in the eyes and says, \"I didn't found the shogunate for you to acquire illegal goods and kill your body toking on my soil.\""
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Radical:mouth} has the {tooltip:Radical:power} to {tooltip:Kanji:add} words together to form a sentence. Marvel at the massive and mighty power your mouth holds! You add words together in an amazing fashion!",
            "hints": "Say this sentence out loud. Incredible! You\u2019ve used the power of your mouth to add words together in a sentence. Your parents must be very proud of you.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Add"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304b",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304f\u308f",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine how awful it would be to have a new car given to you only to have it taken away immediately after. Feel this rollercoaster of emotion as you are joyful and excited, then sad and sorrowful. ",
                "mnemonic": "Your parents are so proud of you for using your powerful mouth to {tooltip:Kanji:add} words together that they decide to surprise you with a gift. It\u2019s a new {tooltip:Reading:ca}r ({span:lang=ja:\u304b}). It\u2019s that shiny brand new car that you\u2019d always wanted. You\u2019re speechless. However, your speechlessness frustrates your parents so they decide to take away the car they just gave you. Boo hoo."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You use a {tooltip:Radical:bookshelf} as a {tooltip:Kanji:book counter}. Duh. What are you gonna count them one by one? Okay, well maybe, but you should count them while they're nice and organized and on shelves. Otherwise counting is going to be a huge pain.",
