{
            "mnemonic": "You'll work your {tooltip:Radical:soul} to {tooltip:Radical:death} if you're too {tooltip:Kanji:busy}. Being busy just isn't good for your soul. Take breaks. Go on vacation. Don't be so busy that you destroy yourself.",
