                "hints": "Think about your busy schedule this week. Now cancel everything and just go bowling instead.",
                "mnemonic": "Take time out of your {tooltip:Kanji:busy} life and go {tooltip:Reading:bow}ling ({span:lang=ja:\u307c\u3046}) once in a while. In fact, you should probably go bowling once a week at least. Nothing brings energy back to your life like some relaxing bowling."
