{
            "mnemonic": "Passed out in front of the {tooltip:Radical:gate} lies a {tooltip:Radical:drunkard} who used to be the {tooltip:Radical:leader} of a popular {tooltip:Kanji:clique}, the Cool Kids {tooltip:Kanji:Clan}. Once, he was a leader, but now he is but a drunkard. The clan has fallen apart, and he no longer has a clique to call his own.",
            "hints": "Imagine this washed up drunkard leader passed out in front of the gate to your house. You have to pass him whenever you enter or exit your house. He\u2019s gross and he smells. Experience the stench in your nostrils. How he was ever the leader of a clan you have no idea.",
