                "mnemonic": "Eventually you get sick and tired of this washed up {tooltip:Kanji:clan} leader and you gather your own {tooltip:Kanji:clique} to chase this guy away from your gate and your property. You and your friends grab some {tooltip:Reading:bats} ({span:lang=ja:\u3070\u3064}) and use these bats to beat the drunkard leader. Being beaten with bats frightens him, and he scurries away."
