            "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Radical:stop} at a {tooltip:Radical:cliff} with a {tooltip:Radical:tree} on it, realizing that {tooltip:Kanji:continuation} is impossible unless you find some way to bridge the gap to the other side of the cliff. The tree seems long enough to reach to the other side, but how are you going to chop it down?",
