{
            "mnemonic": "If you put a {tooltip:Radical:thread} in the middle of a {tooltip:Radical:kiss}, you\u2019re going to {tooltip:Kanji:entangle} it. Things can get pretty messy in a kiss, so adding a thread to the mix will definitely entangle it.",
            "hints": "Imagine trying to kiss someone with a piece of thread between your lips. Feel the thread getting all entangled between the two of you as you lock lips. It\u2019s really detracting from the experience.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Entangle",
                "Alternatives": "Coil Around, Entwine"
            },
