                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture yourself being tied to someone by the tongue with thread. You can\u2019t escape, and you can\u2019t believe your bad luck. Feel the thread tugging on your tongue as you try to get yourself untangled.",
                "mnemonic": "This is your first kiss ever so getting a thread to {tooltip:Kanji:entangle} between your lips was really bad {tooltip:Reading:luck} ({span:lang=ja:\u3089\u304f}). The person you were trying to kiss got really grossed out by the thread and tried to push you away but was so entangled with the thread that they were unable. Bad luck indeed."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Is there a {tooltip:Radical:reason} you're in the {tooltip:Radical:bamboo} grove? Why yes there is. It's so you can get yourself some bamboo and make a {tooltip:Kanji:flute} out of it.",
