                "mnemonic": "While you\u2019re holding up an {tooltip:Kanji:insect} to the sun for comparison, a flock of {tooltip:Reading:con}dors ({span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3093}) flies by, blocking out the sun. There are so many condors that they manage to totally block out sun."
            }
