{
            "mnemonic": "\u201cDon\u2019t {tooltip:Radical:loiter} \u2013 {tooltip:Radical:run}, {tooltip:Kanji:Junior}!\u201d said Indiana Jones Senior to Indiana Jones Junior. They\u2019re escaping from a sticky situation and Junior was just loitering around like a fool. It\u2019s no time to loiter, it\u2019s time to run!",
            "hints": "Imagine Sean Connery saying \u201cDon\u2019t loiter \u2013 run, Junior!\u201d and you should have a much easier time remembering this phrase if you remember it in his voice.",
            "meanings": {
