                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine that you are Indiana Jones Junior and this is happening to you. Feel the terrible pain of your throbbing toe as you clutch it, with the bad guys catching up with you.",
                "mnemonic": "Deciding not to loiter any longer, Indiana Jones {tooltip:Kanji:Junior} takes his dad\u2019s advice and starts to run. Unfortunately he wasn\u2019t paying attention to where his feet were and he stubbed his {tooltip:Reading:to}e ({span:lang=ja:\u3068}) on a jagged rock. His toe is in so much pain that he can\u2019t bear to run any longer."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You jumped off your {tooltip:Radical:roof} for some {tooltip:Radical:reason} and now you're floating in {tooltip:Kanji:midair}! You kick your legs a bit and move your arms like you're in water, but you're still just stuck there in midair.",
