{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Compare} the {tooltip:Radical:sun} with a {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} \u2013 these two things don\u2019t {tooltip:Kanji:mix}. If a tsunami is coming, it will likely get in the way of the sun.",
            "hints": "Imagine the sun getting blocked out as a tsunami rises up from the ocean. Feel the cold fear of death on you as the tsunami approaches. That tsunami is gonna mix you up.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Mix"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3053\u3093",
