                "mnemonic": "Why isn't it dry in {tooltip:Kanji:outer space}, you ask? Because of all the {tooltip:Reading:u}ni ({span:lang=ja:\u3046}) swimming around up there. They have nasty, wet, pointy spikes and they're all over the place."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "What you {tooltip:Radical:say} to the {tooltip:Radical:director} is judged immediately. You're having trouble understanding this {tooltip:Kanji:part of speech}, so he's trying to help you. But you say it over and over and he keeps saying you're wrong.",
            "hints": "\"Is it an adjective?\"\n{linebreak}\"No, that's the wrong part of speech.\"\n{linebreak}\"Is it a verb?\"\n{linebreak}\"N-no! Of course not!\"",
