{
            "mnemonic": "It's important to focus {tooltip:Radical:oneself} in {tooltip:Radical:winter} so that one can emerge {tooltip:Kanji:renew}ed! You can't really go outside in winter without getting cold or sick, so spend winter focusing on YOU.",
            "hints": "Imagine sitting in your house all winter, meditating and thinking about how you can renew yourself.",
