{
            "mnemonic": "If you stab somebody in the {tooltip:Radical:tongue} with an {tooltip:Radical:umbrella}, it\u2019s sure to start a {tooltip:Kanji:riot}. Nobody likes to get stabbed in the tongue with an umbrella, so they\u2019re probably going to retaliate, and before you know it, you\u2019ve a full scale riot on your hands. Look what you\u2019ve done.",
            "hints": "Imagine yourself getting stabbed in the tongue with an umbrella. It\u2019s very painful. Taste the blood and metal in your mouth as this happens to you.",
            "meanings": {
