{
            "mnemonic": "On the bottom of {tooltip:Radical:bamboo} {tooltip:Radical:root}s there is a {tooltip:Radical:stamp} that tells the {tooltip:Kanji:season} in which it was cut. We've been putting these season stamps on bamboo, and later pretty much every perishable food, for a long, long time.",
