{
            "mnemonic": "When the {tooltip:Radical:sun} gets {tooltip:Radical:together} with {tooltip:Radical:water}, only {tooltip:Kanji:violence} can ensue. They don\u2019t mix well together. The sun loves to fight water and water loves to fight the sun. Lots and lots of violence.",
            "hints": "Picture this violent fight scene in your brain. Imagine water locked in battle with the sun as the sun\u2019s fire flares up and the water starts to sizzle.",
            "meanings": {
