                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine the sun and the water trying to bowl. Hear the sound of bowling balls rolling down the lane and pins rattling around and crashing together.",
                "mnemonic": "But after a while, the sun and the water have had enough of {tooltip:Kanji:violence}. They decide to settle their differences with a friendly game of {tooltip:Reading:bow}ling ({span:lang=ja:\u307c\u3046}). Bowling is a great way to relieve stress and in the end, they bond over it."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Give {tooltip:Radical:shellfish} to a {tooltip:Radical:genius} and they'll have no problem accumulating {tooltip:Kanji:wealth}. Geniuses can make loads of money out of pretty much anything, so shellfish are like easy-mode.",
