{
            "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Kanji:acquire} {tooltip:Kanji:theory} after theory. In doing this, you have a lot of theories in your head. You use all these theories as tools for {tooltip:Vocabulary:persuasion}. These theories will allow you to {tooltip:Vocabulary:convince} anyone of anything.",
