                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: You need {tooltip:Vocabulary:to acquire} an {tooltip:Reading:e}lephant ({span:lang=ja:\u3048}) for your elephant collection. If you don't acquire an elephant, you'll look like an idiot in front of your elephant collecting friends.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u5168\u3066\u3092\u5931\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u304c\u3001\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u3068\u3044\u3046\u89aa\u53cb\u3092\u5f97\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Although Koichi lost everything, he was able to gain a best friend in Viet."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eba\u306e\u4fe1\u3089\u3044\u3092\u5f97\u308b\u306e\u306f\u5bb9\u6613\u306a\u3053\u3068\u3067\u306f\u306a\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "It's not easy to obtain one's trust."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u65e5\u672c\u3067\u82f1\u8a9e\u3092\u6559\u3048\u308b\u3068\u3044\u3046\u7d4c\u9a13\u304b\u3089\u3001\u305f\u304f\u3055\u3093\u306e\u3053\u3068\u304c\u5f97\u3089\u308c\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
