                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: You're about {tooltip:Vocabulary:to rage} all over the place. You're going nuts. You're going {tooltip:Vocabulary:to act violently}. Then, a calm wizard steps in front of you and mutters \"{tooltip:Reading:aba}ra kadabara,\" ({span:lang=ja:\u3042\u3070}) causing you to calm down immediately.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u306e\u5e97\u54e1\u306b\u3001\u4e00\u4e07\u5186\u672d\u3092\u7d30\u304b\u304f\u3057\u3066\u304f\u308c\u308b\u3088\u3046\u305f\u306e\u3093\u3060\u3089\u3001\u6025\u306b\u66b4\u308c\u51fa\u3057\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "All I did was ask the store employee to break my 10,000 bill and he suddenly freaked out at me."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d5\u30b0\u304c\u304a\u3053\u3063\u3066\u66b4\u308c\u305f\u306e\u306f\u4e00\u5ea6\u3057\u304b\u898b\u305f\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002",
                    "en": "I've only seen Fugu get that angry and act violently once."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u306f\u9154\u3063\u3066\u66b4\u308c\u305f\u304c\u3001\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u304c\u306a\u3093\u3068\u304b\u843d\u3061\u7740\u304b\u305b\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Viet got drunk and disorderly, but Koichi managed to calm him down."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

