                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: Your status is {tooltip:Vocabulary:to be decreased} amongst the eyes of the Gods. They decide your punishment is to be decreased into {tooltip:Reading:hell} ({span:lang=ja:\u3078\u308b}) where you will live the rest of your days.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5341\u65e5\u3067\u4f53\u91cd\u304c\u30cb\u30ad\u30ed\u6e1b\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "My weight decreased by two kilos in ten days."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4eca\u6708\u306f\u3001\u30ef\u30cb\u30ab\u30cb\u306e\u58f2\u308a\u4e0a\u3052\u304c\u3001\u4e94\u30d1\u30fc\u30bb\u30f3\u30c8\u3082\u6e1b\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "WaniKani sales decreased by 5% this month."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3044\u3064\u3082\u53f3\u306e\u9774\u306e\u8e35\u304c\u5de6\u3088\u308a\u3082\u901f\u304f\u64e6\u308a\u6e1b\u308b\u3093\u3060\u3002",
