                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "30362-subject-4166.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}When everything is in disorder it's finally your chance! You run to the bar, break the windows, and grab all the {tooltip:Reading:mead} ({span:lang=ja:\u307f\u3060}) you can carry.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6700\u8fd1\u3001\u6821\u98a8\u304c\u4e71\u308c\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "School morals are in disarray these days."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u793e\u54e1\u306f\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306e\u524d\u3067\u4e00\u7cf8\u4e71\u308c\u306c\u304a\u3069\u308a\u3092\u3072\u308d\u3046\u3057\u306a\u3051\u308c\u3070\u306a\u3089\u306a\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "The Tofugu employees must perform a dance without getting disheveled in front of Koichi."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b5\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u3068\u96e2\u5a5a\u3057\u305f\u5f8c\u3001\u30d5\u30b0\u306f\u751f\u6d3b\u304c\u4e71\u308c\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "After his divorce from Salmon, Fugu's life was in disarray."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

