                        "file": "21045-subject-4217.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: Look at this {tooltip:Reading:cooler} ({span:lang=ja:\u304f\u3089}). Now look at this other cooler. We need {tooltip:Vocabulary:to  compare} the two coolers. Think about all the features each one has and really compare, like you have a list or something.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u53bb\u5e74\u3068\u6bd4\u3079\u3066\u30ef\u30cb\u30ab\u30cb\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u30fc\u306e\u6570\u304c\u6e1b\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002\u3069\u3046\u3057\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\uff1f",
                    "en": "The number of WaniKani users is lower compared to last year. What should we do?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306e\u3064\u3081\u306e\u3042\u304b\u304c\u5165\u3063\u305f\u304a\u8336\u3068\u9f3b\u304f\u305d\u304c\u5165\u3063\u305f\u304a\u8336\u3092\u98f2\u307f\u6bd4\u3079\u3066\u611f\u60f3\u3092\u8a00\u3063\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Compare this tea that has Koichi's nail dirt to the one with Koichi's boogers and tell me your impressions, please."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e3b\u4eba\u3068\u79c1\u306f\u3001\u79c1\u9054\u306e\u53cc\u5b50\u3092\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3060\u3051\u6bd4\u3079\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306b\u306f\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308a\u96e3\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "My husband and I have been trying not to compare our twins with each other, but it\u2019s difficult."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
