                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: {tooltip:Reading:Two du}des ({span:lang=ja:\u3064\u3065}) get {tooltip:Vocabulary:to continue} on. I'm afraid you two ladies are going to have to stay here. This is a dudes only night club.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u4e94\u65e5\u3082\u96e8\u304c\u7d9a\u3044\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "It's been raining for five consecutive days."
