                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use one of the kun'yomi readings. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you:\n{splitParent}The best way {tooltip:Vocabulary:to memorize} and {tooltip:Vocabulary:to remember} something is to make up a song and play it on your {tooltip:Reading:oboe} ({span:lang=ja:\u304a\u307c}). Something about playing it makes it so you can memorize anything. You're so talented.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3088\u304f\u305d\u3093\u306a\u306b\u7d30\u304b\u3044\u4e8b\u3092\u899a\u3048\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "How can you remember these kinds of details?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30ef\u30cb\u30ab\u30cb\u3092\u4f7f\u3048\u3070\u3001\u6f22\u5b57\u3092\u899a\u3048\u308b\u306e\u306f\u5bb9\u6613\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "It\u2019s easy to memorize kanji, if you use WaniKani."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5341\u5e74\u524d\u3001\u304a\u524d\u304c\u4ffa\u306b\u6bba\u4eba\u306e\u5bb9\u7591\u3092\u304b\u3051\u305f\u3053\u3068\u306f\u3001\u4eca\u3067\u3082\u899a\u3048\u3066\u3044\u308b\u305e\u3002",
                    "en": "I still remember that you suspected me of murder ten years ago."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:mix} so the verb vocab version is {tooltip:Vocabulary:to mix something}, .{tooltip:Vocabulary:to stir something}, or {tooltip:Vocabulary:to blend something}. This is when you're doing the mixing. You can remember this because \"{tooltip:Reading:there} ({span:lang=ja:\u305c\u308b}) is much mixing to be done so it's best if you just do it because nobody else will.\"",
