                        "file": "30370-subject-4220.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: You're doing mixing like your {tooltip:Reading:ma} ({span:lang=ja:\u307e}) taught you, which is why when you do the mixing things get done around here a lot faster.\n{splitParent}You can also use the level 5 vocab {span:lang=ja:\u4ea4\u305c\u308b} to help you remember as it has the same meaning and reading!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6df7\u305c\u308b\u306a\u5371\u967a\uff01",
                    "en": "Don't mix it. It's dangerous!"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30c8\u30f3\u30ab\u30c4\u30bd\u30fc\u30b9\u3068\u30de\u30e8\u30cd\u30fc\u30ba\u3092\u6df7\u305c\u305f\u3089\u6700\u5f37\u306b\u7f8e\u5473\u3057\u3044\u3088\uff01",
                    "en": "It's incredibly tasty when you mix tonkatsu sauce with mayonnaise."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u306d\u3047\u3001\u6c17\u3092\u3064\u3051\u305f\u65b9\u304c\u3044\u3044\u3088\u3002\u3042\u306e\u7537\u304c\u3055\u3063\u304d\u3042\u3093\u305f\u306e\u98f2\u307f\u7269\u306b\u4f55\u304b\u6df7\u305c\u3066\u305f\u306e\u3092\u898b\u305f\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "Hey, you should watch out, I saw that guy mix something into your drink."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

