                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Uses the same reading that you learned with the kanji. Go ahead and use your {tooltip:Vocabulary:tongue} and say the reading out loud... \"{span:lang=ja:\u3057\u305f}.\"\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u820c\u306e\u3057\u3073\u308c\u306f\u3082\u3046\u53d6\u308c\u307e\u3057\u305f\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Is the numbness in your tongue gone yet?"
