                "hints": "\"Ron? Ron, what's your theory? What's your theory, Ron?\" Hermione asks over and over. But you freeze. You don't remember who you are. \"Hermione, I have a theory that I was just a person learning Japanese, and not a magical boy at all.\" \"Shut up Ron, that's a stupid theory,\" she replies.",
