{
            "mnemonic": "Hanging off the edge of a {tooltip:Radical:cliff} is a {tooltip:Radical:sun} worshipping {tooltip:Radical:child} with a {tooltip:Kanji:thick} unibrow. Hanging off the cliff, the child cries at the sun for cursing him to this cruel fate. Even the thickness of his unibrow is not enough to give the child the strength to pull himself back up.",
