                "mnemonic": "The child's {tooltip:Kanji:thick} unibrow can't wait any longer and gives up. It hops off the child's face and says, \"Hey dude, I'll be {tooltip:Reading:at Sue's} ({span:lang=ja:\u3042\u3064}). She'll appreciate my thick, luxuriousness more than a weakling like you."
