                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is the two kun'yomi vocab readings combined. So, {span:lang=ja:\u7a74} and {span:lang=ja:\u5b50} to combine make {span:lang=ja:\u3042\u306a\u3054}. Just watch out for rendaku, which changes the reading of {span:lang=ja:\u5b50} from {span:lang=ja:\u3053} to {span:lang=ja:\u3054}.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u7a74\u5b50\u304c\u6e1b\u3063\u3066\u304d\u305f\u304b\u3089\u3001\u305d\u308d\u305d\u308d\u6ce8\u6587\u3057\u306a\u3044\u3068\u3044\u3051\u306a\u3044\u306a\u3002",
