                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: It's awfully difficult to load a cow into your {tooltip:Reading:Moo-zooka} ({span:lang=ja:\u3080\u305a\u304b}). Click. Boom!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u306e\u304b\u3093\u8005\u306f\u3001\u96e3\u3057\u3044\u624b\u8853\u306e\u5f8c\u306e\u3068\u3046\u3052\u3092\u3053\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "The patient has turned the corner after a difficult surgery."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u307f\u305e\u3092\u98db\u3093\u3067\u308f\u305f\u308b\u306e\u306f\u96e3\u3057\u3044\u3068\u601d\u3046\u3093\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "I think it would be difficult to leap across this ditch."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u3053\u308c\u306f\u3069\u3046\u3059\u308c\u3070\u3044\u3044\u306e\uff1f\u300d\u300c\u30ed\u30b1\u30c3\u30c8\u79d1\u5b66\u307f\u305f\u3044\u306b\u96e3\u3057\u3044\u3082\u306e\u3058\u3083\u3042\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3002\u8cb8\u3057\u3066\u3002\u3084\u3063\u3066\u307f\u305b\u3066\u3042\u3052\u308b\u3088\u3002\u300d",
                    "en": "\"How do I do this?\" \"It\u2019s not as hard as rocket science. Give me that. Let me show you.\""
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This is the noun form of {tooltip:Kanji:disaster}, so it means {tooltip:Vocabulary:disaster} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:misfortune}.",
