                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "21402-subject-4298.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}When a {tooltip:Vocabulary:disaster} strikes, you start moaning and groaning. Say it along with me: \"{tooltip:Reading:Wahhhhh! Zaahhhh! Waahhhh!}\" ({span:lang=ja:\u308f\u3056\u308f}). Be careful of the {span:lang=ja:\u3044} on the end, it can be tricky and make you think it's an adjective when it's a noun.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u308c\u306f\u3001\u707d\u3044\u3092\u9632\u3044\u3067\u304f\u308c\u308b\u304a\u5b88\u308a\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "This is a lucky charm that protects you from misfortune."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u707d\u3044\u8ee2\u3058\u3066\u798f\u3068\u306a\u3059\u3068\u3044\u3046\u8a00\u8449\u3092\u4fe1\u3058\u3066\u304c\u3093\u3070\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I believed in the phrase, \"turn disaster into advantage,\" and it really worked."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b7\u30e3\u30fc\u30af\u306f\u4ed6\u4eba\u306e\u707d\u3044\u3092\u9858\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3088\u3046\u3060\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "It seems like Shark wishes misfortune upon other people."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Kanji:dislike} someone so {tooltip:Kanji:bad}ly that it turns to {tooltip:Vocabulary:disgust} and {tooltip:Vocabulary:hate}.",
