                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "21329-subject-4114.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings are the individual vocab words (you can tell because there's a bit of hiragana stuck on there). It's the reading for {span:lang=ja:\u76bf} and {span:lang=ja:\u6d17\u3046} combined.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u76bf\u6d17\u3044\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u30af\u30ea\u30b9\u30c6\u30f3\u304c\u53ef\u611b\u3059\u304e\u3066\u3001\u7a74\u304c\u3042\u304f\u307b\u3069\u898b\u3064\u3081\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Kristen was just so cute when she was doing dishes and I couldn't help staring holes into her."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u76bf\u6d17\u3044\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u6642\u306f\u3001\u6642\u9593\u304c\u7d4c\u3064\u306e\u304c\u304a\u305d\u304f\u611f\u3058\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I feel that time passes slowly when I'm washing dishes."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u98df\u4e8b\u4ee3\u3092\u652f\u6255\u3046\u4ee3\u308f\u308a\u306b\u76bf\u6d17\u3044\u3092\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u308b\u30e9\u30fc\u30e1\u30f3\u5c4b\u3055\u3093\u304c\u65e5\u672c\u306b\u3042\u308b\u3063\u3066\u672c\u5f53\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "Is it true that there is a ramen restaurant in Japan where you can wash dishes to pay your bill?"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The kanji and the word are exactly the same. That means they share meanings as well. The vocab has the added meanings of {tooltip:Vocabulary:eww}, {tooltip:Vocabulary:gross}, and even {tooltip:Vocabulary:reluctant}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Dislike",
                "Alternatives": "Eww, Gross, Reluctant",
                "Word Type": "noun, \u306a adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3044\u3084"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3044\u3084",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "30718-subject-4283.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3044\u3084",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "21134-subject-4283.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for this word is pretty weird. It's different than the {span:lang=ja:\u5acc\u3044} word you will see in this level too. It is {span:lang=ja:\u3044\u3084}, so when you think of something you dislike, just think \"{tooltip:Reading:iyah}, I dislike it.\" Also, think about that {tooltip:Vocabulary:eww} feeling it gives you when you think of the thing you dislike most.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5acc\u306a\u4ed5\u4e8b\u3092\u5acc\u3005\u3059\u308b\u306e\u306f\u4f53\u306b\u826f\u304f\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "Reluctantly doing a job you don't like isn't good for your health."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5acc\u5acc\u5acc\u5acc\u5acc\uff01\u7121\u7406\u7121\u7406\u7121\u7406\u7121\u7406\u7121\u7406\uff01\u30af\u30e2\u304c\u3044\u308b\uff01\u6c17\u6301\u3061\u60aa\u3044\uff01",
                    "en": "Ewwwwwww!!!! Nooooooo!!!! There is a spider! Gross!"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u3053\u308c\u4ee5\u4e0a\u306f\u5b89\u304f\u3067\u304d\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3002\u5acc\u306a\u3089\u3084\u3081\u3066\u5e30\u3063\u3066\u304f\u308c\u3002\u300d \u300c\u5206\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3088\u3002\u8cb7\u3046\u3053\u3068\u306b\u3059\u308b\u3088\u3002\u300d",
                    "en": "\"That\u2019s my final offer. If you don\u2019t like it stop coming back.\" \"Alright, alright. I\u2019ll take it.\""
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You know that {span:lang=ja:\u5acc} means {tooltip:Kanji:dislike} and this vocab word means the same thing: {tooltip:Vocabulary:dislike} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:hate}!",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Dislike",
                "Alternatives": "Hate, Dislikable, Detestable",
                "Word Type": "noun, \u306a adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u304d\u3089\u3044"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u304d\u3089\u3044",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "30593-subject-4284.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u304d\u3089\u3044",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "20749-subject-4284.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Of all the things out there to {tooltip:Vocabulary:dislike} the thing I dislike the most is the {tooltip:Reading:killer} ({span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3089}) of people. People should never kill people.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u79c1\u306e\u5acc\u3044\u306a\u7a74\u3046\u3081\u554f\u984c\u304c\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u306b\u51fa\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "There were fill in the blank questions on the test, which I hate."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5358\u3058\u3085\u3093\u4f5c\u696d\u306f\u5acc\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002\u305d\u3093\u306a\u3082\u306e\u306f\u6a5f\u68b0\u306b\u307e\u304b\u305b\u308b\u3079\u304d\u3060\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I don't like busy work. I think we should have it done by machines."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u8272\u3005\u3068\u632f\u308a\u56de\u3057\u3066\u3054\u3081\u3093\u306a\u3055\u3044\u3002\u5acc\u306a\u3084\u3064\u3068\u601d\u3063\u3066\u308b\u304b\u3082\u3057\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3051\u3069\u3001\u5acc\u3044\u306b\u306a\u3089\u306a\u3044\u3067\u3002",
                    "en": "I\u2019m sorry to cause so many problems. You may think I\u2019m unpleasant, but please don\u2019t hate me."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Kanji:Stand}ing and {tooltip:Kanji:enter}ing are both {span:lang=ja:\u7981\u6b62} (prohibited). If you see this sign, it's essentially saying {tooltip:Vocabulary:do not enter} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:no entry}.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Do Not Enter",
                "Alternatives": "No Entry, Off-Limits",
                "Word Type": "noun, expression, \u306e adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u305f\u3061\u3044\u308a\u304d\u3093\u3057"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u305f\u3061\u3044\u308a\u304d\u3093\u3057",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "30657-subject-4312.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u305f\u3061\u3044\u308a\u304d\u3093\u3057",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "21411-subject-4312.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for {span:lang=ja:\u7acb\u5165} is a bit strange, but it might help you to know that it can also be written {span:lang=ja:\u7acb\u3061\u5165\u308a}. The {span:lang=ja:\u7acb\u3061} is the same one you learned with {span:lang=ja:\u7acb\u3061\u98f2\u307f} and the {span:lang=ja:\u5165\u308a} is the reading you learned with {span:lang=ja:\u5165\u308a\u53e3}. In our version of the word, the hiragana isn't visible (it's sort of pushed into the kanji), but the word is still pronounced the same way: {span:lang=ja:\u305f\u3061\u3044\u308a}.\n{splitParent}And {span:lang=ja:\u7981\u6b62} doesn't have any weirdness going on, so at least you have that!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u30c9\u30a2\u306b\u306f\u3001\u95a2\u4fc2\u8005\u4ee5\u5916\u7acb\u5165\u7981\u6b62\u3063\u3066\u66f8\u304b\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "This door says Authorized Personnel Only."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b9\u30fc\u30d1\u30fc\u306e\u30d0\u30c3\u30af\u30e4\u30fc\u30c9\u306f\u7acb\u5165\u7981\u6b62\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "The backroom of the grocery store is off-limits."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u305d\u308c\u306f\u5927\u80c6\u3060\u306d\uff01\u541b\u304c\u672c\u5f53\u306b\u7acb\u5165\u7981\u6b62\u3063\u3066\u66f8\u3044\u3066\u308b\u5834\u6240\u306b\u5165\u3063\u3066\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u30d9\u30f3\u3057\u305f\u306a\u3093\u3066\u4fe1\u3058\u3089\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3088\uff01",
                    "en": "That is wild! I can\u2019t believe you went into a place marked \"Do Not Enter\" and then peed in there!"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The kanji and the word are exactly the same. That means they share meanings as well.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Dream",
                "Word Type": "noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3086\u3081"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3086\u3081",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "20954-subject-4275.ogg"
                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "female",
                        "pronunciation": "\u3086\u3081",
                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "30737-subject-4275.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. When learning the kanji, you didn't learn that reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you with this word: You're having this crazy {tooltip:Vocabulary:dream}. The dream allows you to do anything you want. Every time you ask \"hey, can I do this?\" The answer is always \"{tooltip:Reading:you may}\" ({span:lang=ja:\u3086\u3081}). Think of some things you'd want to do if you could do anything. Ask permission and get this answer in your imagination.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u5922\u3092\u58f2\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u305d\u3046\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u4e00\u500b\u3044\u304f\u3089\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "I heard that you sell dreams. How much does one dream cost?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6628\u65e5\u3001\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306b\u6307\u5727\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u5922\u3092\u898b\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "Yesterday, I had a dream that Koichi was giving me a shiatsu massage."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u79c1\u306e\u5922\u306f\u6f2b\u753b\u5bb6\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059\u3002\u53f6\u3046\u3068\u3044\u3044\u306a\u3002",
                    "en": "My dream is to become a manga artist. I hope it will come true."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
