                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word, which usually means on'yomi readings from the kanji. If you know the readings of your kanji you'll know how to read this as well.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u9707\u5ea6\u306f3\u3067\u3057\u305f\u304c\u3051\u3063\u3053\u3046\u3086\u308c\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "The seismic intensity was three, but it felt quite strong."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30de\u30b0\u30cb\u30c1\u30e5\u30fc\u30c9\u3068\u9707\u5ea6\u3063\u3066\u3001\u4f55\u304c\u9055\u3046\u306e\uff1f",
                    "en": "What\u2019s the difference between magnitude and seismic scale?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "2011\u5e74\u306b\u9707\u5ea6\u4e03\u3092\u8a18\u9332\u3057\u305f\u6771\u65e5\u672c\u5927\u9707\u707d\u306e\u4f59\u9707\u306f\u3001\u4eca\u5f8c\u767e\u5e74\u7a0b\u306f\u7d9a\u304d\u3001\u5de8\u5927\u4f59\u9707\u3082\u3042\u308b\u3060\u308d\u3046\u3068\u8a00\u308f\u308c\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "They say the aftershocks from the 2011 Tohoku Earthquake hit a magnitude of seven, and that they'll continue for the next hundred years, even the big ones."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

