                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This is a jukugo word that uses the on'yomi readings of the kanji. It isn't the same as {span:lang=ja:\u6700\u5f8c} though, so watch out for that! It uses the other on'yomi reading you learned with the kanji!\n"
