                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}You didn't learn this reading with the kanji {span:lang=ja:\u5fd8}, but you did learn it with the vocabulary {span:lang=ja:\u5fd8\u308c\u308b}.  What {tooltip:Reading:was} ({span:lang=ja:\u308f\u3059}) that reading again? You can't remember! It's become a {tooltip:Vocabulary:forgotten item}!\n"
