{
            "mnemonic": "The kanji {span:lang=ja:\u9054} pluralizes things sometimes. So, when you have a {tooltip:Kanji:plural} amount of a {tooltip:Kanji:person} you have more than one person, you have {tooltip:Vocabulary:people}.",
