                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. You haven't learned this reading yet though, so here's a mnemonic to help you:\n{splitParent}You look down and you've sprouted a {tooltip:Vocabulary:tail}! You're so shocked that all you can say is \"{tooltip:Reading:Oh}. ({span:lang=ja:\u304a}) Oh okay...\" This your life now. A life with a tail.\n"
