                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \"I have a surplus of kittens from that last batch we made, Reddit. {tooltip:Reading:AMA} (ask me anything, {span:lang=ja:\u3042\u307e}).\"\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u7a74\u3065\u308a\u3067\u3064\u3063\u305f\u9b5a\u304c\u4f59\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u306e\u3067\u3001\u826f\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3089\u5c11\u3057\u3044\u304b\u304c\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "We caught more than enough fish ice fishing, so please take some if you'd like."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u304f\u3089\u3057\u3076\u308a\u304b\u3089\u3057\u3066\u3001\u3042\u306e\u592b\u59bb\u3001\u76f8\u5f53\u304a\u91d1\u304c\u4f59\u3063\u3066\u305d\u3046\u3060\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u305b\u3093\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "From the way they live, they seem to have quite an excess of money, don't you think?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u79c1\u9054\u306e\u679c\u6a39\u5712\u306b\u306f\u3042\u308a\u4f59\u308b\u307b\u3069\u306e\u6797\u6a8e\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "There is an abundance of apples in our orchard."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

