                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "20868-subject-4304.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}You go {tooltip:Vocabulary:to commit a crime}. How did it go, you think? Well, I thought it went {tooltip:Reading:oka}y ({span:lang=ja:\u304a\u304b}). Imagine yourself committing a crime and it going just okay. Not great, not bad... meh. Okay.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u308c\u304b\u3089\u6226\u6642\u4e2d\u306b\u72af\u3057\u305f\u7f6a\u3092\u544a\u767d\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I'm going to confess to the sin I committed during the war."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6cd5\u5f8b\u3092\u72af\u3057\u3066\u307e\u3067\u3059\u308b\u3088\u3046\u306a\u4e8b\u3058\u3083\u306a\u3044\u3088\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "I don't think it's worth doing if we have to break the law."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u304c\u30df\u30b9\u3092\u72af\u3059\u3053\u3068\u306a\u3069\u306a\u3044\u3002\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u306b\u4e0d\u53ef\u80fd\u306f\u7121\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "Viet is incapable of making mistakes. For Viet, nothing is impossible."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You're doing a {tooltip:Kanji:prevent}ion. When you prevent something, what are you really doing? You're trying {tooltip:Vocabulary:to defend} against something from happening. That's why this verb is a little weird and means {tooltip:Vocabulary:to defend} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:to protect against}. It can also be {tooltip:Vocabulary:to prevent}, too, but just make sure you're thinking of it more like you're defending something with your prevention.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "To Defend",
                "Alternatives": "To Protect Against, To Prevent",
                "Word Type": "transitive verb, godan verb"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
