                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "21426-subject-4334.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: You want {tooltip:Vocabulary:to defend} yourself? You should probably put out that {tooltip:Reading:fuse} ({span:lang=ja:\u3075\u305b}) attached to that giant bomb first then.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3069\u3046\u3084\u3063\u3066\u4e8b\u3053\u3092\u9632\u3050\u304b\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3001\u8b70\u8ad6\u3059\u308b\u5fc5\u8981\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "We need to discuss how to prevent accidents."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u9054\u304c\u3066\u304d\u3092\u9632\u3044\u3067\u3044\u308b\u9593\u306b\u3001\u30af\u30ea\u30b9\u30c6\u30f3\u306f\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u738b\u5b50\u3092\u65e5\u672c\u3078\u306b\u304c\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "While Viet and the others were defending themselves against the enemy, Kristen had Prince Koichi escape to Japan."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u30c0\u30a6\u30f3\u30b8\u30e3\u30b1\u30c3\u30c8\u306f\u3001\u5bd2\u3055\u3092\u3068\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3088\u304f\u9632\u3044\u3067\u304f\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "This down jacket will really protect you from the cold."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

