                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}When you try {tooltip:Vocabulary:to fly}, the main thing holding you back is your {tooltip:Reading:toe} ({span:lang=ja:\u3068}). It's like forty pounds and holds you down.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u516c\u5712\u306b\u3064\u304f\u3068\u3001\u305f\u304f\u3055\u3093\u306e\u30b7\u30e3\u30dc\u30f3\u7389\u304c\u7a7a\u3092\u98db\u3093\u3067\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "When we arrived at a park, there were a lot of bubbles floating in the air."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u3042\u898b\u3048\u3066\u3001\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u3059\u3054\u304f\u9ad8\u304f\u98db\u3076\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3093\u3060\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi may not look like he is able to do something like that, but he can actually jump very high."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "Tofugu\u306e\u6700\u65b0\u306eE\u30d6\u30c3\u30af\u306f\u3001\u98db\u3076\u3088\u3046\u306b\u58f2\u308c\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "Tofugu\u2019s latest e-book is flying off the shelves."
                }
