                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: You use the power of the {tooltip:Reading:Tao} ({span:lang=ja:\u305f\u304a}) to do all of your knocking down. Imagine yourself contemplating Tao philosophy, then using those pleasant thoughts to knock everything over around you. BLAM!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u7a74\u3058\u3083\u304f\u5b50\u3001\u5012\u3057\u305f\u306e\u3060\u308c\uff1f",
                    "en": "Who knocked over the perforated ladle?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u3044\u3064\u306e\u4e8b\u306f\u304a\u308c\u304c\u5012\u3057\u3066\u307f\u305b\u308b\u304b\u3089\u3001\u4f59\u8a08\u306a\u5fc3\u914d\u306f\u3059\u308b\u306a\u3002",
                    "en": "I'm gonna bring him down, so don't worry too much."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u65e5\u66dc\u65e5\u3001\u50d5\u306f\u7236\u3068\u4e00\u7dd2\u306b\u6728\u3092\u4f55\u672c\u304b\u5207\u308a\u5012\u3057\u305f\u5f8c\u3001\u305d\u308c\u3092\u53e9\u304d\u5207\u3063\u3066\u85aa\u306b\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "My dad and I knocked down some trees and chopped them up for logs this Sunday."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

