                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: \n{splitParent}You try {tooltip:Vocabulary:to obstruct} a woman coming your way (see kanji). As she gets close, she roars, \"I am {tooltip:Reading:Sama(n)tha}!\" ({span:lang=ja:\u3055\u307e\u305f}) You shall let me pass!\" You don't argue with Samanthas. Get out of her way! \n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u306e\u4f1a\u793e\u306f\u3001\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u306e\u6210\u529f\u3092\u59a8\u3052\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3089\u3057\u3044\u3002",
                    "en": "I heard that company is trying to hamper Tofugu's success."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u751f\u7523\u6027\u3092\u59a8\u3052\u308b\u3082\u306e\u306f\u3001\u3059\u3066\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u65b9\u304c\u3044\u3044\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "You should get rid of things that obstruct productivity."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u4eba\u3005\u306f\u5b87\u5b99\u4eba\u304c\u5730\u7403\u306b\u3084\u3063\u3066\u304f\u308b\u4e8b\u3092\u59a8\u3052\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3059\u308b\u306e\u304b\u7406\u89e3\u3067\u304d\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002",
