                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: What do you say to time as it begins {tooltip:Vocabulary:to pass} you by? \"{tooltip:Reading:Ta} ta ({span:lang=ja:\u305f}), Time!\"\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6642\u9593\u304c\u7d4c\u3064\u306e\u3092\u5fd8\u308c\u3066\u3001\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u306b\u5922\u4e2d\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "I was so into the game I didn't notice the time pass."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30c8\u30fc\u30d5\u30b0\u304c\u3067\u304d\u3066\u304b\u3089\u3001\u3082\u3046\u4f55\u5e74\u7d4c\u3061\u307e\u3057\u305f\u304b\uff1f",
                    "en": "How many years have passed since Tofugu started?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u300c\u3042\u3044\u3064\u3089\u3001\u5e78\u305b\u306a\u7d50\u5a5a\u751f\u6d3b\u3092\u9001\u308c\u308b\u3068\u601d\u3046\uff1f\u300d\u300c\u6642\u9593\u304c\u7d4c\u3066\u3070\u308f\u304b\u308b\u3088\u3002\u300d",
                    "en": "\"Do you think they will have a happy marriage?\" \"Time will tell.\""
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:incur} so you'd think this would mean \"to incur,\" but it doesn't. This is {tooltip:Vocabulary:to put a hat on}. Yep, it's the verb that's made for putting on hats. So, think of it this way. You \"{tooltip:Kanji:incur}\" a hat when you go {tooltip:Vocabulary:to put on a hat}. Pretty weird but you'll get it if you put on your thinking cap.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "To Put On A Hat",
                "Alternatives": "To Put On, To Wear A Hat, To Wear, To Put A Hat On",
                "Word Type": "transitive verb, godan verb"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
