                    },
                    {
                        "gender": "male",
                        "pronunciation": "\u304b\u3076\u308b",
                        "voiceActorId": 2,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "21396-subject-4278.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word consists of a kanji with hiragana attached, you can bet that it will use the kun'yomi reading. You didn't learn that reading with this kanji, so here's a mnemonic to help you: The hat that you put on is none other than a hat made from a bear {tooltip:Reading:cub} ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u3076}). The mother bear comes for you and takes it back the hard way.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u590f\u306f\u5916\u306b\u51fa\u308b\u6642\u306f\u307c\u3046\u3057\u3092\u88ab\u3089\u306a\u304f\u3061\u3083\u3002",
                    "en": "We should put hats on when we go out in summer."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3042\u305d\u3053\u3067\u30b3\u30ca\u30f3\u306e\u304a\u9762\u3092\u88ab\u3063\u3066\u7121\u3058\u3083\u6c17\u306b\u3042\u305d\u3093\u3067\u3044\u308b\u306e\u304c\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u3067\u3001\u305d\u306e\u3068\u306a\u308a\u3067\u3084\u3055\u3057\u304f\u898b\u5b88\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u306e\u304c\u30d3\u30a8\u30c8\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "The one with the Konan mask who is playing innocently is Koichi, and the other one next to him who is carefully watching over Koichi is Viet."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5927\u962a\u3067\u96e8\u306e\u65e5\u306b\u3001\u4e2d\u5e74\u306e\u304a\u3070\u3055\u3093\u304c\u30d3\u30cb\u30fc\u30eb\u888b\u3092\u88ab\u308a\u306a\u304c\u3089\u81ea\u8ee2\u8eca\u306b\u4e57\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u306e\u3092\u898b\u305f\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "On a rainy day in Osaka, I saw a middle aged woman wearing a plastic bag on her head while riding a bicycle."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
