                    "en": "I never once thought they'd given me troublesome tasks."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u308a\u3083\u307e\u305f\u9762\u5012\u306a\u4ed5\u4e8b\u3092\u5f15\u304d\u53d7\u3051\u305f\u3082\u3093\u3060\u306d\u3002",
                    "en": "You've taken on such a difficult job!"
