                        "voiceActorName": "Kenichi",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "21394-subject-4279.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Since this word is made up of a single kanji, it should use the kun'yomi reading. When learning the kanji, you didn't learn that reading, so here's a mnemonic to help you with this word: Your {tooltip:Kanji:wife} does everything for you. She feeds you, she bathes you, she cleans up after you and even wipes your butt when you poop. Really, she is doing {tooltip:Reading:too mu}ch ({span:lang=ja:\u3064\u307e}), and you should stop being a baby.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u59bb\u306e\u305f\u3093\u751f\u65e5\u306b\u3001\u6c34\u4e0a\u98db\u884c\u6a5f\u3092\u30d7\u30ec\u30bc\u30f3\u30c8\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "For my wife's birthday, I got her a seaplane."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u59bb\u304c\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306e\u30b3\u30f3\u30b5\u30fc\u30c8\u306b\u884c\u3063\u3066\u304d\u305f\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u6700\u5f8c\u5c3e\u306e\u5e2d\u3060\u3063\u305f\u3051\u3069\u3001\u3059\u3054\u304f\u826f\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3068\u8a00\u3063\u3066\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "My wife went to Koichi's concert and she said it was fantastic, though her seat was in the last row."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5143\u59bb\u304c\u3001\u300c\u79c1\u307f\u305f\u3044\u306a\u5973\u306b\u306f\u3082\u3046\u5de1\u308a\u5408\u308f\u306a\u3044\u308f\u3088\u300d\u3068\u304b\u8a00\u3046\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3055\u2026\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3046\u304b\u3001\u305d\u308c\u304c\u4ffa\u306e\u8a08\u753b\u306a\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3051\u3069\u3001\u307f\u305f\u3044\u306a\uff1f",
                    "en": "My ex-wife says, \"You\u2019ll never find someone like me.\" Well exactly! That\u2019s the plan!"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
