            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5bb6\u3067\u306f\u59bb\u5b50\u304c\u304a\u306a\u304b\u3092\u3059\u3089\u305b\u3066\u5f85\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "My hungry wife and children are waiting for me at home."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u59bb\u5b50\u3042\u308b\u8eab\u306a\u306e\u306b\u6bce\u6669\u884c\u304d\u3064\u3051\u306e\u30db\u30b9\u30c6\u30b9\u306e\u3068\u3053\u308d\u306b\u901a\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3093\u3060\u3088\u3002\u3072\u3069\u3044\u3068\u601d\u308f\u306a\u3044\uff1f",
                    "en": "Even though Koichi has a wife and kids, he visits his favorite hostess every night. Don't you think he's terrible?"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u652f\u5e97\u306b\u8ee2\u52e4\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3001\u3084\u308b\u6c17\u6e80\u3005\u3060\u3088\u301c\u3002\u30a4\u30a4\u7537\u63a2\u3057\u3092\u65e5\u8ab2\u306b\u9811\u5f35\u3063\u3066\u307e\u3059\u3002\u59bb\u5b50\u6301\u3061\u3060\u308d\u3046\u304c\u95a2\u4fc2\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3093\u306d\u3002\u7b11",
                    "en": "Now that I\u2019ve been transferred to the new branch store, I\u2019m feeling really motivated. Working hard to find a good man has become one of my daily routines. I don\u2019t care whether he has a wife and kids, you know? lol"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This is {tooltip:Kanji:not} what you {tooltip:Kanji:thought} would happen during your {tooltip:Kanji:deliberation}. You thought it would be very normal. Instead, it's the opposite. It's full of {tooltip:Vocabulary:wonder} and {tooltip:Vocabulary:mystery}. It's {tooltip:Vocabulary:marvelous}",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Wonder",
                "Alternatives": "Mystery, Marvelous",
                "Word Type": "noun, \u306a adjective"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
