{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:life} of a {tooltip:Radical:shellfish} is filled with {tooltip:Kanji:blame}. They take the blame for everything from food poisoning and allergies, to cutting people's feet on beaches.",
            "hints": "Just imagine an innocent little shellfish, living its quiet little life, while everyone's heaping blame on it. It hides in its little shell and tries to deflect all that blame. What a life!",
            "meanings": {
