                "mnemonic": "You're trying to {tooltip:Kanji:conserve} your eyes, when the {tooltip:Reading:Shou}gun ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3087\u3046}) marches by. He stops, sees you, and demands you give him your remaining eyes! But sir, I'm conserving what little I have left!"
