{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Cows}, using nothing more than {tooltip:Radical:towels} and {tooltip:Radical:knifes}, have taken {tooltip:Kanji:control} of the world. Their {tooltip:Kanji:system} of control is brutal\u2014payback for how us humans have treated them I guess.",
            "hints": "Imagine this new cow-controlled world\u2014there are cows on every street corner, armed with towels and knives, intimidating all us humans into following their system. ",
