                "mnemonic": "You\u2019re the village {tooltip:Reading:nin}compoop ({span:lang=ja:\u306b\u3093}), but the king and the leader still have a {tooltip:Kanji:duty} to protect you. Even a nincompoop is important to the kings and leaders of the world."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:life} {tooltip:Radical:thread} is an {tooltip:Kanji:element} essential to all living things. This thread of life joins all things together, providing an essential relationship between all life. This element is all that holds this world together.",
            "hints": "Visualize this element of life, interconnecting all living things. Without it, everything would fall apart and into chaos.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Element"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
