                "hints": "Imagine yourself all teched out like the techie you are. Hear the beeps and boops of all the technology you have at your disposal as you search for more mohawk enemies.",
                "mnemonic": "You\u2019re kind of a {tooltip:Reading:techie} ({span:lang=ja:\u3066\u304d}), so you have an advantage over your {tooltip:Kanji:enemy}. You\u2019re armed with night vision goggles and other cool tech gear as well. Being a techie certainly has its advantages."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Horns} grow on the {tooltip:Radical:king} that will be {tooltip:Radical:next} because they're full of {tooltip:Kanji:envy} and {tooltip:Kanji:jealousy} for the present king.",
            "hints": "Picture the person next up for king. They have to sit in a chair behind the current king, and as they glare in front of them with envy, horns start to sprout out of their head.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Envy",
                "Alternative": "Jealousy"
