                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Feel indifferent about this hill of horns on top of the mountain. It's all in your head anyways.",
                "mnemonic": "How was standing atop this hill of horns on top of a mountain to touch the sky? Eh. It was {tooltip:Reading:oka}y ({span:lang=ja:\u304a\u304b}), but that's about it."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:dirt} {tooltip:Radical:mask} is a mask which, when put on, will greatly {tooltip:Kanji:increase} the amount of dirt.",
            "hints": "Imagine putting it on, and suddenly the dirt around you increases by quite a bit.",
