                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "\"THIS IS NOT RIGHTEOUSNESS!\" you yell, just before the guillotine comes down on your neck.",
                "mnemonic": "Such {tooltip:Kanji:righteousness}! Well, at least according to the king who thinks he's being righteous. His version of righteousness is to send anyone who disagrees with him to the {tooltip:Reading:gui}llotine ({span:lang=ja:\u304e})."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Under the {tooltip:Radical:tree} lies a {tooltip:Radical:turkey} with a broken {tooltip:Radical:arrow} in it. It doesn't have {tooltip:Kanji:rights} like humans, so people can just shoot turkeys with arrows and no one is punished.",
            "hints": "Imagine if humans didn't have any rights, like this turkey. People could just gun each other down in the street and no one would be punished for it... oh wait. :/",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Rights"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3051\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "He jumps down and picks the turkey up, the broken arrow sticking out of its neck. \"Turkeys do not have rights, my friend. Just let this one go.\"",
                "mnemonic": "\"You have {tooltip:Kanji:rights}, so I won't shoot you like this turkey,\" says the voice of {tooltip:Reading:Ken} ({span:lang=ja:\u3051\u3093}) the samurai, from above you in the tree."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} is coming for the {tooltip:Radical:cliff} made of {tooltip:Radical:tofu}, but there is a special {tooltip:Kanji:sect} that protects tofu cliff.",
            "hints": "This sect of the tofu-lovers club takes their duties very seriously and they must protect this tofu cliff at all costs.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Sect",
                "Alternative": "Faction"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u306f",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Oh, do you want to be a member of the tofu sect? HA! Don't make me laugh. If you ask to be a member of a sect, you'll never get in.{splitParent}Never ask for a sect.",
                "mnemonic": "All of the members of the {tooltip:Kanji:sect} are standing on the cliff, their hands raised, and right as the tsunami is about to collide with them, they shout, \"{tooltip:Reading:Ha} ({span:lang=ja:\u306f})!\" and it's repelled! The tsunami sinks and rolls back out to sea, the tofu cliff is safe!"
