{
            "mnemonic": "You use a special {tooltip:Radical:spear} in {tooltip:Radical:winter} to give yourself the {tooltip:Radical:power} to do all of your {tooltip:Kanji:task}s.",
            "hints": "It's hard to get a task done in winter. That's why you have this spear to power and motivate you.",
