            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:guard} is at your door and wants some of your {tooltip:Radical:grain}s. This is the {tooltip:Kanji:tax} you pay for living in this town. Back in the day, grains were used like currency, so it makes sense that there was a grain tax in the olden days.",
