{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Angle} your {tooltip:Radical:sword} correctly at a {tooltip:Radical:cow} to {tooltip:Kanji:untie} it without hurting it. This is actually a pretty tough angle to get your sword, so in order to {tooltip:Kanji:solve} this cow puzzle you have to be really smart and careful.",
            "hints": "Picture the cow looking up at you with her big, brown eyes. She doesn't want to be tied here anymore, so you have to solve this and untie her.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Untie",
                "Alternative": "Solve"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304b\u3044",
