                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The readings for this word are both kun'yomi readings. You haven't learned this reading for {span:lang=ja:\u899a} yet, so here's a mnemonic to help you:\n{splitParent}If you start {tooltip:Vocabulary:to wake up} in the middle of the night, it's because of the wake up wi{tooltip:Reading:za}rd ({span:lang=ja:\u3056}). He sneaks into your house when you're sleeping and pokes you with his wand. Wizards like when you wake up. They're weird.\n"
