            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:womb} is a {tooltip:Radical:circle} of {tooltip:Radical:power} where a {tooltip:Kanji:force} of nature is formed. The womb has the power to create life. Life is a force of nature, and the circle of life starts in the womb.",
            "hints": "Imagine yourself in the womb. You\u2019re being born into the world. Feel the force and energy of your mother around you. Hear the sound of water as you float about in the womb. Force yourself to breathe the fluid and imagine yourself doing so.",
            "meanings": {
