                ],
                "hints": "Look at the tater tots at your feet. You feel ashamed for giving up but you were so full, you had to give up! Now they're all down there mocking you.",
                "mnemonic": "After you announce that you are ready to {tooltip:Kanji:give up}, you throw all of your {tooltip:Reading:ta}ter ({span:lang=ja:\u3066\u3044}) tots onto the ground. You have {tooltip:Kanji:abandon}ed your goal of eating all of them."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You can use a {tooltip:Radical:jackhammer} to {tooltip:Kanji:indicate} and {tooltip:Kanji:show} someone where the prize is buried. You buried the prize to keep it safe, but the jackhammer is great at unearthing it. Jackhammers do a great job and show where the treasure lies. They indicate quite clearly where one needs to go.",
            "hints": "Imagine using this jackhammer to show someone where the prize is buried. Feel the vibrations through your hands and the rest of your body.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Indicate",
                "Alternative": "Show"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3058, \u3057",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3057\u3081",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture Jesus getting all over the top and super preachy about his religious beliefs. He\u2019s doing everything he can to indicate to the crowd that he\u2019s the best, and show them how cool he is. Listen to Jesus preach to the crowd, desperate for their attention.",
                "mnemonic": "Actually, you're unearthing {tooltip:Reading:Je}sus ({span:lang=ja:\u3058}). He\u2019s the treasure. For your soul. He\u2019s here to show you that Jesus is still a hip and cool guy and he wants to {tooltip:Kanji:indicate} to you that having faith in Jesus and God and stuff is super rad. Jesus is all like, \u201cWho has two thumbs and wants to {tooltip:Kanji:show} you the way of the Lord? This guy.\u201d"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "From the {tooltip:Radical:roof}, an {tooltip:Radical:icicle} falls and hits {tooltip:Radical:wolverine} in the {tooltip:Radical:forehead}, and he has to go over to the {tooltip:Radical:stool} to {tooltip:Kanji:lie down}. And eventually he goes to {tooltip:Kanji:sleep}.",
            "hints": "Picture this entire scene. The icicle falls in slow motion from the roof. It hits wolverine right in the middle of his forehead. He goes down. He has to lie down. He has to sleep.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Lie Down",
                "Alternatives": "Lay Down, Sleep"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
