                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Wolverine might have a concussion that's making him neigh in his sleep. I guess it's good that he's laying down, but I'm pretty sure you're not supposed to sleep... Maybe you should wake him up so the neighing will stop\u2014I mean, so he'll be okay!",
                "mnemonic": "While wolverine {tooltip:Kanji:sleep}s, he makes a horrible {tooltip:Reading:neigh}ing ({span:lang=ja:\u306d}) sound. It's like there's a giant horse in his mouth screaming to get out! NEIGH NEIGH!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:Viking} who knows how to use a {tooltip:Radical:bathtub} will have to {tooltip:Kanji:manage} all the baths for the other Vikings. Vikings aren't so great with bathing... if you can get one Viking to figure it out he has to manage the rest of them.",
            "hints": "Picture a Viking trying to manage his Viking friends so they'll use the bathtub properly. He has to manage which people go in when, how hot or cold the water is, and provide all the soap. It's a very important job.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Manage"
            },
