{
            "mnemonic": "With a {tooltip:Radical:bamboo} {tooltip:Radical:tree} resting atop your {tooltip:Radical:head}, you devise a {tooltip:Kanji:plan}. The plan is actually for getting the bamboo tree off of your head. You\u2019re trapped under it.",
