{
            "mnemonic": "Pointing your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} to the {tooltip:Radical:sun} is the {tooltip:Radical:correct} way to {tooltip:Kanji:present} yourself or offer to {tooltip:Kanji:submit} your ideas. You're really just raising your hand. And when you want to present yourself, your ideas, or offer anything, the correct way is to raise your fingers to the sun. You definitely learned this in school.",
            "hints": "Picture yourself in class. You want to present next! You want to submit your ideas for class approval. So raise those fingers to the sun the correct way and wait for your teacher to call on you.",
