{
            "mnemonic": "Under the {tooltip:Radical:dirt} in the {tooltip:Radical:ground} is a {tooltip:Radical:drunkard} with something in his {tooltip:Radical:mouth} from a {tooltip:Kanji:region} in North America. He died from whatever it is that\u2019s in his mouth. That\u2019s how this drunkard ended up under the ground in the first place. His whole face region is disfigured from whatever he ate. I wonder what region of North America the strange object came from?",
            "hints": "Try and imagine yourself unearthing this dead drunkard and trying to figure out what\u2019s in his mouth. Smell the decay of flesh as you poke around in his mouth, trying to figure out what this thing is. Think of an object and what region of North America it comes from.",
            "meanings": {
