                "mnemonic": "In an attempt to identify what {tooltip:Kanji:region} of North America the thing in the drunkard\u2019s mouth came from, you touch it and try to remove it with your bare hands. Upon touching whatever it is, you find it to be all {tooltip:Reading:icky} ({span:lang=ja:\u3044\u304d}) and gooey. Like, super icky. So icky that you barf in the region immediately adjacent to you."
