                "mnemonic": "As you {tooltip:Kanji:view} the turkey, Genghis {tooltip:Reading:Khan} ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u3093}) suddenly comes into your view too. He towers over the injured turkey, leans down, and... pulls the arrow out!?"
            }
        }

{
