                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for {span:lang=ja:\u5927} is the {span:lang=ja:\u304a\u304a} reading (like {span:lang=ja:\u5927\u304d\u3044}). Nothing you can do about that but remember it. Then, {span:lang=ja:\u52e2} is rendaku'd to become {span:lang=ja:\u305c\u3044}. Also something you'll just have to remember. Say this word a few times in your head, then you'll be able to come up with an idea of what sounds right and what sounds wrong so that you can figure it out next time this word comes up.\n"
