{
            "mnemonic": "This word consists of kanji with hiragana attached. Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:give up} or {tooltip:Kanji:abandon} so the verb version is {tooltip:Vocabulary:to give up} or {tooltip:Vocabulary:to abandon}.",
