                        "file": "40865-subject-8867.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Just before you're ready {tooltip:Vocabulary:to give up} on something, you yell, \"{tooltip:Reading:AKIRA} ({span:lang=ja:\u3042\u304d\u3089})!\" You don't know anyone named Akira, you just saw it in a movie once and it made sense, you know? So now when you've tried really hard on something, but you have to abandon it anyway, you shout AKIRA into the sky.\n{splitParent}I just did it while trying to write this mnemonic!\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6b7b\u3093\u3067\u3082\u6f22\u5b57\u306e\u52c9\u5f37\u3092\u8ae6\u3081\u306a\u3044\u3067\uff01",
                    "en": "Even if you die, don't give up on learning kanji!"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b3\u30a6\u30a4\u30c1\u306f\u3064\u3044\u306b\u30dd\u30b1\u30e2\u30f3\u30de\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u306b\u306a\u308b\u5922\u3092\u8ae6\u3081\u305f\u3002",
                    "en": "Koichi finally abandoned his dream of becoming a Pokemon master."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u5c71\u306e\u3088\u3046\u306a\u30ec\u30d3\u30e5\u30fc\u3092\u8ae6\u3081\u305a\u306b\u3084\u308b\u304b\u30ea\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u3059\u308b\u304b\u306f\u3001\u3068\u3066\u3082\u96e3\u3057\u3044\u9078\u629e\u3067\u3059\u3002",
