{
            "mnemonic": "On top of a {tooltip:Radical:big} {tooltip:Radical:mountain}, wearing a {tooltip:Radical:lip ring}, you see a {tooltip:Kanji:cape} jutting out into the ocean. You\u2019re wearing a lip ring because you\u2019re a cool and edgy individual who likes to climb big mountains. From the top of the big mountain, you see a cape.",
