{
            "mnemonic": "Moving in the {tooltip:Radical:direction} of a {tooltip:Radical:gun}, an {tooltip:Radical:alligator} can {tooltip:Kanji:carry out} a murder once it reaches it. This alligator wants to kill someone. The alligator wants to carry out their execution.",
