{
            "mnemonic": "Reaching your {tooltip:Radical:ear} is the {tooltip:Radical:sound} of a {tooltip:Radical:drunkard} who can\u2019t find {tooltip:Kanji:employment}. You hear him before you see him because he\u2019s behind some trash cans. Being a drunkard, he\u2019s like, super wasted and just kind of rambling to himself, making strange sounds. No wonder he can\u2019t find employment.",
            "hints": "Hear the strange sounds this drunkard is making. Let his ramblings enter your ears and imagine what he could be trying to say.",
            "meanings": {
