                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Actually you find out that he does have employment. He\u2019s a garbage man. Feel the shock of making this shocking discovery. How can this drunkard possibly hold down his job like this?",
                "mnemonic": "Since this guy is such a pathetic drunkard, it comes as no {tooltip:Reading:shock} ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3087\u304f}) that he can\u2019t find {tooltip:Kanji:employment}. If he did find employment, I would be filled with both shock and awe."
