{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:leader} of the {tooltip:Radical:restaurant} says, \"{tooltip:Kanji:Halt}!\" to everyone who wants to come in. The leader looks them up and down. Stares into their eyes. And then, maybe, they may go into the restaurant to eat.",
