{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:moon} shines on your {tooltip:Radical:roof} in the {tooltip:Radical:evening} and a {tooltip:Radical:snake} suddenly appears! Wait, that's not a snake, it's your {tooltip:Kanji:arm}, sticking out from under the roof.",
            "hints": "Arms really look like snakes in the moonlight. Picture it. Your arm is long and shiny, just like a snake.",
            "meanings": {
