                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Cry your eyes out as you smell the smell of burning plastic from the nendoroids. Worst. Day. Ever.",
                "mnemonic": "What is the worst thing that could {tooltip:Kanji:burn} in this fire? Your {tooltip:Reading:nen}doroid ({span:lang=ja:\u306d\u3093}) collection. You've spent a lot of time and money collecting all these cool and rare and unique nendoroids and now they've all burned in the fire."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You use your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} at {tooltip:Radical:dawn} to {tooltip:Kanji:carry} many things. You have to carry yourself out of bed. You have to carry your backpack or purse or laptop bag to school or work. Your fingers have to carry a lot of weight around at dawn.",
            "hints": "Think about your morning routine. You carry yourself into the bathroom and carry a toothbrush into your mouth. You carry your coat and bag out the door.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Carry",
                "Alternative": "Bear"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305f\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u306b\u306a, \u304b\u3064",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture yourself carrying a coat and a bag, walking through the rice fields to work, with the hot, dawn sun shining down, making your fingers get tanner and tanner.",
                "mnemonic": "Once you're {tooltip:Kanji:carry}ing everything, and the dawn sun is shining bright, you start getting {tooltip:Reading:tan} ({span:lang=ja:\u305f\u3093}). Especially those fingers you're using to carry things."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If a {tooltip:Radical:spirit} blesses your {tooltip:Radical:older brother} it's time to {tooltip:Kanji:celebrate}! This isn't something that happens every day to everyone's older brother. Yours is very good and very lucky. So celebrate with him!",
            "hints": "Imagine what celebrating would be like. Imagine an older brother too, if you don't actually have one.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Celebrate"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3057\u3085\u304f, \u3057\u3085\u3046",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3044\u308f",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Never celebrate too hard. Otherwise you'll always have to think about the time a celebration spirit shook your brother till his head fell off.",
                "mnemonic": "Unfortunately, the two of you {tooltip:Kanji:celebrate}d too much, and you went a little crazy. The spirit grabbed your brother and {tooltip:Reading:shook} ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3085\u304f}) him. Shook him so hard his head popped off."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The American {tooltip:Radical:flag} is the {tooltip:Radical:reason} you need to {tooltip:Kanji:deliver} this package. The flag is inside the package, and you need to deliver it to the president. He lost his old flag, so now it\u2019s up to you to deliver this new one to him. What more of a reason do you need?",
            "hints": "You need to deliver this flag to the president. Imagine yourself running as fast as you can while carrying the parcel in order to get it to him. Your lungs are tired and your legs burn, but you must deliver the flag as soon as possible!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Deliver"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3068\u3069",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "The world depends on you to do this delivery. If you fail, the United States will be ruined. You have to do it! Deliver that flag now! Run! Run!",
                "mnemonic": "To {tooltip:Kanji:deliver} this flag is something you just have {tooltip:Reading:to do} ({span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3069}). Need to do. Want to do. There is no one else to do it. This is something only you are equipped to do."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You take your {tooltip:Radical:scooter} to {tooltip:Radical:Korea} and everything is {tooltip:Kanji:different}!",
            "hints": "Imagine scooting down a street in Korea and seeing how different literally every single thing is compared to what you're used to in Japan.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Different"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
