                "mnemonic": "What's also {tooltip:Kanji:different} is that there's a weird tiger bouncing on its tail alongside you yelling that its name is {tooltip:Reading:Tigger} ({span:lang=ja:\u3061\u304c}). You didn't know Tigger was living in Korea these days. That's definitely different."
