{
            "mnemonic": "When the {tooltip:Radical:horns} of the {tooltip:Radical:king} {tooltip:Radical:slide} down into the {tooltip:Radical:construction} below he loses {tooltip:Kanji:distinction}. Now the king just looks like everyone else, there's nothing that sets him apart!",
