{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:elephant} radical and the {tooltip:Kanji:elephant} kanji are the same. But! This kanji has another meaning: {tooltip:Kanji:phenomenon}. If you were the first person to see an elephant, you'd call it that too.",
