                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture the shougun standing over a pit of zombie elephants. None of these are getting out on his watch, letting people believe in such crazy phenomenons.",
                "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Kanji:Elephant}s are great and all, except that when they die they turn into elephant {tooltip:Reading:zo}mbies ({span:lang=ja:\u305e\u3046}). But you never see these zombies because the {tooltip:Reading:shou}gun ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3087\u3046}) has a special project in place that destroys all elephant bodies when they die."
