                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture Genghis Khan looping around and around just like the king is looping around and around this zombie.",
                "mnemonic": "The king also explains that this {tooltip:Kanji:loop} technique was used by Genghis {tooltip:Reading:Khan} ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u3093}) when he was conquering cities. He'd loop around the entire place with a net and trap them."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "In an attempt to {tooltip:Radical:control} your {tooltip:Radical:clothes}, you {tooltip:Kanji:manufacture} a mind control device. This mind control device will allow you to control the mind of your clothes and all that they do. You just need to manufacture it.",
            "hints": "Imagine being able to control your clothes with your mind. What would you have them do? Imagine what you would do with your clothes if you could manufacture something to control them and move them around at will with your mind.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Manufacture"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
