{
            "mnemonic": "On this {tooltip:Radical:scooter}, there's an {tooltip:Radical:angel} with a {tooltip:Radical:drop} of sweat coming off of it, because it forgot to {tooltip:Kanji:mention} something to you! It seems like it's something important too, since they're sweating so much.",
            "hints": "The angel just visited you, but it forgot to mention something important (probably life-threatening, it's an angel after all), and now you see it scooting at top speeds toward you.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Mention"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
