{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:leader} is always {tooltip:Radical:together} with their {tooltip:Kanji:servant}. The servant is their constant {tooltip:Kanji:companion}, always following close behind the leader, offering them hot towels and bottled water.",
            "hints": "Try to picture the servant without the leader... you can't! The servant and the leader are always together.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Servant",
                "Alternative": "Companion"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
