                "mnemonic": "Once the tree hits the ground with his {tooltip:Kanji:stocks} and his {tooltip:Kanji:shares}, the impact creates a large {tooltip:Reading:KABOO}M ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u3076})! Stocks hit the ground - KABOOM! Shares! KABOOM! Tree! KABOOOOOOM~!"
