        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If, at a certain {tooltip:Radical:angle}, you approach an {tooltip:Radical:insect}, you\u2019ll be able to {tooltip:Kanji:touch} it without it noticing. Most of the time, insects will run away from you when you try and touch them, but if you do so from the right angle, the insect will have no idea.",
