{
            "mnemonic": "If you could just get your {tooltip:Radical:soul} to open the {tooltip:Radical:window} to {tooltip:Radical:shellfish}, you'll grow {tooltip:Kanji:accustomed} to them sooner or later! I know shellfish are a bit of an acquired taste, but if you don't open that window, you'll never like them!",
            "hints": "Close your eyes and picture your soul. Now your soul is opening a little window inside of you that is the perfect size for shellfish of all kinds. Hopefully with exposure and acceptance you'll grow accustomed to them.",
            "meanings": {
