                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Force yourself to get accustomed to shellfish like Genghis Khan, then maybe you'll rule most of the planet someday.",
                "mnemonic": "You'll need to become {tooltip:Kanji:accustomed} to eating shellfish if you want to grow up big and strong like Genghis {tooltip:Reading:Khan} ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u3093}). He didn't have shellfish growing up either you know, he had to grow accustomed to their taste too, but look how successful he was!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:flag} is {tooltip:Radical:old} but that doesn't mean it's not still {tooltip:Kanji:alive}. This is a living flag, and it gets old just like other living things.",
            "hints": "Imagine the old flag with a face and mouth and eyes and nose... it talks and listens and everything else. It's a flag that's {tooltip:Kanji:alive} D:",
            "meanings": {
