                "mnemonic": "The flag that is old and {tooltip:Kanji:alive} is actually a Buddhist relic (that's why it's alive, in fact ... and old!). But, it's a really dumb relic, so it's put in Little {tooltip:Reading:Kyo}to ({span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087})."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Radical:scooter}'s been stolen by a {tooltip:Radical:wolverine}, who's now getting {tooltip:Radical:water} all over it. You need to {tooltip:Kanji:apprehend} that wolverine!",
            "hints": "Not only did the wolverine steal your scooter, but it is getting your poor scooter all wet by riding it through puddles. Now you and all the cops are chasing the wolverine down on police scooters and you're going to apprehend it!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Apprehend"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
