                "hints": "{span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3061}s punch attack was super effective against that Pikurchort.",
                "mnemonic": "The most {tooltip:Kanji:effective} mix of two powers is two {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3061}s. Take one, mix it with another, and you have something with immeasurable power. You use it to attack that animal-like creature. It's super effective!"
