{
            "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Radical:say} you have an {tooltip:Radical:axe} with a {tooltip:Radical:drop} of blood on it. You hit someone with that axe and now they're going to {tooltip:Kanji:sue} you. That drop of blood on your axe is pretty incriminating, which is why they have enough of a case to sue you.",
            "hints": "Imagine being unable to stop yourself from saying \"I have the axe with the drop on it!\" and the recently axed person jumps out from behind a bush and shouts, \"Aha! I'm gonna sue you!\"",
            "meanings": {
