                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305d",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3046\u3063\u305f",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "The person you axed cries and tries desperately to find their blood on the axe so they can keep suing you properly. You hold the soap behind your back and cackle.",
                "mnemonic": "You want to {tooltip:Kanji:sue} them back so you clean the axe with some {tooltip:Reading:so}ap ({span:lang=ja:\u305d}). \"Your honor,\" you say in court, \"I don't see any drops of blood, I countersue!\""
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "There is a {tooltip:Radical:spirit} at your {tooltip:Radical:wedding}. It's there as a {tooltip:Kanji:supplement} to the guests because not enough people came.",
