                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Maybe you should supplement your wedding with other things next time... instead of spirits and garden hoes.",
                "mnemonic": "Along with the spirits to {tooltip:Kanji:supplement} your wedding guests, you made everyone carry a {tooltip:Reading:hoe} ({span:lang=ja:\u307b}). That way no one had to bring a date, they carry a garden hoe as a supplement and no one feels bad about being dateless. Everyone is!"
