{
            "mnemonic": "Alright, so it's not quite the same, but something that is {tooltip:Kanji:fresh} is also {tooltip:Vocabulary:vivid} and {tooltip:Vocabulary:splendid}. I know those are a couple things I'd associate with freshness. Try to make the connection here before moving on.",
