{
            "mnemonic": "On the {tooltip:Radical:grass} near a {tooltip:Radical:rice paddy} sits a {tooltip:Radical:creeper} that is some sort of a {tooltip:Radical:dog} {tooltip:Kanji:beast}, a vicious {tooltip:Kanji:animal}. This creeper isn\u2019t just a normal dog, it is more beast-like, more like a feral animal than domesticated pet.",
            "hints": "Picture this beast creeping, low to the ground, in the grass around the rice paddy. It's got its eyes on you. Uh oh.",
            "meanings": {
