                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "See yourself driving around in this peacock car. Hear the engine purr as strangers jeer and yell at you. This car sure does get a lot of attention, doesn\u2019t it?",
                "mnemonic": "What did I say this car looks like? Oh that\u2019s right, a pea{tooltip:Reading:cock} ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u304f}). This car looks like a peacock. It\u2019s the color of a peacock and you\u2019ll look like you\u2019re peacocking when you\u2019re out on the town driving it. It really is such a stark {tooltip:Kanji:contrast} to like, every other car out there."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "In your {tooltip:Radical:warehouse} you use your {tooltip:Radical:knife} to {tooltip:Kanji:create}. You keep old pieces of wood in your warehouse, and you use your knife to carve them into new things that only you could create.",
            "hints": "What do you create in your warehouse? Picture all the different things you could create in your mind.",
            "meanings": {
