                "hints": "When you create something your soul is happy! It's good for you, you know?",
                "mnemonic": "When you {tooltip:Kanji:create} it's good for your {tooltip:Reading:sou}l ({span:lang=ja:\u305d\u3046}). It's so freeing, in fact, that when you get really into your creating, sometimes you'd swear your soul was floating a little bit outside of your body. But every time you notice, it sinks back down. Hmm."
            }
        }

{
