{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} that is {tooltip:Radical:white}, traveling in the {tooltip:Radical:direction} of {tooltip:Radical:winter} is a {tooltip:Kanji:fierce} and {tooltip:Kanji:violent} force of nature. This white tsunami is chasing after winter, and that\u2019s why the tsunami is white\u2014it\u2019s a winter tsunami. It\u2019s the most fierce and most violent kind of tsunami in existence.",
            "hints": "Imagine this white tsunami, more violent and fierce than any other tsunami you\u2019ve ever seen, coming toward you. It\u2019s very frightening. Feel the cold wetness it brings to your skin.",
            "meanings": {
