                "mnemonic": "The tsunami is too {tooltip:Kanji:fierce}, too {tooltip:Kanji:violent}, and before you realize what's happening, {tooltip:Reading:Gecki} ({span:lang=ja:\u3052\u304d}), your beloved gecko, is lifted up and carried off into the air."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:fortune} radical and the {tooltip:Kanji:fortune} kanji are exactly the same! But it also means {tooltip:Kanji:occupy} as well, so don\u2019t forget that. Fortune and occupy both occupy the same radical.",
            "hints": "Just remember that this kanji also means occupy and you\u2019ll be just fine.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Fortune",
                "Alternative": "Occupy"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305b\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
