{
            "mnemonic": "A broken {tooltip:Radical:car} sits in a {tooltip:Radical:building}. You need to get rid of it, so you put it in the {tooltip:Kanji:mail}. Or, depending on where you live, maybe you put it in the {tooltip:Kanji:post}.",
