{
            "mnemonic": "In a {tooltip:Radical:gold} {tooltip:Radical:cross}, you see a {tooltip:Kanji:needle} sticking out of it. The needle is right in the middle of the gold cross. If Jesus were on there, the needle would be sticking him right in the chest.",
