                ],
                "hints": "You stole those jewels together and now you're an accomplice for accompanying him! You better hide those jewels!!",
                "mnemonic": "If you {tooltip:Kanji:obey} the horned man you'll end up with a ton of {tooltip:Reading:jew}els ({span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3085\u3046})!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "On the {tooltip:Radical:moon}, it\u2019s easy to turn a {tooltip:Radical:pig} into {tooltip:Kanji:pork}. The low gravity of the moon makes the whole process much easier and cost efficient. Soon, all the pig farming will be done on the moon and there will never be a pork shortage ever again.",
            "hints": "Imagine going to a pig farm/restaurant on the moon. You\u2019re in a space suit, eating some space pork. It\u2019s delicious. Imagine the best pork you\u2019ve ever had. This is better than that.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Pork",
                "Alternative": "Pig"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3068\u3093",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3076\u305f",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Butter and pork. A match made in heaven! Imagine yourself scarfing down this buttered pork by the pound. You\u2019re stuffed, but you have to eat more. It\u2019s soooo gooood.",
                "mnemonic": "At this particular pig restaurant, they have a secret ingredient that goes onto their {tooltip:Kanji:pork}. Lots and lots of {tooltip:Reading:butte}r ({span:lang=ja:\u3076\u305f}). Okay, so it\u2019s not that big of a secret. But boy is it delicious. Mmm, butter."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Radical:loiter} around a {tooltip:Radical:black hole}, waiting for it to finish destroying and switch to {tooltip:Kanji:restore} mode. You were told all black holes finish eventually, and when they do you can press a button to restore everything back to the way it was.",
            "hints": "Imagine loitering around near (but not too near!) the black hole waiting for it to finish so you can restore the galaxy.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Restore"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3075\u304f",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Maybe if you yell f**k you enough things will be restored. Ha. No. Everything's gone and it's your fault for being gullible.",
                "mnemonic": "Finally there's nothing else for the black hole to eat so you hit the {tooltip:Kanji:restore} button.... but nothing happens. \"Oh {tooltip:Reading:f**k} ({span:lang=ja:\u3075\u304f}) you!\" you scream as you realize you were lied to."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "During a {tooltip:Radical:tsunami}, your {tooltip:Radical:lip ring} is ripped off while you\u2019re trying to cross a {tooltip:Kanji:river}. There was no other path to safety, you had to cross the raging river, but you lost your footing and smashed your face on a rock and lost your lip ring.",
            "hints": "Imagine how painful this would be, having your lip ring ripped from your lip. It would hurt a lot. Touch your lip and imagine missing half of it. Yikes.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "River"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304b",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304b\u308f",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "\u3053\u3046, \u3053\u304a",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine yourself fording the river, all wet and cold from the water. Keeping your eyes on your car, you move slowly across. Look at the car. Look at it!",
                "mnemonic": "But why were you trying to cross this {tooltip:Kanji:river} anyway? Well your {tooltip:Reading:ca}r ({span:lang=ja:\u304b}) was on the other side of it, and you figured if you could get to your car you could outrun the tsunami and be safe. Too bad you fell and ripped out your lip ring though."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You keep all of your {tooltip:Radical:shellfish} under a {tooltip:Radical:roof} down the {tooltip:Radical:street} and it's your {tooltip:Kanji:savings}. Shellfish used to be used as money way back, and these aren't shellfish you're spending, they're ones you're saving up for later.",
            "hints": "Imagine walking down the street to deposit more shellfish into your special savings and gaze happily at the huge pile you keep far enough away that you aren't tempted to spend it.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Savings"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3061\u3087",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305f\u304f\u308f",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine trying to lift up a shellfish with a pair of smooth chopsticks. It slips right out. Ugh! I guess that's good though, because it's a savings for a reason (you shouldn't be spending it)!",
                "mnemonic": "When you want to withdraw from your {tooltip:Kanji:savings} you force yourself to use {tooltip:Reading:cho}psticks ({span:lang=ja:\u3061\u3087}) to pick up the shellfish. They're especially slippery, hard to use chopsticks too, that way it's really hard to take too much out of your savings."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You take this {tooltip:Radical:comb}, break the handle off, and use it to {tooltip:Radical:stamp} your official {tooltip:Kanji:seal} of approval onto a document. It's kind of a messy {tooltip:Kanji:mark}ing process, but it gets the job done.",
            "hints": "Imagine breaking and bending a comb so you can use it to stamp your seal onto things.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Seal",
                "Alternative": "Mark"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
