                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Hopefully the inn accepts this seal... or you aren't going to have a place to sleep tonight. And it kind of just looks like you dipped a comb in ink and pressed it around on some paper.",
                "mnemonic": "You need this {tooltip:Kanji:seal} to stay at an {tooltip:Reading:inn} ({span:lang=ja:\u3044\u3093}). All inns require official paperwork, so you had to improvise and make a seal on the fly."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You're trying to use your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} to cause a {tooltip:Radical:landslide} so you have to {tooltip:Kanji:shake} the earth. You probably won't succeed, but the best you can do is to shake your hands on the dirt as hard as you can. It looks like you're trying to {tooltip:Kanji:wave} at the ground now.",
            "hints": "Imagine shaking your fingers at the dirt. Do you think you can shake the dirt hard enough to cause a landslide (spoilers, no).",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Shake",
                "Alternative": "Wave"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3057\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3075",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine your shins shaking, your hands are waving, and they won't stop. No! You shouldn't have tried to start a landslide. This was a bad idea!",
                "mnemonic": "You think you finally got the earth to {tooltip:Kanji:shake} but when you look down it's just your {tooltip:Reading:shin}s ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3093}). Darn you shins, I thought I made some progress. Hey wait... why won't you stop?!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "There is a {tooltip:Radical:head} pinned to a {tooltip:Radical:tree} by a {tooltip:Radical:knife}. This person has been {tooltip:Kanji:stab}bed! They were stabbed so hard that they were pinned to the tree here.",
            "hints": "Imagine how much force you would need to stab someone to have the knife and go all the way through them and pin their head to a tree. That's a lot of force.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Stab"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3057",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3055",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine getting closer to the sheep and seeing blood on its wool. You squint your eyes and see some knives strapped to its back. Even closer and you see a little sign around its neck that says, \"Hello, I'm the Stabbing Sheep.\" Uh oh.",
                "mnemonic": "You want to know who did the {tooltip:Kanji:stab}bing, so you look around to see if the stabber is still in the area. But all you see is a {tooltip:Reading:shee}p ({span:lang=ja:\u3057}). Sheep can't stab people, right? They have hooves and probably can't pick up knives... right?"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "In a {tooltip:Radical:hole}, you see a {tooltip:Radical:big} guy who looks like he wants to {tooltip:Kanji:stab} you. You don\u2019t want him to stab you, so you make sure not to fall into the big hole that houses the big guy that wants to stab you big time.",
            "hints": "Look at this hole \u2013 it\u2019s like, super big. The guy is really big. They\u2019re terrifying enough on their own, but put them together and you\u2019ve got a big problem. You feel very afraid of this hole and getting stabbed. Just don\u2019t fall in, okay?",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Stab",
                "Alternative": "Thrust"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
