                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "This big guy inside the big hole is totes going to stab you. Why did you fall in?? Feel the big guy press you up against the wall of the hole as he begins to stab you repeatedly.",
                "mnemonic": "You fall in the big hole. What did I just tell you not to do!? He\u2019s {tooltip:Reading:totes} ({span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3064}) going to {tooltip:Kanji:stab} you for sure. Totes."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You see a {tooltip:Radical:soul} floating around a {tooltip:Radical:tombstone} acting {tooltip:Kanji:suspicious}. To be fair, if a soul is going to be anywhere, a tombstone is probably high up on the list, but this one seems like it's doing something weird.",
            "hints": "Imagine inching closer to this suspicious soul floating around a tombstone. What do you think it's doing?",
