{
            "mnemonic": "Out of {tooltip:Radical:bamboo}, you make a {tooltip:Radical:brush} \u2013 a {tooltip:Kanji:writing brush}. This is no ordinary brush, mind you. It is a brush specifically designed for writing elegant characters. And it\u2019s made from bamboo!",
            "hints": "Imagine yourself using this bamboo writing brush. Do you know many kanji? Of course you do! Imagine yourself writing them all with this nice writing brush. It\u2019s actually fun to write things with it!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Writing Brush"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
