                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine the sound the brush makes when it hits the paper. It\u2019s a bit of a plop, and then kind of a scratching sound as the brush bristles move around. Really focus on this sound that the brush makes when it hits the paper. ",
                "mnemonic": "Once the {tooltip:Kanji:writing brush} {tooltip:Reading:hits} ({span:lang=ja:\u3072\u3064}) that paper, it\u2019s like you transform into a totally different person. All of a sudden you\u2019re a master calligrapher, writing anything and everything in a most beautiful fashion. Once that brush hits the paper, it\u2019s on!"
