{
            "mnemonic": "Inside this {tooltip:Radical:moon} is a {tooltip:Radical:black hole}... haha just kidding, it's your {tooltip:Kanji:belly}! It's beautiful and round like the moon and it eats up everything you give it like a black hole. What a good {tooltip:Kanji:stomach} you have!",
