                "mnemonic": "You set up this stand at the top of the mountain so you could give a speech to the world. But you need to look your best, so you decide to get a {tooltip:Reading:tan} ({span:lang=ja:\u305f\u3093}). You lay next to the {tooltip:Kanji:edge} of the mountain, and prepare to tan. Everyone likes a person with a healthy tan."
