{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tree} with a {tooltip:Radical:mouth} eats a {tooltip:Radical:beggar} and his {tooltip:Radical:stool}, which were on the {tooltip:Radical:ground} next to him, which seems to be a bit {tooltip:Kanji:extreme}, don't you think?",
