{
            "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Radical:substitute} some {tooltip:Radical:shellfish} for collateral so your friend will {tooltip:Kanji:lend} you some money. Normally he would ask for something more valuable, but you\u2019ve convinced him to substitute these shellfish for what he would normally take as collateral when lending to people.",
