                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine yourself in this new car that you got with the money your friend lent you. Hear the roar of the engine and feel the wind in your hair.",
                "mnemonic": "You want your friend to {tooltip:Kanji:lend} you some money so you can buy yourself a {tooltip:Reading:ca}r ({span:lang=ja:\u304b}). You need money and a car a lot more than you need this pile of shellfish, so you\u2019re happy to put them up as collateral for the loan."
            }
