{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:drunkard} who has his {tooltip:Radical:mouth} on the {tooltip:Radical:ground}, has a {tooltip:Radical:heart} that is {tooltip:Kanji:misguided}. First of all, he tries to drink his problems away, but worse, he's so drunk he's trying to drink out of the ground.",
