{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Kanji:visit} {tooltip:Kanji:problem} is when someone makes {tooltip:Vocabulary:a visit}, because you're the type of person who doesn't like visitors, since they're usually so inconsiderate and you have to feed them. That's why {tooltip:Vocabulary:a visit} is a visit problem.",
