                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading is also not the same as {span:lang=ja:\u6355\u307e\u308b}. Sorry! It does have a similar reading to {span:lang=ja:\u53d6\u308b} though, which also has to do with grabbing things (like grabbing onto an idea, for example). You can use {span:lang=ja:\u53d6\u308b} as a jumping off point for remembering the reading of this word. You might also find it useful to think back to {span:lang=ja:\u6349\u3048\u308b}, which has to do with mentally \"catching\" or \"grasping\" things. \n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u3054\u6765\u5149\u306e\u3057\u3085\u3093\u9593\u3092\u30ab\u30e1\u30e9\u3067\u6355\u3048\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002",
