{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Construction} in the {tooltip:Radical:winter} leads to {tooltip:Kanji:aggression}. Just think about it. It's cold, it's unpleasant, and you don't want to be there. So, you start to develop an aggression towards other people working with you on this winter project.",
