                "hints": "\"Aggression\" is going to depend on you, so you should imagine a scene where you take your aggression out on {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3061}, whatever that entails.{splitParent}Hint: When you see {span:lang=ja:\u5de5} in a kanji it will often take the {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046} reading.",
                "mnemonic": "You're taking your {tooltip:Kanji:aggression} out on everyone. Then, the sexy construction worker from WaniKani Level 1, {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3061}, walks by without a shirt on. You take out all your aggression on him."
