{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Blood} and {tooltip:Radical:hair} and {tooltip:Radical:tofu} make up the {tooltip:Kanji:populace}. Those are the three categories the entire populace fits into, anyway.",
            "hints": "Blood shows that all the people are related. Hair shows that we're all humans. Tofu is food to all. So, as you can see, those three words describe the entire populace.",
