                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You Gak up the wheels so when the scooter tries to switch to reverse it gets stuck. Success! But now it can't go forward either. Darn you Gak, you tricked me again.",
                "mnemonic": "Your scooter going in {tooltip:Kanji:reverse} and leaving you here is {tooltip:Kanji:opposite} of what you want. You want to ride it back home when you're done, so you stuff the wheels with {tooltip:Reading:Gak} ({span:lang=ja:\u304e\u3083\u304f}). If you don\u2019t know what Gak is, {link#%20http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kgST63f6x88#check out this Gak commercial}."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:grain}, from one {tooltip:Radical:evening} to the next {tooltip:Radical:evening}, experiences a {tooltip:Kanji:shift}. After two evenings, the grain has shifted from one location to another.",
            "hints": "Picture the grain in your head with a time-lapse of one evening after another happening in the background. Slowly, the grain shifts.",
