{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Rice} that is {tooltip:Radical:blue} has a strong {tooltip:Kanji:spirit}. Our spirits are blue, so if you ever see rice (or other food, or even people) that's blue, you know that's their spirit radiating out!",
