{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:gladiator} in front of you draws his {tooltip:Radical:sword}. He points the sword at your chest and right when you think everything is about to end, you realize he's pointing the sword at the {tooltip:Kanji:ticket} in your hand.",
