            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "As a {tooltip:Radical:hat}, {tooltip:Radical:four people} holding a {tooltip:Radical:cross} use an {tooltip:Kanji:umbrella}. The umbrella is big enough to be a hat for all four people, so it makes sense. All four of them are religious missionaries, so that\u2019s why they\u2019re holding the cross.",
