                "mnemonic": "You know the Spanish phrase \u201cMi {tooltip:Reading:casa} ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u3055}) es su casa\u201d? Well this is kind of like that, but only with a hat. And that hat is an {tooltip:Kanji:umbrella}. Mi casa es yours too, because it\u2019s an umbrella and also a hat. This makes sense, trust me."
