{
            "mnemonic": "{span:lang=ja:\u72ec\u308a} is when you're {tooltip:Kanji:alone}. {span:lang=ja:\u8a00} is when you {tooltip:Kanji:say} something. So, when you say something and you're alone, you're just {tooltip:Vocabulary:talking to yourself}.",
