                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "32429-subject-5173.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for {span:lang=ja:\u72ec\u308a} is just the reading for {span:lang=ja:\u72ec\u308a}. The reading for {span:lang=ja:\u8a00} is an exception, though. It's {span:lang=ja:\u3054\u3068}, which comes from {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3068}. Just think that as you're {tooltip:Vocabulary:talking to yourself} you're telling yourself over and over to {tooltip:Reading:go to} hell. You're mean to yourself, and you're also insane, which is why you keep saying that out loud to nobody but you.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u541b\u304c\u5973\u6027\u306b\u5bfe\u3057\u3066\u53e3\u304c\u3046\u307e\u3044\u306e\u306f\u77e5\u3063\u3066\u305f\u3051\u3069\u3001\u305d\u306e\u7df4\u7fd2\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306b\u305d\u3093\u306a\u98a8\u306b\u30d6\u30c4\u30d6\u30c4\u72ec\u308a\u8a00\u3092\u8a00\u3063\u3066\u308b\u306a\u3093\u3066\u3053\u308c\u3063\u307d\u3063\u3061\u3082\u77e5\u3089\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3088\u3002",
