{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Grain}s get {tooltip:Radical:blame}d for how much they {tooltip:Kanji:accumulate}. If the grains accumulate too much then they make more work for the farmers. If they accumulate too little, then they're starving the people. Ugh, grains just can't win with you people. They're blamed for everything.",
            "hints": "Picture a pile of grains accumulating in size while a person watches. No matter how large the pile gets, the person keeps blaming them for something!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Accumulate"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
