                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Look up at this ten story tall tsunami. It looks big and powerful. Feel the water spray from the tsunami as it towers over you.",
                "mnemonic": "Just after you {tooltip:Kanji:append} the small drop of water to the tsunami, it grows {tooltip:Reading:ten} ({span:lang=ja:\u3066\u3093}) stories high. Before it was only nine, but since you appended that drop, the tsunami is now a full ten stories tall."
            }
