{
            "mnemonic": "Under a {tooltip:Radical:roof}, but still in the {tooltip:Radical:sun}, a {tooltip:Radical:woman} is laying out a fabulous {tooltip:Kanji:banquet}. The woman doesn't want anyone to burn from the sun, but banquets are best outside, so she's set up a roof to protect her and her guests.",
