{
            "mnemonic": "If you're {tooltip:Radical:anti}-{tooltip:Radical:tree}, you won't mind if I turn all of them into {tooltip:Kanji:board}s! Hahaha!",
            "hints": "\"Boards are much more useful than trees.\" - The Anti-Tree Association. Now picture this sign on a big machine that's cutting up all the trees into big boards.",
