{
            "mnemonic": "You set up a {tooltip:Radical:net} on a {tooltip:Radical:cross} to wash your {tooltip:Radical:clothes} in the river, when a huge wave of {tooltip:Radical:dirt} smashes into it, {tooltip:Kanji:break}ing the whole thing and sending your clothes tumbling down the river.",
