                "hints": "Think of a haiku about a cup of liquid and a counter for cups. Use that haiku to help remember this kanji.",
                "mnemonic": "Another way to remember the {tooltip:Kanji:counter for cups} using a {tooltip:Kanji:cup of liquid} would be by creating and memorizing a {tooltip:Reading:hai}ku ({span:lang=ja:\u306f\u3044}) about them. Aren\u2019t haikus useful?"
