{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:woman} who is {tooltip:Radical:good} is my {tooltip:Kanji:daughter}. My daughter is a good woman, I guarantee it.",
            "hints": "Look at how good this woman is! She\u2019s my daughter! She\u2019s good! You wish your daughter was as good a woman as mine is!",
