{
            "mnemonic": "They {tooltip:Radical:say} to wear a {tooltip:Radical:hat} to cover your {tooltip:Radical:hair} if your doctor {tooltip:Kanji:diagnose}s you with hair loss. It's the best option, folks. ",
            "hints": "Imagine the doctor diagnosing you with hair loss. He pulls out a hat and places it on your poor, thinning hair. ",
