{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:saw} cuts into your {tooltip:Radical:heart} and you are filled with {tooltip:Kanji:fear}. Well, you were filled with fear before the saw reached your heart too, but now that the saw is cutting into your heart, you\u2019re feeling more fear than ever.",
            "hints": "Try and imagine this saw slicing into your heart. Are you filled with fear? You should be.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Fear"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304d\u3087\u3046",
