                ],
                "hints": "I fear you\u2019ll never make it to {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3068}. Think of {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3068} and how you long for it as you slowly die from that saw wound to the heart.",
                "mnemonic": "Even more so than your {tooltip:Kanji:fear} of dying, you are filled with the fear that you\u2019ll never get to vacation in {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3068}. You always wanted to take a trip to {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3068}, but if you die from this saw wound to the heart, you\u2019ll never get the chance to go."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "An {tooltip:Radical:animal} eats a {tooltip:Radical:child} from a {tooltip:Radical:plate} in a very {tooltip:Kanji:fierce} manner. This is a fierce animal, so it makes sense that it would eat the child in a fierce style.",
