{
            "mnemonic": "There is a {tooltip:Radical:cross} in your {tooltip:Radical:forehead} with a {tooltip:Radical:thread} attached to it, forcing you to {tooltip:Kanji:search} where it leads. You\u2019re not sure how the cross got stuck in your forehead, but you are interested in seeing where this piece of thread leads. The search is on.",
