                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading isn't the same as {span:lang=ja:\u8a2a\u306d\u308b}, though, I'm afraid. It's {span:lang=ja:\u304a\u3068\u305a}, so think how this verb is the one where you do have a (fun) purpose to visit wherever you're visiting. That being said, you forgot what you were visiting as well. When you finally remember, it's because you were looking down to think. It's to look at the toes of the giant Buddha statue. \"{tooltip:Reading:Oh Toes}!\" ({span:lang=ja:\u304a\u3068\u305a}) you exclaim.\n"
