                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Please read my super special Han Solo edition of the Star Wars story. I ripped out all the one sided pages that had him in it and put them into a single edition together so it's just the good stuff now.",
                "mnemonic": "The first {tooltip:Kanji:edition} you create is a fan fiction all about the adventures of {tooltip:Reading:Han} ({span:lang=ja:\u306f\u3093}) Solo. You hated how short and one sided his story in Star Wars seemed to be, and trying to keep track of it all was really hard. But not anymore!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You've made yourself a {tooltip:Radical:tree} {tooltip:Radical:bookshelf} (that is, a bookshelf cut into a tree), so you build a {tooltip:Kanji:fence} to keep the riffraff out.",
            "hints": "Your tree bookshelf is often being raided by the neighbors, and since it's outside, all you can do is build a fence around it to protect it. Better check out that fence-building book in your tree bookshelf.",
