                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You give him your Mac cooler and he goes on his way. He's quite happy he can cool down his Mac, now. The trees are quite warm and he hears this will help to cool down his tree apples.",
                "mnemonic": "As he hits you with his {tooltip:Kanji:pillow} he makes a demand: \"Give me your {tooltip:Reading:Mac cooler} ({span:lang=ja:\u307e\u304f\u3089}). He wants the device that cools down your Mac computer."
            }
