{
            "mnemonic": "On a {tooltip:Radical:scooter} running in one {tooltip:Radical:direction} is a {tooltip:Radical:gun}-toting {tooltip:Radical:child}. This is a terribly dangerous situation, but to the child it is just {tooltip:Kanji:play}.",
            "hints": "Imagine a child riding a scooter with a gun having a good time. \"Come play with me!\" they shout. \"No!\" you yell back.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Play"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3086\u3046",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3042\u305d",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine trying to explain to the youth that this is not play and that they should stop, but them youths can't stop playing.{splitParent}P.S. From the WaniKani staff to you: Don't let youths play with guns, please.",
                "mnemonic": "Everything is {tooltip:Kanji:play} for {tooltip:Reading:you}ths ({span:lang=ja:\u3086\u3046}), even if it's a terrible, scary, not good situation like this one."
