{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:soul} of a {tooltip:Radical:person} has a {tooltip:Radical:hook} that can make them {tooltip:Kanji:pleasant}. When you see, hear, or feel something pleasant, can't you feel that hook pressing into the middle of your body?",
            "hints": "Imagine that feeling you get when everything is just SO pleasant. There is a pressure from your soul's hook digging in. It's a good feeling though, a pleasant one! It isn't too hard or too soft.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Pleasant"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
