                        "reading": "\u3053\u3053\u308d\u3088",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Go look up pictures of kayaks to get some of that pleasant high. Mm, your soul is hooking you real good.",
                "mnemonic": "If you want to feel this {tooltip:Kanji:pleasant} feeling just look at a {tooltip:Reading:kay}ak ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u3044}). Kayaks are the most pleasant boats in the world. Feel that pleasant feeling in your chest just from reading about kayaks in this mnemonic right now."
            }
        }

{
