                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Try to come up with some neo-scents right now. This is neo-laundry, this is neo-flowers, and this is neo-delicious-steak I'll never get to eat because I'm in prison sniffing a spoon.",
                "mnemonic": "You can't remember what any of these {tooltip:Kanji:scent}s are anymore, you've been in prison for so long, so you call them all {tooltip:Reading:neo}-scents ({span:lang=ja:\u306b\u304a}). They're neo, they're new."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:next} {tooltip:Radical:plate} is the one you will {tooltip:Kanji:steal}. This one would be too obvious, better wait for the next one.",
            "hints": "Wait for this next plate. Here it is\u2014now steal it! Imagine stealing this plate and making off with it.",
