                "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Kanji:steal} this plate from a {span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3046\u304d\u3087\u3046} restaurant, so after you steal it, picture yourself running through the streets of {span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3046\u304d\u3087\u3046} as you lose your pursuers."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Picture a {tooltip:Radical:shellfish} {tooltip:Radical:lifeguard}. They're not going anywhere. First, they're a shellfish, so they can't really move. And, they're a lifeguard, so they need to be in their lifeguard tower. How does this shellfish lifeguard get stuff? Through {tooltip:Kanji:subscription} services.",
