                "mnemonic": "The shellfish lifeguard's favorite {tooltip:Kanji:subscription} is its subscription to {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3061} magazine. It has all the latest {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3061} versions, news, and interviews. "
