            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "There are some {tooltip:Radical:feathers} resting on a {tooltip:Radical:stand} and you and {tooltip:Kanji:the following} of the feathers are {tooltip:Kanji:following} the feathers. The feathers have a following, and you are one member of the following. You and your fellow followers follow the feathers wherever they may go.",
