                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine cleaning up egg yolk with a feather. The rest of the following follows your example and takes the other feathers, helping you clean up the yolk.",
                "mnemonic": "While you and {tooltip:Kanji:the following} are {tooltip:Kanji:following} the feathers from their departure from the stand, one of the members of the following drops an egg and {tooltip:Reading:yolk} ({span:lang=ja:\u3088\u304f}) spills everywhere. What a mess! Being a quick thinker, you use one of the feathers to soak up the yolk and clean up the mess."
