{
            "mnemonic": "You're stuck in a {tooltip:Radical:prison} on the {tooltip:Radical:sun} with nothing but a {tooltip:Radical:spoon}. Lucky for you a {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} is coming, so you take your spoon and use the tsunami to quench your {tooltip:Kanji:thirst}. You spoon the hot, hot water into your mouth as fast as you can. This is the only way to get water on the sun.",
            "hints": "Imagine this thirst of yours. You've been in this sun prison for longer than you can remember. You've been holding onto this spoon, waiting for this moment for so long.",
