{
            "mnemonic": "Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:photograph}. When you make that into a verb, you are doing a photograph, aka making it become {tooltip:Vocabulary:to take a picture}. It can also be {tooltip:Vocabulary:to film} as well. Really anything to do with a camera.",
