                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Think of the reading like you do the meaning {tooltip:Vocabulary:to take a photograph}. You \"take\" all these things, and how do you say \"to take\" in Japanese? It's {span:lang=ja:\u53d6\u308b}, aka {span:lang=ja:\u3068\u308b}, which happens to be the same reading!\n"
