{
            "mnemonic": "He's a creeper and he's Four-T (forty). If someone like this creeps on you, they're just a {tooltip:Radical:bully}. When you get to forty you aren't supposed to creep on people anymore. You bully. You jerk.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Bully"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Imagine this in your mouth. It's one tooth that sticks out more than any other. It's your {tooltip:Radical:fang}. Can you see this sticking out of a wolf mouth instead? Try that if you can't picture yourself with a fang this cool.",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
