{
            "mnemonic": "If you can write an interesting {tooltip:Radical:poem} about {tooltip:Radical:winter} while riding on a {tooltip:Radical:horse}, I\u2019ll be pretty {tooltip:Kanji:surprised}. It\u2019s hard enough to write a poem as it is, let alone an interesting one. And then you\u2019re riding on a horse and the poem has to be about winter? Heck, I\u2019d be surprised if you didn\u2019t fall off the horse and injure yourself.",
            "hints": "Imagine trying to write a poem while riding a horse. It\u2019d be really hard to do. I bet you\u2019d be surprised if you managed to do it as well.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Surprised"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
