                ],
                "hints": "Imagine riding through {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3068} on a horse. As if that wasn\u2019t difficult enough for poem writing, now you have all the sights and sounds of {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3068} to distract you as well.",
                "mnemonic": "You might also be {tooltip:Kanji:surprised} to learn that you are to ride this horse all across {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3068}. That gives you a time limit. You have until you traverse {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3068} to write this poem about winter."
            }
        }

{
