                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}For the reading, just think about this feeling you're having (this lamenting grieving one). Then, decide you're done with it. {tooltip:Reading:Throw} ({span:lang=ja:\u6295\u3052\u308b}) it out the window. You don't want these feels anymore!\n"
