                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}You should have learned this reading with the kanji, but here's a mnemonic to help you, just in case:\n{splitParent}What are you trying {tooltip:Vocabulary:to resemble}?? Is that... oh no. A {tooltip:Reading:knee} ({span:lang=ja:\u306b}) face resemble surgery, where you make your face look like your knee and vice versa? Do you know how dangerous that surgery is?\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u6700\u521d\u306f\u304a\u6bcd\u3055\u3093\u306b\u4f3c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3068\u601d\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3051\u3069\u3001\u3060\u3093\u3060\u3093\u304a\u7236\u3055\u3093\u306b\u3082\u4f3c\u3066\u304d\u305f\u306d\uff01",
                    "en": "At first I thought she looked like her mother, but then she started to look like her father too!"
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u3053\u306e\u30ba\u30dc\u30f3\u3001\u79c1\u304c\u305a\u3063\u3068\u63a2\u3057\u3066\u305f\u30ba\u30dc\u30f3\u306b\u4f3c\u3066\u308b\u3002",
                    "en": "These pants look like the ones I've been trying to find for a while."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u304a\u524d\u304c\u5f7c\u5973\u306e\u5144\u8cb4\u3060\u3063\u3066\uff1f\u5618\u3064\u3051\uff01\u5168\u7136\u4f3c\u3066\u306a\u3044\u3058\u3083\u306d\u3048\u304b\u3002",
                    "en": "Are you telling me that you\u2019re her brother? Liar! You look nothing like each other."
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
