            "mnemonic": "Mix {tooltip:Radical:spider}s into {tooltip:Radical:alcohol} to make {tooltip:Kanji:acid}. Spiders have a little bit in them already, but if you really want to make it potent, smash them in some whiskey to make a deadly acid that will rip through anything.",
            "hints": "Imagine crushing up some spiders into alcohol. Watch it turn green. It's going to eat through the beaker! Quick, do something!",
