                "mnemonic": "You're trying to find a container for this {tooltip:Kanji:acid} when {tooltip:Reading:San}ta-san ({span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3093}) bursts through your wall. He frowns down at you. You're on the naughty list now. You killed spiders AND made dangerous acid? Ooooh you're in trouble."
