{
            "mnemonic": "You come across a {tooltip:Radical:spirit} wearing a {tooltip:Radical:top hat} and it claims to be your {tooltip:Kanji:ancestor}. Well of course, if you remember correctly, all of your ancestors wore top hats when they were alive. This spirit must be your long lost, great great... uh... somebody.",
            "hints": "Imagine coming across your long dead top hatted ancestor in spirit form. What would you do? What would you say?",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Ancestor"
            },
