                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Your ancestor didn't come here to see you, it just wanted to learn about soap. Something that they didn't have back when it was alive. That's actually kinda sad... and stinky. Your ancestor needs to use this soap, if anything.",
                "mnemonic": "You ask your {tooltip:Kanji:ancestor} what it wants and it points to the {tooltip:Reading:so}ap ({span:lang=ja:\u305d}) by the sink. Soap? It nods at you. I guess your ancestor is here to see the wonders of soap."
            }
