                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Okay, so maybe this defense strategy will take a while, but you aren't rich and acorns are on the ground for free. Don't judge!",
                "mnemonic": "You need a good {tooltip:Kanji:defense} to go to Korea, so you fill your pockets with {tooltip:Reading:a}corns ({span:lang=ja:\u3048\u3044}). When you get to Korea you plant them all around yourself. In no time you'll have a strong tree defense, keeping you safe."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tree} combines with a {tooltip:Radical:table} to make a {tooltip:Kanji:desk}. When you think about it, a desk is just a table with more stuff. To make this more stuff, like drawers and such, you need more wood, and wood comes from trees. Add materials from the tree to the table and you have a desk.",
            "hints": "Chop this tree into pieces to transform this table into a desk. Hear the sounds of construction in your head as you make this desk with your bare hands.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Desk"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
