                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Just imagine someone slurring \u201cIt\u2019s cool, eh?\u201d While you think about how cool this desk really is. Run your hands over the finished project as you say it.",
                "mnemonic": "When you finish the {tooltip:Kanji:desk} you turn to your friend and say, \u201c{tooltip:Reading:It\u2019s cool, eh} ({span:lang=ja:\u3064\u304f\u3048})?\u201d Your friend looks at you and says, \u201cS\u2019coo\u2019 eh? What?\u201d \u201cThis desk, it\u2019s cool. It\u2019s cool, eh?\u201d \u201cAw, yeah man. S\u2019coo\u2019 eh.\u201d"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} hits the {tooltip:Radical:ground}, dumping all the muddy water onto this poor {tooltip:Radical:beggar}, making him very {tooltip:Kanji:dirty}.",
            "hints": "Picture the dirty beggar gasping for air on the dirty ground. He was not expecting to get hit by a tsunami today.",
