                "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:dye} continues to pass through the forest and hits a group of {tooltip:Reading:cen}taurs ({span:lang=ja:\u305b\u3093}). Now each centaur is dyed with the forest green dye. They don\u2019t look happy."
