{
            "mnemonic": "Two {tooltip:Radical:pool}s, both altered and not quite like a pool you\u2019ve seen before are put together and flipped around \u2013 this is an {tooltip:Kanji:egg}. One pool is the egg white, the other pool is the egg yolk. They\u2019re different, but similar.",
