                        "reading": "\u304c\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3081",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Look at Gandhi\u2019s eyeball with your eyeball. It's pretty remarkable.",
                "mnemonic": "You know who has some pretty good {tooltip:Kanji:eyeball}s? {tooltip:Reading:Gan}dhi ({span:lang=ja:\u304c\u3093}). Gandhi used his eyes to see the oppression around him and decided to do something about it. But it's all thanks to his eyeballs."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} that hits at {tooltip:Radical:night} leaves even more {tooltip:Kanji:fluid} than normal. It's dark at night, so the sun isn't there to help evaporate all that tsunami {tooltip:Kanji:liquid}.",
            "hints": "Picture the dark fluids from the tsunami flowing by your window at night. You look out and the liquid is shining in the moonlight. It looks like an entire sea is out there!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Fluid",
                "Alternative": "Liquid"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3048\u304d",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture the {span:lang=ja:\u99c5} filled to the brim with fluids and liquids. Maybe if you swim, you'll be able to catch your train.",
                "mnemonic": "This {tooltip:Kanji:fluid} stays in the {span:lang=ja:\u99c5} ({span:lang=ja:\u3048\u304d}) longer than anywhere else. All of those tsunami liquids pour deep inside the {span:lang=ja:\u99c5} late at night and the sun still can't reach them to help evaporate them during the day. It's a real *night*mare."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Take your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} and dig the {tooltip:Radical:tree} bits out of this {tooltip:Radical:cleat} to {tooltip:Kanji:gather} it into evidence. Gather it in a pile or a bag, just make sure it's all in one place so you can take a closer look later.",
            "hints": "Picture your fingers really getting in there to gather the tree pieces from out of this cleat. Some of the tree bits are stabbing under your fingernails, but you have to keep gathering them, don't stop now!",
            "meanings": {
