                        "reading": "\u3072\u3055",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Cucumbers are tasty, but not when you've been eating them for a long time.",
                "mnemonic": "You slide for such a {tooltip:Kanji:long time} that you get hungry. Luckily, once in a while a {tooltip:Reading:cu}cumber ({span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3085\u3046}) comes tumbling down the slide next to you."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:Viking} and his {tooltip:Radical:older brother} join a {tooltip:Kanji:party}. They can raid and pillage better in a {tooltip:Kanji:group} like this, so it makes sense that the Viking and his older brother would join a group with other Vikings.",
            "hints": "Look at this big group that contains the Viking and his older brother. Hear them shouting as a group and imagine their Viking battle cry.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Party",
                "Alternative": "Group"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
