                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You can imagine trying to break one of the mitts-wearing members of this group, but they can't tell you anything because of their magical mitts.",
                "mnemonic": "This {tooltip:Kanji:secrecy} is so secret that the people who know about it wear magical {tooltip:Reading:mitts} ({span:lang=ja:\u307f\u3064}) of secrecy that make it so we can't tell anyone, no matter what."
            }
