                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3059",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Just throw away all your suits when you want to relax. Don't worry about needing one some day, throw it awaaaay!",
                "mnemonic": "The number one thing you {tooltip:Kanji:throw away} while in your cottage is your {tooltip:Reading:su}it ({span:lang=ja:\u3059}). Suits just don't fit the cottage life vibe, man. "
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "They {tooltip:Radical:say} a {tooltip:Radical:shrimp} who is bad with {tooltip:Kanji:translation} has no {tooltip:Kanji:reason} to live. Most shrimp make a living with their translation skills. They are the translators of the ocean. If they don\u2019t know how to say something in all the languages of the sea, they have no reason to live. They might as well be dead.",
            "hints": "Imagine this one shrimp who is bad at translation. He\u2019s trying to find a reason to live, but he\u2019s having trouble. Look at him all alone, being shunned by the other shrimp.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Translation",
                "Alternative": "Reason"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3084\u304f",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u308f\u3051",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "The translation of the word yak was the reason this shrimp fell into despair and gave up the translation profession. Now everyone hates him. See this poor shrimp being harassed by others while they shout at him, \u201cYak! Yak! Yak!\u201d",
                "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:translation} this shrimp failed to make was for the word \u201c{tooltip:Reading:yak}\u201d ({span:lang=ja:\u3084\u304f}). The shrimp found no {tooltip:Kanji:reason} to translate yak because there are no yak in the sea and then the shrimp just started questioning everything in his life and fell apart."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "In the {tooltip:Radical:valley} you feel a {tooltip:Radical:lack} of {tooltip:Kanji:want}. You want for nothing in this valley. It is the valley of plenty.",
            "hints": "Think of how much you want to be in this valley. They have everything in there. You lack nothing. You want for nothing. Man, you wanna be in that valley so badly.",
