                "mnemonic": "Once you get to the valley, you {tooltip:Kanji:want} some protein. Egg {tooltip:Reading:yolk} ({span:lang=ja:\u3088\u304f}) falls from the sky! It\u2019s a miracle! You wanted protein, and egg yolk was presented. It falls right into your open mouth."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You're in the {tooltip:Radical:sun} playing {tooltip:Radical:football} and you get very {tooltip:Kanji:warm}.",
            "hints": "Feel how warm the sun is, as you try to throw and catch the football.",
