{
            "mnemonic": "This is the words {span:lang=ja:\u80cc} and {span:lang=ja:\u9ad8\u3044} put together to make one adjective. When your height is tall it means you are a {tooltip:Vocabulary:tall} person. This word is only used for tall people though, not anything else that's tall like a building or a tree.",
