{
            "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Kanji:illuminate} and then {tooltip:Kanji:bake} some food. To illuminate it, you put on some shiny sauce. Then, you cook it. Sound familiar, in terms of a type of food? This is {tooltip:Vocabulary:teriyaki}, though I have to warn you it's quite different from what you get at \"teriyaki shops\" in the west.",
