{
            "mnemonic": "This {tooltip:Radical:car} is all weird because it looks like the side is going to {tooltip:Kanji:dangle} and {tooltip:Kanji:drip} off or something. The front bumper of the car is dangling off and the sides of the car look like they could drip off at any moment.",
