                ],
                "hints": "Imagine yourself swinging off these dangling car parts. Hear the car creak and groan as you swing around on it, causing more fluid to drip out of the car.",
                "mnemonic": "You see the parts as they {tooltip:Kanji:dangle} off the car and you get an idea. You could probably {tooltip:Reading:swi}ng ({span:lang=ja:\u3059\u3044}) on these dangling parts. The parts can probably take some weight still before they {tooltip:Kanji:drip} off the car, so you might as well swing around on them while you still can."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} hits the {tooltip:Radical:greenhouse}, destroying the last remaining plant life in the area. The tsunami recedes, and there is nothing but sand, and the lands become a {tooltip:Kanji:desert}.",
            "hints": "The greenhouse was your only hope in turning the desert into a green forest. Now it's all washed away by salt water, meaning nothing will grow anyways. Feel disappointed about this.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Desert",
                "Alternative": "Vague"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
