{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:greenhouse} is already really good when it comes to a plant's livelihood. But add the {tooltip:Radical:sun} into that equation and you have something really great for the plants. Their {tooltip:Kanji:livelihood} will be awesome, now!",
            "hints": "Just feel happy that your plants have such a nice livelihood now that the sun is out. They look so healthy and fresh!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Livelihood"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
