                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Look at Bobo do what he needs to do to maintain his own livelihood. Hear the flowers screaming as they are plucked from their homes.",
                "mnemonic": "From out of nowhere, {tooltip:Reading:Bo}bo ({span:lang=ja:\u307c}) the notorious clown thief starts picking the plants, ending their {tooltip:Kanji:livelihood}. Bobo needs the flowers for his clown acts, so he uses the livelihood of the flowers to support his own livelihood."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Those that are in the {tooltip:Radical:middle} of your {tooltip:Radical:heart} are the ones you have the most {tooltip:Kanji:loyalty} towards. The middle of your heart is the most sacred, special place for people, so it makes sense that those you keep in the middle of your heart are those you are most loyal to.",
            "hints": "Who do you feel the most loyalty towards? Imagine them in the middle of your heart. Feel them in your chest. Imagine them, literally inside the middle of your heart.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Loyalty"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3061\u3085\u3046",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Chewbacca is very loyal. Focus on your loyalty to Chewbacca. Picture him right in the middle of your heart and hear his Chewbacca yell. Also keep in mind that this kanji shares its reading with {span:lang=ja:\u4e2d} which is also included in this kanji.",
                "mnemonic": "You pictured {tooltip:Reading:Chew}bacca ({span:lang=ja:\u3061\u3085\u3046}), didn\u2019t you? No? Well you should have. Chewbacca deserves everyone\u2019s {tooltip:Kanji:loyalty}. Chewbacca is super loyal to you, so he deserves your loyalty back."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "There is a {tooltip:Radical:moon} and a {tooltip:Radical:city} inside your {tooltip:Kanji:lung}. Inside of your lung there is a city and above that city lies a moon. It\u2019s a pretty sight, but also very strange. Moons and cities don\u2019t usually reside inside lungs.",
            "hints": "Imagine having a moon and a city inside your lung. Feel their presence as you breathe in and breathe out. Also, {span:lang=ja:\u6708} often refers to internal organs as well, so remember that when you see this kanji.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Lung"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u306f\u3044",
