                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Listen as the Not Mouth continues to scream in bloodcurdling agony. Hear the flames flicker as they lick across the Not Mouth\u2019s being. Seems as though the heat was too much for the Not Mouth.",
                "mnemonic": "You ask the Not Mouth if it is afraid of {tooltip:Reading:he}at ({span:lang=ja:\u3072}). The Not Mouth says, \u201c{tooltip:Kanji:no}\u201d. So you set the Not Mouth on fire. The Not Mouth then screams, \u201cNONONONONONONONONONOOOOOO~!\u201d Looks like someone can\u2019t handle the heat."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If you {tooltip:Radical:become} a {tooltip:Radical:plate}, I will {tooltip:Kanji:pile} food up upon you. With such a huge pile, everyone will think you're {tooltip:Kanji:prosperous}.",
            "hints": "If you have piles of something, you're prosperous. If you become a plate, that's the best thing that can happen to you.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Pile",
