                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Be really proud of your storehouse. You've collected a lot of zombies and put them in there, where they'll keep fresh a long time!",
                "mnemonic": "You have a {tooltip:Kanji:storehouse}. Inside is where you keep all your {tooltip:Reading:zo}mbies ({span:lang=ja:\u305e\u3046})."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Bring {tooltip:Radical:rice} under a {tooltip:Radical:canopy}, crush it with your {tooltip:Radical:brush}, and sweep the white powder in your {tooltip:Radical:mouth}... it's {tooltip:Kanji:sugar} now! You make sugar by carefully crushing rice to a powder, until it's small enough to brush into your mouth.",
            "hints": "Taste the sugar in your mouth and feel the breeze waft under the canopy. You're surrounded by rice, but what's in your mouth is definitely sugar now.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Sugar"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3068\u3046",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "As you eat the sugar, you picture {span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3046\u304d\u3087\u3046}. The place where you fell in love with these sugar-making techniques.",
                "mnemonic": "You learned how to make {tooltip:Kanji:sugar} in {span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3046\u304d\u3087\u3046}. You found a special {span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3046\u304d\u3087\u3046} sugar sensei and they introduced you to all of the secret methods you know now."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:thread} you have {tooltip:Radical:inside} is your whole {tooltip:Kanji:supply}. When you're outside sewing and you run out, you just go inside, look through your supply, and pick a new one.",
            "hints": "Go inside your house or shed, it doesn't matter where, and look happily at your thread supply. You have thread in all sizes, shapes, and especially colors.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Supply"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u306e\u3046",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304a\u3055, \u306a\u3063",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Nostradamus says you should have a large supply of everything you use regularly. Thread, water, canned foods. You can't see the future, but he can, and if he's telling you to stock up on your inside supplies I think you should listen.",
                "mnemonic": "You have this {tooltip:Kanji:supply} because {tooltip:Reading:No}stradamus ({span:lang=ja:\u306e\u3046}) had a prediction, saying you would. And that if you didn't keep a good supply of thread inside, you'd run out."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "They {tooltip:Radical:say} {tooltip:Radical:someone} with {tooltip:Kanji:various} talents is important. Various talents can include speaking various languages so if you are someone who knows various languages you can say things that various peoples will comprehend.",
            "hints": "You are someone who can say things in various languages. Speak some of these various languages now. You are someone who is good at saying things. Nice job.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Various"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3057\u3087",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3082\u308d",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine yourself at this show. The spotlight is on and all eyes are watching. You feel kind of nervous, but you speak the various languages with ease.",
                "mnemonic": "You\u2019re so good at speaking {tooltip:Kanji:various} languages that you decide to put on a {tooltip:Reading:sho}w ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3087}). At the show, you say a lot of things in various languages and everyone is impressed."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:hole} leading to the {tooltip:Radical:private} {tooltip:Radical:heart} of your house is the {tooltip:Kanji:window}. Or maybe it's just the window to your soul, and not your house. Like the poetry people say.",
            "hints": "Imagine someone looking into a hole that shows your private heart. That's a window. A window you probably should have kept closed. Now everyone is looking in.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Window"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
