                        "reading": "\u307e\u3069",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Look out your window back at the faces. Try to express how mad you are at them with your face through the glass. Make as many mad faces that you can think of.",
                "mnemonic": "You realize that a ton of people are looking into your {tooltip:Kanji:window} and seeing all your private things. This makes you {tooltip:Reading:mad} ({span:lang=ja:\u307e\u3069})! What right do they have to know your private thoughts and desires?!"
