                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}The reading for {span:lang=ja:\u5bb6} is an exceptional one. It is {span:lang=ja:\u3084}, because when your landlord asks if you paid your rent, you always say {tooltip:Reading:yah} ({span:lang=ja:\u3084}), whether you did or not.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u5b89\u6708\u7d66\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u3053\u306e\u5bb6\u8cc3\u3060\u3063\u305f\u3089\u4f55\u3068\u304b\u66ae\u3089\u3057\u3066\u3044\u3051\u305d\u3046\u304b\u306a\u3002",
                    "en": "If the rent is this much, I might be able to manage living on a small salary."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u6628\u65e5\u3001\u30a2\u30d1\u30fc\u30c8\u306e\u5951\u7d04\u3053\u3046\u65b0\u3057\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u53bb\u5e74\u304b\u3089\u5bb6\u8cc3\u304c500\u30c9\u30eb\u3082\u4e0a\u304c\u3063\u305f\u3063\u3066\u3069\u3046\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\uff1f\u4e00\u3057\u3085\u3093\u5f15\u3063\u8d8a\u305d\u3046\u304b\u3068\u601d\u3063\u305f\u3088\u3002",
                    "en": "I renewed my contract for the apartment yesterday, but I didn't understand why the rent was $500 more than last year. I thought about moving out for a second."
                },
                {
                    "ja": "\u30d5\u30b0\u304c\u79c1\u306b\u3069\u3093\u306a\u6271\u3044\u3092\u3057\u3066\u305f\u304b\u8003\u3048\u3066\u307f\u308b\u3068\u3001\u5f7c\u304c\u3069\u308c\u3060\u3051\u6700\u4f4e\u7537\u3060\u3063\u305f\u304b\u304c\u5206\u304b\u308b\u308f\u3002\u79c1\u306f\u5f7c\u306e\u5bb6\u8cc3\u304b\u3089\u96fb\u8a71\u4ee3\u304b\u3089\u98df\u8cbb\u304b\u3089\u4f55\u304b\u3089\u4f55\u307e\u3067\u6255\u3063\u3066\u3042\u3052\u3066\u3044\u305f\u306e\u306b\u3001\u3042\u306e\u7537\u306f\u4ed6\u306e\u5973\u3068\u6d6e\u6c17\u3057\u3066\u305f\u306e\u3088\uff01",
                    "en": "When I think about the way Fugu treated me, I realized that he was a real jerk. I paid his rent, phone bills, groceries, and everything, but he ended up cheating on me!"
                }
            ],
            "collocations": []
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You already know that {span:lang=ja:\u7406\u5c48} means \"theory\". So what's {tooltip:Kanji:flatulence} theory? It's an {tooltip:Vocabulary:illogical argument}, a {tooltip:Vocabulary:far-fetched argument}, or sometimes a {tooltip:Vocabulary:lame excuse}. It's all just hot air!",
            "hints": "",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Illogical Argument",
                "Alternatives": "Far-Fetched Argument, Lame Excuse",
                "Word Type": "noun"
            },
            "vocabReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "primary": true,
                        "reading": "\u3078\u308a\u304f\u3064"
                    }
                ],
                "pronunciationAudios": [
