{
            "mnemonic": "Inside the {tooltip:Radical:building} is the {tooltip:Radical:Winter} {tooltip:Radical:Cow}. You need to see it, so you go inside. It is deep down in there, and you'll have to {tooltip:Kanji:descend} to reach it.",
            "hints": "Focus on descending the stairs. There are many signs that say \"To Winter Cow: descend\" with an arrow pointing down. \"I guess I'll have to descend,\" you say.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Descend"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3053\u3046",
