                "hints": "\"Hello, thank you for descending all the way down here to see me,\" says the Winter Cow with {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3061}'s face. \"You thought you could use the Winter Cow to stop me, but as you can see, I got here first.\"",
                "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Kanji:descend} to the bottom and there it is, the Winter Cow. You walk up to the cow, and it swings its head back to see you. Instead of a cow's face, it's {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3061}'s face."
            }
        }

{
