                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Basically, you store zombies in your regular storehouse, harvest their organs, then launch them into space where they are put into a storehouse on the moon where the zombies will never be able to find them again.",
                "mnemonic": "Where did you get all these {tooltip:Kanji:internal organ}s from? You actually harvested them from the {tooltip:Reading:zo}mbies ({span:lang=ja:\u305e\u3046}) from your other storehouse. "
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Raise your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} to another {tooltip:Radical:member} and you'll receive a {tooltip:Kanji:loss} in return. You should never hurt a member of your team, group, or society. It's just wrong. And you'll incur a loss as punishment for your bad deeds.",
            "hints": "Imagine raising your fingers to slap, hurt, or point angrily at a member of your own team. How dare you! I hope you're ready for some deep, personal loss.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Loss"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305d\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305d\u3053",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture your son. Your future son, maybe even your animal son, if you don't want to have real kids. Now imagine the loss of that son. Nooooo!",
                "mnemonic": "Unfortunately for you, payment is in the form of the {tooltip:Kanji:loss} of your {tooltip:Reading:son} ({span:lang=ja:\u305d\u3093}). The loss of any family member is horrible, but this was your son. He was your favorite child. You loved him. But that's the loss you must bear for raising your fingers to a team member."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Seeing a {tooltip:Radical:stone} and some {tooltip:Radical:horns} on the {tooltip:Radical:ground} next to a piece of {tooltip:Radical:poop} and another piece of {tooltip:Radical:poop}, you try and pick each of them up with a {tooltip:Kanji:magnet}. The magnet fails to pick up either piece of poop. The magnet doesn\u2019t pick up the horns either. But wait! The magnet picks up the stone!",
            "hints": "Imagine yourself trying to pick each object up off the ground with your magnet. Hear the clink of the stone against metal as the magnet lifts it off the ground. Must be some iron in it or something.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Magnet"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
