                "hints": "Imagine Jesus snickering behind you as the stone falls to the ground once again. Imagine running after Jesus so you can catch him and give him a piece of your mind. He\u2019s always playing tricks on you.",
                "mnemonic": "You\u2019re pretty excited that you lifted something up with your {tooltip:Kanji:magnet}. Science is cool! But then you hear someone laughing behind you. It\u2019s {tooltip:Reading:Je}sus ({span:lang=ja:\u3058})! Jesus was using his magic to levitate the stone all along, it wasn\u2019t your magnet. Darn it Jesus! You\u2019ve fooled me for the last time!"
