{
            "mnemonic": "They {tooltip:Radical:say} accidentally firing a {tooltip:Radical:catapult} is an unforgivable {tooltip:Kanji:mistake}. They say you shot the catapult at your own castle. Even though it was an accident, it\u2019s still a mistake you will never be forgiven for.",
            "hints": "Imagine shooting the catapult on your own people by mistake. Hear the catapult whoosh as your heart drops into your stomach. Oh, what a terrible mistake you\u2019ve just made.",
