                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Okay, so maybe building a pure barracks that you can only use in June was a bad idea, but it's there now and I don't want you getting it dirty, so just use it when I say so, okay?",
                "mnemonic": "This {tooltip:Kanji:pure} thread barracks can only be used in {tooltip:Reading:June} ({span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3085\u3093}), unfortunately. Any other time of year there will be snow and rain and mud and that will get tracked into the pure barracks and ruin them. But June is the cleanest, most pure month, so you can use it then."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You want some {tooltip:Radical:flowers} to put on the {tooltip:Radical:canopy} above your {tooltip:Radical:helicopter} to keep the {tooltip:Radical:bird}s away, so you ask people what they would {tooltip:Kanji:recommend}.",
