                    }
                ],
                "hints": "I hope the centaur recommends a cheap flower... but with your luck flowers that keep birds away will cost a fortune.",
                "mnemonic": "You ask for a {tooltip:Kanji:recommend}ation from the {tooltip:Reading:cen}taur ({span:lang=ja:\u305b\u3093}) that owns the local flower shop. Now he's walking around your helicopter canopy and staring at the birds, nodding."
