{
            "mnemonic": "Into a {tooltip:Radical:well}, a {tooltip:Radical:drop} of rice falls from your {tooltip:Kanji:rice bowl}. You were eating out of your rice bowl on the side of a well, and some rice fell out of your rice bowl and this drop of rice proceeded to fall all the way down.",
            "hints": "You lost a drop of rice from your rice bowl. Feel sorrow for the lost rice as you watch it fall down the well and hear it splat into the water below.",
            "meanings": {
