{
            "mnemonic": "You need to take a {tooltip:Radical:body} {tooltip:Radical:measurement} before you can {tooltip:Kanji:shoot}. Whether it's for a photo shoot, you're gonna shoot them with a gun, or if you're about to shoot them full of radiation for X-rays, you need the right measurements of that body first.",
