{
            "mnemonic": "A magic {tooltip:Radical:thread} fell from the {tooltip:Radical:roof} onto the {tooltip:Radical:leader} of a {tooltip:Radical:hundred} people, causing him to {tooltip:Kanji:shrink}!",
            "hints": "Picture one hundred people under the same roof watching in horror as their leader suddenly shrinks to nothingness before them.",
