{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:samurai} has a {tooltip:Radical:jackhammer}, a {tooltip:Radical:brush}, and some {tooltip:Radical:water}. All these things tell you that this samurai is actually a {tooltip:Kanji:slave}.",
            "hints": "Traditionally, samurai don't carry things like jackhammers, brushes, or water. The samurai is carrying these things for someone else, meaning this samurai is somebody's slave.",
