{
            "mnemonic": "There\u2019s some {tooltip:Radical:rice} in the shape of a {tooltip:Radical:nine} on a {tooltip:Radical:cross} and this is {tooltip:Kanji:stylish}. The rice grains are arranged to form the number nine. This number nine is prominently displayed on the cross, and it\u2019s stylish to carry it around and be seen with it.",
            "hints": "Imagine hefting this cross with the rice in the shape of a nine on it. You don\u2019t feel stylish, but society tells you that you are. You\u2019re stylish.",
            "meanings": {
