                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "See the rice fly through the air from you swinging the cross. Hear it as it clatters to the ground. This cross just isn\u2019t as stylish anymore now.",
                "mnemonic": "It\u2019s also {tooltip:Kanji:stylish} to {tooltip:Reading:swi}ng ({span:lang=ja:\u3059\u3044}) the cross around while you wait for things. You\u2019re waiting at a bus stop so you swing the cross around violently. You swing it so violently that the rice comes flying off!"
            }
