{
            "mnemonic": "You see a {tooltip:Radical:thread} that wants to {tooltip:Radical:loiter} from some {tooltip:Radical:horns} and you would be {tooltip:Radical:correct} to assume that it would hang {tooltip:Kanji:vertical}. The thread wants to loiter and hang from one of the horns. When things hang from things, they usually hang vertical, so that\u2019s what this thread is going to do.",
