{
            "mnemonic": "Take your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} and {tooltip:Radical:dry} them. Then {tooltip:Radical:dry} them again. This is what you do when you are in  {tooltip:Kanji:worship}. Once you go into your place of worship, and again before you leave. You have really sweaty fingers, and you can't worship anyone or anything if you have wet hands. So you dry them!",
