{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:ability} to {tooltip:Radical:boil} is one of the main abilities of a {tooltip:Kanji:bear}.",
            "hints": "I bet you didn't know this, but a bear can boil whenever it wants. Imagine a bear heating itself up and boiling, its fur and skin bubbling and letting off steam.",
