                "hints": "You can also imagine Mrs. Chou doing the act of carving someone's hair out, but that may just be too much.",
                "mnemonic": "When you think of all the people who could have done this... all the people who could have {tooltip:Kanji:carve}d out someone's hair, only one person comes to mind, and that is Mrs. {tooltip:Reading:Chou} ({span:lang=ja:\u3061\u3087\u3046}). She's the only person evil enough to do something like this."
