{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:ground} and a {tooltip:Radical:shuriken} have {tooltip:Kanji:mutual} respect for one another. The shuriken respects the ground because of how solid and stable it is, and the ground respects the shuriken for how pointy it is. They have great mutual respect here.",
