                "mnemonic": "You pull the cross out of your {tooltip:Kanji:soup} and see that the cross' {tooltip:Reading:jew}els ({span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3085\u3046}) fell off and are in there now. The jewels sparkle, shine, and dissolve into the soup!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:commander}'s {tooltip:Radical:alcohol} is really just {tooltip:Kanji:soy sauce}. When he goes out to drink with his troops and they all get drunk together, he manages to have fun and stay sober by drinking down a tasty, non-alcoholic pint of soy sauce.",
            "hints": "The next time you go to a bar, order yourself a commander's alcohol. It's like saying you want a Roy Rogers or a Shirley Temple, except it isn't pretty and it tastes horrible.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Soy Sauce"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
