                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture the Shougun sitting on his throne, guzzling down some salty, brown soy sauce. It's splashing on his robes and the smell is making his assistants gag.",
                "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Kanji:Soy sauce} also happens to be the {tooltip:Reading:Shou}gun's ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3087\u3046}) favorite drink. Unfortunately, he can't just tell people he likes drinking glasses of soy sauce, or they'll look at him weird. Instead he orders it as a commander's alcohol too."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tsunami}, once stopped by a {tooltip:Radical:belt}, will begin to {tooltip:Kanji:stagnate}. This belt is a belt of water resistance, so the belt stops the tsunami. The belt has caused the tsunami to stagnate.",
            "hints": "Watch this belt as it stagnated the tsunami. See the belt glow as its enchantment activates, immediately stagnating the tsunami water.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Stagnate"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305f\u3044",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3068\u3069\u3053\u304a",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Look in the mirror at you in your tie. Put the finishing touches on your outfit and imagine going out into the world with your tie on, no longer afraid of any tsunamis. They\u2019re all stagnant now thanks to that magical belt.",
                "mnemonic": "While you watch the tsunami {tooltip:Kanji:stagnate}, you get ready for work. While you were watching this whole thing happening, you were tying your {tooltip:Reading:tie} ({span:lang=ja:\u305f\u3044}). Once the tsunami stagnated, you were all done tying your tie. And since the tsunami is no longer a threat, you\u2019re ready to go to work."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Tie a {tooltip:Radical:squid} to a {tooltip:Radical:knife} and you get a {tooltip:Kanji:sword}! Knives are too small to be considered a sword on their own. That's why you strapped a squid to it. They're the right shape, kinda pointed, so no one will know it's just a knife.",
