                "mnemonic": "You learned how to make {tooltip:Kanji:sword}s this way from {tooltip:Reading:Ken} ({span:lang=ja:\u3051\u3093}) the samurai. He put his own little squid buddy on his knife and now no one realizes it's not a sword!"
            }
