{
            "mnemonic": "Because the hiragana ends with an {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound, you know this word is a verb. The kanji itself means {tooltip:Kanji:stagnate}, and the verb vocab version is {tooltip:Vocabulary:to be overdue}. After all, if something stagnates, it's not advancing, which causes it {tooltip:Vocabulary:to be delayed}.",
