                        "file": "34238-subject-5877.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Your work tends {tooltip:Vocabulary:to be overdue}, so you get a lot of {tooltip:Reading:to-do call}s ({span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3069\u3053\u304a\u308b}) from your boss, reminding you to do your work. These calls are pretty annoying, but at least your work is less delayed.\n"
