{
            "mnemonic": "Remember how you learned that {span:lang=ja:\u66ae\u3089\u3059} means \"to live?\" Well when you're in too much of a rush ({span:lang=ja:\u3089\u3059}) to live life to the fullest, you won't notice it start {tooltip:Vocabulary:to get dark}. You try to live day and night until it starts {tooltip:Vocabulary:to end}. Shine on in that darkness!",
