{
            "mnemonic": "There is a {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} in the {tooltip:Radical:middle} of the {tooltip:Kanji:open sea}. Luckily there are no ships around, so the tsunami in the middle of the open sea is not damaging to anyone.",
            "hints": "Look at this tsunami in the middle of the open sea. When the tsunami isn\u2019t destroying things and is just out there in the open sea it looks really majestic and pretty.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Open Sea"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3061\u3085\u3046",
