{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:leader} has {tooltip:Radical:clothes} that he is quite {tooltip:Kanji:reliant} on. The leader needs his clothes to make him look like a leader. The leader has become more reliant on his clothes than he is on his actual skills as a leader!",
