                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Salmon. Drink {span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3051}. Salmon. Drink {span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3051}. Salmon. Drink...{splitParent}\"Ughhh.... I'm feeling tipsy... Hey, where's my {span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3083\u3051}!?\"",
                "mnemonic": "You make a drinking game out of watching the {tooltip:Kanji:salmon} going up stream. Every time one jumps onto the dirt, you drink a shot of {tooltip:Reading:\u9152} ({span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3051}). You realize you're drunk when you ask for more {span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3051} but it comes out as {tooltip:Reading:\u3057\u3083\u3051}."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You soak each {tooltip:Radical:foot} in {tooltip:Radical:water} before going out in the {tooltip:Radical:sun} to take your first {tooltip:Kanji:step}. Stepping on the ground when it's been baking in the hot sun can burn your feet, so you're careful to make them wet with water before stepping outside even once.",
            "hints": "Imagine each step on hot, sun-baked asphalt. The water under your feet sizzles, leaving steaming footprints where you stepped from.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Step"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3068\u3046",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3075",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Each step is taking you closer to {span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3046\u304d\u3087\u3046}. Don't forget that, no matter how hard it seems, don't lose your motivation to keep stepping forward toward your goal. \u2661",
                "mnemonic": "Each {tooltip:Kanji:step} you take brings you closer to {span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3046\u304d\u3087\u3046}. Unfortunately, the sun keeps getting hotter, meaning you have to take breaks between steps more often, to get your feet wet with even more water. But you're determined to reach {span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3046\u304d\u3087\u3046}, no matter how many steps it takes."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:leader} who's {tooltip:Radical:humble} will {tooltip:Kanji:stretch} in front of everyone. They'll show that they have to get up every hour or so and stretch just like the rest of us.",
            "hints": "The leader is humble and human, just like the rest of us, and has to stretch to stay healthy too. He's not some kind of god!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Stretch"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3057\u3093",
