{
            "mnemonic": "You send your {tooltip:Radical:private} {tooltip:Radical:sword} man out with your {tooltip:Radical:shellfish} so he can {tooltip:Kanji:trade} them. Shellfish were used as currency back in the olden days. And you aren't going to go out trading and dirty your own hands, no no. Trading your shellfish is the job for the private sword you hired!",
            "hints": "Imagine your private sword holding a big bag of shellfish and going off to market to trade them.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Trade"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
