                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Oh boy, I hope my private sword trades my shellfish for that new bowling ball I heard about!",
                "mnemonic": "While he's out making the {tooltip:Kanji:trade} for you, you decide to relax and do some {tooltip:Reading:bow}ling ({span:lang=ja:\u307c\u3046}). In fact, you can't wait for the trade to be done because you're hoping he's going to come back with a new bowling ball for you."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:bundle} of {tooltip:Radical:geoduck}s is something you can always {tooltip:Kanji:trust}.",
