{
            "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Radical:run} and {tooltip:Radical:call} out to people at the same time because you're {tooltip:Kanji:super} {tooltip:Kanji:ultra} excited right now. You have a super crazy amount of energy you need to get out with your running and calling.",
