                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Do you know the width of a habanero? It's one scarecrow minus one cloth.",
                "mnemonic": "You finish measuring the {tooltip:Kanji:width} of the scarecrow and the width of the towel, and you realize you're the width of a {tooltip:Reading:haba}nero ({span:lang=ja:\u306f\u3070}) pepper short. This is fine, you grow those. This is a whole field of habaneros! So you pluck one off the nearest plant, tape it to the cloth, and cover that scarecrow right up."
