            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You brought {tooltip:Radical:flowers} to place on top of the place where a {tooltip:Radical:yakuza} took a {tooltip:Radical:spoon} and killed {tooltip:Radical:twenty} people, and there is now a {tooltip:Kanji:burial} happening. You carefully toss the flowers in with the dirt and everything is buried together.",
