{
            "mnemonic": "You're in {tooltip:Radical:prison}, but you can use your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} and a {tooltip:Radical:spoon} in the light of the {tooltip:Radical:sun} to {tooltip:Kanji:display} little moving pictures on your cell wall. It's like a shadow puppet display except you can only make a few characters with your limited hand tools.",
