            "mnemonic": "Someone is offering you a {tooltip:Radical:shellfish} in exchange for a {tooltip:Radical:kiss}. This is a {tooltip:Kanji:bribe}! You don't want to kiss them, but that shellfish sure looks tasty.",
            "hints": "\"Come on, don't you want this shellfish?\" they ask, shaking it up and down at you.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Bribe"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
