                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "This is why you never accept a bribe. One second you're staring a yummy shellfish in the face, and the next you're standing alone in the road feeling used.",
                "mnemonic": "You go through with the {tooltip:Kanji:bribe} and kiss the person, but then they snatch hold of the shellfish and run straight down the {tooltip:Reading:ro}ad ({span:lang=ja:\u308d}). No!!"
