{
            "mnemonic": "In the {tooltip:Radical:rain} I take my {tooltip:Radical:rake} and shake it, making a {tooltip:Kanji:demand} that the rain stop! I demand this rain stop right now! Don\u2019t make me shake my rake more violently than I am currently shaking it!",
            "hints": "Go out into the rain and shake your rake. Imagine shouting your demand at the sky as the rain pelts you from above.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Demand"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3058\u3085",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture yourself demanding more rain from the sky, trying to fill up your tiny juice box with what little juice rain you were able to get.",
                "mnemonic": "Now imagine the rain changing. Wait a second, this isn't rain, it's {tooltip:Reading:ju}ice ({span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3085})! You shake your rake harder, and {tooltip:Kanji:demand} that the juice rain continues. It doesn't listen to your demands and stops as soon as you start bottling it. Well, at least you have enough for one, really small juice box. "
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You offer a {tooltip:Radical:hot pepper} to the {tooltip:Radical:king}, and he gives you a {tooltip:Radical:drop} of something. You look down at the drop to see it transforming into a {tooltip:Kanji:disc}. And not just any old disc at that. It's a {tooltip:Kanji:jade disc}.",
            "hints": "You took a long time to pick out the perfect hot pepper. Only the best for the king, right? It burned your hands a little as you held it on your way to the palace. You were hoping for something pretty special in return, but you never imagined it would be a drop that magically turns into a disc. Wow!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Disc",
                "Alternative": "Jade Disc"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3078\u304d",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305f\u307e",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You start to realize just how crazy the situation is. Seriously. How the heck is a drop able to turn into a jade disc?",
                "mnemonic": "Wait, did a drop really just change into a {tooltip:Kanji:disc}? What the {tooltip:Reading:heck i}s ({span:lang=ja:\u3078\u304d}) going on?"
            }
        }

{
