{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:woman} who has a {tooltip:Radical:landslide} getting ready inside her is {tooltip:Kanji:pregnant}. And that baby is gonna come out like a landslide.",
            "hints": "Picture an ultrasound of the pregnant woman, but instead of a little baby heartbeat, you hear a scary roaring sound. That's what being pregnant is like. Waiting for the landslide to come.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Pregnant"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3057\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine being pregnant and getting kicked by the shins of your baby all day, but especially all night. You're so tired. Please let this landslide come already.",
                "mnemonic": "When you're {tooltip:Kanji:pregnant} the baby is constantly kicking you with their {tooltip:Reading:shin}s ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3093}). Not their feet, their shins. And shins are really hard, let me tell you."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:woman} sleeps with the {tooltip:Radical:king} and becomes {tooltip:Kanji:pregnant}. Only the king wasn\u2019t human and now the woman is pregnant with a hybrid alien baby!",
            "hints": "The king radical is slightly altered in this kanji, so just remember that the king is a strange alien and not human. Imagine being this woman and having this half-breed alien baby inside you. Feels weird.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Pregnant"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u306b\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "What game are you playing on the Nintendo? Maybe it\u2019s a game where you kill alien invaders? That\u2019s messed up.",
                "mnemonic": "Being {tooltip:Kanji:pregnant} with this strange creature, you need to do something to calm you down. You should play {tooltip:Reading:Nin}tendo ({span:lang=ja:\u306b\u3093}). Nintendo really calms your nerves and makes being pregnant with some mutant baby not seem like that big of a deal anymore."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You put on the {tooltip:Radical:shellfish} {tooltip:Radical:mask} once per year and break into people's beach houses, leaving behind {tooltip:Kanji:presents}.",
            "hints": "You're like beach santa, except you're real and you wear a mask made of shellfish.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Presents"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305e\u3046",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304a\u304f",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Ooh hoo, it's me! the Shellfish Mask Man!\n{linebreak}I go to beach houses and leave presents where I can!\n{linebreak}The presents are not clothes, or anything good.\n{linebreak}I don't even care if you leave me some food.\n{linebreak}Try whipping some up, try cooking me peas,\n{linebreak}It matters not, I'll leave you zombies!{splitParent}Tee hee hee hee hee!",
                "mnemonic": "The \"{tooltip:Kanji:presents}\" you leave? They are actually just {tooltip:Reading:zo}mbies ({span:lang=ja:\u305e\u3046}). You leave zombies in people's houses."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Shove your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} into a bowl of {tooltip:Radical:shrimp} to {tooltip:Kanji:select} the best one. You know your shrimp and you know them well, so you won't settle for anything less than the best. Put your whole arm in there and feel around until you can select the one you want most.",
            "hints": "Feel your fingers touching each and every shrimp, one by one, until they graze the one you select as the perfect shrimp. Slowly pull it out and lower it into your mouth. Munch munch... ahhh! The perfect shrimp.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Select"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305f\u304f",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3048\u3089",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Oh, woe is me! How will I select the perfect shrimp with my fingers if there are tacks in the shrimp bowls! Boohoohoo!",
                "mnemonic": "You do this at every restaurant, party, and indoor sporting event and people start getting wise to your shrimp {tooltip:Kanji:select}ion methods. One day, as you attempt to select your shrimp, a sharp pain shoots through your finger. Ow! You pull your hand back to find... a {tooltip:Reading:tack} ({span:lang=ja:\u305f\u304f})!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "There's a {tooltip:Radical:scooter} coming toward you with a {tooltip:Radical:net} trapping a weird {tooltip:Radical:zombie} on it. You don't want this here, so you decide to {tooltip:Kanji:send back} the zombie.",
            "hints": "You want to send back this zombie the way it came. You definitely don't want it loose in your neighborhood.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Send Back"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304b\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304b\u3048",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You managed to send back the zombie, good for you! Genghis Khan would be proud.",
                "mnemonic": "As you prepare to {tooltip:Kanji:send back} the zombie, you imagine yourself as Genghis {tooltip:Reading:Khan} ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u3093}). On your horse (it's just your own scooter) you stab forward with your spear (stick), swing the scooter the zombie is on, and send it back from whence it came!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You have {tooltip:Radical:thread} and some {tooltip:Radical:syrup} and you need to {tooltip:Kanji:spin} them together. Drip the syrup onto the thread and spin it around and around over your head.",
            "hints": "Imagine carefully dripping syrup onto a thread and then spinning it in a circle.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Spin"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305d\u3046",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304f",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine eating a syrup cookie you made by spinning it yourself. Homemade is always better than store-bought.",
                "mnemonic": "As you {tooltip:Kanji:spin} the syrup, it begins to change shape and forms into a {tooltip:Reading:coo}kie ({span:lang=ja:\u304f})! Haven't you ever made syrup-spun cookies before? The spinning forms and cooks them in the air."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Use your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} on the {tooltip:Radical:cat pirate} to {tooltip:Kanji:suppress} him. The cat pirate was attacking you, so you took your fingers and pet his head and scratched his chin. Now he's calm and suppressed. He doesn't even remember why he was attacking you.",
            "hints": "Imagine suppressing a cat pirate with your own fingers. His fur is so soft, but his nails are so sharp!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Suppress"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3088\u304f",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304a\u3055",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Defend the yolk! Smell the smell of eggs in the air as you suppress the cat pirate. Maybe even share the yolk with him, once he's done trying to kill you for it. And then enjoy breakfast while petting your new cat friend.",
                "mnemonic": "He forgot, but you know you had to {tooltip:Kanji:suppress} the cat pirate because he was trying to steal your egg {tooltip:Reading:yolk} ({span:lang=ja:\u3088\u304f}). You were making breakfast on your ship and the cat pirate boarded you out of nowhere, and tried to take it by force."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "In your {tooltip:Radical:prefecture}, you come from a long {tooltip:Radical:lineage} of people who share one {tooltip:Radical:heart}. When the heart is passed on to the next in line, it flies out of their body, and {tooltip:Kanji:suspend}s itself in the sky, for you to take.",
            "hints": "You see the suspended heart in the distance, and make your way towards it.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Suspend"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3051\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304b",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "\"I've protected this suspended heart for you, for you are next in the lineage to receive it.\" He grabs the heart and throws it into your body.",
                "mnemonic": "You arrive at the {tooltip:Kanji:suspend}ed heart. There in front of it, protecting it, is {tooltip:Reading:Ken} ({span:lang=ja:\u3051\u3093}) the samurai. "
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You take a {tooltip:Radical:grain} and fashion it into a {tooltip:Radical:gun} that is {tooltip:Radical:small}, earning you the {tooltip:Kanji:title} of Small Arms Dealer (or SAD). Congratulations!",
            "hints": "This isn't exactly a title you're proud of, in fact, you're really embarrassed. Maybe you can make a name for yourself in something else so you can get a new title.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Title"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3057\u3087\u3046",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3068\u306a, \u305f\u305f, \u307b\u3081",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "The plaque says, \"No one is more deserving of this SAD title.\" - Love, the Shougun.",
                "mnemonic": "Word of your SAD {tooltip:Kanji:title} makes it all the way to the {tooltip:Reading:Shou}gun ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3087\u3046}) and he travels out to see you. When he arrives at your door, with all of his fancy escorts, he hands you a plaque with your title on it."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Radical:thread} {tooltip:Radical:someone} {tooltip:Kanji:together} with thread. Someone is falling apart so you use thread to put them back together.",
            "hints": "Imagine taking some thread and putting someone back together with it. It\u2019s awfully messy. I hope you\u2019re good with blood.",
