                "hints": "Imagine threading someone back together again, but this time you have an audience. Hear them \u201cooh\u201d and \u201caah\u201d as you put on a riveting show.",
                "mnemonic": "You\u2019re threading this someone back {tooltip:Kanji:together} as part of a {tooltip:Reading:show} ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3087}). The show is a demonstration to show med students how to thread someone\u2019s skin together after they have an accident. You\u2019re the most experienced, so you\u2019re leading the show."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Radical:boat} holds your {tooltip:Radical:weapon} like a {tooltip:Radical:plate}. So in a way, it's just a {tooltip:Kanji:tray} for your weapon.",
