                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Each reading has a slightly different meaning. Here's some mnemonics to help you remember them:\n{splitParent}You need {tooltip:Vocabulary:to avoid} people who drink {tooltip:Reading:sake} ({span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3051}) all the time. Why? Because when they get drunk you'll have {tooltip:Vocabulary:to dodge} the {tooltip:Reading:yo}-yos ({span:lang=ja:\u3088}) they spin at you. Sake makes you want to toss the ol' yo-yo around. Avoid them or you'll have to get good at dodging!\n"
