                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3059\u305a",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Wait, should this buzzer be buzzing or ringing? Oh well, you got your gold. It\u2019s the client\u2019s problem now.",
                "mnemonic": "Finally the {tooltip:Kanji:buzzer} is done. You\u2019ve earned your gold. You test the buzzer and it goes {tooltip:Reading:rin}g ({span:lang=ja:\u308a\u3093})! Ring! Ring! Ring! Ring ring ring ring ring! Man, that ringing is annoying but hey, that\u2019s what buzzers do."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "There is something {tooltip:Radical:odd} sticking out of the {tooltip:Radical:dirt}. Oh wait, it's just the {tooltip:Kanji:cape} jutting out into the water below. Phew.",
            "hints": "It's just the cape sticking out into the sea. Haha, for a second... you thought... no...",
