                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Feel the recoil of the gun in your hands and the ringing of the shots in your ears as you slaughter the flock without remorse. BANG BANG BANG!",
                "mnemonic": "Now take out your {tooltip:Reading:gun} ({span:lang=ja:\u3050\u3093}) and murder every sheep in the {tooltip:Kanji:flock}. Except for your buddy. You\u2019re incredibly jealous of your buddy and you don\u2019t like the attention his flock gives him so that\u2019s why you decided to murder them all with a gun."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "In a {tooltip:Radical:tree} on {tooltip:Radical:nine} branches are some {tooltip:Radical:cross} {tooltip:Kanji:frame}s. Each cross frame is hung on the branches of the tree. You don\u2019t know who decided to hang the frames there, but you think it might be some new wave art or something. Actually you need a frame, and there are already nine up there, so you decide to take one.",
            "hints": "Feel the tree bark under your palms as you climb up the tree to take a frame. You get a splinter from grabbing the frame. It really smarts.",
