                "mnemonic": "The cross shaped {tooltip:Kanji:frame} you took has a picture of the American rapper {tooltip:Reading:Waka} ({span:lang=ja:\u308f\u304f}) Flocka in it. If you don\u2019t know who Waka is, take the time to YouTube a song of his to get the Waka beat flowin\u2019 through your body."
            }
