{
            "mnemonic": "You need to {tooltip:Radical:allocate} enough {tooltip:Radical:gold} to buy a {tooltip:Kanji:gun}. Guns are weapons of the old world, so you can't just buy them with paper money. Guns have to be bought with gold coins and slabs and bricks.",
