                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture an old fashioned hold up. You're holding a gun and shoveling jewels into a burlap sack. The heist of the century!",
                "mnemonic": "You need this {tooltip:Kanji:gun} so you can steal some {tooltip:Reading:jew}els ({span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3085\u3046})! Why didn't you just use your gold to buy the jewels, you ask? Because! That's not how we did things in olden days. When you want jewels you buy a gun with gold and rob a jewelry store! "
