        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:leader} who lives in a {tooltip:Radical:mountain} is a {tooltip:Kanji:hermit}. The only thing this hermit is a leader of now is mountain goats. This hermit dislikes people so that\u2019s why he lives in a mountain now.",
