                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Oh no, oh no, oh no! Now the lord is running around with his dented weapon trying to put dents in all of you. You don't want a dent in your head! Run!",
                "mnemonic": "As you give the {tooltip:Kanji:lord} his weapon together, you see his face turn into a frown, \"What's wrong, {tooltip:Kanji:Milord}?\" you ask. \"THERE'S A {tooltip:Reading:DEN}T ({span:lang=ja:\u3067\u3093})!\" he bellows."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "When you go to the {tooltip:Radical:yakuza} to {tooltip:Radical:fix} your problems they'll just {tooltip:Kanji:multiply}.",
            "hints": "You thought you had problems before? Yikes, now you've done it. The yakuza are just going to make all of your problems multiply!",
