{
            "mnemonic": "One way to put {tooltip:Radical:wheat} in your {tooltip:Radical:face} is with {tooltip:Kanji:noodles}.\n",
            "hints": "Imagine yourself shoveling piles of wheaty noodles into your face. They're so wheaty and delicious!",
