                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You're in a group with a bunch of other scooter people, and you're all assigned to one month of flood patrol duty. But you got June. The floodiest month. Womp womp.",
                "mnemonic": "You have to {tooltip:Kanji:patrol} all of the floods in {tooltip:Reading:June} ({span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3085\u3093}). Unfortunately, that's the month when most of the floods in Japan happen, so you end up on patrol a lot."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "This {tooltip:Radical:tree} is the {tooltip:Radical:master} of a {tooltip:Kanji:pillar}. The pillar is subservient to its tree master because the tree is so great and awesome and big and cool and stuff. The pillar has great respect for its tree master.",
            "hints": "See the pillar next to the tree master. See the pillar bow over and over in veneration of its tree master.",
            "meanings": {
