{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:horse} is your {tooltip:Radical:master} and you are merely a {tooltip:Kanji:resident} in his house. How did this horse become your master? Those aren\u2019t questions a resident should ask! Know your place, resident!",
