{
            "mnemonic": "You see an {tooltip:Radical:animal} with some {tooltip:Radical:flowers} and a {tooltip:Radical:turkey} on a {tooltip:Radical:stool} trying to {tooltip:Kanji:seize} them. The animal with the flowers is really tall so the turkey needs to stand on the stool in its attempt to seize the flowers.",
            "hints": "Look at this turkey straining itself on the stool trying to seize the flowers, grunting with effort. You think he\u2019ll ever get them?",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Seize"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
