                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine this scene again only with a big cock holding the flowers as the turkey attempts to seize them. Hear the cock shouting cock-a-doodle-doo as it defends its flowers.",
                "mnemonic": "The animal the turkey is trying to {tooltip:Kanji:seize} the flowers from is a {tooltip:Reading:cock} ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u304f}). The cock is a lot bigger than the turkey, so that\u2019s why the turkey needs to stand on the stool in its attempt to seize those flowers."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If you have {tooltip:Radical:gold} you also need a {tooltip:Radical:guard} with a very {tooltip:Kanji:sharp} sword to protect it.",
            "hints": "You should probably also get some sharp spikes, sharp traps, and sharp spears to keep that gold safe too. Just a bunch of sharp stuff.",
