                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine covering the floor around your gold in sharp acorns. This is basically a Home Alone situation, and anyone who tries to steal your stuff is gonna get stuck full of sharp things and probably stabbed by your guard.",
                "mnemonic": "You're setting up all these sharp traps around your gold when you step on a {tooltip:Kanji:sharp} {tooltip:Reading:a}corn ({span:lang=ja:\u3048\u3044}) that's just laying on the floor. Ouch! But wait, then you get a great idea!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Taking a {tooltip:Radical:cross}, you walk through the {tooltip:Radical:rice paddy} in the {tooltip:Radical:direction} of {tooltip:Radical:winter} and {tooltip:Kanji:spread} your arms wide. You spread your arms to halt the approach of winter because your rice paddy is not done growing yet. You take the cross with you for some extra religious power of persuasion.",
            "hints": "Imagine facing the direction of the approaching winter while facing away from the rice paddy. Feel the weight of the cross in your hands as you spread your arms and implore the winter to hold off on its arrival.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Spread"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3075",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3057\u304d, \u3057",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Feel the strain on your Sheikh arms as you continue to spread them. Since you\u2019re a Sheikh, you have to set a good example for your people, so don\u2019t let them (or your arms) down.",
                "mnemonic": "You\u2019re actually a {tooltip:Reading:Sheikh} ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u304d}) (an Arab leader) which makes the fact that you\u2019re holding a cross while you {tooltip:Kanji:spread} your arms even more of a big deal. You spread your arms wider than any Sheikh ever has before."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "What kind of {tooltip:Radical:woman} comes down from {tooltip:Radical:heaven}? A {tooltip:Kanji:supernatural} one. She is so {tooltip:Kanji:enchanting}.",
            "hints": "Imagine your idea of what an extremely supernatural woman would look like, and have her come down from heaven towards you. You're totally enchanted by her looks.",
