{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:scooter} you made out of {tooltip:Radical:grain}s, and are about to ride down the {tooltip:Radical:stairs} with, is completely {tooltip:Kanji:transparent}. You mashed the grains down so fine that you can see through them! And then you made them into a scooter.",
            "hints": "Picture this transparent scooter. Well, it's actually a bit hard to see, because it's see-through. I guess imagine the outline and the feel, as you perch at the top of your stairs.",
