                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Almost immediately you lose track of the scooter because it's transparent. All you see is {span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3046\u304d\u3087\u3046} in front of you. And no scooter. Maybe this is why people don't make transparent vehicles.",
                "mnemonic": "You slip, the {tooltip:Kanji:transparent} scooter scoots down the stairs without you and into the streets of {span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3046\u304d\u3087\u3046}. Nooo! Transpa-scootie come back!"
            }
        }

