                        "file": "41872-subject-8916.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}So this {tooltip:Vocabulary:enchanting} and {tooltip:Vocabulary:charming} feeling is {tooltip:Vocabulary:mysterious}... some would say {span:lang=ja:\u602a\u3057\u3044} (suspicious). It actually shares the same reading as {span:lang=ja:\u602a\u3057\u3044}. They're kind of similar, too. Here's the difference:\n{splitParent}{span:lang=ja:\u602a\u3057\u3044} usually has a negative feel to it whereas {span:lang=ja:\u5996\u3057\u3044} generally has a positive feel. {span:lang=ja:\u5996\u3057\u3044} also feels more mysterious or has a magical edge.\n"
            },
