                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Everything except the {span:lang=ja:\u751f} uses the readings you learned with the kanji, and you learned this reading of {span:lang=ja:\u751f} when you learned {span:lang=ja:\u4e00\u751f}. You've really been going {tooltip:Vocabulary:all out} to learn these readings! \n"
