{
            "mnemonic": "Wipe your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} on this {tooltip:Radical:table} in {tooltip:Radical:winter} to see what it was {tooltip:Kanji:based on}. The cold winter weathers cover the table in frost, and when you wipe it away, you can see traces of what the table was originally based on. All tables have to be based on something, even if it's just other tables that came before them.",
            "hints": "Imagine tracing your fingers over the table, the cold winter frost stinging them, as you reveal the secrets of this table and what it was based on.",
            "meanings": {
