{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:leader} of {tooltip:Radical:righteousness} is the only one who can run this {tooltip:Kanji:ceremony}. Why? Because it's a very pure ceremony, and only those with an extremely righteous mind can run it.",
