{
            "mnemonic": "You climb up a {tooltip:Radical:mountain} and a {tooltip:Radical:cliff} in search of {tooltip:Radical:fire}, but all you find is {tooltip:Kanji:charcoal}. You can make fire with the charcoal, but you were hoping to find fire itself. All that climbing for nothing.",
