{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} carries a {tooltip:Radical:husband} and his {tooltip:Radical:husband} up into the {tooltip:Radical:sun} where they {tooltip:Kanji:conceal} their centaur. The two husbands run a centaur farm, but the local government isn\u2019t too pleased by this so they have to conceal their centaurs in the sun unless they want them to be confiscated by the government.",
