                "hints": "Just make sure to remember there is a centaur up on that tsunami with the husbands. They need to conceal the centaur to keep it safe.",
                "mnemonic": "What is it the husbands are going to {tooltip:Kanji:conceal}? Oh that\u2019s right, a {tooltip:Reading:cen}taur ({span:lang=ja:\u305b\u3093}). They are concealing a centaur in the sun. How forgetful of you."
            }
