{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:leader} gets a nice uniform for the {tooltip:Radical:sake} of not wanting to look like a {tooltip:Kanji:fake}. The leader is a fake, he just doesn\u2019t want to look like one. He\u2019s not really a leader, but he thinks he should get an official-looking uniform for the sake of not looking like a fake.",
