{
            "mnemonic": "Everyone has a {tooltip:Radical:poop} {tooltip:Radical:guy} from their {tooltip:Kanji:hometown}. You know. That poop guy. And every single time you try to visit your hometown, poop guy is there making everyone uncomfortable and reminding you why you left in the first place.",
            "hints": "Picture the poop guy from your hometown. Picture him really vividly. The awkward, rude things he does. The way he smells. The way he makes you never want to come back.",
            "meanings": {
