                "hints": "Imagine all the wonderful things that exist in your hometown of {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3068}. All the things you love to do and see. And now picture poop guy. Ruining it all with his poop hands.",
                "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Kanji:hometown} is in {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3068} which, unfortunately, means your poop guy is in {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3068} too. Now every time you go back home he's there stinking everything up."
