{
            "mnemonic": "This {tooltip:Radical:leader} has {tooltip:Radical:two} things that remind him of his {tooltip:Kanji:humanity}: his shoes, and his hat. These two things remind the leader of his humanity because humans are the only ones who wear shoes and hats.",
