{
            "mnemonic": "There is a tiny {tooltip:Radical:leader} on {tooltip:Radical:Wolverine}\u2019s {tooltip:Radical:forehead} sitting on a {tooltip:Radical:stool} and commanding his troops to {tooltip:Kanji:invade} Wolverine\u2019s brain. These tiny soldiers are going to invade Wolverine\u2019s body in an attempt to destroy him. The leader himself isn\u2019t going to invade Wolverine\u2019s brain, he\u2019s just going to sit on the stool and supervise.",
            "hints": "Imagine the little leader sitting on Wolverine\u2019s forehead as he shouts \u201cInvade! Invade invade! Invade his brain and destroy the Wolverine!\u201d",
            "meanings": {
