                "mnemonic": "Soon they realize that they cannot {tooltip:Kanji:invade} Wolverine through his head so they travel down to his leg and try to enter through his {tooltip:Reading:shin} ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3093}). The little soldiers take a big knife and slice open Wolverine\u2019s shin in order to invade his body."
            }
