{
            "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Radical:mouth} {tooltip:Radical:proclaim}s \"I am {tooltip:Kanji:noisy} and I am {tooltip:Kanji:picky}!\" It keeps repeating this over and over to everyone you pass by.",
            "hints": "The townsfolk agree with your mouth, you are noisy and you are picky and you need to shut up.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Noisy",
                "Alternative": "Picky"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3051\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3084\u304b\u307e",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "\"Ken, your armor color is so last year. That squid you have is gross. Your sword is so gaudy. You talk like you're from the Edo Period, but it's Reiwa right now.\"{splitParent}Your noisy and picky self just goes off on Ken the Samurai. He skulks off, defeated by your noisy and picky words.",
                "mnemonic": "You are so {tooltip:Kanji:noisy} and {tooltip:Kanji:picky} that the townsfolk hired {tooltip:Reading:Ken} ({span:lang=ja:\u3051\u3093}) the Samurai to shut you up."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Radical:leader} is also a {tooltip:Radical:director} so you need to {tooltip:Kanji:pay respects} to him before you can start filming. He\u2019s a huge big-shot and you don\u2019t want to offend him by not paying the proper respects, so you make sure to bow every time you go on stage.",
            "hints": "Imagine bowing really really low as you walk on set. Don\u2019t look him in the eye! He might get upset. Just do as you\u2019re told!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Pay Respects"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3057",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3046\u304b\u304c",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine Ook Aga looking down on you and you bow, slowly walking onto the stage. Oh no, your cell phone is ringing. He\u2019s grunting Ook Aga Ook Aga and looking around angrily. Quick, put it away and pay your respects harder!! Bow, BOW!",
                "mnemonic": "The name of the director is {tooltip:Reading:Ook Aga} ({span:lang=ja:\u3046\u304b\u304c}). Ook Aga is a caveman which is why everyone has to be really careful and make sure they {tooltip:Kanji:pay respects} to him. Ook Aga doesn\u2019t know how to live in a civilized society so your phones and clothes scare him. You have to bow really low and respect what he says, moving slowly, so that he continues to direct you and won\u2019t run away or hurt anyone."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You decide to {tooltip:Radical:loiter} next to the {tooltip:Radical:trash} under the {tooltip:Radical:moon} in {tooltip:Radical:winter} so the moon's light will {tooltip:Kanji:penetrate} you. The sky is {tooltip:Kanji:clear}est in winter, and this spot next to the trash happens to get the most of it.",
            "hints": "Picture a single beam of moonlight penetrating through the winter sky, right onto the trash.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Penetrate",
                "Alternative": "Clear"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3066\u3064",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "The clear, penetrating beam tastes exactly like iron, which is something you really weren't expecting. But now it's filling your entire mouth and you don't want it to stop.",
                "mnemonic": "You want the light to {tooltip:Kanji:penetrate} you, so you put your face in the way of the beam and it shoots {tooltip:Kanji:clear} through you. Your mouth fills with the taste of {span:lang=ja:\u9244} ({span:lang=ja:\u3066\u3064})."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} hits a {tooltip:Radical:bundle} of {tooltip:Radical:geoduck}s, swirling around their weird shapes, and creating {tooltip:Kanji:rapids}! The rapids are so violent, some of the geoducks break out of the bundle and get washed into the {tooltip:Kanji:shallows}.",
            "hints": "Picture the bundle of geoducks getting smashed by the tsunami, breaking apart, and getting tossed around in the rapids.",
            "meanings": {
