                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "\u3044\u3064\u304d",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "However! A non-wood tree will be really thirsty from pretending to be a wood tree. It will start making sounds and moving and probably say, \"Can I have a juice box, please?\"",
                "mnemonic": "If you're still not sure if the tree is really made of {tooltip:Kanji:wood}, just take out a small {tooltip:Reading:ju}ice ({span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3085}) box and start drinking it. A wooden tree will show no interest in the juice box at all."
            }
        }

