                "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Kanji:arrival} to {span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3046\u304d\u3087\u3046} is now ruined. And your next stop is now going to be an arrival at a {span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3046\u304d\u3087\u3046} hospital to get this mole knife out."
