{
            "mnemonic": "You see a {tooltip:Radical:flag} near the {tooltip:Radical:exit}, so you use your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} to {tooltip:Kanji:dig} there. Most flags mark something, and this exit is pretty obvious, so there must be something under here. At least that's what you think to yourself as you dig.",
            "hints": "Imagine digging under the flag by the exit of your building with your bare fingers. The dirt is getting under your fingernails as you dig. It's getting on your knees. It's everywhere.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Dig"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
