                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304f\u3064",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u307b",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You carefully un-dig the old coots and leave them to their old grumpy coot hole... basement... secret clubhouse? Whatever.",
                "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Kanji:dig} until you finally hit something. It's a bunch of buried old {tooltip:Reading:coots} ({span:lang=ja:\u304f\u3064}). They're in an underground room for old coots. One yells up at you, \"Whatcha doing to our roof, ya whipper snapper?! Stop digging in our lawn!\""
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Take this {tooltip:Radical:thread} and look at this {tooltip:Radical:part}. Now look at this part! Now look at this part. You don't know where to look! Haha, I have {tooltip:Kanji:distract}ed you!",
