                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine yourself really enjoying looking at parts of the thread. You don't know why it's so fun, but being derpy is exciting, I guess.",
                "mnemonic": "Despite how distracted you are, that was indeed a lot of {tooltip:Reading:fun} ({span:lang=ja:\u3075\u3093})."
