{
            "mnemonic": "This {tooltip:Radical:bamboo} can be whittled into an {tooltip:Kanji:example} of anything. See, here's a {tooltip:Radical:car}. Here's a {tooltip:Radical:snake}. I can make so many examples just with bamboo.",
