{
            "mnemonic": "You use your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} in a {tooltip:Radical:shop} to {tooltip:Kanji:grip} what you want to buy.",
            "hints": "Imagine picking up a few different things in a shop. If something fits nicely in your grip: buy it. If it's too small or too big, put it back.",
            "meanings": {
