{
            "mnemonic": "In the {tooltip:Radical:tree} {tooltip:Radical:district} of town you can buy a lot of tree products, including doors. With those doors, though, you always need {tooltip:Kanji:hinge}s.",
            "hints": "Don't forget to buy a hinge. Your door purchase will {tooltip:Kanji:hinge} on your hinges.",
