{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} crashes into the {tooltip:Radical:sun} (breaking it in half) and creating a different {tooltip:Radical:wing} of the tsunami all together. This wing crashes down and creates a {tooltip:Kanji:lagoon}.",
            "hints": "The lagoon is beautiful! The water is hot (from hitting the sun) but it isn't so bright that you'll get a sunburn.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Lagoon"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
