{
            "mnemonic": "Under the {tooltip:Radical:cross} is a {tooltip:Radical:mouth} and another {tooltip:Radical:mouth} wearing special {tooltip:Radical:clothes} because they're in {tooltip:Kanji:mourning}.",
            "hints": "Picture the cross looming overhead, people's mouths open so they can sob loudly, and everyone wearing the same color clothes (just picture whatever color works for your particular culture/religion combo).",
            "meanings": {
