                    }
                ],
                "hints": "When you do this, it destroys your lawn mower, because who thought it was a good idea to use a lawn mower on netting? Your dumb idea. C'mon!",
                "mnemonic": "There's so much {tooltip:Kanji:netting} that it's out of control. You decide to take your lawn mower to {tooltip:Reading:mow} ({span:lang=ja:\u3082\u3046}) it all down."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Even though you\u2019ve {tooltip:Radical:old} {tooltip:Radical:legs}, you {tooltip:Kanji:overcome} your disability. These old legs of yours don\u2019t work very well, but you overcome the odds and you run a marathon!",
