                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Filled with the jubilation of achievement from overcoming all odds, imagine the flavor of this cold Coke in your mouth. Fizzy and Coke flavored, it runs down your throat and into your tummy. Yum.",
                "mnemonic": "When you pass the finish line and finally {tooltip:Kanji:overcome} the limits of your old legs, someone hands you an ice cold {tooltip:Reading:Coke} ({span:lang=ja:\u3053\u304f}) as a reward. Mmm, such a refreshing Coke."
            }
