{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} that is {tooltip:Radical:white} is the most scary tsunami of all. It doesn't come in and destroy everything. No, it comes in, goes inside your door, then stays at your place {tooltip:Kanji:overnight}, without even asking!",
