{
            "mnemonic": "You keep your {tooltip:Radical:substitute} {tooltip:Radical:clothes} in a {tooltip:Kanji:sack}. The clothes in the sack are just substitute clothes, so they only come out in emergencies.",
            "hints": "Look at this sack of substitute clothes. Imagine it filled with all the clothes you hardly ever wear. What kind of clothes would be inside this sack?",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Sack"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
