{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Flowers} find their {tooltip:Radical:death} in a {tooltip:Radical:river} out in the {tooltip:Kanji:wild}. Flowers live on water, but this river drowns the flowers to death. The wild is a dangerous place.",
