{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} can't resist the {tooltip:Radical:call} of a {tooltip:Kanji:bog}. Whenever a tsunami is headed toward land, a bog will always call out to it, \"Hey tsunami, don't you want to hit me with your water? Come this way~\"",
