                "mnemonic": "Why is he chastising you, really, though? He foretold Mrs. Chou coming back in a previous mnemonic, but you saved Mrs. Chou on the beach (once again, in a previous mnemonic), so you could have prevented her second coming. He is {tooltip:Kanji:chastis}ing you for saving Mrs. {tooltip:Reading:Chou} ({span:lang=ja:\u3061\u3087\u3046})."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "We put a {tooltip:Radical:flag} to remember where we tried to use a {tooltip:Radical:jackhammer} to {tooltip:Radical:measure} your friend's {tooltip:Radical:heart}. Granted, it was a terrible idea, but hopefully that flag of remembrance is some kind of {tooltip:Kanji:consolation}?",
            "hints": "Obviously it's not good enough consolation. Be furious about this.",
            "meanings": {
