        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You hold the {tooltip:Radical:roof} of the {tooltip:Radical:festival} up with your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} but it {tooltip:Kanji:grate}s on them. The roof is heavy, and you have to walk to keep up, so the roof is grating on them really, really badly.",
            "hints": "Have you ever been to a Japanese festival? There's always one of those portable shrines that are basically just roofs people hold up. That's what you're trying to hold with your fingers as the whole thing grates on them.",
