                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine rooting around under some hedges, desperately trying to find your car keys. Hedges are prickly and there's spiders in here! If only you didn't need a car in the first place!",
                "mnemonic": "You're looking intently at one particular {tooltip:Kanji:hedge} because yesterday you dropped your {tooltip:Reading:ca}r {tooltip:Reading:key}s ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u304d}) behind it. Now that you know where the hedge is you're going to need to search it to find your car keys."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:root} of a {tooltip:Radical:stamp} is to get an {tooltip:Kanji:instant} picture down. Back in the olden days, people had to make seals and draw out things by hand, so stamps came about so you can\u2014BAM\u2014just stamp it and have what you want in an instant.",
            "hints": "Lots of things have roots from wanting to have something in an instant. Just think about instant ramen. The root of that was to get ramen real, real fast. Similar to stamps, ya know?",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Instant"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305d\u304f",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3059\u306a\u308f",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine using instant socks. How do they feel? Soggy, but hey, it was fast!",
                "mnemonic": "Think about the thing you want to make {tooltip:Kanji:instant}. I'd want instant {tooltip:Reading:sock}s ({span:lang=ja:\u305d\u304f})! Don't waste time searching for a matching pair or pulling them on. Just take out a pair of instant socks, add water, and the socks are already on your feet. In an instant!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:drunkard} goes down a {tooltip:Radical:slide}, hits the {tooltip:Radical:ground} and bumps into a {tooltip:Radical:woman}. Who is that woman? It's none other than her {tooltip:Kanji:majesty}.",
            "hints": "The problem is that you don't want to run into her majesty. That's a grave offense. Feel the fear that you're going to get your head lopped off from running into her.",
