{
            "mnemonic": "A (fresh water) {tooltip:Radical:tsunami}. Some {tooltip:Radical:horns}. The {tooltip:Radical:ground}. A bunch of {tooltip:Radical:poop}. Combine these together and let them decompose a while. You'll have yourself some very {tooltip:Kanji:nourishing} soil.",
