{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:cow} in the {tooltip:Radical:winter} doesn't like to leave the barn to go to the {tooltip:Kanji:pasture}. It has to, though, because a cow's gotta eat.",
            "hints": "It's cold outside (it's winter after all). Imagine you having to herd all the cows out to pasture even though they don't want to leave the warm barn.",
