{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:king}'s {tooltip:Radical:hat}, not to mention the {tooltip:Radical:hair} stuck to said hat, is incredibly {tooltip:Kanji:rare}. If you have your hands on either of these things, you'll be a rich duck.",
