                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Dig up your sealed food and eat it in the comfort of your own home. Mm, delicious!",
                "mnemonic": "You can also {tooltip:Kanji:seal} {tooltip:Reading:foo}d ({span:lang=ja:\u3075\u3046}) in dirt to make it last longer. That's how jerky came about, you know. Seal some meat underground and in a few months you'll have some tasty dried meats to chew."
