                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}This word is made up of the reading from {span:lang=ja:\u6fe1\u308c\u308b} and the rendaku version of the {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u306c} reading of {span:lang=ja:\u8863}. You learned this reading in the {span:lang=ja:\u8863} vocabulary, but here's a mnemonic to remember it. Imagine someone's dumped water on you and you're all wet. You might say \"{tooltip:Reading:gi}ve {tooltip:Reading:new} ({span:lang=ja:\u304e\u306c}) clothes to me!\"\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u50d5\u304c\u304a\u306a\u3089\u3057\u305f\u3063\u3066\uff1f\u305d\u3093\u306a\u306e\u6fe1\u308c\u8863\u3060\u3088\u3002",
