                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine a beautiful, ripe pear in your mind. Now gnash your teeth. Mmm. You want to eat a pear right now, don't you?",
                "mnemonic": "As you cut the {tooltip:Kanji:pear}s down, you can't help but {tooltip:Reading:gnash} ({span:lang=ja:\u306a\u3057}) your teeth. You want to eat these pears right now. You gnash and grind and wait though, because you want to have them all down before you start the feast."
