                "hints": "Imagine the word {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3068} not coming out clearly because of your mouth vines. People can only hear the {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u3046} part, so they don't know where you want to go. SHOUT LOUDER! {span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3087\u3046\u3068\uff01}",
