                "hints": "Make sure you make the connection between the word {span:lang=ja:\u6b74\u53f2} and this kanji. If you do, it'll be much easier to remember the reading of this kanji.",
                "mnemonic": "Remember the word {span:lang=ja:\u6b74\u53f2}, which means \"history\"? Using a {tooltip:Kanji:calendar}, you too can remember history (otherwise, who knows when these things happened). So, the reading for this kanji is the same as the reading for {span:lang=ja:\u6b74\u53f2}'s beginning, because they're related."
            }
        }

