                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "A ray gun, coincidentally, is the only thing that can kill a ghost, and there it lays, just out of reach. You'll have to be the one to pull the trigger of the ray gun. Do you pick up the ray gun out of the row boat to destroy the ghosts?",
                "mnemonic": "You come across the {tooltip:Kanji:ghost}s, who are stabbed into the ground. \"Please,\" they beg. \"Please use that {tooltip:Reading:ray} ({span:lang=ja:\u308c\u3044}) gun that's in that {tooltip:Reading:row} ({span:lang=ja:\u308a\u3087\u3046}) boat and end our suffering.\""
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Tsunami} vs {tooltip:Radical:lifeguard}. Who will win? After the water drains away, we find the lifeguard in the {tooltip:Kanji:gutter}.",
            "hints": "To be fair, it's pretty obvious who would win. Nobody knows what that lifeguard was thinking.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Gutter"
            },
