                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "\"This lifeguard didn't believe in the power of kanji learning,\" {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3061} says to the press. \"He was punished by the great Crabigator, who sent its tsunami as a warning for all.\"{splitParent}Hint: when you see the \"lifeguard\" radical, the reading is probably going to be {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046}.",
                "mnemonic": "In the {tooltip:Kanji:gutter} is a lifeguard, so Emperor {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3061} decides to survey the damage."
