{
            "mnemonic": "I {tooltip:Radical:protect} my own {tooltip:Radical:animal}s by going to {tooltip:Kanji:hunt} other animals... like wolves and cougars and such. ",
            "hints": "My animals can't protect themselves, that's why I hunt other animals instead.",
            "meanings": {
