                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture Kyaku lifting up their pant leg and showing you all the stamps from all the different places they've been. There are even some planets on there!",
                "mnemonic": "You've only met one other person with the same mark on their {tooltip:Kanji:leg} and it was {tooltip:Reading:Kyaku} ({span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3083\u304f}) the customer. Kyaku visits many places all over the world, so it only makes sense that they've also been off-world too."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "When the {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} struck, it hit your {tooltip:Radical:tent} full of {tooltip:Radical:beans}. When you lost your tent of beans, you had a moment of {tooltip:Kanji:lucidity}. You don't need so much stuff, you can live without it!",
            "hints": "Then you went back to being crazy. That moment of lucidity was only temporary, and you go back to stockpiling beans.",
