                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine yourself wearing a sharp suit and being a model of lucidity",
                "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Kanji:lucidity} is clear to everyone because you wear a {tooltip:Reading:sui}t ({span:lang=ja:\u3059}). Everyone knows that lucid people wear suits!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:dirt} {tooltip:Radical:demon} is just a {tooltip:Kanji:lump}. Just like a dust bunny is just a clump of dust.",
            "hints": "Picture a lump of dirt. Is there a demon hiding under there? No. It's just a saying, ya nerd.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Lump"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304b\u3044",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304b\u305f\u307e\u308a",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "If you don't know the game and have never heard the music (especially), it's great stuff! If you have, this word will be really easy for you. If you haven't, look it up!",
                "mnemonic": "Have you ever heard of the game \"Katamari Damacy?\" That game is about a little guy who rolls a ball around, turning it into a bigger and bigger {tooltip:Kanji:lump}. What do you think the {tooltip:Reading:Katamari} ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u305f\u307e\u308a}) part means? It means lump, of course."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:animal} {tooltip:Radical:king}? He's just this guy who lives in the forest and thinks he's king of all the animals. He's a {tooltip:Kanji:lunatic}, though.",
            "hints": "While we're speaking of animals, he's absolutely bat sh*t crazy.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Lunatic",
                "Alternative": "Crazy"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
