{
            "mnemonic": "Below this {tooltip:Radical:canopy} of {tooltip:Radical:tree}s is a {tooltip:Radical:stone}. Since it's the only stone here, you make sure to {tooltip:Kanji:polish} it.",
            "hints": "It's a single, perfectly round stone under this canopy of trees. It didn't start this way, but thanks to all the polishing you did, it has become nice and smooth.",
