{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:moon} {tooltip:Radical:table} is a table that's made entirely of {tooltip:Kanji:skin}. You thought the table was made of moon, with all those pores and such, but when you look more closely, you realize it's skin. Disgusting, porous, skin.",
