{
            "mnemonic": "As usual, you can guess this is a verb thanks to the {span:lang=ja:\u3046} sound on the end. The kanji means {tooltip:Kanji:frustration}, and unfortunately frustration tends {tooltip:Vocabulary:to torment} people. This verb is pretty advanced, but still useful to know!",
