                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine carefully putting your makeshift key into your car's lock. You close your eyes and pray that the car guillotine isn't going to trigger, knowing it isn't a legit key.",
                "mnemonic": "This {tooltip:Kanji:key} has to be perfect, because if it isn't the {tooltip:Reading:ca}r {tooltip:Reading:gui}llotine ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u304e}) will come down and chop off your hand!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "I found {tooltip:Radical:part} of a {tooltip:Radical:plate} at the {tooltip:Kanji:lantern festival}, and put it on a {tooltip:Kanji:tray} to keep it safe. There is a legendary plate broken into three parts. One part of the plate I found was at the lantern festival. The lantern festival was pretty cool, but I\u2019m really glad I found the part of that plate I was looking for.",
            "hints": "Imagine holding a tray in your hands with this part of the plate on it, as the light from the lanterns glitters off it and dances around, illuminating the background. It\u2019s enchanting.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Lantern Festival",
                "Alternative": "Tray"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
