                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "I'm not sure why gaining pride made the beggar revert back to being a child, but it seems like you did something good, maybe?",
                "mnemonic": "After giving some {tooltip:Kanji:pride} to the ground beggar, he looks up at you and tears off his beard and skin. \"I am a {span:lang=ja:\u5b50} ({span:lang=ja:\u3053}) again, thanks to you!\""
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Inside your {tooltip:Radical:eye} {tooltip:Radical:stand}s a tiny {tooltip:Radical:village} that makes up your {tooltip:Kanji:pupil}. That's the black part of your eye!",
            "hints": "Oh, did you think your pupil was a hole? No, no, you misunderstand. That's where the village stands. It's full of little people who whisper to your brain what you should see.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Pupil"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3068\u3046, \u3069\u3046",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3072\u3068\u307f",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Even if you're a pupil non-believer, at least you can see how it's shaped like a doughnut hole, right?",
                "mnemonic": "All of the people in your {tooltip:Kanji:pupil} eat {tooltip:Reading:dou}ghnuts ({span:lang=ja:\u3069\u3046}) all day long. That's why your eye is shaped like a doughnut, with the \"hole\" (village) as their home."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "On the {tooltip:Radical:roof} is your {tooltip:Radical:heart}. OR! In a {tooltip:Radical:net} in the {tooltip:Radical:street}. Which would you {tooltip:Kanji:rather}?",
            "hints": "Would you rather have your heart up on the roof, close to falling but out of the way of people. Or would you rather have your heart in a net, which people can't steal from, but is in the way of cars.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Rather"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u306d\u3044",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3080\u3057",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "\"I'd rather you didn't have that!\" you shout as your neighbors run through the neighborhood to their own house. You'd rather this wasn't happening! You'd rather your neighbors let you make your own choice!!",
                "mnemonic": "As you try to decide which you'd {tooltip:Kanji:rather} have, your {tooltip:Reading:neigh}bors ({span:lang=ja:\u306d\u3044}) come out and grab the heart out of your hands."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:leader} of your sad {tooltip:Radical:life} aims a {tooltip:Radical:kick} at the {tooltip:Kanji:sack} you are holding. This leader is in charge of making your life sad. The next step in the leader making your life suck is attempting to kick your sack out of your hands. Your sack holds all your valuables, so it\u2019s not something you want to have kicked.",
            "hints": "See this leader\u2019s kick coming at your sack. Hear the leader yelling as he aims his kick at your sack. Hiyahhh! Also keep in mind that the life radical is missing the little drop/slide thing on the side. It\u2019s missing that because your life is lousy and sad.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Sack"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3072\u3087\u3046",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305f\u308f\u3089",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You thought you were all cool saying \u201cheyo\u201d and moving your sack away from the kick, but they had this planned all along. Heyo\u2026",
                "mnemonic": "You manage to get your {tooltip:Kanji:sack} out of the way as you shout \u201c{tooltip:Reading:Heyo} ({span:lang=ja:\u3072\u3087\u3046})! Look, you missed! Heyo!\u201d Unfortunately your leader\u2019s friend was standing behind you and he kicks your sack as you move it out of the way. \u201cHeyo!\u201d he shouts, mockingly."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Poop} {tooltip:Radical:Poop} {tooltip:Radical:Mountain} is covered in poop because it is such a {tooltip:Kanji:secluded} place.",
            "hints": "A secluded place has no toilets, so you just poop right on the mountain.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Secluded"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3086\u3046",
