                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine hundreds of youths on this secluded mountain, all pooping on the ground while trying to get a cell phone signal.",
                "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:secluded} Poop Poop Mountain is a favorite of {tooltip:Reading:you}ths ({span:lang=ja:\u3086\u3046}). They go there to get away from their phones to get in touch with nature again. "
