        }

{
            "mnemonic": "With the {tooltip:Radical:power} of your {tooltip:Radical:mouth} you command a {tooltip:Radical:tree} to become a {tooltip:Kanji:shelf}. Most of the time one would have to use their hands and tools to turn a tree into a shelf, but you are capable of turning a tree into a shelf by using the power of your mouth.",
            "hints": "Imagine using your mouth to turn a tree into a shelf. Yell at this tree and keep yelling at it until you see it become a shelf.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Shelf"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304b",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304b",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine transporting the shelves in your car. Over and over. Back and forth in your car. Vroom vroom.",
                "mnemonic": "Once you turn the tree into a {tooltip:Kanji:shelf} you put the shelf in your {tooltip:Reading:ca}r ({span:lang=ja:\u304b}) and sell it at a local pawn shop. You keep doing this over and over again until you are rich. You command the trees to turn into shelves and then you take the shelves in your car to sell them. Easy money."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Your village wants to take the {tooltip:Radical:village} {tooltip:Radical:dog} and {tooltip:Radical:boil} it, and you can think of no other response than {tooltip:Kanji:SHUT UP}! ",
            "hints": "The entire village is shouting and yelling and pointing at the poor dog. They're boiling a giant boiling pot of water, and you can't even hear yourself think anymore. Shut up, shut up, shut up! ",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Shut Up"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3082\u304f",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3060\u307e",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Even the dog is mocking you now. It's barks sound more like \"shut up, shut up\" than \"bow wow, bow wow.\" What the heck dog, I was trying to save your life!",
                "mnemonic": "The villagers are mad that you told them to {tooltip:Kanji:shut up}, and they start to {tooltip:Reading:mock} ({span:lang=ja:\u3082\u304f}) you. They put their hands on their hips, lean forward, cross their eyes, and yell \"SHUT UP!\" back."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You use your {tooltip:Radical:car} and an {tooltip:Radical:axe} to {tooltip:Kanji:slice} down a pedestrian. This innocent guy is just walking along the road when you drive up to him in your car and axe him to death with your axe. You\u2019re all like, VROOM! AXE! Now this guy is dead because you sliced him down in cold blood.",
            "hints": "Imagine driving your car, waving your axe out the window and slicing this guy down. Hear his scream ring in your ears as you slice, slice, SLICE.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Slice"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3056\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304d",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Zanzibar is a crazy place, huh? Continue to drive around Zanzibar as you wave your axe out your car window looking for another victim to slice.",
                "mnemonic": "You were driving around in {tooltip:Reading:Zan}zibar ({span:lang=ja:\u3056\u3093}) when you {tooltip:Kanji:slice}d down this man. Luckily, Zanzibar has no laws at all, so you won\u2019t get arrested for slicing down this guy with your axe."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Radical:stand} your {tooltip:Radical:towel} up so everyone can see it. This announces that you are the {tooltip:Kanji:sovereign} ruler of this bathroom.",
            "hints": "Whenever someone walks into your bathroom, you start screaming that you are the sovereign ruler of this toilet, this sink, this toothbrush, and all that touch these tiles.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Sovereign"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3066\u3044",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u307f\u304b\u3069",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture your standing towel with a huge tater tot sewn into it. Everyone who sees this will know that you're the toilet tater tot sovereign.",
                "mnemonic": "As the {tooltip:Kanji:sovereign} ruler of this bathroom, you must choose a monogram to represent your rule. For this, you choose the symbol of the food that passes through you the most: The mighty {tooltip:Reading:ta}ter ({span:lang=ja:\u3066\u3044}) tot!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Someone with a {tooltip:Radical:top hat} comes and tells you that your {tooltip:Radical:grain}s are going to be taxed from now on. Top hat man says there is a {tooltip:Kanji:tariff} that's been enacted on grains. Rice? Triple the price. Wheat? Quadruple.",
            "hints": "People in top hats like to put tariffs on lots of things. Especially things you need, like grains you eat to stay alive. You have no choice but to pay.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Tariff"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305d",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Everything you get from other counties has been tariffed except for soap. You'll be hungry, but at least you'll be clean.",
                "mnemonic": "You're listening to all the things in this {tooltip:Kanji:tariff} and you finally get fed up and ask what isn't being taxed now. The top hat man looks at you and smiles, holding out his hand. In his hand is some {tooltip:Reading:soa}p ({span:lang=ja:\u305d})."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:gold} from the {tooltip:Radical:east} needs {tooltip:Kanji:tempering} before it can be sold. The gold from the east is good, it just needs some tempering before it\u2019s entirely presentable. You know, tempering like you\u2019d do in a forge.",
            "hints": "Imagine tempering this gold from the east. You\u2019re heat treating the gold when you\u2019re tempering it, so feel the heat from the fire on your face and arms.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Tempering"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u308c\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u306d",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine yourself in this rental smithy. It\u2019s really nice. There\u2019s like TVs and live music and free WiFi and everything. It\u2019s a very nice rental in which to do tempering. Also keep in mind that this kanji shares its reading with {span:lang=ja:\u7df4}, which has the same right side.",
                "mnemonic": "The smithy where you\u2019re doing the {tooltip:Kanji:tempering} is pretty fancy, but it\u2019s just a {tooltip:Reading:ren}tal ({span:lang=ja:\u308c\u3093}). You haven\u2019t sold enough gold to own a smithy as nice as this one yet, so for now, you rent one. It is pretty swanky though, even for a rental."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If you see a {tooltip:Radical:building} wearing a giant {tooltip:Radical:top hat}, beware! This building is a fake and it's trying to {tooltip:Kanji:thwart} all of the plans the people in other buildings have.",
            "hints": "Picture the building, with it's tall top hat, inching closer to other buildings when no one is looking. It's planning to thwart everything!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Thwart"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305d",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u306f\u3070",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Watch as the soap cleans all of the paint away, thwarting the entire paint project. The painters are on the ground, crying and squeaky clean.",
                "mnemonic": "The building next door is being painted, and the top hat building is jealous. It {tooltip:Kanji:thwart}s the painting plans by dumping {tooltip:Reading:so}ap ({span:lang=ja:\u305d}) out of its windows and onto the painters and the building!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You need to {tooltip:Radical:stop} a {tooltip:Radical:drunkard} from going down a {tooltip:Radical:slide} with a {tooltip:Radical:jackhammer} to ask him how many {tooltip:Kanji:years old} he is. He's doing a lot of dangerous things right now, and they all have age limits.",
            "hints": "Depending how many years old he is, this guy could be violating like three different laws right now.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Years Old"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3055\u3044, \u305b\u3044",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Your saber cuts through the cyborgs robo-body and it screams, \"OKAY OKAY I'M NOT A MILLION I'M ONLY FIVE YEARS OLD AND A CYBORG PLEASE DON'T REPROGRAM ME!\"",
                "mnemonic": "When you ask him how many {tooltip:Kanji:years old} he is, he turns to you and screams, \"I'M A MILLION YEARS OLD AND YOU'LL NEVER STOP ME!\" That's obviously not how old this kid is, so you take out your holy blue {tooltip:Reading:sa}ber ({span:lang=ja:\u305b\u3044}) and slice the slide in half. Then the jackhammer. Then the kid's metal arm\u2014wait! This kid is a {tooltip:Reading:cy}borg ({span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3044})!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You get {tooltip:Radical:rain} {tooltip:Radical:orders}. Your orders are to make sure there is {tooltip:Kanji:zero} {tooltip:Kanji:spill}.",
            "hints": "Despite it raining, your orders are to make sure none (zero!) of the rain spills anywhere. Figure out what you need to do to make sure you follow these rain orders successfully. Zero spill, alright?",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Zero",
                "Alternative": "Spill"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u308c\u3044",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3053\u307c",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You just take your ray gun and \"zap!\" the clouds are gone. There will be zero spills today.{splitParent}Hint: when you see the radical {tooltip:Radical:orders} it's fairly likely the reading will be {span:lang=ja:\u308c\u3044}.",
                "mnemonic": "The best way to make sure there is {tooltip:Kanji:zero} {tooltip:Kanji:spill} when it rains is to get rid of the rain. You use a special {tooltip:Reading:ray} ({span:lang=ja:\u308c\u3044}) gun and zap the rain right out of the sky. There will be zero spills because there will be zero rain."
            }
        }

