{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:moon} has a lot of {tooltip:Radical:power} that is {tooltip:Radical:power} it gets from the {tooltip:Radical:power} of every {tooltip:Kanji:armpit} of every human on earth! Why does your armpit smell? It\u2019s because the moon is draining the power from your armpit. The moon saps power from your armpit and that power is sucked up into the sky where the moon collects the power for its own devices.",
