{
            "mnemonic": "Cast a {tooltip:Radical:book} in {tooltip:Radical:gold} to make a {tooltip:Kanji:bowl}. Books can be bent into the shape of a bowl, so then all you have to do is pour gold over it to keep it in that shape and ta-da! A bowl has been born!",
            "hints": "Imagine creating this bowl yourself. Try not to burn your fingers with that hot gold.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Bowl"
