                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Okay, so this may not be the best bowl. You usually don't need a hatch or this much gold coating. But that's how they used to do it in the old days, so that's good enough for you!",
                "mnemonic": "The gold {tooltip:Kanji:bowl} has a {tooltip:Reading:hatch} ({span:lang=ja:\u306f\u3061}) attached to it, which used to be the book's back cover. That's fine, you use the hatch as a lid for the bowl!"
            }
