{
            "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Radical:servant} uses a {tooltip:Radical:stool} to break open {tooltip:Radical:shellfish}. You know how much work shucking shellfish is so this method is really {tooltip:Kanji:clever}.",
            "hints": "You knew hiring this servant was a good idea. \"Clever girl,\" you say, as your servant sits on some shellfish again.",
            "meanings": {
