                "mnemonic": "\"More {tooltip:Kanji:clever} than you!\" your servant yells, tearing off his wig. \"It is I, {tooltip:Reading:Ken} ({span:lang=ja:\u3051\u3093}) the samurai. I saw you take this shellfish from my master's lands.\""
            }
