                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You couldn't take the pain of losing your cyborg, so you've become one. Your robo-hair can change its coloring, but soon you'll be even more cyborg-y than before!",
                "mnemonic": "This cool {tooltip:Kanji:coloring} can only happen because you turned yourself into a {tooltip:Reading:cy}borg ({span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3044}). Your hair and scalp are now made of high tech parts, not human ones."
            }
