{
            "mnemonic": "In this {tooltip:Radical:building} there's a {tooltip:Radical:small} {tooltip:Radical:sun} that's {tooltip:Radical:small}. They keep this small, small sun inside of a {tooltip:Kanji:crevice}.",
            "hints": "You wouldn't want to keep a sun out in the open, even if it's small (and small). You'd put it inside something, like a crevice. Imagine walking into the building and seeing the small sun right inside, in a crevice.",
