{
            "mnemonic": "You need to put a {tooltip:Radical:clown} in the {tooltip:Radical:dirt} if you want to {tooltip:Kanji:cultivate} good crops there. Clowns act as a natural fertilizer, and this will make it super easy to cultivate any crops you could ever want in this dirt. Isn't nature amazing?",
            "hints": "Imagine burying a dead clown in the dirt and then planting some seeds on top. It's worth it, you think, if it helps cultivate your crops.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Cultivate"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
