                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Saying bye is polite. Never forget to say bye, even in the middle of a cold-blooded clown murder.",
                "mnemonic": "Before you can start this whole {tooltip:Kanji:cultivation} process however, you have to say {tooltip:Reading:bye} ({span:lang=ja:\u3070\u3044}) to the clown. Say bye to him, then bash his head in, and drop him in the dirt."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Radical:foot}, as your {tooltip:Radical:mama} says, was given the {tooltip:Radical:task} to {tooltip:Kanji:dance}. Shake those two foots your mama gave you and dance dance dance!",
            "hints": "Picture your mama asking you to dance. The two of you pick up and kick your feet to dance, spinning 'round and 'round.",
