{
            "mnemonic": "This {tooltip:Radical:gate} makes the {tooltip:Radical:sound} of {tooltip:Kanji:darkness}. The gate looks like darkness, but it\u2019s even more creepy that it sounds like darkness too.",
            "hints": "Imagine this gate making an ominous sound. The sound of darkness. Look deep into the darkness of the gate as you hear the sound it makes. Ouummmmm\u2026",
