{
            "mnemonic": "You have a {tooltip:Radical:surplus} of {tooltip:Radical:ladle}s laid out {tooltip:Kanji:diagonally} in front of you. Why are they diagonal? And why do you have so many ladles? Why the surplus? Hang on, we'll get there.",
