                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Uh oh, is this one of those weird tests where they find out if you're the chosen one or some old scholar reincarnated? Who knew laying ladles at diagonal angles could reveal this kinda stuff?!",
                "mnemonic": "In front of this {tooltip:Kanji:diagonal} pattern is a {tooltip:Reading:sha}man ({span:lang=ja:\u3057\u3083}) who is currently staring at you. You slowly reach down and turn one of the ladles around, diagonally, and look back up. The shaman's eyes are wide, and now they're scribbling on in a notebook."
