{
            "mnemonic": "You see {tooltip:Radical:shrimp} on {tooltip:Radical:ice} at the market in the morning. \"I'll get some on the way home\" you think to yourself. Later that evening, you see no shrimp, just ice. The supply of shrimp has been {tooltip:Kanji:exhaust}ed. It's all gone! ",
