                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine the worker's jeans and how gross they are with all those shrimp stuffed into them. Yuck!",
                "mnemonic": "How could the store {tooltip:Kanji:exhaust} its shrimp supply so quickly? Suddenly you notice the worker behind the fish counter has shrimp stuffed into their {tooltip:Reading:jean}s ({span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3093}) . Aha! The culprit! "
