{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Rain} falls off a {tooltip:Radical:tree} and lands in your {tooltip:Radical:eye} where it turns to {tooltip:Kanji:frost}. It turns to frost because it\u2019s super cold outside and your body is freezing. The rain that fell off the tree turns to frost as soon as it hits your eye.",
            "hints": "Feel the rain hit your eye and then crystalize into frost immediately. The rain in your eye is wet, and then very cold as it becomes frost.",
