{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:landslide} {tooltip:Radical:measurement} {tooltip:Kanji:humiliate}s you. You told everyone you couldn't come to work, that your house had been destroyed and your car was carried away, but then scientists measured the landslide, and it only went a few feet.",
