{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Fire} you use to light up the {tooltip:Radical:street} needs to go in a {tooltip:Kanji:lamp}. Campfires, matches? No, none of those work. You need bright, safe lamps to keep the street nice at night.",
