                "mnemonic": "These street {tooltip:Kanji:lamp}s were first used in {span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3046\u304d\u3087\u3046}. It was the most advanced city after all. And more people were out at night in {span:lang=ja:\u3068\u3046\u304d\u3087\u3046} than anywhere else in Japan. So they needed lamps to light things up!"
