{
            "mnemonic": "In the {tooltip:Radical:mysterious} {tooltip:Radical:rice paddy} there is some {tooltip:Kanji:livestock}. This livestock is also mysterious because no one knows where it came from. The mysterious livestock are only seen in the mysterious rice paddy. How mysterious indeed.",
