{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} hits your {tooltip:Radical:form} and you begin to {tooltip:Kanji:melt}. You are a witch and water makes you melt. The tsunami is a lot of water, so once it touches your form, you begin to melt.",
