{
            "mnemonic": "If the {tooltip:Radical:king} gives you a {tooltip:Radical:knife} you become part of his {tooltip:Kanji:squad}. Every king has a knife squad or two protecting him and making sure his subjects keep in line.",
            "hints": "Imagine if you were given a knife and allowed into the king's squad. Would you let the power corrupt you?",
