        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You\u2019re so hungry that you {tooltip:Radical:eat} a {tooltip:Radical:table} so you won\u2019t {tooltip:Kanji:starve}. If you don\u2019t eat this table, you will most definitely starve, so you eat the table to stay alive.",
            "hints": "You don\u2019t want to starve, do you? Feel your tummy gurgle in pain. You gotta eat this table. Taste the dry wood taste on your tongue as you eat the table and get splinters in your tongue and gums.",
