                        "reading": "\u304a\u304a\u3080",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "The guy is trying to look at your approximation now, while calling YOU \"guy\" over and over, and you just want him to buy it and leave you alone!",
                "mnemonic": "As you're recording your {tooltip:Kanji:approximation} down,  somebody comes up and shouts, \u201cHey {tooltip:Reading:guy} ({span:lang=ja:\u304c\u3044})! I\u2019ll give you $10,000 for that tree there, guy!\u201d This guy must be crazy. That\u2019s much more than your approximation of the value of this thing. But you sell it to the guy anyway."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You run your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} along the words of a  {tooltip:Radical:paragraph}. You are learning about the law because you plan to {tooltip:Kanji:arrest} somebody.",
            "hints": "Imagine reading the paragraph very slowly. You find your answer. It looks like you'll be able to arrest that person...",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Arrest"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
