                "hints": "Still, according to this paragraph you're running your fingers through, you can do it. You can arrest {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3061}.",
                "mnemonic": "Who do you want to {tooltip:Kanji:arrest}? You want to arrest {span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3061}. Even though he's started wars, created a religion, and trapped a child in a cavity, it's going to be tricky to arrest him because he's the emperor now."
            }
