                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Now cultivation is going to involve getting all the tacks out of here, preferably with the stone and not your fingers, so they don't get stuck anymore.",
                "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Kanji:Cultivation} is suddenly halted because a {tooltip:Reading:tack} ({span:lang=ja:\u305f\u304f}) sticks into your finger. You pull the tack out, throw it away and start cultivation again when... ouch! There's another tack. This field is full of tacks!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You take a {tooltip:Radical:lid}, and aiming it at the {tooltip:Radical:sun} you {tooltip:Radical:kick} it into the air and eventually it begins to {tooltip:Kanji:decline} and crashes into the sun, causing it to supernova. Imagine kicking this lid so hard that it flies into space. See it fly up to the peak of its arch, then watch as it begins the decline until it finally collides with the sun.",
            "hints": "As you watch the lid decline, keep in mind that the sun radical its middle line extending outside the box on both sides. This is because the sun is going supernova. Pew!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Decline"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3059\u3044",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304a\u3068\u308d",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine swinging on these vines as you hear the sun explode and go supernova behind you. Swing faster! Swing faster!",
                "mnemonic": "As the lid begins to {tooltip:Kanji:decline} in the sky, you realize what\u2019s going to happen so you attempt to {tooltip:Reading:swi}ng ({span:lang=ja:\u3059\u3044}) to safety. Swing on some vines in the direction opposite of the sun. You know that once that lid finishes its decline and collides with the sun, there\u2019s gonna be trouble."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:commander} who's {tooltip:Radical:big} will use his size to {tooltip:Kanji:encourage} his troops.",
