{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} and a couple {tooltip:Radical:fire}s run into each other. They cancel each other out completely, and the remainder left behind is a {tooltip:Kanji:faint} remnant of what was once there.",
            "hints": "You go to see if you can find any remainder of the fire + tsunami battle. You can, but it's so faint.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Faint"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
