                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}A foundation is made of {tooltip:Reading:stone} ({span:lang=ja:\u3044\u3057}). And it holds up an entire {tooltip:Reading:zoo A} ({span:lang=ja:\u305a\u3048}) but none of Zoo B. Zoo B will fall apart when an earthquake hits.\n"
