                        "voiceActorId": 1,
                        "voiceActorName": "Kyoko",
                        "voiceDescription": "Tokyo accent",
                        "file": "37356-subject-7314.ogg"
                    }
                ],
                "mnemonic": "\n{splitParent}Of all the ideas that need {tooltip:Vocabulary:to be overturned}, it's the ones from the {tooltip:Reading:\u9774 guy} ({span:lang=ja:\u304f\u3064\u304c\u3048}). He thinks we should only wear shoes. Not shoes and nothing else, but shoes all over out entire bodies. Yikes, now that's an idea I'd like {tooltip:Vocabulary:to be retracted}, {span:lang=ja:\u9774} guy.\n"
            },
            "contextSentences": [
                {
                    "ja": "\u30b9\u30dd\u30fc\u30c4\u306f\u305a\u3063\u3068\u305d\u3093\u306a\u306b\u597d\u304d\u3067\u306f\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u4e00\u5ea6\u91ce\u7403\u306e\u8a66\u5408\u3092\u898b\u306b\u884c\u3063\u305f\u6642\u306b\u305d\u308c\u304c\u8986\u308a\u307e\u3057\u3066\u3001\u4eca\u3067\u306f\u30de\u30ea\u30ca\u30fc\u30ba\u306e\u5927\u30d5\u30a1\u30f3\u3067\u3059\u3002",
                    "en": "I didn\u2019t always like sports, but that was overturned once I went to see a baseball game and now I\u2019m a big fan of the Mariners."
                }
            ],
