                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Or, maybe you get so good that you write a {span:lang=ja:\u672c} ({span:lang=ja:\u307b\u3093}) about doing a flip. Wow, you're good!",
                "mnemonic": "You're pretty good at your {tooltip:Kanji:flip} technique, but you're not that good. You really need to practice and {tooltip:Reading:hone} ({span:lang=ja:\u307b\u3093}) your skills and get better."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tree} {tooltip:Radical:can} be a {tooltip:Radical:tree}, but it can also be a {tooltip:Radical:psychopath}. The tree goes from being a regular tree to being a psychopath. Such mood swings are so rough. Especially when the tree slips to {tooltip:Kanji:gloom}.",
            "hints": "Imagine all the mood swings of this tree. Psychopath tree! Also very gloomy sometimes.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Gloom"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
