                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Sing along with the moody tree. Gloom to dubstep. Such a big change.",
                "mnemonic": "Then the tree switches from {tooltip:Kanji:gloom} to being super excited (these moodswings!). The super excited tree starts doing dubstep. {tooltip:Reading:Uts} ({span:lang=ja:\u3046\u3064}) uts uts uts uts {span:lang=ja:\u266c}."
