{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} crashes into the {tooltip:Radical:sun}, which is then caught in a {tooltip:Radical:net} tied to a {tooltip:Radical:stool}! Wait a second... this doesn't sound realistic, this is from that pirate {tooltip:Kanji:manga} you're always reading!",
            "hints": "Imagine reading this issue of your favorite stretchy pirate boy manga, Lumpy uses his arms as a net, his legs tied to a stool, and traps the sun in a net right as the tsunami hits. Gee what kind of crazy trouble is he getting into this time?!",
