{
            "mnemonic": "You're sitting on your {tooltip:Radical:stool} {tooltip:Kanji:again}!!?",
            "hints": "Imagine your super comfy, state-of-the-art stool. You take it everywhere with you, and you're always sitting on it. Again, and again, and {tooltip:Kanji:again}. You love that stool.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Again"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
