                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine throwing buckets of uranium into the bay. It only burns your hands a little. And now they glow green, just like the bay does!",
                "mnemonic": "How did you get a tsunami to show up in the {tooltip:Kanji:bay} in the first place? By throwing a bunch of {tooltip:Reading:ura}nium ({span:lang=ja:\u3046\u3089}) in there, of course! Its highly unstable nature can make any body of water, especially a calm bay, turn violent."
            }
        }

{
