{
            "mnemonic": "Who goes into their {tooltip:Radical:yurt} to {tooltip:Radical:boil} things? {tooltip:Kanji:All} the people you've ever known. You don't boil things outside, are you crazy?",
            "hints": "Wait, you're telling me all people don't do the same things? Excuse me?",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "All",
                "Alternative": "Bastard"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
