                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304b\u3093\u3080\u308a",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Why don't you go look up what Genghis Khan's crown/cap looked like. Then try to imagine how it would look atop your head.",
                "mnemonic": "You want your {tooltip:Kanji:crown} to be just like Genghis {tooltip:Reading:Khan}'s ({span:lang=ja:\u304b\u3093}), which was more of a cap. He's your hero though, because he ruled over the most people, so you want yours to match his measurements."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If you {tooltip:Radical:announce} that {tooltip:Radical:alcohol} is illegal you're just being {tooltip:Kanji:cruel}. Honestly, saying no one can have any alcohol at all is totally {tooltip:Kanji:unjust}. They tried that in the 1920s and it didn't work then either, so cut it out! Let people drink what they want to drink!",
            "hints": "Imagine if your country's leader announced that there would be no more alcohol. People would be in the streets in seconds calling them cruel and unjust!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Cruel",
                "Alternative": "Unjust"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3053\u304f",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3072\u3069",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine drinking coke while complaining how unjust it is that you can't add rum to it.",
                "mnemonic": "After this {tooltip:Kanji:cruel} announcement is made everyone will turn to the next best thing after alcohol. {tooltip:Reading:Coke} ({span:lang=ja:\u3053\u304f})! It's not a replacement, but if this unjust law won't change, then coke sales are going to go through the roof."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:surplus} {tooltip:Radical:stool}, please {tooltip:Kanji:describe} it.",
            "hints": "You have a surplus (extra) stool, and someone wants it. But, they need to know more about it, so you describe it in great detail. Imagine yourself doing just that. Every screw and nubbin is described.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Describe"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
