                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Jo-Anne is really excited about this stool. It's the perfect height for her (remember, she's on the shorter side to distinguish {span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3087} from {span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3087\u3046}). She pays attention to you describing the stool while sitting on it and spinning around. Have her ask for you to describe it more. ",
                "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Kanji:describe} the features of the stool to {tooltip:Reading:Jo}-Anne ({span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3087}). "
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Jump on a {tooltip:Radical:scooter} to {tooltip:Radical:excuse} yourself from answering a question and you've successfully {tooltip:Kanji:deviate}d from that nosey person's plan! You've also been able to {tooltip:Kanji:elude} them pretty well.",
            "hints": "Imagine excusing yourself by scooting away on a scooter. If they want to get your answer, they'll have to chase you.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Deviate",
                "Alternative": "Elude"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3044\u3064",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u305d, \u306f\u3050",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Welp, it's too late to turn back now. You've already deviated pretty far, and you're not even sure where you are now. You were too busy trying to elude that person that you didn't look where your scooter was taking you.",
                "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Kanji:deviate} from the plan a little too well, and as you're scooting, what you've done {tooltip:Reading:eats} ({span:lang=ja:\u3044\u3064}) away at you. You feel guilty for eluding them... "
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You use {tooltip:Radical:thread} and {tooltip:Radical:writing} to sew our {tooltip:Kanji:family crest}. You've been sewing your family crest since you were a kid, you could do it today with your eyes closed.",
            "hints": "Imagine the thread slowly forming the writing that makes up your family crest. You're making a scarf with your crest on it. It's like a wizarding school house symbol.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Family Crest"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
