                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "What will you do with your foolish goo heart now? ",
                "mnemonic": "Splinter tells you to your face how {tooltip:Kanji:foolish} you are and you feel your heart turn to {tooltip:Reading:goo} ({span:lang=ja:\u3050}). Now you can't even give it to someone else. No one wants goo."
