                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You pour a bucket of tater tots into his mouth body and he continues his presentation about mouths. \"You see, mouths are just orifices...\"",
                "mnemonic": "\"I will {tooltip:Kanji:present} to you a presentation about mouths, but I require energy. Please fill my giant mouth body with delicious {tooltip:Reading:ta}ter ({span:lang=ja:\u3066\u3044}) tots."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Your {tooltip:Radical:leader} managed to find the right {tooltip:Radical:direction} home using marks in the {tooltip:Radical:dirt} in the middle of {tooltip:Radical:winter}. This makes you so {tooltip:Kanji:proud}! You're proud because this resourceful leader is YOUR resourceful leader.",
            "hints": "Imagine how proud you and your whole country feel as your leader comes trudging in through the snow. He made it home. You're (sniff) so (sob) proud!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Proud"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3054\u3046",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3042\u306a\u3069, \u304a\u3054",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Let's be honest here, {span:lang=ja:\u3054\u3046\u3044\u3061} isn't getting any younger. You really should be proud of him for surviving this long at all.",
                "mnemonic": "This leader you're so {tooltip:Kanji:proud} of is old man {span:lang=ja:\u3054\u3046\u3044\u3061}. He's been getting a bit slow over the years, and you really didn't think he'd make it back. But, by gum, he did it."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:sick}ness that hits you like an {tooltip:Radical:arrow} will do its gross work {tooltip:Kanji:rapidly}. It's not a good thing, you're gonna get really sick really fast.",
            "hints": "Picture this rapid sickness spreading through your body like a cartoon arrow ricocheting through your body. Yuck!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Rapidly",
                "Alternative": "Rapid"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
