{
            "mnemonic": "If you travel to the {tooltip:Radical:fish} {tooltip:Radical:capital}, you'll find the leader of all fish, the mighty {tooltip:Kanji:whale}! Okay, so a whale isn't technically a fish, but that's why it makes such a good leader. You can usually only find whales hanging around near the capital because they really enjoy ruling over all the other fish. They are the biggest, after all.",
