                        "reading": "\u304a\u308d\u3057, \u304a\u308d",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "\"Oh Roshi\" you say carefully as you hand your stamps over at noon. The guy raises an eyebrow at you, but gives you them wholesale! It worked! ",
                "mnemonic": "Oh, one more thing. Going at noon isn't enough, you have to say the password to get them at {tooltip:Kanji:wholesale} price too. The password is \"{tooltip:Reading:Oh Roshi}\" ({span:lang=ja:\u304a\u308d\u3057}). Okay, so maybe that's just the name of the guy there, but it always works when I want to get stamps wholesale so you should do it too!"
            }
        }

