{
            "mnemonic": "You start growing {tooltip:Radical:thread} in your {tooltip:Radical:rice paddy} to {tooltip:Kanji:accumulate} more. You didn't want to have to buy any, so you're just trying to grow thread with your rice. That seems like a good way to accumulate more to you.",
