                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u308a\u3087, \u308d",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3068\u308a\u304f, \u3068\u308a\u3053",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture the poor captive tiger being stuffed into a bathrobe and paraded around a cage for the man.",
                "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Kanji:captive} tiger is even sadder because the man put him in a {tooltip:Reading:ro}be ({span:lang=ja:\u308a\u3087}) and is making him act like a human. Tigers look good in robes, but they don't really enjoy being forced into people clothing."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If you want to {tooltip:Radical:loiter} on a {tooltip:Radical:cliff} with the {tooltip:Radical:pope} you better be ready to move in perfect {tooltip:Kanji:circulation} with him. The pope is wearing really heavy robes and it's hot up here on this cliff, so you both need to walk in circles to keep cool.",
            "hints": "Imagine this strange circulation of you and the pope up here on a cliff. It's not even like you two are up here for a reason, you're just loitering. But he doesn't want to be hot so he makes you circulate with him.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Circulation",
                "Alternative": "Sequential"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3058\u3085\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "\"This circulation is all June's fault,\" you mutter, walking in a circle with the pope to stay cool.",
                "mnemonic": "This {tooltip:Kanji:circulation} wouldn't have to even be happening if it wasn't {tooltip:Reading:June} ({span:lang=ja:\u3058\u3085\u3093}). The cliffs are so hot in June, and in any other month the two of you would have just sat down and had a chat. But in June you have to do this weird circulation dance."
            }
        }

