{
            "mnemonic": "If you try to turn something into {tooltip:Radical:ice} while having {tooltip:Radical:doubt}s, it will just {tooltip:Kanji:congeal} instead. It will {tooltip:Kanji:freeze}, but it will get kinda yucky too. Your doubts will affect the ice-making process, so try not to be so worried and unsure next time you want normal ice.",
            "hints": "Imagine looking over water in an ice cube tray. You aren't sure if they'll turn out alright, and you doubt whether ice is even a thing. As you think this, the water congeals and freezes into gross shapes.",
            "meanings": {
