                "mnemonic": "It turned out this {tooltip:Kanji:cork} hat was given to him by a {tooltip:Reading:cen}taur ({span:lang=ja:\u305b\u3093}). You look into it and it turned out it IS a really big cork that centaurs use on their big wine casks. But the king didn't understand, and thought it was a hat. The centaurs are probably still laughing."
