{
            "mnemonic": "When {tooltip:Radical:spring} is {tooltip:Radical:dry} you need to {tooltip:Kanji:dedicate} your time and effort somewhere else. You can't plant flowers or vegetables, it's too dry. You can't play outside, your skin will flake. So you need to dedicate yourself to something inside.",
            "hints": "You know how you get. When you can't go outside, you dedicate yourself full force into something else. I mean, you made it to level 55, right? That's some serious dedication. And it probably started because of one particularly dry spring.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Dedicate"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
