                "mnemonic": "You chase the scooter to that {tooltip:Kanji:distant} place, but then you see it heading for a lake. Oh good, it should be stopped by the water. But wait! In the distance you see your scooter drive onto a {tooltip:Reading:row} ({span:lang=ja:\u308a\u3087\u3046}) boat and... row itself through the water?! No!!"
