{
            "mnemonic": "Put your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} in a {tooltip:Radical:jet} if you want to {tooltip:Kanji:erase} them from existence. You aren't just chopping or burning them off. There's like, no trace of them at all. Your parents can't even remember if you were born with fingers or not. Jets are that powerful.",
            "hints": "Imagine your fingers slowly getting closer and closer to the jet's engine. It feels like it's going to suck your whole body in. And you better watch out, because if it does you'll be erased from the planet. And probably from time itself.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Erase"
            },
