                ],
                "hints": "Picture the leader bowling nearby. You keep him close by, you never know when he'll fall over and need your help.",
                "mnemonic": "You decide to bring the leader to a {tooltip:Kanji:nearby} {tooltip:Reading:bow}ling ({span:lang=ja:\u307c\u3046}) alley. It's really close and you can stay right by his side as he throws bowling balls and gets his anger out."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:soul} of the {tooltip:Radical:Death Star} is actually quite {tooltip:Kanji:pleasant}. And if you think about it, it's the people who control the Death Star that are evil and kill.",
            "hints": "Picture the Death Star in your mind. As you picture it, its pleasant, smiling soul floats up and out of it. \"Oh hello, dear,\" it says happily, \"Didn't see you there!\"",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Pleasant"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
