                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine how sexy the height of a ten foot tall person would be after just coming back from weight training on the moon.",
                "mnemonic": "Getting a taller {tooltip:Kanji:stature} will also make you seem super {tooltip:Reading:sexy} ({span:lang=ja:\u305b\u304d}) on the moon and back home on earth. If you stay on the moon long enough, you'll be the tallest person in the galaxy and who wouldn't find that sexy?! Huh?"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You want to {tooltip:Radical:slice} what you {tooltip:Radical:say} in half so that people focus on {tooltip:Kanji:the above} text first. The above is what you want them to see! So slice what you say!",
            "hints": "Imagine actually slicing the words you say in the air. The above section is what you want people to pay attention to, so you slice a big gap between the above and the below words.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "The Above",
                "Alternative": "That Specifically"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
