                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "That guy doesn't care if the above is all he's supposed to hear. That guy sucks.",
                "mnemonic": "As you focus on {tooltip:Kanji:the above} words you realize a {tooltip:Reading:guy} ({span:lang=ja:\u304c\u3044}) is trying to push the rest of the things you're saying back up with the rest of them. No! The above text is all that matters! Go away guy!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "How do you make a mnemonic for the word this? You don\u2019t. But, we can try. You climb many {tooltip:Radical:hill}s. On top of one of the hills is a little {tooltip:Radical:drop} of water. You pick it up and say \u201c{tooltip:Kanji:THIS}\u2026 THIS IS WHAT I WAS LOOKING FOR!\u201d",
            "hints": "As you look at the drop of water, you note that you found the right thing. Written on it is the word \u201cthis.\"",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "This"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
