                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3053\u308c, \u306e",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "The core of the universe is in this drop of water. Or is it in this mnemonic? Ooohhhhh you'll never knoooowwww!",
                "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Kanji:This} particular drop of water hold the {tooltip:Reading:core} ({span:lang=ja:\u3053\u308c}) of the universe. If you didn't find this very droplet, we all would have died and this universe would be gone."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:reality} of {tooltip:Radical:gold} is that it has the power to {tooltip:Kanji:tranquilize} anyone who gets their hands on it. Gold may seem cool to have in movies and songs, but in reality, it has the power to mess you up!",
            "hints": "Imagine being tranquilized by the sweet caress of gold coins. You can't even move. You're in a daze or something.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Tranquilize"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3061\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u304a\u3055\u3048, \u3057\u305a",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "If you let gold tranquilize you, you'll drool all over your own chin. Maybe the chins of other people too, who knows?",
                "mnemonic": "You've been {tooltip:Kanji:tranquilize}d and now drool is running down your {tooltip:Reading:chin} ({span:lang=ja:\u3061\u3093}). It's actually really gross. But you don't care, look at all this gold! No one will care about your chin when you're rich!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "When you go to the pool or lake to swim, you'll see a {tooltip:Radical:flag} stuck somewhere in the {tooltip:Radical:water}. That flag is there so you know it's okay to {tooltip:Kanji:pee} in that area of the pool. Everyone knows {tooltip:Kanji:urine} dilutes in water, and if everyone just pees in one place, it won't be gross. So go pee over by that flag when you have to go. Don't bother getting out of the water.",
            "hints": "Imagine swimming over to the flag that's sticking out of the water and peeing there. Yeah, everyone knows what you're doing over there, but it's better than getting out and walking to the bathroom right? Just pee in the water. Just do it.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Urine",
                "Alternative": "Pee"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u306b\u3087\u3046",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine your embarrassment when you find out that you aren't supposed to urinate in the water, not even by the pee flag, because a life guard yelled NYOOOOOO and pointed right at you while you did it.",
                "mnemonic": "Right as you start to {tooltip:Kanji:pee}, you hear the life guard start to yell, \"{tooltip:Reading:NYOOOOOO}! ({span:lang=ja:\u306b\u3087\u3046})\" and he's pointing at you! You were just peeing by the pee flag! Why is he mad?"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Between the {tooltip:Radical:roof} and the {tooltip:Radical:ground} there are {tooltip:Radical:few} {tooltip:Radical:shellfish}. This is because we invited some {tooltip:Kanji:VIP} {tooltip:Kanji:guest}s into our home and they ate all our shellfish.",
            "hints": "The VIPs came into our home (the place between our roof and the ground) where they consumed all our shellfish. Only the best for guests, I guess.",
