{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Kanji:Life} in Japan was {tooltip:Kanji:increasing} at its fastest rate during the {tooltip:Vocabulary:Yayoi Period}. It's one of the earliest periods of history in Japan that we know about! You should look it up, if you don't already know about it.",
