{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Stand} staring up at the {tooltip:Radical:blue} sky and you'll feel more {tooltip:Kanji:peaceful} than you ever have. Blue is a color that promotes peaceful thoughts and feelings. That's why all the social media sites are blue. To stop you from being a jerk.",
            "hints": "Imagine how peaceful staring at the blue ocean, the blue sky, or the blue tumblr makes you.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Peaceful"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
