                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You can also imagine hacking the ship's computer. \"Look at me, look at me. You are the hacker now.\"",
                "mnemonic": "A white-painted {tooltip:Kanji:ship} is a kind of {tooltip:Reading:hack} ({span:lang=ja:\u306f\u304f}). It makes the ship more visible without costing much."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If you want to fit your {tooltip:Radical:fingers} into a {tooltip:Radical:key} {tooltip:Radical:hole}, you have to {tooltip:Kanji:squeeze} them in. Fingers aren't exactly supposed to fit in key holes... they're for keys, after all. But you want to squeeze your finger on in there anyway to unlock the door.",
            "hints": "Imagine what it would be like to squeeze your fingers into a keyhole. Maybe try squeezing one finger really tight first. Did that hurt? Well it's going to be a lot worse in that key hole.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Squeeze"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3055\u304f",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3057\u307c",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You have the ability to squeeze your fingers into locks to open them, so of course you're stealing. And you squeeze those stolen goodies into your sack so you can take them with you.",
                "mnemonic": "Once you've {tooltip:Kanji:squeeze}d your finger in the key hole to unlock this door you squeeze all the money and jewels and treasures you can fit into your {tooltip:Reading:sack} ({span:lang=ja:\u3055\u304f}). Your stealing sack."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "An {tooltip:Radical:animal} with {tooltip:Radical:horns} is drinking our {tooltip:Radical:alcohol}? {tooltip:Kanji:Still}?",
            "hints": "You keep checking outside to see if they have stopped, but they are still drinking. They haven't stopped yet.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Still",
                "Alternative": "Yet"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
