                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You keep checking, but that youth is still drinking. Of course, you don't know they are a youth, so it's quite impressive an animal can drink this much.",
                "mnemonic": "The animal with horns that is {tooltip:Kanji:still} drinking your alcohol is no animal at all. It is actually one of the local {tooltip:Reading:you}ths ({span:lang=ja:\u3086\u3046}) dressed up like a horned animal so they can drink as long as they want and you'll be too scared to shoo them away."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Take a {tooltip:Radical:mole} out of its {tooltip:Radical:hole} and it will {tooltip:Kanji:suffocate}. They need to be in tight quarters, unlike us humans. So when you take one out of its nice, safe hole, it thinks it can't breathe and suffocates.",
            "hints": "Picture a poor little mole suffocating in your hand after you took it out of its hole. Put it back right away! Don't kill that little mole!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Suffocate"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3061\u3064",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Unfortunately, you can't use cheats on life, and the mole suddenly stiffens and suffocates to death anyway. You should feel bad about what you've done.",
                "mnemonic": "As the mole {tooltip:Kanji:suffocate}s it {tooltip:Reading:cheats} ({span:lang=ja:\u3061\u3064}) and shoves its head into your closed hand. You realize what it's doing and squeeze your hand tighter so it's more like a hole. You can feel the mole breathing again now."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:stone} {tooltip:Radical:drop}s from the sky into a {tooltip:Radical:rice paddy} and then a {tooltip:Radical:cross} {tooltip:Radical:drop}s on top of it. They've combined to form a {tooltip:Kanji:tombstone}! Wait, does that mean a body fell from the sky first and you just didn't see it?",
            "hints": "Imagine seeing a stone and a cross drop from the sky onto each other to form a tombstone right in front of your eyes!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Tombstone"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
