                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3044\u3057\u3076\u307f",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Can you feel the heat radiating off this space tombstone? Maybe there's a space skeleton sizzling under there too...",
                "mnemonic": "Now you're curious about what's under there but when you try to touch the {tooltip:Kanji:tombstone} it's radiating with intense {tooltip:Reading:he}at ({span:lang=ja:\u3072})! It must have come from outer space and this heat is from when it entered our atmosphere!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You shoot an {tooltip:Radical:arrow} at the {tooltip:Radical:mouth} of the {tooltip:Radical:sun} so that it will grant you a gift of {tooltip:Kanji:wisdom}. You heard about a Greek hero doing this and the god in the sun gave him the wisdom to see everything. You're hoping it will work for you too.",
            "hints": "Imagine shooting an arrow at the mouth of the sun and then waiting for the wisdom of the world to hit you. Did it work? Will you know when it works? Probably...",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Wisdom"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3061",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "\u3068\u3082",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture yourself thanking the sun for teaching you that all wisdom comes from cheese. Now take a big bite!",
                "mnemonic": "You're standing around waiting for the {tooltip:Kanji:wisdom} to hit you when something else does. In the head. Ouch! You look down and it's a wheel of {tooltip:Reading:chee}se ({span:lang=ja:\u3061})! At first you're angry, until you realize that this must be a sign. Cheese IS wisdom. And the key to wisdom is eating a lot of cheese!"
            }
        }

