{
            "mnemonic": "\"For the  {tooltip:Radical:samurai}, it is a {tooltip:Radical:jackhammer} that they will {tooltip:Radical:lack}.\" That is the latest {tooltip:Kanji:article} of the law written about samurai, hundreds of years after katana were taken away. This article was written with great {tooltip:Kanji:sincerity} by the government.",
            "hints": "By writing up new articles and laws they keep taking things away from samurai. First the katana, now jackhammers?",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Article",
                "Alternative": "Sincerity"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
