                "mnemonic": "When you're {tooltip:Kanji:blind} you probably shouldn't drive anymore because if you do you'll {tooltip:Reading:mow} ({span:lang=ja:\u3082\u3046}) everyone over. Actually, don't mow your lawn either. Blind people probably shouldn't be driving anything."
