                "hints": "Kids can't get enough of it. Anything that makes a loud drumming noise or anything they can beat together is fun for them.",
                "mnemonic": "Who loves to {tooltip:Kanji:drum} things together and make a huge racket? {span:lang=ja:\u5b50}s ({span:lang=ja:\u3053}), of course."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Radical:go} to a {tooltip:Radical:big} {tooltip:Radical:rice paddy} and establish a {tooltip:Radical:prison} right in the middle of it to restore the {tooltip:Kanji:equilibrium} of the area.",
            "hints": "There was a lot of crime right here in this rice paddy, so you just built a big prison right there to lower the crime rate so this region can experience equilibrium once again.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Equilibrium"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
