{
            "mnemonic": "Put a {tooltip:Radical:guard} at your {tooltip:Radical:gate} to get a good {tooltip:Kanji:inspection} of your neighborhood going. The guard will stand there all day inspecting everything and then report it all back to you. You won't have to do any of the inspection yourself!",
            "hints": "Imagine the guard doing his inspection in front of the gate all day long. He should have a nice report for you once he's done.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Inspection"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
