{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:tree} that does well in the {tooltip:Radical:wind} is a {tooltip:Kanji:maple} tree. Maple trees don't have fruit so the wind can't knock anything off of it. That's why they thrive well in windy places!",
            "hints": "Picture a bunch of maple trees being blown by the wind. They don't seem upset, they actually seem really happy. ",
