{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:drunkard} has {tooltip:Radical:dirt} in his {tooltip:Radical:mouth} as he tries to talk to you. You walk over and he spits a {tooltip:Kanji:question mark} into your hand. It's covered in dirt and spit. Um... does this mean he's confused? He probably doesn't even know where he is. But how did he make this question mark and why was it in his mouth?",
            "hints": "Imagine having a drunkard spit a dirty question mark into your hand. You want to say, \"Yes, I'm ??? too.\"",
