{
            "mnemonic": "Move your {tooltip:Radical:coat rack} in one {tooltip:Radical:direction} by shooting it with a {tooltip:Radical:gun}. Then you can keep shooting it to get a good {tooltip:Kanji:rotation} going. If you think there is a better way to make your coat rack make {tooltip:Kanji:revolution}s, you're probably wrong. ",
