{
            "mnemonic": "The {tooltip:Radical:leader} says {tooltip:Radical:spring} is looking {tooltip:Radical:dry}, so you'll need your {tooltip:Kanji:salary} in advance.",
            "hints": "The leader shows you the number, it's all of your salary for spring. \"This way, if things dry up worse, you'll be okay for a while,\" he says. This is awfully nice, but very suspicious at the same time.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Salary"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
