{
            "mnemonic": "Riding a {tooltip:Radical:scooter} to the {tooltip:Radical:library} is a {tooltip:Kanji:universal} experience. People young and old have all, at some point, taken a scooter to the library, picked up a book, used the internet, sat in the comfy chairs, then left via that same scooter.",
