                "hints": "Picture a bunch of muddy ducks munching on some muddy trapped insects, in a some muddy leftover tsunami water.",
                "mnemonic": "Unfortunately for the insects, these {tooltip:Kanji:muddy} conditions have created the perfect habitat for {tooltip:Reading:duck}s ({span:lang=ja:\u3060\u304f}). And muddy insects already imprisoned in a muddy net is a duck's favorite treat!"
            }
