                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You wanna have fun hanging out on a cross with flowers and all the shellfish you can eat. Your resentment grows and grows as you watch the soul having everything you suddenly want.",
                "mnemonic": "You realize you {tooltip:Kanji:resent} them because it looks like they're having {tooltip:Reading:fun} ({span:lang=ja:\u3075\u3093}). You aren't having fun, and you wanna be! How dare they have fun when you aren't!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "As the {tooltip:Radical:tsunami} hits your {tooltip:Radical:scooter} and your {tooltip:Radical:car}, it alters the wave, creating {tooltip:Kanji:ripples}.",
            "hints": "They're hard to see because a tsunami is pretty big, but your scooter and car do create ripples in the water as it goes past.",
