                    }
                ],
                "hints": "As you watch the ripples come off your car / scooter, be sure to imagine the relief you'd feel if you knew they were rentals and not something owned by you.",
                "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Kanji:Ripples} come off of your scooter and car from when they were hit by a tsunami. More importantly, those things were {tooltip:Reading:ren}tals ({span:lang=ja:\u308c\u3093}), so ripples or not, it doesn't matter if they were hit by a tsunami."
