{
            "mnemonic": "You're walking down the street when you see {tooltip:Radical:twenty} {tooltip:Radical:big} {tooltip:Radical:cross}es lined up in front of you. Crosses creep you out and this is way too many for you to keep walking so you decide to {tooltip:Kanji:run} as fast as you can to get past them.",
            "hints": "Imagine trying to run down a street with twenty big crosses lining it. It's so scary that you keep running faster and faster as you go.",
