                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine distracting yourself from the scary crosses by honing your running skills while you do it. ",
                "mnemonic": "You figure since you're already on the {tooltip:Kanji:run} that you might as well {tooltip:Reading:hone} ({span:lang=ja:\u307b\u3093}) your running skills while you make your way down this scary, cross lined street. "
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "You hoist your {tooltip:Radical:towel} above your {tooltip:Radical:table}, {tooltip:Radical:drop} into the water and {tooltip:Kanji:sail} away. You turned the towel into an actual sail and you're balancing on top of the table, which is now a boat.",
            "hints": "Imagine sailing out into the open sea, drops of water hitting your face, as the towel sail catches the air and carries you away.",
