                    }
                ],
                "hints": "You sail nervously past Han Solo who also seems to be sailing, though in worse shape than you. But he keeps throwing you finger guns so you figure it's best to just sail on and pretend this never happened.",
                "mnemonic": "As you {tooltip:Kanji:sail} off into the ocean you hear a familiar voice shout out, \"Ahoy!\" {tooltip:Reading:Han} ({span:lang=ja:\u306f\u3093}) Solo calls. He's also got a towel sail, but it's on the Millennium Falcon, which is half-submerged in the water."
            }
        }

{
