                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Now you're staring in the mirror at yourself. You sigh loudly and take out the pliers. You'll be a guy like everyone else. S-soon. As soon as you can muster up enough strength to stop sighing and rip these fangs out.",
                "mnemonic": "You {tooltip:Kanji:sigh} again and say, \"I wish I was just a normal {tooltip:Reading:guy} ({span:lang=ja:\u304c\u3044}).\" I swear the rest of me is a guy like the rest of you. *sigh*"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Put {tooltip:Radical:thread} in the {tooltip:Radical:mouth} of a worm while the {tooltip:Radical:moon} is out and it will poop out some {tooltip:Kanji:silk}. That's why they call them silkworms, didn't you know? But it has to be while the moon is out, otherwise normal thread will come right back out the other end of the worm. The moon is what makes the magic happen.",
            "hints": "Picture feeding some thread into the mouth of a worm as the light from the full moon shines in on you. See the silk come out of the worm's butt and into your hands.",
