{
            "mnemonic": "You see a {tooltip:Radical:mountain} in the shape of a {tooltip:Radical:turtle shell} sticking out into the ocean. It's a {tooltip:Kanji:cape}! No, not the kind you wear, the geographical kind. When you're on land, most capes look like turtle shell mountains sticking out into the sea. Do you know any capes like that near where you live?",
