                "mnemonic": "After you make your {tooltip:Kanji:clumsy} mistake you realize that these doors come in {tooltip:Reading:sets} ({span:lang=ja:\u305b\u3064}). And now you have to try to open another door. And another door. So many sets of doors!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If you want to {tooltip:Radical:say} how {tooltip:Radical:eternity} sounds you have to {tooltip:Kanji:compose} a poem. Or an essay. Or a song. {tooltip:Kanji:Recite} those deep thoughts about eternity and impress everyone who hears it.",
            "hints": "Try to compose a poem about eternity right now. Just jot it down somewhere.",
            "meanings": {
