                "mnemonic": "You decide to {tooltip:Kanji:compose} a poem about an {tooltip:Reading:a}corn ({span:lang=ja:\u3048\u3044}). The tiny acorn is the perfect vessel for you to say how eternity feels to you."
            }
        }

{
