{
            "mnemonic": "If someone makes a {tooltip:Radical:bamboo} {tooltip:Radical:horse}, you know it's {tooltip:Kanji:deliberate}. You can't accidentally make an entire horse out of bamboo.",
            "hints": "Someone sat down and deliberately planned the entire horse out, collected the materials, and made it by hand.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Deliberate"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
