{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Every} {tooltip:Radical:leader} will come to {tooltip:Kanji:despise} their followers. In the beginning everything is fine and dandy, but eventually the leader's followers will ask for more and more things, eventually ridiculous things, and the leader will really despise them for it.",
            "hints": "Imagine yourself as a leader who's come to despise every single one of their followers. Look down at them in disgust as they ask you to grant them all a pony.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Despise"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
