                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "This is not a healthy way to handle things! If you despise someone you should talk to them, don't turn to booze. Don't be like every leader that's come before you.",
                "mnemonic": "The more you {tooltip:Kanji:despise} them, the more {tooltip:Reading:boo}ze ({span:lang=ja:\u3076}) you drink. This is not smart or healthy, but it's what this kind of hate does to people."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If there is {tooltip:Radical:dirt} in a {tooltip:Radical:crab trap}, it's a lot for the crabs to {tooltip:Kanji:endure}.",
