                "mnemonic": "You decide to make the little crab that {tooltip:Kanji:endure}d being stuck in a dirty crab trap your pet, and put a {tooltip:Reading:colla}r ({span:lang=ja:\u3053\u3089}) round its little neck."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "A {tooltip:Radical:spirit} wearing two {tooltip:Radical:mustache}s must be {tooltip:Kanji:evil}. Everyone knows a mustache makes you evil, but two? And on a spirit? Yup, definitely evil.",
            "hints": "Look at the evil spirit with two mustaches on its spirit face. Imagine its face in detail, especially those mustaches.",
            "meanings": {
