                "mnemonic": "You're watching the {tooltip:Kanji:evil} mustache spirit when it starts to float toward your {tooltip:Reading:ca}r ({span:lang=ja:\u304b}). And it's... hey! It's trashing your car! You knew this guy was evil!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If you can {tooltip:Radical:stop} a {tooltip:Radical:turkey} by putting a {tooltip:Radical:spoon} in its face you'll know it's a {tooltip:Kanji:female} turkey. A male turkey will peck the spoon out of your hand and run away. But a female turkey will wonder why you're putting a spoon there, stop, and look up at you wondering if you're okay.",
            "hints": "Picture the female turkey stopping when it sees you holding out a spoon. Why are you doing that human? it thinks. Are you sick?",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Female"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
