                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Okay, so that's a lie, Your fingers are definitely imitating them, but you don't want to end up in the guillotine so you keep your mouth shut.",
                "mnemonic": "Everyone thinks the friend you were trying to {tooltip:Kanji:imitate} is the imitation now and they have them in a {tooltip:Reading:gui}llotine ({span:lang=ja:\u304e}). You even doubt if they're an imitation or if your fingers are the imitation."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "What kind of {tooltip:Radical:tree} is {tooltip:Radical:spicy}? A {tooltip:Kanji:Japanese birch}, or {tooltip:Kanji:birch}, obviously. There's nothing spicier than a Japanese birch!\n",
            "hints": "Imagine licking the trunk of a Japanese birch tree and feeling the heat on your tongue.",
            "meanings": {
