{
            "mnemonic": "If you only let {tooltip:Radical:oneself} (yourself) into your {tooltip:Radical:heart}, you'll end up {tooltip:Kanji:mourning} all of the loves and friendships you could have had but didn't let in.",
            "hints": "Picture yourself all alone. You never let anyone into your heart but yourself, and now you're mourning the life and friends you could have had.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Mourning"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
