{
            "mnemonic": "Set {tooltip:Radical:fire} to a {tooltip:Radical:geoduck} if you want to {tooltip:Kanji:annoy} it. Fire won't kill a geoduck, but have you ever been on fire? It's not really pleasant. So you'll just annoy it pretty badly.",
            "hints": "Imagine how annoyed you would be if someone set YOU on fire for no reason. The geoduck has every reason to find you annoying, dude.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Annoy",
                "Alternative": "Annoying"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u306f\u3093, \u307c\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
