                        "reading": "\u3046\u308b\u3055, \u308f\u305a\u3089",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Think how annoying it must be to be a geoduck when Han Solo comes around.",
                "mnemonic": "You know who loves {tooltip:Kanji:annoying} geoducks more than anyone else in the universe? {tooltip:Reading:Han} ({span:lang=ja:\u306f\u3093}) Solo! If you watch Star Wars closely enough you can see him shooting geoducks with his blaster and catching them on fire for fun. "
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Red} {tooltip:Radical:insect}s only bite {tooltip:Kanji:barbarian}s. If a red insect bites you then you have barbarian blood! Waaay back a barbarian was your aunt or uncle or great great grand pappy! But the insects kinda hurt, so it's a bit of a downside I guess.",
            "hints": "If you see a red insect follow it and see who it bites. Then you'll know that person is at least part barbarian.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Barbarian"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3070\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u3048\u3073\u3059",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Thanks to those Ray Bans you still don't know what a real life barbarian looks like. After going to all the trouble of following a red bug too. What a waste.",
                "mnemonic": "You follow the red insect and see it bite someone who must be a {tooltip:Kanji:barbarian}! You look up at their face but all you can see are giant Ray-{tooltip:Reading:Ban} ({span:lang=ja:\u3070\u3093}) sunglasses. You really want to look at his face to see what a barbarian looks like but those darn things are in the way!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "Under this {tooltip:Radical:canopy} is the {tooltip:Radical:Mona Lisa}, being sold for cheap, what a great {tooltip:Kanji:bargain}! You never know what kind of bargains you'll find when you look under a canopy at the wares of a traveling salesperson.",
            "hints": "Look really closely at this Mona Lisa. Hmm, I don't remember her having a mustache, but I guess it is a little dark under this canopy.",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Bargain"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
                    {
                        "name": "On\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "\u308c\u3093",
                        "primary": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Kun\u2019yomi",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Nanori",
                        "reading": "None",
                        "primary": false
                    }
                ],
                "hints": "The salesperson pulls the painting away and mutters, \"Ah, yes, well this is such a good bargain already! And besides... it's already a rental, you see. From the, uh, the Louvre. So you really should just take this bargain and buy it!\"",
                "mnemonic": "You want to make sure this {tooltip:Kanji:bargain} is as good as it seems, so you ask if you can get this Mona Lisa as a {tooltip:Reading:ren}tal ({span:lang=ja:\u308c\u3093}). Just for now, so you can make sure it's real before you buy it at that low, low price."
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "If you want to {tooltip:Radical:slice} the {tooltip:Radical:power} out of someone just {tooltip:Kanji:censure} them. Then they'll be cut down in front of everyone and they'll feel super embarrassed. It's the best way to slice them down without actually cutting them and getting arrested.",
            "hints": "Picture yourself as you slice the power out of that senator you hate by censuring them in front of the world!",
            "meanings": {
                "Primary": "Censure"
            },
            "kanjiReadings": {
                "readings": [
