                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Imagine saying something to the King. Get low down on the ground to be as humble as you can. Whisper into the King's boots. Lick them if you have to.",
                "mnemonic": "You're being {tooltip:Kanji:humble} like this because those boots belong to the {tooltip:Reading:Kin}g ({span:lang=ja:\u304d\u3093}) of England. You can't just say whatever you want at eye level to a king. He'll have your head chopped off for insolence, or worse!"
            }
        }

{
            "mnemonic": "{tooltip:Radical:Flowers} that you {tooltip:Radical:oversee} are always {tooltip:Kanji:indigo}. You aren't sure why though...",
