{
            "mnemonic": "Carve a {tooltip:Radical:tree} into a {tooltip:Radical:bar} and lay it sticking out into the water to make a {tooltip:Kanji:jetty} or a {tooltip:Kanji:pier}. Now you can walk out on the jetty and go further into the water without needing a boat or getting wet.",
