                    }
                ],
                "hints": "Picture Santa-san coming in from the water on his speedboat and docking on your jetty to deliver presents to you.",
                "mnemonic": "You made this {tooltip:Kanji:jetty} so it would be easier for {tooltip:Reading:San}ta-san ({span:lang=ja:\u3055\u3093}) to dock his sleigh. Oh, you didn't know? His sleigh is more of a speed boat now, so he needs a jetty to give you presents, not a chimney anymore."
